1046\" data-end=\"1068\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1172\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1098\">Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)</strong><br data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and supports the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1247\"><strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1189\">Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier and lock in moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1310\"><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1262\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\nProvides moisturizing and soothing skin care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1391\"><strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1335\">Tea Tree Leaf Water</strong><br data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\nHelps provide calming care for stressed-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1485\"><strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1430\">Centella Asiatica + Madecassoside</strong><br data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\nKnown for soothing and skin-conditioning properties.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1576\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1506\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture for hydrated, plump-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1593\">Resveratrol</strong><br data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\nProvides antioxidant care and helps support a healthy-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1652\" data-content-reference-end=\"1684\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1707\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1731\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1803\"><strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1803\">Sensitive • Acne-Prone • Combination • Oily • Dry • Dehydrated Skin</strong></p><p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1803\"><strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1803\"><br></strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1822\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"2059\">After cleansing and applying lighter skincare products such as toner/serum, apply an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1950\">345 Relief Cream</strong> as the final or semi-final step. Gently spread and pat until absorbed.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,NULL,16,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/vbNolsNctFNQpZZ4Aos8gPczxhXvuKwoLNQPt3A8.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 09:23:10','2026-09-16 09:05:04'),(7,'The Vita A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster 15ml','the-vita-a-retinal-shot-tightening-booster-15ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"447\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CELIMAX The Vita-A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster is a concentrated <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"182\">retinal-based booster</strong> designed to target the appearance of <strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"286\">wrinkles, enlarged pores, uneven texture, and loss of firmness</strong>. It contains <strong data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"316\">0.1% retinal</strong>, <strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"333\">3% Matrixyl</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"355\">1% panthenol</strong>, together with CELIMAX\'s A-Shot™ delivery technology. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"410\" data-content-reference-end=\"442\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p><p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"447\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r7sgei\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"469\">🌟 Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jwwocg\" data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"530\">\r\n✨ Helps reduce the <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"530\">appearance of fine lines &amp; wrinkles</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1qu6f\" data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"586\">\r\n🔍 Helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"586\">enlarged pores</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"56i7q3\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n💪 Supports a <strong data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"635\">firmer, more elastic-looking</strong> complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"es8abj\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n🌙 Helps refine <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"688\">uneven skin texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rhaesb\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n💧 Provides moisturizing and soothing care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17f1zdp\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"791\">\r\n🌟 Helps skin look <strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"791\">smoother, tighter &amp; more refined</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><b><br></b></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"815\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"833\">0.1% Retinal</strong><br data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\">\r\nAn advanced vitamin A derivative that helps improve the appearance of wrinkles, texture and pores. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"923\" data-content-reference-end=\"942\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1120\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"989\">3% Matrixyl</strong><br data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\">\r\nA peptide complex designed to support the appearance of firmer, more elastic-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1053\" data-content-reference-end=\"1072\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p