21\" data-end=\"1764\">every other night for the first 2 weeks</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15kr2d\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\nApply a small amount to targeted areas first.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1map1q9\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\nOnce your skin becomes accustomed to it, you can gradually increase usage.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lyb2h\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer if needed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1890sne\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1968\">Use sunscreen every morning.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1865\" data-content-reference-end=\"1884\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol><div><b><br></b></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2zgyvj\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2024\">⚠️ Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2280\">Retinal can cause <strong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2074\">mild tingling or irritation</strong>, especially when first introduced. If irritation occurs, reduce frequency and use a soothing moisturizer. A patch test is recommended, particularly for sensitive skin.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,56,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/xS91YWcBtYmBwO8Knrn5R2WoZBo3z09ItAMxiAa9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 09:30:50','2026-09-17 02:36:08'),(8,'Retinal Booster Shot Serum 30ml','retinal-booster-shot-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"424\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Arencia Retinal Booster Shot is an advanced <strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"144\">night-time firming serum</strong> formulated with <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"236\">Retinal, Caffeine, Ectoin, Bakuchiol, Ceramide NP and multiple peptides</strong>. It is designed to improve the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, enlarged pores and uneven texture while supporting hydration and the skin barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"387\" data-content-reference-end=\"419\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p><p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"424\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r7sgei\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"446\">🌟 Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hiuwqo\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"507\">\r\n✨ Helps reduce the appearance of <strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"507\">fine lines &amp; wrinkles</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzpm26\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n🔍 Helps <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"562\">refine the appearance of enlarged pores</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ee17x\" data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n💪 Supports <strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"614\">firmer, more elastic-looking skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fypc9j\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n🌙 Helps improve <strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"665\">rough &amp; uneven skin texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2txzk2\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"711\">\r\n☕ Helps revive <strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"711\">tired, dull-looking skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j0qr4z\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"764\">\r\n💧 Provides hydration and <strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"764\">skin-barrier support</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b7busn\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n🌿 Helps soothe and protect stressed-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><br></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"840\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"1006\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"865\">🌙 Retinal — 200ppm</strong><br data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\">\r\nA vitamin A derivative that helps improve the appearance of skin texture, fine lines and elasticity. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"956\" data-content-reference-end=\"988\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1022\">☕ Caffeine</strong><br data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\nHelps energize dull-looking skin and reduce the appearance of puffiness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1080\" data-content-reference-end=\"1099\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1285\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1150\">🧬 Ectoin</strong><br data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\nHelps protect the skin from environmental stress and moisture loss while supporting hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1211\" data-content-reference-end=\"1230\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1408\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1303\">🌿 Bakuchiol</strong><br data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\nComplements the formula with skin-conditioning and firming care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1315\" data-content-reference-end=\"1334\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1429\">🛡️ Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\nHelps support the skin barrier and retain moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1409\" data-content-reference-end=\"1428\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1663\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1545\">💎 Peptide Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\nContains multiple peptides designed to support firmer, smoother-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1532\" data-content-reference-end=\"1551\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1663\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1687\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1739\">Mature • Normal • Combination • Dry • Oily Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1862\">Especially suitable for skin concerned with <strong data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1861\">fine lines, wrinkles, visible pores, uneven texture and loss of firmness</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1862\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j28pgr\" data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1881\">🌙 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"2263\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x8gx47\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\nApply to <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1913\">clean, dry skin</strong>, preferably at night.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ycjk0b\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\nStart with a <strong data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1986\">small amount every other night</strong>, especially if you are new to retinal.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11z5qlf\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\nGently spread over the face, avoiding the immediate eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bazxp\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vs2q8n\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\nGradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to it.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlo8fe\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2263\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2225\">Use sunscreen every morning.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2112\" data-content-reference-end=\"2144\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol><div><b><br></b></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2zgyvj\" data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2281\">⚠️ Important</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2551\">Because it contains retinal, beginners should introduce it slowly. Avoid using it in the same routine with strong exfoliating acids or other potentially irritating actives until your skin has adjusted. Patch testing is recommended.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/yazvBdJ1iwMpecU8zS7P1nQNOQVinIVvsarYlZS8.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 09:38:11','2026-09-14 09:10:55'),(9,'All in One Black Snail Repair Cream 100ml','all-in-one-black-snail-repair-cream-100ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"381\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">DABO All In One Black Snail Repair Cream is a multifunctional moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"225\">Black Snail Secretion Filtrate, Niacinamide and Adenosine</strong>. It is designed to provide hydration, nourishment, brightening care and support for smoother, healthier-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"343\" data-content-reference-end=\"375\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p><p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"381\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yqshc1\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"402\">✨ Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uu90l3\" data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"478\">\r\n🐌 <strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"428\">Skin Repair Care</strong> — Helps support damaged and stressed-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16p1p2f\" data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"502\">Deep Hydration</strong> — Helps lock in moisture and reduce dryness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jsxe7\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"628\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"571\">Brightening Care</strong> — Helps improve the appearance of dull, uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j5oelr\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"653\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> — Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x72wjb\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"788\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"745\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> — Helps skin look smoother and more supple\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dktyji\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"819\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> — Helps leave skin soft, smooth and radiant\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h0vyby\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"978\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"887\">Fast-Absorbing</strong> — Designed to absorb without a heavy, greasy feeling <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"929\" data-content-reference-end=\"961\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><br></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1002\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1104\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1041\">🐌 Black Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong><br data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1044\">\r\nHelps nourish, moisturize and support the skin\'s resilience.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1219\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1123\">✨ Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\">\r\nHelps brighten the appearance of dull skin, improve uneven tone and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1312\"><strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1237\">💜 Adenosine</strong><br data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\nProvides anti-aging care and helps improve the appearance of fine lines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1463\"><strong data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1350\">💧 Glycerin &amp; Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1353\">\r\nHelp attract and retain moisture for softer, more hydrated-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1405\" data-content-reference-end=\"1437\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1487\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1612\"><strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1506\">All Skin Types</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1573\">dry, normal, combination, sensitive and mature skin</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1548\" data-content-reference-end=\"1580\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1612\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1631\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103msd1\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1706\">\r\nApply serum/essence if using one.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rt0wa5\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\nGently massage over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1819\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13c29z8\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1848\">morning and night</strong>.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,16,35,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/6sBhXiZPHANrCyZXX3lUk9RLZ16MT5qfG7