l Ascorbic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\nA stable Vitamin C derivative that provides brightening and radiance care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1607\" data-content-reference-end=\"1639\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1666\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1690\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1738\">Normal • Dry • Combination • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1898\">Especially suitable for skin concerns such as <strong data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1859\">dullness, dark spots, uneven skin tone and post-blemish discoloration</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1833\" data-content-reference-end=\"1852\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1898\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1917\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jt0t3r\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"knnl15\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\nApply evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz298d\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c156l5\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2139\">sunscreen</strong>.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/dfAW