\"730\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"752\">Soothing Care</strong> — Fermented grain extracts help calm and comfort the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11j1wgj\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"833\">No White Cast</strong> — Blends smoothly into the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14dfm06\" data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n💄 <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"890\">Makeup-Friendly</strong> — Lightweight texture works well under makeup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rsg38\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"963\">Non-Sticky Finish</strong> — Leaves a natural, dewy-looking finish <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"993\" data-content-reference-end=\"1025\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><br></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1065\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1185\"><strong data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1092\">🌾 Rice Extract — 30%</strong><br data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\nRich in vitamins, amino acids and minerals; helps moisturize and provide antioxidant care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1218\">🌿 Fermented Grain Extracts</strong><br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\nHelp nourish, soothe and hydrate the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1328\"><strong data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1282\">✨ Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1285\">\r\nProvides brightening and skin-barrier care.</p><p data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1328\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1352\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1431\"><strong data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1371\">All Skin Types</strong> — especially <strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1430\">Normal, Dry, Combination &amp; Sensitive Skin</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1568\">The product is also officially described as <strong data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1529\">non-comedogenic, fragrance-free and alcohol-free</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1511\" data-content-reference-end=\"1530\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1568\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1587\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kqimts\" data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1649\">final step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itc27k\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\nApply a generous, even layer to the face, neck and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfwmn4\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\nApply before sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dp15u5\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1786\">Reapply every 2–3 hours</strong> for continued protection, especially during prolonged sun exposure.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,19,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/44UXyND3vOugB3CGXOIdbKVy0Wi40tn7mXzRXTaE.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 10:06:45','2026-09-14 09:07:06'),(12,'Day-Light Protection Airy Sunscreen SPF50 PA+++ 50ml','day-light-protection-airy-sunscreen-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"431\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN Day-Light Protection Airy Sunscreen is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"231\">broad-spectrum UV protection</strong> while keeping the skin hydrated and comfortable. Its airy texture absorbs quickly and is designed t