data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1723\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1747\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1944\"><strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1766\">All Skin Types</strong><br data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\nEspecially suitable for <strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1848\">Oily • Combination • Normal • Dry • Dehydrated Skin</strong> and those who prefer a lightweight, less-shiny sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1847\" data-content-reference-end=\"1866\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1944\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1963\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjrck6\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2024\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkgton\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\nApply an adequate amount evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykg86y\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2114\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d0udif\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2144\">\r\nApply before sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sx229h\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2251\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2182\">Reapply at least every 2 hours</strong> during continued sun exposure.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,19,79,NULL,'[\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AKGkAahIiLA\", \"https://youtu.be/raeWk0rgNhs?si=Iex0xy9gWDrzVa3F\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/2efDRR0rymzjf6fhbEF0mLTsD3RQJe4Cxph9j3KE.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 11:40:42','2026-09-13 17:27:27'),(13,'A-CLEAR SOOTHING PINK ERASER 15ml','a-clear-soothing-pink-eraser-15ml','<p data-s