 Helps skin look <strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"832\">clearer and smoother</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><b><br></b></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"856\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"961\"><strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"873\">🌸 Calamine</strong><br data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"876\">\r\nHelps soothe blemishes and irritated-looking areas while supporting oil-control care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1075\"><strong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"990\">🧪 Salicylic Acid (BHA)</strong><br data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"993\">\r\nHelps exfoliate dead skin cells, unclog pores and remove pore-clogging impurities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1101\">🌿 Tea Tree Leaf Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\nProvides purifying and soothing care for blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1194\">💙 Azulene (Guaiazulene)</strong><br data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\nKnown for its soothing properties and helps reduce the appearance of redness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1367\"><strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1316\">🍃 Centella Asiatica &amp; Madecassoside</strong><br data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\nHelp provide calming and skin-conditioning care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1480\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1385\">💧 Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\nHelps moisturize and support comfortable-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1425\" data-content-reference-end=\"1444\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1480\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1504\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1569\">Blemish-Prone • Oily • Combination • Normal • Sensitive Skin</strong></p><p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1569\"><br></strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1588\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1620\">⚠️ Do NOT shake the bottle.</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zhy8dp\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\nCleanse and dry your skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f4pgbq\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\nLeave the liquid and pink sediment separated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mndhn3\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\nTake a clean cotton swab and reach all the way to the bottom.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13zvx2k\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\nPick up the <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1823\">pink sediment together with the liquid</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ld6dk1\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1873\">\r\nDab directly onto the affected/blemish areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vsdaji\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\nAllow it to dry.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,11,79,NULL,'[\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/3jr4Z7SH1xY\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/13GgsNsoeFvpnAD2D4T9uuwBFk2uCHD9XbrsGpCc.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 11:47:27','2026-09-13 17:28:18'),(14,'Real Fresh Foam Green Tea Facial Cleanser 160ml','real-fresh-foam-green-tea-facial-cleanser-160ml','<p data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"404\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN Real Fresh Foam Green Tea is a refreshing daily facial cleanser formulated with <strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"230\">Green Tea Water and real Green Tea leaves</strong>. It creates a rich foam that helps remove dirt, excess sebum and impurities