"917\" data-end=\"1088\"><strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"939\">🍃 Green Tea Water</strong><br data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"942\">\r\nThe cleanser features Green Tea Water as a key ingredient, providing antioxidant and skin-conditioning care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1020\" data-content-reference-end=\"1039\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1118\">🍵 Real Green Tea Leaves</strong><br data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\nReal green tea leaves are included in the product and are separated at the bottom of the bottle. Green tea provides antioxidant and soothing benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1222\" data-content-reference-end=\"1241\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1328\">✨ Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1331\">\r\nHelps provide brightening and skin-barrier care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1443\"><strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1406\">💧 Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1409\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1558\"><strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1473\">🌿 Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong><br data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\nProvide moisturizing and soothing skin care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1451\" data-content-reference-end=\"1470\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1558\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1582\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1835\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1601\">All Skin Types</strong> — including <strong data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1660\">Normal, Combination, Oily &amp; Sensitive Skin</strong>. The product is particularly useful for people looking for a cleanser that removes excess oil while maintaining a comfortable skin feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1709\" data-content-reference-end=\"1728\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1835\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1854\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2146\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hpuxr0\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\nPump an appropriate amount of foam onto your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16h0bqw\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\nGently massage over the entire face in circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2048\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2r242a\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2146\">\r\nFollow with toner and the rest of your skincare routine.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,3,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/wQZA8OeFAdPFKVkryKEkSaJOQs4P0YPNktgh0ezd.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 11:51:54','2026-09-13 17:46:42'),(15,'Calming Cica Tree Micellar Cleansing Oil 300ml','calming-cica-tree-micellar-cleansing-oil-300ml','<p data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"444\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN Calming Cica Tree Micellar Cleansing Oil is a lightweight cleansing oil designed to remove <strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"251\">makeup, sunscreen, dirt, excess sebum and impurities</strong> while helping maintain the skin’s moisture balance. Its micellar-structured formula emulsifies with water and rinses away without a heavy, sticky feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start