=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><br></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1111\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1200\"><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1152\">🍃 Centella Asiatica (Cica) Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\nProvides soothing and skin-conditioning care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1217\">🌿 Tea Tree</strong><br data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\nHelps provide purifying and calming care for blemish-prone and oily-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1405\"><strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1331\">💙 Azulene (Guaiazulene)</strong><br data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\nKnown for its soothing properties and helps calm stressed-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1495\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1444\">🧪 LHA (Capryloyl Salicylic Acid)</strong><br data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\nProvides gentle exfoliating and pore/sebum care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1589\"><strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1534\">🛡️ Ceramide NP + Other Ceramides</strong><br data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\nHelp support the skin barrier and maintain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1704\"><strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1621\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\">\r\nMultiple forms of hyaluronic acid help provide hydration and moisture retention.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1923\"><strong data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1730\">🌱 10 Botanical Oils</strong><br data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1733\">\r\nIncludes oils such as olive, evening primrose, carrot seed, camellia, moringa, argan, avocado, grape seed and walnut oils for nourishing cleansing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1861\" data-content-reference-end=\"1880\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1923\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1947\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1979\"><strong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1966\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2042\"><strong data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2042\">Sensitive • Combination • Oily • Dry • Blemish-Prone Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2191\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2130\">makeup removal + pore care + soothing care</strong> in one cleansing step. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2110\" data-content-reference-end=\"2129\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2191\"><br></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2210\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jyrmem\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount onto <strong data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2259\">dry hands</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58wexx\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2327\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2287\">dry face</strong> and gently massage in circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r4x841\" data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\nAdd a little lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ow3gwn\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2412\">\r\nContinue massaging until the oil turns <strong data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2411\">milky</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wns0rj\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser if you prefer a <strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2536\">double-cleansing routine</strong>.&nbsp;</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,2,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/EQEJEp3rkv6BEKACuOa3WVQIrvNUfCfulCDoLR1F.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 11:56:03','2026-09-13 17:40:05'),(16,'Azulene Soothing PH Cleanser 150ml','azulene-soothing-ph-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"435\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SUR.MEDIC+ Azulene Soothing pH Cleanser is a gentle <strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"160\">low pH facial cleanser</strong> designed to effectively remove <strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"259\">dirt, excess oil, sunscreen, light makeup, and daily impurities</strong> while maintaining the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. Its rich, creamy foam cleanses without stripping the skin, leaving it feeling soft, refreshed, and comfortably hydrated.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p><p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"435\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><br></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"678\">Formulated with <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"526\">Azulene, Centella Asiatica, Ceramides, Hyaluronic Acid, and Panthenol</strong>, this cleanser helps calm sensitive skin, reduce the appearance of redness, and support a healthy skin barrier, making it ideal for everyday cleansing.</p><p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"678\"><br></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"683\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yqshc1\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"704\">✨ Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17126hm\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"736\">Gentle Deep Cleansing</strong> — Removes dirt, excess oil, sunscreen, and daily impurities without over-drying the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mt6dj\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"940\">\r\n💙 <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"849\">Soothing Care</strong> — Azulene and Centella Asiatica help calm sensitive, irritated, and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ujpf2t\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n⚖️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"964\">Low pH Formula</strong> — Helps maintain the skin\'s natural pH balance for a healthier skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lxinrv\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1060\">Hydrating</strong> — Hyaluronic Acid and Panthenol help keep skin moisturized after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165h06s\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1159\">Barrier Care</strong> — Ceramides help strengthen and protect the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4qr8o\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1253\">Soft Creamy Foam</strong> — Creates rich, luxurious foam that cleanses comfortably without leaving skin feeling tight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12z3561\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1377\">Daily Gentle Cleanser</strong> — Suitable for both morning and evening skincare routines.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><div><br></div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1465\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1581\"><strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1495\">💙 Guaiazulene (Azulene)</strong><br data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\nKnown for its soothing properties, helping calm redness and sensitive-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1677\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1615\">🍃 Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br>\r\nProvides calming care while supporting skin barrier recovery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1764\"><strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1703\">🛡️ Ceramide Complex</strong><br>\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier and prevent moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1856\"><strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1788\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br>\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration and helps keep skin soft and plump.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1939\"><strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1887\">🌱 Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong><br>\r\nHelps moisturize, soothe, and support healthy skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2018\"><strong data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1957\">🌼 Allantoin</strong><br>\r\nSoftens the skin and helps reduce the feeling of irritation.</p><p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2018\"><br></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2047\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2080\"><strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2067\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2155\"><strong data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2155\">Sensitive • Dry • Combination • Normal • Acne-Prone • Dehydrated Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2291\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2268\">gentle cleansing + soothing care + hydration + skin barrier support</strong> in one daily cleanser.</p><p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2291\"><br></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2296\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2315\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzm5or\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\nWet your face with <strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2357\">lukewarm water</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f450bh\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount into your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11in0io\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2466\">\r\nAdd a little water and work into a rich, creamy foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq4hfj\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2522\">\r\nGently massage over the face using circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kdhos\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\nFollow with toner and the rest of your skincare routine.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,3,65,NULL,'[\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/eN_HYFYfmGU\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/YOdsiOLarttHNbNXKr22yv5UFyNCrpL0lUhXGMy3.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 12:02:14','2026-09-13 17:14:07'),(17,'Super Glutathione 100™ Bright Tone Up Cream 40ml','super-glutathione-100-bright-tone-up-cream-40ml','<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"463\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SUR.MEDIC+ Super Glutathione 100™ Bright Tone Up Cream is a lightweight <strong data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"190\">tone-up moisturizer</strong> that instantly enhances skin radiance while providing long-lasting hydration. Infused with <strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"346\">Glutathione, Niacinamide, and brightening botanical extracts</strong>, it helps improve the appearance of dull, uneven-looking skin for a naturally brighter and more luminous complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"695\">Its smooth, non-sticky formula blends seamlessly into the skin, delivering an instant tone-up effect without feeling heavy or cakey. Perfect for daily use as the final step of your skincare routine or as a brightening makeup base.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yqshc1\" data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"721\">✨ Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a87en7\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"753\">Instant Tone-Up Effect</strong> — Brightens dull-looking skin for a naturally radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18mt5o3\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"845\">Brightening Care</strong> — Glutathione and Niacinamide help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ga6pv\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"943\">Hydrating</strong> — Moisturizes the skin while maintaining long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ern7hl\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1039\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> — Helps keep the skin healthy and comfortable throughout the day.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p23uw5\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1134\">Lightweight Texture</strong> — Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy or sticky finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k7ib8w\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\n💄 <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1224\">Perfect Makeup Base</strong> — Smooths the skin and creates an even-looking canvas before makeup application.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x9u2fx\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1325\">Daily Glow</strong> — Leaves skin looking fresh, luminous, and naturally healthy.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1416\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1560\"><strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1444\">✨ Glutathione (100ppm)</strong><br>\r\nA well-known antioxidant that helps improve the appearance of dull skin and promotes a brighter-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1685\"><strong data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1593\">💛 Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)</strong><br>\r\nHelps visibly brighten the skin, improve uneven skin tone, and strengthen the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1794\"><strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1724\">🌿 Botanical Brightening Extracts</strong><br>\r\nHelp nourish the skin while supporting a healthy, radiant appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1876\"><strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1818\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br>\r\nProvides deep hydration and helps maintain skin moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1976\"><strong data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1908\">🛡️ Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong><br>\r\nHelps soothe and moisturize the skin while supporting barrier care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2080\"><strong data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2007\">🌱 Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong><br>\r\nAn antioxidant that helps protect the skin from environmental stressors.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2109\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2142\"><strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2129\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2207\"><strong data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2207\">Dull • Dry • Normal • Combination • Oily • Uneven Skin Tone</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2334\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2320\">instant brightening + hydration + glowing skin + smooth makeup base</strong> in one cream.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2358\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2632\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7velbs\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\nComplete your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pxixyz\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end