 Asiatica Extract (Cica)</strong><br data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\nHelps soothe irritation while supporting healthy skin barrier function.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1692\"><strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1633\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br>\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration and helps retain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1780\"><strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1718\">🛡️ Ceramide Complex</strong><br>\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier and helps prevent moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1863\"><strong data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1811\">🌱 Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong><br>\r\nHelps moisturize, soothe, and support healthy skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1953\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1881\">🌼 Allantoin</strong><br>\r\nSoftens the skin and helps reduce irritation for a smoother complexion.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1982\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2015\"><strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2002\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2093\"><strong data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2093\">Sensitive • Dry • Combination • Normal • Dehydrated • Redness-Prone Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2218\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2204\">soothing care + hydration + skin barrier support + redness relief</strong> in one toner.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2242\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rglawb\" data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\nAfter cleansing, shake the bottle well before use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oey7gm\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of mousse into your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5fztg\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"107i4bf\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gb5stp\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\nUse morning and evening as part of your daily skincare routine.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,6,65,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/qyZZoZ4GijD4FPM2C5l2uIQ9kojBY0zvbYPAEaiB.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 12:14:40','2026-09-13 17:13:02'),(19,'Super Ceramide Renewal Cream 50ml','super-ceramide-renewal-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"473\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SUR.MEDIC+ Super Ceramide Renewal Cream is a rich yet lightweight <strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"178\">barrier-repair moisturizer</strong> designed to deeply hydrate and strengthen the skin\'s natural protective barrier. Formulated with <strong data-start=\"276\" data-end=\"368\">Multi-Ceramide Complex, Panthenol, Hyaluronic Acid, and nourishing botanical ingredients</strong>, it helps replenish moisture, reduce dryness, and improve skin comfort for a healthy, smooth complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"715\">Its creamy, non-greasy texture absorbs comfortably into the skin, providing long-lasting hydration while helping protect against moisture loss and environmental stress. Ideal for daily use, especially for dry, dehydrated, or sensitive skin.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"720\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yqshc1\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"741\">✨ Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wupzh0\" da