1523\" data-end=\"1545\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br>\r\nProvides deep hydration and helps keep the skin plump and moisturized.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1711\"><strong data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1647\">🌱 Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong><br>\r\nHelps soothe irritation while supporting skin barrier recovery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1791\"><strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1729\">🌼 Allantoin</strong><br>\r\nSoftens the skin and helps reduce the feeling of sensitivity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1890\"><strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1832\">🍃 Centella Asiatica Extract (Cica)</strong><br>\r\nProvides soothing care and supports healthy-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"2001\"><strong data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1906\">✨ Squalane</strong><br>\r\nHelps nourish the skin, improve moisture retention, and maintain a smooth, healthy complexion.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2030\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2063\"><strong data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2050\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2143\"><strong data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2143\">Dry • Sensitive • Normal • Combination • Dehydrated • Barrier-Damaged Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2280\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2260\">deep hydration + barrier repair + soothing care + long-lasting moisture</strong> in one moisturizer.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2304\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2558\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ime0we\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\nComplete your cleansing, toner, and serum steps.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yiev9o\" data-start=\"2358\" data-end