ata-start=\"771\" data-end=\"797\">Firming &amp; Lifting Care</strong> — Helps improve skin elasticity for a firmer, lifted appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y121sr\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"886\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> — Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpkd2b\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"968\">Deep Hydration</strong> — Replenishes moisture and keeps skin soft, smooth, and plump.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzwfkv\" data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1057\">Barrier Support</strong> — Ceramides help strengthen the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"km3oe8\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1211\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1153\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> — Leaves skin feeling smoother, softer, and more refined.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpaipg\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n🌸 <strong data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1241\">Boosts Skin Radiance</strong> — Promotes a healthy, youthful-looking glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdqwv0\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n⚡ <strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1314\">Lightweight Formula</strong> — Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy or sticky residue.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15n0bhy\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1405\">🔬 Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1536\"><strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1429\">💜 Peptide Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1432\">\r\nHelps improve skin elasticity, supports collagen production, and minimizes the appearance of fine lines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1655\"><strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1568\">🧬 Triple Collagen Complex</strong><br>\r\nA blend of collagen types that helps improve skin firmness, resilience, and hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1775\"><strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1687\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong><br>\r\nProvides intense hydration and helps maintain moisture for plump, healthy-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1863\"><strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1801\">🛡️ Ceramide Complex</strong><br>\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier and helps prevent moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1894\">🌱 Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong><br>\r\nHelps soothe the skin while supporting barrier repair and moisture retention.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2079\"><strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1991\">✨ Niacinamide</strong><br>\r\nHelps brighten dull skin, improve uneven skin tone, and support a healthier complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2182\"><strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2097\">🌼 Adenosine</strong><br>\r\nHelps improve the appearance of wrinkles and supports smoother, firmer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"i8rbhu\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2211\">💁‍♀️ Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2244\"><strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2231\">All Skin Types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2324\"><strong data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2324\">Mature • Dry • Normal • Combination • Dehydrated • Loss of Elasticity Skin</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2433\">It is particularly suitable if you want <strong data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2419\">lifting + firming + wrinkle care + deep hydration</strong> in one serum.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2457\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9kgo35\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\nAfter cleansing and applying toner, dispense 2–3 drops or an appropriate amount onto your fingertips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wesv0l\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\nApply evenly to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo7ms0\" data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytg95t\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer to lock in hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"102b64m\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\nUse morning and evening for the best results.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,11,65,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/lPTg0SR099t9Jyi6kcpQulFctaGaKnCjKNg9caxs.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-13 12:24:37','2026-09-13 17:17:26'),(21,'Rice & Ceramide Moisturizing Cream 50ml','rice-ceramide-moisturizing-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"367\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"152\">THE FACE SHOP Rice &amp; Ceramide Moisturizing Cream</strong> is a rich moisturizing cream designed mainly to provide <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"274\">deep hydration, nourish dry skin and support the skin barrier</strong>. It contains rice extract, rice bran oil and ceramide. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"493\" data-content-reference-end=\"525\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18gpaej\" data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"389\">🌾 Main Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"136vxas\" data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"442\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"418\">Deeply moisturizes</strong> dry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bdnx89\" data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"512\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"481\">Strengthens the skin barrier</strong> and helps reduce moisture loss\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvf2q5\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"603\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"550\">Rice extract + rice bran oil</strong> help nourish and improve the appearance of dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19e04q8\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n✨ Helps skin look <strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"662\">soft, smooth and naturally radiant</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15hft54\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n🧴 Helps relieve the feeling of <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"737\">dryness, tightness and rough texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6a1hy\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n💦 Contains <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"774\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> for additional hydration <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"952\" data-content-reference-end=\"984\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ntixjr\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"860\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"979\"><strong data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"896\">1. Rice Extract (Oryza Sativa)</strong><br data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"899\">\r\nHelps nourish the skin and supports a smoother, more radiant-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1064\"><strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1001\">2. Rice Bran Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\nProvides emollient nourishment and helps keep dry skin soft.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1084\">3. Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\nHelps reinforce the skin\'s natural moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1240\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1181\">4. Glycerin</strong><br data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\nA humectant that attracts and retains water in the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1267\">5. Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\nHelps bind moisture and improve the skin\'s hydrated, plump feel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1365\">6. Shea Butter &amp; Lecithin</strong><br data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\nHelp condition and soften the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1551\" data-content-reference-end=\"1583\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cw7ih5\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1472\">🧖‍♀️ Suitable Skin Types</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1494\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1494\">Best suited for:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1inr22w\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1511\">\r\nDry skin ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"194dznx\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\nVery dry/dehydrated skin ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"104cclg\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\nNormal skin ⭐⭐⭐⭐\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vko732\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1586\">\r\nCombination skin ⭐⭐⭐\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4iy9d7\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\nSensitive skin ⭐⭐⭐\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1731\">The product is particularly positioned for <strong data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1692\">dry, flaky or moisture-depleted skin</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1835\" data-content-reference-end=\"1868\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1889\"><strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1758\">Oily/acne-prone skin:</strong> It may feel somewhat rich, so oily skin users may prefer using a smaller amount, especially in Bangladesh\'s hot and humid weather.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kk4nc4\" data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1908\">🧴 How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13z84id\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner/serum as usual.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38l322\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\nTake about an <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2003\">almond-sized amount</strong> of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j8d5x3\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2087\">\r\nGently massage until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19tfihk\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2119\">morning and/or night</strong> as the final moisturizing step.</li></ol>',NULL,NULL,16,76,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/bJP3lBhVbrHNAZzPRtu8niq3jC6gVuaK3LdoXT1O.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:07:16','2026-09-14 09:01:52'),(22,'Rice Water Bright Light Cleansing Oil 150ml','rice-water-bright-light-cleansing-oil-150ml','<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"341\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"158\">THE FACE SHOP Rice Water Bright Light Cleansing Oil</strong> is a lightweight cleansing oil designed to effectively remove <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"282\">makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and oil-based impurities</strong> while leaving the skin feeling soft, clean, and refreshed.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"361\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"olb5k8\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"445\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"398\">Removes Makeup &amp; Sunscreen</strong> – Dissolves makeup, SPF, and daily impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mzmgx1\" data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"528\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"469\">Deep Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove excess sebum and oil-based dirt from pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ipsqa0\" data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"634\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"554\">Brightening Care</strong> – Rice-derived ingredients help promote a fresh and radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3w3wy\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"663\">Lightweight Texture</strong> – Feels light on the skin without an overly heavy or greasy finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ij9fka\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"751\">Nourishing</strong> – Rice bran oil and jojoba oil help keep skin soft and conditioned.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzcxoh\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"850\">Helps Prevent Dryness</strong> – Cleanses while helping maintain a comfortable skin feel.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"161iyt3\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\n🔄 <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"945\">Ideal for Double Cleansing</strong> – Perfect as the first step of an evening cleansing routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"8pya06\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1029\">🌾 Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vvet7t\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1050\">1. Rice Extract</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1131\">Helps nourish the skin and supports a <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1130\">brighter, smoother-looking complexion</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2ve08i\" data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1153\">2. Rice Bran Oil</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1249\">Provides nourishing and conditioning benefits while helping the skin feel soft after cleansing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"n0slj9\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1273\">3. Jojoba Seed Oil</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1357\">Helps soften and condition the skin while supporting a smooth cleansing experience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11b2zvh\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1374\">4. Glycerin</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1475\">A humectant that helps attract and retain moisture, reducing the feeling of dryness after cleansing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1493\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e97dvo\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1558\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount to <strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1557\">dry hands and a dry face</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7m9mk\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\nGently massage over the face to dissolve makeup, sunscreen, and impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9po06\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\nAdd a little water and massage again until the oil turns <strong data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1707\">milky</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tjxcaq\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm or comfortable-temperature water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9t1w2\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\nFollow with a <strong data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1825\">water-based facial cleanser</strong> for double cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15lfzkk\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1874\">💡 Best Used At Night</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1950\">Especially useful after wearing <strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1949\">sunscreen or makeup throughout the day</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,2,76,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/NN2QYDFWEPRoOBovwXUMEsPf0MFnK274U9AZtuE4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:11:28','2026-09-16 11:14:09'),(23,'All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml','all-around-safe-block-aqua-sun-gel-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"365\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"165\">MISSHA All Around Safe Block Aqua Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++</strong> is a lightweight Korean sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"257\">high-level UVA and UVB protection</strong> with a refreshing, hydrating gel texture. It is particularly popular for its comfortable, non-heavy finish.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"386\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xo30xx\" data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"416\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA++++ provides strong UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18t26nh\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"568\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"521\">Hydrating</strong> – Helps keep skin moisturized and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12c4wkf\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"658\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"606\">Lightweight Aqua Gel Texture</strong> – Absorbs comfortably without feeling overly heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18sbt6\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"680\">Smooth Finish</strong> – Helps skin feel soft and fresh after application.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vzxrki\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"801\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"764\">Suitable for Daily Use</strong> – Ideal for everyday sun protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a9z33b\" data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"826\">Makeup-Friendly</strong> – Can be used as the final step of your morning skincare routine before makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"928\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6c7wdf\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"952\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1031\">Helps attract and retain moisture, supporting hydrated and plump-feeling skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wblwf6\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1064\">🌿 Botanical/Plant Extracts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1177\">The formula contains several plant-derived ingredients intended to provide conditioning and antioxidant support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j0yqz7\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1210\">💦 Moisturizing Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1292\">Help maintain a comfortable moisture level while the sunscreen protects the skin.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1310\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ary5z\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\nApply sunscreen as the <strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1406\">last step of skincare</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nniqox\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\nUse a generous amount over the face, neck, ears and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ro7caj\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\nApply approximately <strong data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1541\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omc446\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, wiping the face, or prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mo69mk\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1677\">📌 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1752\"><strong data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1752\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → MISSHA Aqua Sun Gel → Makeup</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,21,7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/6mNAuj4qz0X110kVhVpks5UK3erWD8YnlPgNoRSV.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:13:41','2026-09-14 08:50:52'),(24,'Essence Sun Milk Ex SPF50+/PA+++ 70ml','essence-sun-milk-ex-spf50pa-70ml','<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"371\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"155\">MISSHA All Around Safe Block Essence Sun Milk EX SPF50+/PA+++</strong> is a lightweight daily sunscreen with a <strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"227\">milky, essence-like texture</strong>. It is designed to provide strong UVB protection while helping protect the skin from UVA rays and keeping the skin comfortable and moisturized.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"392\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ia9g59\" data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"500\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"422\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA+++ provides UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ojwdyf\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"522\">Moisturizing</strong> – Helps keep skin feeling hydrated and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eep3v8\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n🥛 <strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"608\">Lightweight Milk Texture</strong> – Spreads easily and absorbs comfortably.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"41mlt3\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"737\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"677\">Smooth Skin Finish</strong> – Helps create a smooth base for daily skincare and makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qw84l\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"821\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"767\">Daily Sun Protection</strong> – Suitable for everyday use when exposed to sunlight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gd17ox\" data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"844\">Easy to Apply</strong> – The fluid texture makes it easy to spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z3id49\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"957\">⭐ Key Ingredients &amp; Skin Benefits</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j0yqz7\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"990\">💦 Moisturizing Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1098\">Help maintain skin hydration and prevent the skin from feeling excessively dry after sunscreen application.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"29x4ps\" data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1127\">🌿 Plant-Based Extracts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1236\">The formulation includes botanical ingredients that help condition the skin and provide antioxidant support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1025oec\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1262\">🧴 Essence-Type Base</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1371\">Designed to give the sunscreen a more comfortable, moisturizing feel rather than a thick cream-like texture.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1389\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2p3xx\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\nShake the bottle well before use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uzte9w\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1492\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1491\">final step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fopym3\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\nTake a generous amount and spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xh3yt3\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1604\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong> when possible.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f86j7z\" data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1648\">2 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure and after sweating or wiping the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o003fo\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1745\">🌞 Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1827\"><strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1827\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → MISSHA Essence Sun Milk EX → Makeup</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1857\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"2036\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1886\"><tr data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1886\"><th data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1871\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1886\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"2036\"><tr data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1924\"><td data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1915\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1914\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1924\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1957\"><td data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1948\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1947\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1957\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\