h3 data-section-id=\"1olkp1r\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1272\">🛡️ SPF50+ PA++++</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1364\">Provides <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1328\">high-level broad-spectrum-style protection</strong> against both UVB and UVA radiation.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1382\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lojjzi\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\nApply the sunscreen as the <strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1482\">last step of skincare</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pg2tuz\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\nTake a generous amount and apply evenly to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iu8yf3\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\nApply before going outdoors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14vmwn4\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\nReapply approximately every <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1623\">2 hours</strong> during prolonged sun exposure, and after sweating or wiping your face.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1722\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1795\"><strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1795\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → MISSHA Cotton Sun → Makeup</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1825\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"2002\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1854\"><tr data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1854\"><th data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1839\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=