125\">greasy sunscreen</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lngzq\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2158\">\r\nPrefer a <strong data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2158\">soft-matte finish</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gckeq4\" data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2211\">\r\nWant sunscreen that works comfortably under makeup</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/RP0gQEzmOwfCrHONc30MIrAPiewqTlvz3yh7hMRh.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:19:19','2026-09-15 14:51:57'),(26,'All Around Safe Block Waterproof Sun Milk SPF50+/PA++++ 70ml','all-around-safe-block-waterproof-sun-milk-spf50pa-70ml','<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"415\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"177\">MISSHA All Around Safe Block Waterproof Sun Milk SPF50+/PA+++</strong> is a lightweight, water-resistant sunscreen designed for <strong data-start=\"235\" data-end=\"260\">daily and outdoor use</strong>. Its milky texture spreads easily and provides high UV protection while helping the sunscreen stay on the skin during <strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"414\">sweating and outdoor activities</strong>.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"436\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhr9gu\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"466\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA+++ provides strong UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wfk5k7\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"589\">Waterproof / Water-Resistant</strong> – Designed to provide better staying power when exposed to water and sweat.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rqgdsh\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n🏃 <strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"703\">Ideal for Outdoor Activities</strong> – Suitable for sports, travel, beach trips and other outdoor activities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ib0dam\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"859\">\r\n🥛 <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"810\">Lightweight Milk Texture</strong> – Spreads easily without a thick, heavy feeling.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwvtpw\" data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"936\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"881\">Smooth Finish</strong> – Helps leave the skin feeling comfortable and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k0bme\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n🌞 <strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"969\">Long-Lasting Protection</strong> – Designed to remain on the skin better during active use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"etycth\" data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1047\">⭐ Key Features</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jvn3p6\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1079\">💦 Water-Resistant Formula</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1247\">Its key advantage is its <strong data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1147\">waterproof/water-resistant performance</strong>, making it more suitable than a regular daily sunscreen when you expect sweating or water exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mc16d3\" data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1272\">🥛 Sun Milk Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1356\">The fluid milk texture makes it easy to distribute evenly across the face and body.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hhtrac\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1378\">🛡️ SPF50+ PA+++</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1469\">Provides high UVB protection with strong UVA protection for everyday and outdoor exposure.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1487\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2p3xx\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\nShake the bottle well before use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9aox1e\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1588\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kawyz5\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1664\">\r\nApply a generous, even layer to the face, neck and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iu8yf3\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\nApply before going outdoors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a0hx95\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\nReapply approximately every <strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1739\">2 hours</strong>, especially during prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u851vh\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\nReapply after <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1852\">swimming, excessive sweating or towel drying</strong>, even when using a water-resistant sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1926\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1999\"><strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1999\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → MISSHA Waterproof Sun Milk</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2029\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2207\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2058\"><tr data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2058\"><th data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2043\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2058\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2207\"><tr data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2096\"><td data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2087\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2086\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2096\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2129\"><td data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2120\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2119\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2129\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2154\"><td data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2146\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2145\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2178\"><td data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2170\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2169\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2178\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2207\"><td data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2200\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2199\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2207\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"377ojl\" data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2224\">💡 Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8muel\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n🏖️ Beach and swimming activities\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a4z4iz\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2294\">\r\n🏃 Sports and outdoor exercise\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t7isqw\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2324\">\r\n✈️ Travel and outdoor trips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0zixk\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n☀️ Hot and sunny weather\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jf5k3j\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n💦 People who sweat easily\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x1capg\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n🚶 Long periods outdoors</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/VlleMrfbQoLVKwuc0Z3tnYOqrVbpsiaDRPHWzyn1.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:22:25','2026-09-15 14:51:30'),(27,'Azelaic Acid 10 Hyaluron Redness Soothing Serum 30ml','azelaic-acid-10-hyaluron-redness-soothing-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"390\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"159\">ANUA Azelaic Acid 10 Hyaluron Redness Soothing Serum</strong> is a lightweight soothing serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"228\">10% azelaic acid</strong> and hydrating ingredients. It is designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"305\" data-end=\"363\">redness, blemishes, uneven skin tone and rough texture</strong> while providing hydration.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"410\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wn2w4u\" data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n🔴 <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"459\">Helps Reduce the Appearance of Redness</strong> – Azelaic acid helps calm the look of redness and irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ep0p29\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"555\">Blemish Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of acne-prone and blemish-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s7x3bi\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"661\">Brightening &amp; Even-Tone Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of post-blemish marks and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5l87rw\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"789\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"753\">Soothing</strong> – Helps calm stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vqi32\" data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"813\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Hyaluronic acid helps replenish and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c7jc8s\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n🧱 <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"899\">Supports Skin Barrier</strong> – Hydrating and conditioning ingredients help maintain a healthy-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kj7gn1\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1016\">Refines Skin Texture</strong> – Helps skin appear smoother and more even.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1082\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lyi2az\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1107\">1. 10% Azelaic Acid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1143\">The star ingredient of the formula.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1162\">It can help with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9jhzt9\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\nRedness and uneven-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ub54ne\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\nBlemishes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y6kz1d\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\nExcessive oiliness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7qse9e\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\nPost-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15tktu7\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\nRough skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5jjwlb\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1314\">2. Hyaluronic Acid 💧</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1403\">Helps attract and retain moisture, keeping the skin <strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1402\">hydrated, plump and comfortable</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11u99y9\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1435\">3. Soothing Ingredients 🌿</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1523\">The formula is designed to help calm and comfort skin that looks stressed or irritated.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1541\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1564\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ts7cyy\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\nApply toner if you use one.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9tvh8\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1635\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"txbmkk\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\nGently spread over the face, focusing on areas with <strong data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1728\">redness, blemishes or uneven tone</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12zjlss\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\nPat gently until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocmelr\" data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dkxt\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\nIn the morning, always finish with <strong data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1849\">SPF30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14mztfs\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1878\">🌙 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1960\"><strong data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1960\">Cleanser → Toner → ANUA Azelaic Acid 10 Serum → Moisturizer → Sunscreen (AM)</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6avsxv\" data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1979\">💡 How Often?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2133\">If you are new to azelaic acid, start <strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2041\">2–3 times per week</strong>, preferably at night. If your skin tolerates it well, you can gradually increase frequency.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2163\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2410\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2192\"><tr data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2192\"><th data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2177\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2192\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2410\"><tr data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2234\"><td data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2225\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2224\">Acne-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2234\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2269\"><td data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2260\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2259\">Redness-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2269\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2302\"><td data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2293\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2292\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2302\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2328\"><td data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2319\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2318\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2328\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2355\"><td data-start=\"2329\" data-end=\"2347\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2346\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2355\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2379\"><td data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2371\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2370\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2379\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2410\"><td data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2401\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2400\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2410\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2591\">*Even though azelaic acid is generally considered a relatively gentle active, sensitive skin can still experience <strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2562\">tingling, dryness or irritation</strong>, particularly when starting.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd2mpe\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2613\">⚠️ Important Tips</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2983\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nbxtbe\" data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\nDon\'t apply too much—<strong data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2664\">a thin layer is enough</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1inbn3m\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\nMild tingling can occur when first introducing azelaic acid.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rohkgk\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2783\">\r\nAvoid applying on damaged or freshly irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4f0aq\" data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2934\">\r\nIf using other strong actives such as <strong data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2866\">AHA/BHA, retinoids or strong vitamin C</strong>, introduce them carefully rather than combining everything at once.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11qal1\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"2983\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2963\">Sunscreen is essential</strong> during the daytime.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/D1lbtCcS19ee8Qd9iI5UOz3m7bsH3hOi43SFTYFo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:26:16','2026-09-14 08:58:18'),(28,'Niacinamide 10+ TXA 4 Serum 30ml','niacinamide-10-txa-4-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"384\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"125\">ANUA Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Serum</strong> is a targeted brightening serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"222\">10% Niacinamide and 4% Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</strong>. It is designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"335\">dark spots, post-acne marks, uneven skin tone and dullness</strong>, while supporting a smoother-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"404\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9i5vsp\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"474\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"431\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve dull, uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bobrvu\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"560\">\r\n🟤 <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"498\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Targets the appearance of hyperpigmentation and dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9c1d3\" data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"589\">Post-Acne Mark Care</strong> – Helps fade the appearance of lingering acne marks over time.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v8vlbx\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"682\">Helps Even Skin Tone</strong> – Supports a more uniform-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xglp7x\" data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"751\">Sebum Control</strong> – Niacinamide can help regulate excess sebum and reduce the appearance of enlarged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vh3jv3\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"872\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> – Niacinamide supports the skin\'s natural barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rorfz\" data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"942\">Hydrating</strong> – Helps maintain skin moisture for a smoother, healthier-looking finish.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1037\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w9gy2p\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1064\">1. Niacinamide 10% 💧</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1111\">A well-known form of vitamin B3 that can help:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16hmszp\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\nBrighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bipult\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\nReduce the appearance of dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134jhfi\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\nImprove uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vcbkpk\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\nControl excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ak6sl\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\nMinimize the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5qv0\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\nSupport the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c3u1t5\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1327\">2. Tranexamic Acid 4% (TXA) 🎯</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1422\">A targeted ingredient commonly used in brightening products to help improve the appearance of:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgm9vz\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\nHyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7qse9e\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\nPost-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1606\">The combination of <strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1535\">Niacinamide + TXA</strong> makes this serum particularly focused on pigmentation and brightening.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"guaaro\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1639\">3. Hydrating Ingredients 💦</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1770\">The formula also contains moisturizing ingredients to help keep the skin comfortable and hydrated while using brightening actives.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"drv64m\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\nApply toner if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hv3cx1\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1861\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum to the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18k5hs7\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\nGently spread and pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1956\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbzib5\" data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\nIn the morning, finish with <strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2012\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n42n4h\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2049\">🌞 Recommended Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2135\"><strong data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2135\">Cleanser → Toner → ANUA Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Serum → Moisturizer → Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uqd0yc\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2169\">🌙 Recommended Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2213\"><strong data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2213\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2243\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2456\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2272\"><tr data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2272\"><th data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2272\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2456\"><tr data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2308\"><td data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2299\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2298\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2308\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2341\"><td data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2332\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2331\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2369\"><td data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2360\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2359\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2369\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2401\"><td data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2392\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2391\">Acne-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2401\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2425\"><td data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2417\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2416\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2425\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2456\"><td data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2447\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2446\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2456\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2588\">*Sensitive skin should introduce the serum gradually because <strong data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2539\">10% niacinamide</strong> can cause irritation or flushing in some people.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x0eowd\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2604\">🎯 Best For</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2669\">This serum is particularly suitable if you are concerned about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2793\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2683\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8hrfr\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\nAcne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bhfgcn\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2764\">\r\nPost-inflammatory hyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gvm3bt\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2777\">\r\nExcess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2793\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd2mpe\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2815\">⚠️ Important Tips</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"3235\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5og7w\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\nStart with <strong data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2863\">once daily or every other day</strong> if you are new to active serums.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gqbypm\" data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\nDon\'t use excessive amounts—<strong data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2961\">2–3 drops are generally enough</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j4hez\" data-start=\"2963\" data-end=\"3085\">\r\nAlways use sunscreen during the day. Without adequate sun protection, pigmentation can return or become more noticeable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15977js\" data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3184\">\r\nIf using strong exfoliating acids or retinoids, introduce them carefully to minimize irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1sqqh\" data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3235\">\r\nPatch testing is recommended for sensitive skin.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/PJPLbiRc66XVwJ9Xhb4VlAfUt9t4eL14o8inKS5n.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:28:38','2026-09-14 17:24:57'),(29,'Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil 200ml','heartleaf-pore-control-cleansing-oil-200ml','<p data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"425\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"93\" data-end=\"138\">ANUA Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil</strong> is a lightweight cleansing oil designed to remove <strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"239\">makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum and impurities</strong> while helping cleanse the appearance of clogged pores. It features <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"349\">Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) extract</strong> and is particularly suitable for oily, combination and pore-congested skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"445\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nyo3vg\" data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"540\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"482\">Removes Makeup &amp; Sunscreen</strong> – Effectively dissolves makeup, SPF and daily impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xgosgz\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\">Pore Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove excess sebum and impurities around pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i52v6p\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n⚫ <strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"651\">Helps With Blackheads</strong> – Regular cleansing can help reduce the buildup that contributes to visible blackheads.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72jkj5\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"762\">Soothing Care</strong> – Heartleaf extract helps provide a calming, skin-comforting effect.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jw7bl6\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"934\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"868\">Moisture-Friendly Cleansing</strong> – Cleanses without leaving the skin feeling excessively stripped.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpu5yi\" data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"963\">Lightweight Texture</strong> – Easy to spread and massage over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ba3n2u\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n🔄 <strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1043\">Ideal for Double Cleansing</strong> – Works as the first step of an evening cleansing routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16k0z6v\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1125\">🌿 Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"u13wdm\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1175\">1. Heartleaf / Houttuynia Cordata Extract 🌿</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1356\">A popular Korean skincare ingredient known for its <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1272\">soothing and skin-conditioning properties</strong>. It is particularly popular in products formulated for oily and blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3xl4n8\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1383\">2. Plant-Derived Oils</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1491\">Help dissolve <strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1444\">oil-based impurities, sunscreen and makeup</strong> while providing a smooth cleansing experience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"139d4hs\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1511\">3. Glycerin 💧</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1598\">Helps attract and retain moisture, supporting a comfortable skin feel after cleansing.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1616\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r9utyl\" data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\nPump an appropriate amount onto <strong data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1666\">dry hands</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wcsk8n\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1695\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1694\">dry face</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cm7m63\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\nGently massage for about <strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1741\">30–60 seconds</strong>, especially around the nose and areas with visible sebum buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ge46j7\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and continue massaging until the oil turns <strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1891\">milky</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdg6bt\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\nFollow with a <strong data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1982\">water-based facial cleanser</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8oruqu\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2028\">🌙 Recommended Double-Cleansing Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2105\"><strong data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2105\">ANUA Cleansing Oil → Water-Based Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2135\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table 