tion-id=\"377ojl\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2363\">💡 Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2410\">Especially useful for people concerned about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a001ro\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\nBlackheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4590y\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\nClogged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kd1jz\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2475\">\r\nSunscreen buildup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w4zer0\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2490\">\r\nHeavy makeup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wlniu4\" data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2504\">\r\nOily T-zone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6sz7c5\" data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\nRough-looking skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd2mpe\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2555\">⚠️ Important Tips</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rn79eo\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2613\">\r\nCleansing oil should be applied to <strong data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2612\">dry skin first</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hjk18\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\nProper <strong data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2641\">emulsification</strong> is important—add water and massage until it becomes milky before rinsing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wa7cpt\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2769\">\r\nAvoid aggressively rubbing or squeezing blackheads.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1zja68\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\nIf you have very sensitive skin, patch testing is recommended.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,2,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/SSJIdSwEjO3mpGTSVBJdNzVcgkDSuunJ50Baxd7J.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:31:07','2026-09-16 09:53:28'),(30,'Intensive UV Sunblock Cream SPF50 PA+++ 70ml','intensive-uv-sunblock-cream-spf50-pa-70ml','<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"412\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"153\">3W CLINIC Intensive UV Sunblock Cream SPF50 PA+++</strong> is a daily sunscreen cream designed to provide <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"223\">high UV protection</strong> while helping keep the skin moisturized and comfortable. Its cream texture makes it suitable for users who prefer a more nourishing sunscreen rather than a very watery or gel-type formula.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"433\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15g3cja\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"540\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"463\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50 helps protect against UVB rays, while PA+++ provides UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obvf90\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n🌞 <strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"574\">Helps Prevent Sun Damage</strong> – Helps protect skin from the visible effects of prolonged UV exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocifqh\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"712\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"668\">Moisturizing</strong> – Helps keep the skin soft and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l9djgq\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"737\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps maintain a brighter and more even-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apybf2\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"822\">Cream Texture</strong> – Provides a comfortable, moisturizing feel, particularly for normal-to-dry skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tki03n\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"1010\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"930\">Daily Protection</strong> – Suitable for everyday use as the final step of your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"etycth\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1029\">⭐ Key Features</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wo29es\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1052\">🛡️ SPF50 + PA+++</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1142\">Provides strong protection against <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1095\">UVB</strong> and good protection against <strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1131\">UVA</strong> radiation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10x3p7d\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1172\">💧 Moisturizing Sun Care</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1291\">The cream-based texture helps provide additional moisture, making it more comfortable for skin that tends to feel dry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ay3knz\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1312\">✨ Smooth Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1386\">Can help leave the skin looking smoother and more even after application.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1404\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lojjzi\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\nApply the sunscreen as the <strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1504\">last step of skincare</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17g31i7\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\nTake a generous amount and apply evenly to your face, neck and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ro7caj\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\nApply approximately <strong data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1650\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5sn41\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1680\">2 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15y1451\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\nReapply after heavy sweating, swimming or towel drying.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1802\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1867\"><strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1867\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → 3W CLINIC Sunblock</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1897\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2074\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1926\"><tr data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1926\"><th data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1911\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1926\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2074\"><tr data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1961\"><td data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1952\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1951\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1961\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1989\"><td data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1980\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1979\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1989\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2021\"><td data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2013\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2012\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2021\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2045\"><td data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2038\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2037\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2074\"><td data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2067\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2066\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2074\">⭐⭐⭐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"377ojl\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2091\">💡 Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2130\">Particularly suitable for people who:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2310\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d7v20c\" data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\nHave <strong data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2161\">normal or dry skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"he787q\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\nPrefer a <strong data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2197\">cream-type sunscreen</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rojx87\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2232\">\r\nWant moisturizing sun protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i71na8\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2265\">\r\nNeed everyday SPF50 protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r57b9\" data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2310\">\r\nPrefer a more nourishing sunscreen texture</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,21,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/109O5edmEq7emllFsFT8nogPoLA5Vnyzsvt80neP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:35:16','2026-09-14 10:55:37'),(31,'Collagen Lifting Cream 70ml','collagen-lifting-cream-70ml','<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"379\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"138\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Collagen Lifting Cream 70ml</strong> is an intensive moisturizing and firming cream designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"292\">loss of firmness, fine lines, dryness and dull-looking skin</strong>. It focuses on hydration, elasticity and a smoother, more youthful-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"399\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"adfs7i\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"485\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"432\">Firming &amp; Lifting Care</strong> – Helps skin appear firmer, tighter and more lifted.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15lrtu5\" data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"509\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Provides rich moisture to dry and dehydrated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1utn3f\" data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"595\">Improves Skin Elasticity</strong> – Helps support a supple, bouncy-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10qgngn\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n👵 <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"673\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> – Helps minimize the appearance of fine lines and signs of skin aging.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1scxyva\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"774\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Helps make rough or uneven-looking skin feel softer and smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u9csux\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"874\">Supports Skin Barrier</strong> – Helps maintain moisture and protect the skin from dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4cm2i3\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"960\">Plumping Effect</strong> – Hydration can make skin look fuller and more youthful.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1039\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zkwegl\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1056\">🧬 Collagen</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1263\">Helps support the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1127\">firmness, elasticity and plumpness</strong>. Topical collagen primarily acts as a moisturizing/film-forming ingredient rather than directly replacing the collagen inside the skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6c7wdf\" data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1287\">💧 Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1386\">Helps attract and retain moisture, making the skin appear <strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1385\">plumper, smoother and more hydrated</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12dk9wi\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1416\">🌿 Botanical Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1518\">Plant-based ingredients help provide conditioning and antioxidant support for healthier-looking skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19k4x3v\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1569\">🧴 Moisturizing &amp; Barrier-Support Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1683\">Help replenish moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness, supporting a softer and more comfortable skin texture.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1701\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9djnzg\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\nApply toner and serum as desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19vcxq9\" data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1ofj4\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\nMassage upward using gentle motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12z01tl\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1928\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uqd0yc\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1962\">🌙 Recommended Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2032\"><strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2032\">Cleanser → Toner → Essence/Serum → NEOGEN Collagen Lifting Cream</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h5cxvd\" data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2052\">🌞 Morning Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2135\">It can also be used in the morning. <strong data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2134\">Always finish with sunscreen (SPF30–50+)</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2165\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2372\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2194\"><tr data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2194\"><th data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2179\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2194\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2372\"><tr data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2229\"><td data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2220\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2219\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2229\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2257\"><td data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2248\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2247\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2257\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2285\"><td data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2276\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2275\">Mature Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2317\"><td data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2309\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2308\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2317\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2341\"><td data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2334\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2333\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2341\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2372\"><td data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2363\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2362\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2372\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2452\">*If you have sensitive skin, patch testing is recommended before regular use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"377ojl\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2469\">💡 Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2518\">Especially suitable for people concerned about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46ymop\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2538\">\r\nLoss of firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1i3wx\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\nFine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ae6xa4\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\nDryness and dehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2597\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"de3glp\" data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\nReduced elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15tktu7\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2639\">\r\nRough skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4aez1\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\nMature skin</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/QKv5xq68F3A29tve6b84YgbwvrC1UJmOlnLcDyBH.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:39:10','2026-09-13 17:29:16'),(32,'Real Bakuchiol Firming Serum 30ml','real-bakuchiol-firming-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"368\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"83\">NEOGEN Real Bakuchiol Firming Serum</strong> is an anti-aging and firming serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"148\">bakuchiol</strong>, a plant-derived ingredient often used as a gentler alternative to retinol. It is designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"335\">fine lines, loss of firmness, uneven texture and dullness</strong> while keeping the skin hydrated.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"388\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l099tt\" data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"454\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"411\">Firming Care</strong> – Helps skin look firmer and more elastic.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t4mbuj\" data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"536\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"478\">Fine-Line Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w45dek\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"643\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"560\">Bakuchiol Care</strong> – Provides retinol-like anti-aging benefits with generally good skin tolerability.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rwkuey\" data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"667\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Helps keep skin moisturized and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40x416\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"739\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Helps create a smoother, more refined-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hqu1jy\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"871\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"825\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xhzofw\" data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"952\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"901\">Antioxidant Support</strong> – Helps protect skin from environmental stressors.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"o2985j\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"973\">⭐ Key Ingredient</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11bch09\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"991\">🌿 Bakuchiol</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1076\">Bakuchiol is a botanical ingredient derived from the <strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1069\">Psoralea corylifolia</strong> plant.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1102\">It is commonly used for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2pwp\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\nFine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46ymop\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\nLoss of firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn6xcb\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\nUneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wvg9m\" data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\nSigns of premature aging\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1365\">Unlike traditional retinol, bakuchiol is generally considered <strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1316\">less irritating for many people</strong>, although individual sensitivity can still vary.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"focfqw\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1395\">💧 Hydrating Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1496\">The formula also provides moisture to help maintain a <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1495\">soft, smooth and plump-looking complexion</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1514\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1564\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ph3sq1\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1586\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1641\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b6lqq6\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1724\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1803\"><strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1803\">Cleanser → Toner → Essence → NEOGEN Bakuchiol Firming Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1873\">It can also be used during the day, followed by <strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1872\">SPF50 sunscreen</strong>.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1903\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2111\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1932\"><tr data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1932\"><th data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1917\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1932\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2111\"><tr data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1970\"><td data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1961\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1960\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1970\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1995\"><td data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1986\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1985\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"1995\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2023\"><td data-start=\"1996\" data-end=\"2014\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2013\">Mature Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2055\"><td data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2047\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2046\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2055\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2080\"><td data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2072\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2071\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2111\"><td data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2102\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2101\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2111\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2219\">*Bakuchiol is often well tolerated, but sensitive skin should still start gradually and patch-test first.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x0eowd\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2235\">🎯 Best For</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2300\">This serum is particularly suitable for people concerned about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1i3wx\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\nFine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"en60ez\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2325\">\r\nWrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7sqwz\" data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\nLoss of elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sip567\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\nSagging-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ommhc\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2396\">\r\nRough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7z39\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\nDehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pcvbms\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\nEarly signs of aging\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"sd2mpe\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2459\">⚠️ Important Tips</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2827\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"emc1sg\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2534\">\r\nStart <strong data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2483\">once daily</strong>, preferably at night, if you are new to bakuchiol.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mgga8\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2599\">\r\nUse a small amount; more product does not mean faster results.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifvkgn\" data-start=\"2600\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\nIf using other strong actives such as <strong data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2680\">retinol, AHA/BHA or strong vitamin C</strong>, introduce them carefully to avoid unnecessary irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1fitq\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2827\">\r\nUse sunscreen every morning to protect your skin and support your anti-aging routine.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,79,NULL,'[\"https://youtu.be/99xljt_3SZ4?si=s7fIJmq9VAd1zvvC\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/AagmZkdy3R8iKQJWsZVd7SCzoWlrvG2DKH4IVwhZ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 05:42:21','2026-09-13 17:32:46'),(33,'Real Vita C Serum 32ml','real-vita-c-serum-32ml','<p data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"374\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"128\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Vita C Serum 32ml</strong> is a brightening and antioxidant serum designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"273\">dullness, uneven skin tone, dark spots and post-acne marks</strong>. It combines Vitamin C-focused brightening care with moisturizing and skin-conditioning ingredients.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"394\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1724nar\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"461\">\r\n🍊 <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"416\">Brightening</strong> – Helps improve dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dh897x\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"535\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"485\">Evens Skin Tone</strong> – Helps create a more uniform-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ooeiod\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"559\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and dark spots over time.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sm8jv2\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"715\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"660\">Post-Acne Mark Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of leftover acne marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lb08m2\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"748\">Antioxidant Protection</strong> – Vitamin C helps defend skin against oxidative stress caused by environmental factors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q6444c\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"855\">Hydration</strong> – Helps keep the skin moisturized and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jy4vdz\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"930\">Radiance Boost</strong> – Helps skin look fresher and more luminous.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1shgg8b\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1081\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1003\">Anti-Aging Support</strong> – Antioxidant care can help support a healthier-looking, youthful complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1103\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xx9x8z\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1121\">🍊 Vitamin C</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1154\">The main brightening ingredient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1175\">Vitamin C can help:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16hmszp\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\nBrighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"134jhfi\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\nImprove uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bipult\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\nReduce the appearance of dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9c5eat\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\nSupport collagen production\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xifhjf\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\nProvide antioxidant protection\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"focfqw\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1363\">💧 Hydrating Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1454\">Help maintain moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness while using a brightening active.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ori37k\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1486\">🌿 Antioxidant Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1563\">Help support the skin against oxidative stress and environmental aggressors.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1581\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ph3sq1\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1653\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocmelr\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o003fo\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1791\">🌞 Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1872\"><strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1872\">Cleanser → Toner → NEOGEN Real Vita C Serum → Moisturizer → SPF50 Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1894\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1945\"><strong data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1945\">Cleanser → Toner → Vita C Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1975\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2181\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2004\"><tr data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2004\"><th data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"1989\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2004\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2181\"><tr data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2042\"><td data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2033\" data-col-size=\