-210ml','<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"353\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"134\">NEOGEN Next Glow Pore Refining Toner 210ml</strong> is a refreshing toner designed to provide <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">hydration, pore care, gentle exfoliation and brightening benefits</strong>. It helps remove leftover impurities after cleansing while supporting smoother, more refined-looking skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"373\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rp5z4x\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"445\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"401\">Hydrates the Skin</strong> – Helps replenish moisture after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lgv1b5\" data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"473\">Pore Refining Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of enlarged pores and creates a smoother-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"akx2w4\" data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"640\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"584\">Brightening</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12derwc\" data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"665\">Removes Residue</strong> – Helps remove traces of impurities left after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x0qilv\" data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"783\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"746\">Soothing Care</strong> – Helps calm and condition the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1514fm1\" data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"860\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"813\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Helps improve rough, uneven-looking texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13kufhx\" data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"896\">Prepares Skin for Skincare</strong> – Helps skin feel hydrated and ready for serums and moisturizers.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x20q1v\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"992\">⭐ Key Ingredient Benefits</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"focfqw\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1022\">💧 Hydrating Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1113\">Help replenish moisture and prevent the tight, dry feeling that can occur after cleansing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rm46nc\" data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1132\">✨ Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1251\">Helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1215\">uneven skin tone, excess oil and visible pores</strong>, while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1soeotc\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1283\">🧪 Exfoliating Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1437\">Depending on the formulation, mild exfoliating ingredients can help remove dead skin cells and improve the appearance of rough texture and clogged pores.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12dk9wi\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1467\">🌿 Botanical Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1540\">Help condition and soothe the skin for a fresher, more comfortable feel.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1558\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h9xi90\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\nCleanse your face with a suitable facial cleanser.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyv7fz\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of toner onto your palms or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oovexs\" data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1727\">\r\nGently apply across the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvspkr\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awcou4\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\nFollow with serum/essence and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o003fo\" data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1828\">🌞 Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1921\"><strong data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1921\">Cleanser → NEOGEN Next Glow Pore Refining Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → SPF50 Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1943\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1987\"><strong data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1987\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2017\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2229\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2046\"><tr data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2046\"><th data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2031\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2046\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2229\"><tr data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2089\"><td data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2080\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2079\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2089\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2115\"><td data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2106\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2105\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2143\"><td data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2134\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2133\">Normal 