comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3966f\" data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"840\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"785\">Improves Skin Tone</strong> – Supports a more even and radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130y0tu\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"864\">Fine-Line Care</strong> – Adenosine helps support smoother, more youthful-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vxuet9\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"951\">Soothing Care</strong> – Bisabolol and Centella Asiatica help condition and comfort the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1012\" data-content-reference-end=\"1045\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1082\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18k5qtb\" data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1106\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1106\">Niacinamide</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1139\">A form of Vitamin B3 that helps:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyggaf\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\nBrighten uneven-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bipult\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\nReduce the appearance of dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7fatev\" data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1242\">\r\nImprove the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5qv0\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\nSupport the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2n9yyv\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1297\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1297\">Tranexamic Acid</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1421\">A key pigmentation-focused ingredient that helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1420\">dark spots, uneven pigmentation and melasma</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cuc42z\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1443\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1443\">Adenosine</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1533\">Provides anti-aging care and helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1532\">fine lines and wrinkles</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"139s0kn\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1555\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1555\">Bisabolol</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1617\">A soothing ingredient that helps calm and condition the skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fpn64t\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1655\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1655\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1709\">Helps soothe and support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pa4cip\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1743\"><span role=\"text\">6. <strong data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1743\">Licorice Root Extract</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1852\">Provides brightening and skin-conditioning benefits and helps improve the appearance of uneven pigmentation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8wkard\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1882\"><span role=\"text\">7. <strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1882\">Green Tea Extract</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1935\">Provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2097\">The ingredient list also includes <strong data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2058\">chamomile, rosemary, polygonum cuspidatum, scutellaria and other botanical extracts</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2045\" data-content-reference-end=\"2077\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2115\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2138\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cisxg1\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\nApply toner and serum if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17eef16\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2219\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of A.M Cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0kqhp\" data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2292\">\r\nApply evenly over the face, concentrating on areas with pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nekem\" data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2333\">\r\nGently massage or pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6g1389\" data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2386\">In the morning, always follow with sunscreen.</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o003fo\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2410\">🌞 Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2490\"><strong data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2490\">Cleanser → Toner → Brightening Serum → W.SKIN A.M Cream → SPF50+ Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2512\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2561\"><strong data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2561\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → W.SKIN A.M Cream</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2591\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2782\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2620\"><tr data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2620\"><th data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2605\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2620\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2782\"><tr data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2653\"><td data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2644\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2643\">Normal</strong></td><td data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2653\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2681\"><td data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2672\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2671\">Combination</strong></td><td data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2701\"><td data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2692\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2691\">Dry</strong></td><td data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2701\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2721\"><td data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2713\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2712\">Oily</strong></td><td data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2721\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2747\"><td data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2738\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2737\">Sensitive</strong></td><td data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2747\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2782\"><td data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2773\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2772\">Pigmentation-Prone</strong></td><td data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2782\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2784\" data-end=\"2940\">The product is marketed for <strong data-start=\"2812\" data-end=\"2830\">all skin types</strong>, particularly skin with pigmentation, uneven tone and melasma concerns.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,58,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/hswx2JN32wBOmxf9kyBDDVrPdj6v0ytqsLpqKgUC.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:04:45','2026-09-18 07:40:54'),(37,'A.M Boosting Serum 30ml','am-boosting-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"419\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"85\">W.SKIN LABORATORY A.M Boosting Serum</strong> is a lightweight Korean brightening serum designed mainly for <strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"223\">hyperpigmentation, melasma, dark spots, acne marks and uneven skin tone</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"323\">Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Adenosine, Sodium Hyaluronate and botanical extracts</strong> for brightening, hydration, soothing and anti-aging care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"382\" data-content-reference-end=\"414\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"439\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5fnu3\" data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"507\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"461\">Brightening</strong> – Helps improve dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k272x4\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"611\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"546\">Dark Spot &amp; Pigmentation Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and discoloration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwkiq5\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n🌸 <strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"633\">Melasma Care</strong> – Formulated specifically for pigmentation and melasma concerns.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ak74cb\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"773\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"722\">Acne Mark Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of post-acne marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ljyv4\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"846\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"796\">Even Skin Tone</strong> – Supports a more uniform and radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0pw8t\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"865\">Hydration</strong> – Helps keep skin hydrated, soft and plump.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ietzj\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"934\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> – Adenosine helps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mkb8pn\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1026\">Soothing Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica, Allantoin and Bisabolol help comfort the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1083\" data-content-reference-end=\"1115\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1154\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18k5qtb\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1178\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1178\">Niacinamide</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1211\">A form of Vitamin B3 that helps:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qyggaf\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1242\">\r\nBrighten uneven-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h5mi4r\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\nImprove the appearance of dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vcbkpk\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\nControl excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hh93e6\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\nRefine the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5qv0\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\nSupport the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2n9yyv\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1392\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1392\">Tranexamic Acid</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1561\">A pigmentation-focused ingredient that helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1522\">dark spots, discoloration, melasma and post-acne marks</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1507\" data-content-reference-end=\"1526\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cuc42z\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1583\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1583\">Adenosine</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1673\">Provides anti-aging care and helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1672\">fine lines and wrinkles</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"r48k9r\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1704\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1704\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1823\">A form of hyaluronic acid that helps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin <strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1822\">hydrated, smooth and plump-looking</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13zqlts\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1853\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1853\">Centella Asiatica</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1970\">Helps soothe and condition the skin, making it useful for skin that is prone to sensitivity or environmental stress.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tgbbrm\" data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2007\"><span role=\"text\">6. <strong data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2004\">11 Botanical Extracts</strong> 🌿</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2219\">The formula includes extracts such as <strong data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2150\">pomegranate, mulberry, ginkgo, fig, wheat sprout, alfalfa, broccoli, cabbage, radish seed and canola</strong>, along with Centella Asiatica. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2146\" data-content-reference-end=\"2178\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2237\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njnl7l\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\nApply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oyb11j\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of serum—<strong data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2329\">2–3 drops</strong> is generally enough.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2422\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ocmelr\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7onrbq\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2540\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2502\">In the morning, finish with SPF50 sunscreen.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2461\" data-content-reference-end=\"2493\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n42n4h\" data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2576\">🌞 Recommended Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2643\"><strong data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2643\">Cleanser → Toner → A.M Boosting Serum → A.M Cream → Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2665\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2722\"><strong data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2722\">Cleanser → Toner → A.M Boosting Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2813\">The product can be used <strong data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2774\">both morning and night</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2727\" data-content-reference-end=\"2746\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2843\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"3063\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2872\"><tr data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2872\"><th data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2857\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2872\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"3063\"><tr data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2910\"><td data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2901\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2885\" data-end=\"2900\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2901\" data-end=\"2910\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2943\"><td data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2934\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2933\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2943\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2969\"><td data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2960\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2959\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2969\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2993\"><td data-start=\"2970\" data-end=\"2985\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2984\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"2993\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3023\"><td data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3015\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3014\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3023\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3063\"><td data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3054\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3053\">Pigmentation-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3054\" data-end=\"3063\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3248\">Its lightweight texture makes it particularly suitable for <strong data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3153\">oily and combination skin</strong>, while dry skin can layer it under a richer moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3142\" data-content-reference-end=\"3161\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x0eowd\" data-start=\"3250\" data-end=\"3264\">🎯 Best For</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3310\">Especially recommended for concerns such as:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"umy2fm\" data-start=\"3312\" data-end=\"3321\">\r\nMelasma\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgm9vz\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3341\">\r\nHyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"3342\" data-end=\"3354\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpfdqj\" data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3366\">\r\nSun spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7qse9e\" data-start=\"3367\" data-end=\"3384\">\r\nPost-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"to99ez\" data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3395\">\r\nFreckles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3414\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1i3wx\" data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3438\">\r\nFine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7z39\" data-start=\"3439\" data-end=\"3456\">\r\nDehydrated skin</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,58,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/yg2Y2OWEWlBr9L6PRjqx12nhp5licbmDFjzbzodq.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:07:14','2026-09-18 07:40:38'),(38,'Nature Plus Sun Block SPF 50+ 70ml','nature-plus-sun-block-spf-50-70ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"394\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"100\">VALENCIA GIO Nature Plus Sun Block SPF50+ 70ml</strong> is a Korean sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"165\">UVA/UVB protection</strong> with a lightweight, non-greasy finish. It also contains <strong data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"294\">hydrolyzed collagen, green tea extract and Centella Asiatica extract</strong> for moisturizing, antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"357\" data-content-reference-end=\"389\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"415\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v8vwlx\" data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"446\">High Sun Protection</strong> – SPF50+ helps protect against UVB; the listed UV filters also provide UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7g3v\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n🌞 <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"567\">Helps Prevent Sun Damage</strong> – Helps protect against sunburn and UV-related skin damage.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v49bbb\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"739\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"662\">Helps Prevent Pigmentation</strong> – Regular sunscreen use helps reduce UV-triggered darkening and uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5lhp9h\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"761\">Moisturizing</strong> – Glycerin and other conditioning ingredients help maintain skin comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a3t6l3\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"858\">Collagen Care</strong> – Hydrolyzed collagen helps condition the skin and supports a soft, supple feel.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5r6guy\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"976\">Antioxidant &amp; Soothing Care</strong> – Green tea and Centella Asiatica extracts provide antioxidant and soothing benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yoaerm\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1087\">Non-Greasy Feel</strong> – Retailer descriptions report a smooth, clean/dry finish without noticeable greasiness or white cast. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1180\" data-content-reference-end=\"1212\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5019zg\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1253\">Water-Resistant</strong> – Product listings describe it as water-resistant, making it suitable for outdoor use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1324\" data-content-reference-end=\"1356\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1400\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2jli0l\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1440\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1440\">Hydrolyzed Collagen – 200mg</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1581\">Helps moisturize and condition the skin, supporting a <strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1531\">soft, supple and elastic-looking</strong> appearance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1522\" data-content-reference-end=\"1541\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1k7j8ar\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1614\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1611\">Green Tea Extract</strong> 🍃</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1756\">Provides <strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1652\">antioxidant and soothing</strong> benefits and helps protect the skin from environmental stressors. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1678\" data-content-reference-end=\"1697\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rn7cjs\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1797\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1794\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong> 🌿</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1918\">Helps <strong data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1828\">soothe and condition</strong> the skin and supports a comfortable, hydrated feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1821\" data-content-reference-end=\"1840\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ut9j53\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1942\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1927\" data-end=\"1939\">Glycerin</strong> 💧</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2044\">A humectant that helps attract and retain moisture in the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1928\" data-content-reference-end=\"1947\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3cqntq\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2071\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2067\">UV Filters</strong> 🛡️</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2353\">The formula includes several UV filters, including <strong data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2275\">Titanium Dioxide, Zinc Oxide, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate and Ethylhexyl Triazone</strong>, which work together for UV protection. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2218\" data-content-reference-end=\"2237\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2371\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gich6m\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\nTake a <strong data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2445\">generous amount</strong> of sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h01adb\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\nApply evenly to the <strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2500\">face and neck</strong> and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvbacd\" data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\nApply around <strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2576\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13rr46q\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\nReapply regularly during prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xfeht\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\nReapply after <strong data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2695\">swimming, heavy sweating or towel drying</strong>. Product listings specifically recommend reapplication after 80 minutes of swimming or sweating. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2676\" data-content-reference-end=\"2708\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2858\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2936\"><strong data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2936\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → VALENCIA GIO Sun Block → Makeup</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2966\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"3146\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2995\"><tr data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2995\"><th data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2980\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2995\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3146\"><tr data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3033\"><td data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3024\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3023\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3066\"><td data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3057\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3056\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3066\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3091\"><td data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3083\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3082\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3091\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3115\"><td data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3107\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3106\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3115\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3146\"><td data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3137\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3136\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3146\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3302\">The product is marketed by retailers as suitable for <strong data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3219\">all skin types</strong>, with a lightweight/oil-control positioning. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3140\" data-content-reference-end=\"3172\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3304\" data-end=\"3447\">*The ingredient list includes <strong data-start=\"3335\" data-end=\"3348\">fragrance</strong>, so very fragrance-sensitive skin should patch-test first.</p>',NULL,NULL,19,59,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Vlvon4rAc1sFDbjaarrcidoZICuJwDZZgDuYD0s0.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:09:07','2026-09-17 17:11:07'),(39,'Vita B3 Source Serum 40ml','vita-b3-source-serum-40ml','<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"380\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"63\">TIAM Vita B3 Source Serum</strong> is a lightweight brightening serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"115\" data-end=\"162\">10% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3) and 2% Arbutin</strong>. It is mainly designed to target <strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"276\">dark spots, hyperpigmentation, acne marks, uneven skin tone and excess sebum</strong>. The official TIAM ingredient list confirms these concentrations. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"343\" data-content-reference-end=\"362\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"400\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ys1ncc\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"483\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"430\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of a dull complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dhq93q\" data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"569\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"507\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sv42r2\" data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"593\">Acne Mark Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of post-acne marks and discoloration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h5xzpk\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"744\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"686\">Evens Skin Tone</strong> – Promotes a more uniform and radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1es60mq\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"767\">Sebum Control</strong> – Niacinamide helps manage excess oil and shine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lixqqi\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"835\">Pore Care</strong> – Can help minimize the appearance of enlarged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdck6s\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"959\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">Hydrating</strong> – Sodium Hyaluronate helps maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2x4ng\" data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"977\">Soothing</strong> – Allantoin and Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate help comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1064\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gekvp7\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1092\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1092\">Niacinamide 10%</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1135\">The main active ingredient. It helps with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u62a14\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\nSkin-barrier support\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15rr322\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1256\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1256\">Arbutin 2%</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1427\">A targeted brightening ingredient that helps reduce the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1388\">hyperpigmentation, dark spots and post-acne discoloration</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1365\" data-content-reference-end=\"1397\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c6j4g9\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1449\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1449\">Allantoin</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1530\">Helps soothe and condition the skin, making the formula more comfortable to use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"oycfk9\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1568\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1568\">Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1646\">A licorice-derived soothing ingredient that helps calm stressed-looking skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bkaza6\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1677\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1677\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1791\">A form of hyaluronic acid that helps attract and retain moisture for a <strong data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1779\">hydrated and plump-looking</strong> complexion.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rrsis1\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1822\"><span role=\"text\">6. <strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1822\">Botanical Extracts</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"2002\">The formula includes <strong data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1912\">Lindera Erythrocarpa, Cornus Officinalis and Geranium Thunbergii</strong> extracts for additional skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1935\" data-content-reference-end=\"1954\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2020\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gjj5sn\" data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\nCleanse your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njnl7l\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2059\">\r\nApply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ytlsbs\" data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2082\">2–3 drops</strong> of TIAM Vita B3 Source Serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i1t4y9\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\nGently spread over the face and pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1omaw7l\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\nDuring the day, finish with <strong data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2246\">SPF50 sunscreen</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2199\" data-content-reference-end=\"2218\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o003fo\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2309\">🌞 Morning Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2384\"><strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2384\">Cleanser → Toner → TIAM Vita B3 Serum → Moisturizer → SPF50 Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4svvl\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2406\">🌙 Night Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2463\"><strong data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2463\">Cleanser → Toner → TIAM Vita B3 Serum → Moisturizer</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2493\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2706\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2522\"><tr data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2522\"><th data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2507\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2522\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2706\"><tr data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2558\"><td data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2549\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2548\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2549\" data-end=\"2558\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2591\"><td data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2582\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2581\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2591\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2619\"><td data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2610\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2609\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2619\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2651\"><td data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2642\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2641\">Acne-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2651\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2675\"><td data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2667\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2666\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2675\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2706\"><td data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2697\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2696\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2874\">*If you have sensitive skin, start with a smaller amount or use it every other day initially. Some people can experience irritation from higher-strength niacinamide.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x0eowd\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2890\">🎯 Best For</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2932\">This serum is particularly suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8hrfr\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\nAcne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgm9vz\" data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2979\">\r\nHyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2998\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"2999\" data-end=\"3009\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gvm3bt\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3022\">\r\nExcess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3038\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpfdqj\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\nSun spots</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,77,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/AjAav97jffXqV9n8ISHjnwqRayD4vkoQsSSVwVMc.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:10:57','2026-09-18 07:37:41'),(40,'B3 Niacin Sunscreen 50ml','b3-niacin-sunscreen-50ml','<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"362\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"61\">TIAM B3 Niacin Sunscreen</strong> is a multifunctional <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"110\">SPF50+ PA++++ sunscreen</strong> designed to provide high UVA/UVB protection while also targeting <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"221\">dullness, dark spots and uneven skin tone</strong>. Its formula combines <strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"294\">Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin and Tranexamic Acid</strong> for brightening-focused care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"325\" data-content-reference-end=\"357\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"130eop1\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"383\">☀️ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czgoes\" data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"482\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"413\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ PA++++ provides strong protection against UVA and UVB rays.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qx47qt\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"553\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"507\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16gkpei\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"670\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"577\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin and Tranexamic Acid help target the appearance of pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12x9tc3\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"694\">Even Skin Tone</strong> – Helps promote a more uniform and radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15myzl9\" data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"771\">Moisturizing</strong> – Helps keep skin comfortable and hydrated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5kazwg\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"840\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> – Helps address the appearance of fine lines and premature signs of aging.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jw46ft\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"943\">Lightweight Finish</strong> – Designed to blend easily with an <strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1015\">invisible, non-white-cast finish</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1006\" data-content-reference-end=\"1038\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1076\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"efgmen\" data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1113\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1113\">Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1239\">Helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1203\">dark spots, uneven tone, excess oil and visible pores</strong>, while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uaijqs\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1265\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1265\">Alpha-Arbutin</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1364\">A brightening ingredient that helps reduce the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1363\">hyperpigmentation and dark spots</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16crqee\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1392\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1392\">Tranexamic Acid</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1477\">Helps target the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1476\">pigmentation, discoloration and uneven skin tone</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s83p58\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1499\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1499\">Adenosine</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1576\">Provides anti-aging care and helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1575\">fine lines</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1i2033q\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1598\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1598\">Panthenol</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1636\">Helps moisturize and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mvdcg0\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1674\"><span role=\"text\">6. <strong data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1674\">Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1793\">A stable Vitamin C derivative that provides antioxidant and brightening support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1740\" data-content-reference-end=\"1772\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1811\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqnskx\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\nApply sunscreen as the <strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1908\">final step of skincare</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kawyz5\" data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\nApply a generous, even layer to the face, neck and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ls9iqs\" data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\nApply at least <strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2037\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdjlxd\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2200\">\r\nReapply approximately every <strong data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2081\">2 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure, especially after sweating or wiping the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2141\" data-content-reference-end=\"2173\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2228\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2299\"><strong data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2299\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → TIAM B3 Niacin Sunscreen</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2329\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2550\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2358\"><tr data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2358\"><th data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2343\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2358\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2550\"><tr data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2396\"><td data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2387\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2386\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2396\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2429\"><td data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2420\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2419\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2429\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2455\"><td data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2446\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2445\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2455\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2479\"><td data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2471\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2470\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2479\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2510\"><td data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2501\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2500\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2510\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2550\"><td data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2541\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2540\">Pigmentation-Prone Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2550\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2686\">Its lightweight, invisible finish is marketed as suitable for <strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2647\">all skin types and skin tones</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2619\" data-content-reference-end=\"2638\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2859\">*The formula contains <strong data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2762\">bergamot and geranium oils/fragrance components</strong>, so very fragrance-sensitive skin should patch-test first. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2774\" data-content-reference-end=\"2793\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x0eowd\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2875\">🎯 Best For</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2924\">Especially suitable for people concerned about:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2938\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgm9vz\" data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2958\">\r\nHyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8hrfr\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2971\">\r\nAcne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2990\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7pkoi\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3001\">\r\nDullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pcvbms\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\nEarly signs of aging\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bn5075\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3044\">\r\nDaily UV exposure</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,77,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/5I7e5ntH1DTxLgYUcwmCrcrep6KcJpQqMmS5K4bG.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:15:00','2026-09-18 07:37:26'),(41,'Perfect Cover BB Cream 50ml','perfect-cover-bb-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"508\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"114\">TENZERO Perfect Cover BB Cream</strong> is a Korean BB cream that combines <strong data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"214\">makeup coverage with moisturizing and skin-conditioning care</strong>. It is designed to help conceal <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"305\">blemishes, acne marks, dark spots and uneven skin tone</strong> while giving the complexion a smooth, natural-looking finish. The official TENZERO product page lists it as the Perfect Cover BB Cream, and the product size is 50g. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"615\" data-content-reference-end=\"648\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"528\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dyosp6\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"552\">High Coverage</strong> – Helps cover dark spots, acne marks, redness and other imperfections.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bqokm\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"648\">Evens Skin Tone</strong> – Helps create a more uniform-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uln443\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"728\">Pore-Blurring Effect</strong> – Powder and pigment ingredients help create a smoother-looking appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jkqwuf\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"826\">Moisturizing</strong> – Glycerin, butylene glycol and conditioning ingredients help maintain skin comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l5q4nr\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"942\">Natural-Looking Finish</strong> – Blends into the skin for a smooth, polished appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gmq24b\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1026\">Lightweight Feel</strong> – Despite its coverage, it is designed to spread easily without feeling excessively heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7bf8aw\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1149\">Skin-Conditioning Care</strong> – Contains Centella Asiatica, chamomile and other botanical extracts. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1354\" data-content-reference-end=\"1386\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cq7v9w\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1279\">⭐ Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"7rsksc\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1308\"><span role=\"text\">1. <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1308\">Titanium Dioxide</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1518\">Provides pigment/coverage and contributes to UV protection in the formula. However, this BB cream <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1462\">should not be relied upon as your primary sunscreen</strong> unless the packaging specifically states an SPF rating.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vp1b6p\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1542\"><span role=\"text\">2. <strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1539\">Glycerin</strong> 💧</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1648\">A humectant that helps attract and retain moisture, keeping the skin feeling softer and more comfortable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1afhx3e\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1673\"><span role=\"text\">3. <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1670\">Allantoin</strong> 🌿</span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1762\">Helps soothe and condition the skin, making the formula more comfortable for daily wear.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1paamb0\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1800\"><span role=\"text\">4. <strong data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1800\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1857\">Known for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xpj9x\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1887\"><span role=\"text\">5. <strong data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1887\">Chamomile Extract</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1932\">Provides soothing and conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sd3hee\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1993\"><span role=\"text\">6. <strong data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1993\">Evening Primrose &amp; Sunflower-Derived Ingredients</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2068\">Help condition and nourish the skin while supporting a smoother skin feel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dsu5sw\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2103\"><span role=\"text\">7. <strong data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2103\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2194\">Provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2284\" data-content-reference-end=\"2316\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4aqsw7\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2219\">💄 Coverage &amp; Finish</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2473\"><strong data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2234\">Coverage:</strong> ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ High<br data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2260\">Texture:</strong> Creamy, blendable<br data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2292\">Finish:</strong> Natural / smooth, with some listings describing it as semi-matte<br data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2373\">Best for:</strong> Concealing pigmentation, acne marks, redness and uneven tone. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2557\" data-content-reference-end=\"2590\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j8gtgn\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2491\">🧴 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nzkw6j\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2534\">\r\nComplete your normal skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jkgezz\" data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\nApply sunscreen first if using it during the day.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2wwxny\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\nTake a small amount of BB cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q8gs4g\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2677\">\r\nDot it across the forehead, cheeks, nose and chin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18d6sgh\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2738\">\r\nBlend evenly using <strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2737\">fingers, a makeup sponge or brush</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fz2w18\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2806\">\r\nBuild coverage gradually on areas requiring additional coverage.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw0d9\" data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2914\">\r\nSet with powder if you want a longer-lasting or more matte finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2993\" data-content-reference-end=\"3025\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"c6kmfj\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2942\">🌞 Recommended Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3034\"><strong data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3034\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → Sunscreen → TENZERO BB Cream → Setting Powder</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3064\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3244\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3093\"><tr data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3093\"><th data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3078\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3093\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3244\"><tr data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3131\"><td data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3122\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3121\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3131\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3164\"><td data-start=\"3132\" data-end=\"3155\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3134\" data-end=\"3154\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3164\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3189\"><td data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3180\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3179\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3189\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3214\"><td data-start=\"3190\" data-end=\"3206\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3205\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3214\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3244\"><td data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3236\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3217\" data-end=\"3235\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"3236\" data-end=\"3244\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3452\">*The formula contains <strong data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3282\">fragrance</strong> and fragrance allergens such as <strong data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3343\">geraniol and citronellol</strong>, so very sensitive or fragrance-reactive skin should patch-test first. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3523\" data-content-reference-end=\"3542\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15kws0e\" data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3469\">🎯 Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3653\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3483\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u8hrfr\" data-start=\"3484\" data-end=\"3496\">\r\nAcne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6itgw\" data-start=\"3497\" data-end=\"3506\">\r\nRedness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3525\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3541\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pstewh\" data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3559\">\r\nDull complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x1x3u6\" data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3577\">\r\nEveryday makeup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckdu9l\" data-start=\"3578\" data-end=\"3653\">\r\nPeople who want <strong data-start=\"3596\" data-end=\"3638\">coverage + skincare-style conditioning</strong> in one product</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,40,88,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/bKLGyemUXwuWQXeEemmm7dcDXmPFo2Q0mB04rLPr.webp',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:17:33','2026-08-14 08:17:33'),(42,'Perfect Brightening Tone Up Cream- 50ml','perfect-brightening-tone-up-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"401\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"91\" data-end=\"140\">TENZERO Perfect Brightening Tone Up Cream 50g</strong> is a Korean tone-up cream designed to provide an <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"220\">instant brightening effect</strong> while moisturizing and smoothing the appearance of the skin. It can be used as a <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"345\">makeup base or as a final skincare step</strong> when you want a brighter, more even-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1wij56q\" data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"421\">✨ Main Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fv9p75\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"520\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"454\">Instant Tone-Up Effect</strong> – Visibly brightens the complexion immediately after application.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12mmn5x\" data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"550\">Evens Skin Appearance</strong> – Helps create a more uniform and fresh-looking skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oztn9s\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"631\">Moisturizing</strong> – Helps keep skin soft and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ust0l9\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"693\">Natural Glow</strong> – Gives the complexion a brighter, more radiant appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1djasno\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"830\">\r\n🪶 <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"781\">Smooth Makeup Base</strong> – Helps create a smoother surface before makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wjvhtv\" data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"931\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"865\">Blurs Minor Imperfections</strong> – Can visually soften the appearance of dullness and uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3qdxol\" data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n💖 <strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"963\">Daily Brightening Care</strong> – Suitable for everyday use when you want a fresh, bright complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x20q1v\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1063\">⭐ Key Ingredient Benefits</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rm46nc\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1082\">✨ Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1169\">Helps brighten the appearance of dull skin and supports a more even-looking skin tone.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g09jwd\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1186\">💧 Glycerin</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1274\">A humectant that helps attract and retain moisture, keeping the skin hydrated and soft.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"iucxbe\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1301\">🌿 Botanical Extracts</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1414\">Plant-derived ingredients help condition and moisturize the skin while providing additional antioxidant support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1py3702\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1439\">🤍 Tone-Up Pigments</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1626\">Light-reflecting and color-correcting ingredients create the <strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1533\">immediate brightening effect</strong>. This effect is primarily cosmetic and should not be confused with permanent skin whitening.</p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xyadjo\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1644\">💄 How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15i73lc\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\nCleanse your face and complete your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12oxano\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\nApply sunscreen during the daytime.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xkmhvz\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\nTake a small amount of the tone-up cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aczcm\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1826\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ces4f\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\nBlend carefully around the hairline, eyebrows and jawline.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"175gpnv\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\nAdd another thin layer if you want a stronger tone-up effect.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vjjisl\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1978\">🌞 As a Makeup Base</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2050\"><strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2050\">Skincare → Sunscreen → TENZERO Tone Up Cream → BB Cream/Foundation</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1h3uj70\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2079\">🌙 For Simple Daily Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2139\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum → Moisturizer → Tone Up Cream</strong></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"116ps47\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2169\">👩‍🦰 Suitable Skin Types</h2>\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2348\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2198\"><tr data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2198\"><th data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2183\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Skin Type</th><th data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2198\" data-col-size=\"sm\" class=\"last:pe-10\">Suitability</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2348\"><tr data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2236\"><td data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2227\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2226\">Normal Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2236\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2261\"><td data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2252\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2251\">Dry Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2261\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2293\"><td data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2285\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2284\">Combination Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2293\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2318\"><td data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2310\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2309\">Oily Skin</strong></td><td data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2348\"><td data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2340\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2339\">Sensitive Skin</strong></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2348\">⭐⭐⭐*</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2435\">*If your skin is very sensitive or fragrance-reactive, patch testing is recommended.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15kws0e\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2452\">🎯 Best For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yunyw9\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\nUneven-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4qtfnw\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\nPeople who want an <strong data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2549\">instant tone-up effect</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9pp72u\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\nMakeup preparation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14tu6ds\" data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\nNo-makeup makeup looks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kmg3dy\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\nPeople who prefer a brighter, fresh-looking finish\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xoezy6\" data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2676\">⚠️ Tone-Up vs Whitening</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2858\">The <strong data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2726\">tone-up effect is immediate and cosmetic</strong>—it comes from the way the product brightens/reflects light on the skin. It does <strong data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2857\">not permanently change your natural skin color</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"3047\">For long-term pigmentation and uneven-tone concerns, ingredients such as <strong data-start=\"2933\" data-end=\"2987\">niacinamide, tranexamic acid, vitamin C or arbutin</strong>, together with consistent sunscreen use, are more relevant.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,88,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/B8KbIxQTPoqQzufBMc2qhmA0pZdYdHRQSWDpyu22.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:19:30','2026-09-17 11:01:48'),(43,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner 150ml','aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-toner-150ml','<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"407\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SOME BY MI AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner is a gentle exfoliating toner designed to help improve skin texture, unclog pores, control excess sebum, and support clearer-looking skin. It combines <strong data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"296\">AHA, BHA, and PHA</strong> with soothing ingredients such as <strong data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"349\">Tea Tree Water</strong> to exfoliate dead skin cells while helping calm the skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"425\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p3twrc\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"471\">\r\nHelps remove dead skin cells and impurities\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oxj3jk\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"523\">\r\nHelps unclog and minimize the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13be0sq\" data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"555\">\r\nControls excess oil and sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6jwbmn\" data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"601\">\r\nHelps improve rough and uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cypd9k\" data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"676\">\r\nSupports clearer-looking skin and helps with the appearance of blemishes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qvf8zx\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"755\">\r\nProvides gentle exfoliation without leaving the skin feeling overly stripped\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gngzw0\" data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"791\">\r\nHelps soothe and refresh the skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"812\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"919\"><strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"842\">AHA (Alpha Hydroxy Acid):</strong> Helps exfoliate dead skin cells from the skin\'s surface and improve texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"1013\"><strong data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"949\">BHA (Beta Hydroxy Acid):</strong> Helps penetrate into pores to remove excess oil and impurities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1043\">PHA (Poly Hydroxy Acid):</strong> Provides gentle surface exfoliation and is generally suitable for skin that prefers a milder exfoliating ingredient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1226\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1181\">Tea Tree Water:</strong> Helps soothe and refresh blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1242\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sm9baq\" data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of toner to your hands or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jd0vx\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\nGently pat or wipe over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aodbwt\" data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\nFollow with serum, moisturizer, and sunscreen during the daytime.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1502\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwghqg\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1554\">\r\nBlemish-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dnrw2o\" data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\nSkin with visible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jozycx\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\nRough or uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1727\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1622\">Size:</strong> 150ml<br data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1648\">Skin Concern:</strong> Excess oil, clogged pores, dead skin cells, rough texture, blemish-prone skin.</p>',NULL,NULL,7,8,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/czryr8rivOogxCHpehdIoo5zqa4ygwS6wO9fghAU.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 08:22:26','2026-09-18 07:21:06'),(44,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Acne Clear Body Cleanser: 400ml','aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-acne-clear-body-cleanser-400ml','<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"379\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SOME BY MI AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Acne Clear Body Cleanser is a refreshing body wash formulated with <strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"