-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1019\">Emollient Ingredients:</strong> Help dissolve oil-based impurities and makeup while helping maintain a soft skin feel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1122\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bye5ij\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cleansing balm with dry hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17qbxqu\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1213\">dry face</strong> and gently massage over the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dvd6bb\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\nFocus on areas with heavy makeup, sunscreen, or excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bm59mn\" data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\nAdd a small amount of lukewarm water and massage until the balm emulsifies into a milky texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywt9n5\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1513\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser for double cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1531\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i93wd\" data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\nAll skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17d5hnm\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\nMakeup and sunscreen users\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-sta