-start=\"923\" data-end=\"950\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5):</strong> Helps attract moisture, soothe the skin, and support the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1149\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1068\">Hydrating Ingredients:</strong> Help maintain comfortable moisture levels and prevent the skin from feeling dry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1165\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i3cpyf\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1226\">\r\nApply as the final step of your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"106y9xr\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\nTake an adequate amount of sunscreen and apply evenly to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131rvhj\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\nApply generously before sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7ddxsd\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpqrcg\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\nFor best protection, ensure all exposed areas are adequately covered.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1527\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1541\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7z39\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1589\">\r\nDehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dazbek\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\nSensitive-feeling skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"razjd8\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1668\">\r\nSkin that prefers lightweight, hydrating sunscreens\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"2083\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1679\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1695\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+<br data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1705\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1719\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++<br data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1746\">Product Type:</strong> Hydrating Facial Sunscreen<br data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1796\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Extract, Panthenol (Vitamin B5)<br data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1836\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1848\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, creamy, hydrating<br data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1893\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Finish:</strong> Fresh, natural-looking finish<br data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1944\">Main Concerns:</strong> UV protection, dryness, dehydration, skin-barrier support<br data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2005\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2025\">Recommended Use:</strong> Every morning as the final step of your skincare routine.</p>',NULL,NULL,21,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/6TbL16KD2mVYaFG65rgz8mhSIkVDcAwFro1FXbqZ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 11:17:49','2026-09-16 11:28:12'),(71,'Revive Eye Serum Ginseng +Retinal 30ml','revive-eye-serum-ginseng-retinal-30ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"390\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Revive Eye Serum is a nourishing eye-care serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"212\">Ginseng Root Extract and Retinal Liposome</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=