g> Helps attract and retain moisture to keep the delicate eye area hydrated and comfortable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1209\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qks6a3\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner or serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"155nuxe\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1293\">\r\nTake a small amount of eye serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uaf4fa\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\nGently apply around the eye contour using your ring finger.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10iyn08\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\nAvoid direct contact with the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnkhby\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\nFollow with your moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"530as2\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\nIf new to retinal, start gradually and increase usage as your skin becomes accustomed to it.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7eyoll\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\nUse sunscreen during the daytime.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1610\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2pwp\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1636\">\r\nFine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jg6uhy\" data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\nTired-looking eyes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iiqt61\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1672\">\r\nDry eye area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18qokrm\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1699\">\r\nDullness around the eyes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4aez1\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\nMature skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9xvts\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\nSkin concerned with early signs of aging\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"2039\"><strong data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1767\">Size:</strong> 30ml<br data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1792\">Product Type:</strong> Eye Serum<br data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1825\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Ginseng Root Extract, Retinal Liposome<br data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1879\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, nourishing serum<br data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1912\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"1930\">Main Concerns:</strong> Fine lines, wrinkles, puffiness, dryness, dullness<br data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2004\">Recommended Use:</strong> Evening or gradually as tolerated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2214\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2050\">Note:</strong> Because this product contains retinal, introduce it gradually if you are new to retinoid-based skincare. Avoid direct eye contact and use sunscreen during the day.</p>',NULL,NULL,28,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/N3CiTgVJc4Zbp7venpMkO9ihJB79iW1Z0QAkDzUP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 11:19:34','2026-09-16 11:27:52'),(72,'The Vita-A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum 30ml','the-vita-a-retinol-shot-tightening-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"402\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CELIMAX The Vita-A Retinol Shot Tightening Serum is an intensive anti-aging serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"203\">Vitamin A (Retinol)</strong> to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"316\">fine lines, wrinkles, enlarged pores, uneven texture, and loss of firmness</strong>. Its targeted formula he