1172\" data-end=\"1186\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1638\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwmpp8\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1311\">\r\nApply a small amount of serum evenly over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykg86y\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qm71f\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizing cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ancdmx\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\nStart <strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1410\">2–3 times per week</strong> and gradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrdcyf\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\nUse sunscreen every morning.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o6s6af\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1638\">\r\nAvoid using multiple strong exfoliating or retinoid products in the same routine when first introducing this serum.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1656\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1832\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2pwp\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1682\">\r\nFine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ei9uqz\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1707\">\r\nEnlarged-looking pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn6xcb\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\nUneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46ymop\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\nLoss of firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ff80ba\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\nMature or aging skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx53qq\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1832\">\r\nSkin seeking intensive anti-aging care\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"2144\"><strong data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1843\">Size:</strong> 30ml<br data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1868\">Product Type:</strong> Retinol Tightening &amp; Anti-Aging Serum<br data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1928\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Retinol (Vitamin A)<br data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1963\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight treatment serum<br data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"1994\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2012\">Main Concerns:</strong> Fine lines, wrinkles, pores, uneven texture, loss of firmness<br data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2097\">Recommended Use:</strong> Preferably in the evening, starting gradually.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2365\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2165\">Important Note:</strong> Retinol can cause dryness, irritation, or increased sensitivity, particularly when first introduced. Patch testing and gradual use are recommended. Always use broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,56,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/YrAUUOYrO1lBCCVSvO1TyAEK9Eab3WUwp54OH42F.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 11:21:31','2026-09-17 02:35:48'),(73,'Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF 50+ 70ml','secret-tone-up-sun-cream-spf-50-70ml','<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"385\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CHRISTIAN DEAN Secret Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF50+ is a daily sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"262\">high UV protection while instantly brightening and evening the appearance of the skin tone</strong>. Its tone-up effect helps create a fresh, radiant complex