 data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1555\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Salicylic Acid<br data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1573\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1585\">Texture:</strong> Creamy cleanser with rich foam<br data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1637\">Main Concerns:</strong> Excess oil, clogged pores, dead skin cells, blemishes, rough texture<br data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1729\">Recommended Use:</strong> Daily cleansing, preferably once or twice daily depending on skin tolerance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1990\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1817\">Note:</strong> Salicylic acid may cause dryness or sensitivity in some people. If your skin is sensitive, start once daily or less frequently and adjust according to your skin\'s response.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/LpV1pQwNU2HXbXWR0KlY3nTZh9e6Z7icTGuhcU7l.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 11:28:06','2026-09-15 09:58:03'),(77,'Vitamin C Boosting Serum 30ml','vitamin-c-boosting-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"373\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">DR.ALTHEA Vitamin C Boosting Serum is a brightening and antioxidant serum designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"248\">dullness, uneven skin tone, dark spots, and post-acne marks</strong>. Its lightweight formula helps provide hydration while supporting a brighter, smoother, and more radiant-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"391\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"731\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"426\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r