n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1625\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2pwp\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\nFine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn6xcb\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\nUneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ei9uqz\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\nEnlarged-looking pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gi7vye\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\nDull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46ymop\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\nLoss of firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ff80ba\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\nMature or aging skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"2098\"><strong data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1782\">Size:</strong> 30ml<br data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1807\">Product Type:</strong> Retinal Anti-Aging Serum<br data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1855\">Key Ingredients:</strong> 2% Retinal Liposome, Black Ginseng<br data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1893\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1905\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, nourishing serum<br data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1956\">Main Concerns:</strong> Fine lines, wrinkles, pores, uneven texture, dullness, loss of firmness<br data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2051\">Recommended Use:</strong> Preferably in the evening, starting gradually.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2349\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2109\">Note:</strong> Retinal is a potent vitamin A derivative and may cause dryness or irritation when first introduced. Avoid combining it with multiple strong exfoliating or retinoid products initially, and always use broad-spectrum sunscreen during the day.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>',NULL,NULL,11,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/GrUnmQppTDlAezkvaVxYki4xSRGzcIMDOLxGsdKo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-14 11:51:27','2026-09-14 15:33:45'),(91,'Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream 12ml','tranexamic-acid-glutathione-eye-cream-12ml','<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"443\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">MARY &amp; MAY Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream is a targeted eye-care cream designed to improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"295\">dark circles, dullness, uneven tone, fine lines, and dryness around the delicate eye area</strong>. Formulated with <strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"348\">Tranexamic Acid and Glutathione</strong>, it provides brightening, moisturizing, and nourishing care for a fresher-looking eye contour.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"461\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5e0pr\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"515\">\r\nHelps brighten the appearance of the under-eye area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18tkpyt\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"579\">\r\nHelps improve the look of dark circles caused by pigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4h9ps8\" data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"629\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12sjfwk\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"673\">\r\nHelps improve dull and tired-looking eyes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1io76m5\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"718\">\r\nProvides moisture to the delicate eye area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hwh2f\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"780\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines caused by dryness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9ddbk\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"822\">\r\nLeaves the eye area softer and smoother\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cw62dg\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"874\">\r\nSupports a brighter, refreshed-looking appearance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"895\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1048\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"917\">Tranexamic Acid:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of pigmentation and uneven skin tone, making it useful for under-eye areas affected by discoloration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1156\"><strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1066\">Glutathione:</strong> An antioxidant ingredient that helps support a brighter and more even-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1239\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1174\">Niacinamide:</strong> Helps brighten the skin and support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1335\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1270\">Moisturizing Ingredients:</strong> Help keep the delicate eye area hydrated, soft, and comfortable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1351\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qks6a3\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner or serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v2e3p2\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1435\">\r\nTake a small amount of eye cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uaf4fa\" data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\nGently apply around the eye contour using your ring finger.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10iyn08\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\nAvoid direct contact with the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"na58ey\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\nLightly pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yr6hdp\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\nUse morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xcyc6\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\nDuring the daytime, apply sunscreen around the eye area carefully.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1684\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mkpju9\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\nDark-looking under-eyes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pl9rl5\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\nPigmentation around the eyes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ejirdk\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\nDull and tired-looking eye area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1794\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xjceh0\" data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\nDry under-eye skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z00lkb\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\nFine lines caused by dryness\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1857\">Size:</strong> 12ml<br data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1882\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening Eye Cream<br data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1907\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1927\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Tranexamic Acid, Glutathione, Niacinamide<br data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1984\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, moisturizing cream<br data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2037\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dark circles, pigmentation, dullness, dryness, fine lines<br data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2118\">Recommended Use:</strong> Morning