\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"688\">\r\nHelps improve dull and tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fg6vy5\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"735\">\r\nLeaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and supple\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"57fx5i\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"790\">\r\nHelps create a plumper, healthier-looking appearance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eda2vm\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"834\">\r\nSupports overnight skin-conditioning care\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"855\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"963\"><strong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"870\">Collagen:</strong> Helps condition the skin and improve the appearance of firmness, elasticity, and smoothness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1072\"><strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"985\">Hyaluronic Acid:</strong> Helps attract and retain moisture, supporting a hydrated and plump-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1090\">Niacinamide:</strong> Helps brighten dull-looking skin and support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1283\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1195\">Moisturizing Ingredients:</strong> Help prevent moisture loss during the night and maintain a soft, comfortable skin feel.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1299\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1679\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lqzmcg\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\nComplete your evening skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11l2agk\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount as the <strong data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1395\">final step</strong> of your routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yutpuu\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\nSpread an even layer over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9bnved\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\nAllow the product to form a comfortable wrapping layer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1skng7s\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\nLeave on overnight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ctzqvs\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\nIn the morning, gently rinse with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"144bncu\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1679\">\r\nUse regularly as part of your nighttime skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1697\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1885\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7z39\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\nDehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n2ccbr\" data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\nMature-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gi7vye\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\nDull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"clwpop\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\nSkin lacking firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afhigl\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\nSkin concerned with fine lines and loss of elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1854suc\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1885\">\r\nSkin needing intensive overnight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"2260\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1896\">Size:</strong> 75ml<br data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1921\">Product Type:</strong> Overnight Wrapping Mask<br data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1968\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide<br data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2010\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2010\" data-en