d\" data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\nGently pat or massage until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uikqud\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1611\">morning and/or evening</strong> as part of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4h7t3\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1719\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always follow with a <strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1718\">broad-spectrum sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1741\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1855\">A moisturizing cream texture designed to absorb comfortably into the skin and leave it feeling soft and hydrated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"2045\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1866\">Size:</strong> 45ml<br data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1891\">Main Purpose:</strong> Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Even Skin Tone • Moisturizing<br data-start=\"1952\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1974\">Best Used With:</strong> Daily sunscreen for better protection against UV-related pigmentation.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/V2XtzzK3A67z1MgmZPVYXdxmo0gryPZZK8rlWC5e.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 11:45:27','2026-09-14 09:06:40'),(97,'Anti-Melasma Cica Cream 40ml','anti-melasma-cica-cream-40ml','<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"393\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL Anti-Melasma Cica Cream is a soothing and brightening facial cream designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"243\">melasma, dark spots, pigmentation, and uneven skin tone</strong>. It combines brightening-focused ingredients with <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"322\">Cica (Centella