ata-section-id=\"vqgar2\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"723\">Hydration</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and keep skin soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vhnjos\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"808\">Skin Texture Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of rough and uneven texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16rt4uk\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"956\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"895\">Antioxidant Care</strong> – Glutathione provides antioxidant-focused skincare support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lrzemg\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\nHelps give the skin a <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1013\">healthy, luminous appearance</strong> with regular use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1052\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1069\">Glutathione</strong><br data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\nAn antioxidant commonly used in brightening skincare. It helps support a <strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1189\">more radiant and even-looking complexion</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1207\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\nA versatile skincare ingredient that helps with <strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1341\">uneven skin tone, excess sebum, visible pores, and the appearance of dark spots</strong>, while also supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1492\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1412\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\nHelp maintain skin hydration and improve the feeling of softness and comfort.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1510\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1524\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"113pqme\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1540\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1540\">Dull skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rczgr2\" data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\nDark spots and post-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1623\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vujh0g\" data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\nNormal and dry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vusi5h\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\nSkin lacking radiance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1739\">For sensitive skin, patch testing is recommended before regular use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1755\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1793\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e16dfr\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1815\">2–3 drops</strong> of the ampoule serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uft45i\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\nApply evenly over the face, avoiding the immediate eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15yekzm\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2025\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2048\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2195\">A lightweight <strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2088\">ampoule-serum texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2194\">hydrated, smooth, and refreshed</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2515\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2214\">Product Name:</strong> APLB Glutathione Niacinamide Ampoule Serum<br data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2269\">Size:</strong> 40ml<br data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2277\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2294\">Product Type:</strong> Ampoule Serum<br data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2331\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Glutathione + Niacinamide<br data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2378\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Even Tone • Hydration • Skin Texture Care<br data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2454\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2471\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2489\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2497\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,12,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/615q5e7KuD1wxLp4CITlY9xaxsplUvfEcuXFBO3n.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:07:52','2026-09-17 16:27:18'),(107,'Complete No-Stress Physical Sunscreen 50ml','complete-no-stress-physical-sunscreen-50ml','<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"386\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">AXIS-Y Complete No-Stress Physical Sunscreen is a <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"171\">mineral/physical sunscreen</strong> designed to provide stron