ata-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1037\">Zinc Oxide</strong> – A mineral UV filter that helps protect against UVA and UVB rays.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r427yu\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1122\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ulkse\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1286\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1240\">Botanical/soothing ingredients</strong> – Help provide conditioning and calming care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0s1sb\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1317\">Moisturizing ingredients</strong> – Help keep the skin comfortable and hydrated.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1382\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1396\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14er7tn\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1417\">Sensitive skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1461\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ws1dnk\" data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\nSkin concerned with redness or irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cgtr4z\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\nPeople who prefer <strong data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1556\">physical/mineral sunscreen</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1572\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"htbin6\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\nComplete your skincare routine first.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ymfxi\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\nApply sunscreen as the <strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1686\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m732r8\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1736\">\r\nUse a generous amount over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ro7caj\" data-start=\"1737\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\nApply approximately <strong data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1794\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j5p7x\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1824\">2 hours</strong>, especially when outdoors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"namuu2\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\nReapply after sweating, swimming, or towel drying.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1927\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2111\">A creamy mineral sunscreen texture designed to provide comfortable coverage. As with many physical sunscreens, it may leave a <strong data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2075\">slight white cast</strong>, particularly on deeper skin tones.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2520\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2130\">Product Name:</strong> AXIS-Y Complete No-Stress Physical Sunscreen<br data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2187\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2195\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2203\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+<br data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2213\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2227\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++<br data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2237\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2254\">Product Type:</strong> Physical / Mineral Sunscreen<br data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2304\">Key UV Filter:</strong> Zinc Oxide<br data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2336\">Main Benefits:</strong> UVA/UVB Protection • Soothing • Moisturizing • Brightening Support<br data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2406\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2423\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types, especially sensitive skin<br data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2476\">Use:</strong> Every Morning &amp; Reapply During Sun Exposure</p>',NULL,NULL,19,26,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/81k4zUZ1nfqoRiGGeXcdLaikuWYqIQlqKydWndEi.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:10:02','2026-09-17 16:43:10'),(108,'Daily Purifying Treatment Toner 200ml','daily-purifying-treatment-toner-200ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"349\">AXIS-Y Daily Purifying Treatment Toner is a refreshing, lightweight toner designed to <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"199\">balance, hydrate, and soothe the skin</strong> while helping remove remaining impurities after cleansing. It is particularly suitable for skin that feels congested, oily, irritated, or unbalanced.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"367\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17e31xl\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"465\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"391\">Purifying Care</strong> – Helps refresh the skin and remove remaining impurities after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"upcigi\" data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"552\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"484\">Hydration</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and prevent the skin from feeling tight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhix30\" data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n✨ <strong data-st