Anchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"378\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17afnvz\" data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"460\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"403\">Pore Clarifying</strong> – Helps remove impurities and excess buildup from pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1609grk\" data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n🧖 <strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"483\">Sebum Control</strong> – Helps absorb excess oil for a cleaner-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gnl2d1\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"575\">Refines Pore Appearance</strong> – Helps pores look cleaner and less noticeable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gu9mj1\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n🌱 <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"646\">Soothing Care</strong> – Mugwort helps calm stressed and irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rubnig\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"784\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"728\">Deep Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dead skin cells, dirt, and excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lezumd\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"811\">Hydration Support</strong> – Helps prevent the skin from feeling excessively dry after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o052pl\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"968\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"913\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Leaves skin feeling smoother, softer, and refreshed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"989\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1150\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1020\">Mugwort (Artemisia Annua)</strong> 🌿<br data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1026\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps calm stressed-looking skin while providing purifying care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1181\">Kaolin / Clay Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\nHelp absorb excess sebum and impurities, making the skin feel cleaner and refreshed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1365\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1291\">Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\nProvides soothing and conditioning care for sensitive or stressed skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1455\"><strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1395\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\nHelp maintain skin comfort and prevent excessive dryness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1473\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1484\">Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3mco4\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1500\">Oily skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8gpaoh\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\nCongested skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iryaq2\" data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\nEnlarged/visible-looking pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1584\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g1byao\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\nDull and rough-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1693\">It can also be used on normal skin as an occasional deep-cleansing treatment.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1709\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d413na\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1826\">\r\nApply an even layer of the pack to <strong data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1793\">dry skin</strong>, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhvdtl\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\nLeave on for approximately <strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1874\">10–15 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tmevjt\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\nGently rinse off with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b69rtl\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13qfmvc\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\nUse approximately <strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2006\">1–2 times per week</strong>, depending on your skin\'s needs.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2061\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2218\">A creamy <strong data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2093\">wash-off treatment</strong> with a clay-like texture that spreads easily. After rinsing, the skin feels <strong data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2217\">cleaner, smoother, refreshed, and less oily</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2601\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2237\">Product Name:</strong> AXIS-Y Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack<br data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2285\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2294\">Size:</strong> 100ml<br data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2303\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2320\">Product Type:</strong> Wash-Off Face Pack / Pore Treatment<br data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2379\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Mugwort • Clay • Centella Asiatica<br data-start=\"2414\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\n<strong data-sta