morning and evening cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4nnk2\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"967\">\r\nHelps prepare the skin for <strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"966\">toner, serum, and moisturizer</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"988\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1128\"><strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1015\">Tea Tree Leaf Extract</strong> 🌿<br data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\nKnown for its purifying and skin-conditioning properties, making it useful for oily and blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1201\"><strong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1151\">Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\nHelps soothe and comfort stressed-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1300\"><strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1218\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier and helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1342\">Botanical &amp; Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\nHelp provide conditioning and hydration support during cleansing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1428\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1439\">Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3mco4\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1455\">Oily skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1474\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwghqg\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\nBlemish-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2iwrya\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\nSkin with excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lc83pj\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\nDaily facial cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1634\">For very dry or sensitive skin, use gently and follow with a moisturizer.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1650\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxmn4b\" data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\nTake a small amount of cleanser into your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"chfv5g\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\nAdd water and gently create a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3lgif\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\nMassage the foam over your face using gentle circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fqnttv\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\nAvoid the immediate eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"164knqb\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with clean water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ikw6rr\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\nFollow with toner and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1998\"><strong data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1980\">Recommended Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2020\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2159\">A soft <strong data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2055\">foaming facial cleanser</strong> that creates a refreshing lather and leaves the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2158\">clean, fresh, smooth, and comfortable</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2523\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2178\">Product Name:</strong> AXIS-Y Sunday Morning Refreshing Cleansing Foam<br data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2238\">Size:</strong> 120ml<br data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2264\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Cleansing Foam<br data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2289\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2307\">Main Benefits:</strong> Cleansing • Refreshing • Sebum Control • Soothing • Moisture Balance<br data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2379\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2399\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Tea Tree • Centella Asiatica • Niacinamide<br data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2462\">Suitable For:</strong> Oily, Combination &amp; Normal Skin<br data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2497\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2505\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,3,26,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/bimcqKGqRcVmKOX3fK4cNYPDjbBeEEr6tgiK7jU1.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:18:30','2026-09-17 16:39:43'),(114,'Biome Double Defense Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ 50ml','biome-double-defense-sunscreen-spf-50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"395\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">AXIS-Y Biome Double Defense Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ is a daily <strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"175\">broad-spectrum sunscreen</strong> formulated to help protect the skin from UVA and UVB rays while providing hydration and skin-barrier care. It is designed for comfortable everyday use and helps keep the skin looking healthy, moisturized, and protected.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"413\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o6of2k\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"503\">\r\