pply approximately <strong data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1843\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100a4kn\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1899\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1873\">2 hours</strong> when exposed to sunlight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ouh47t\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\nReapply after sweating, swimming, or towel drying.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1975\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2141\">A lightweight sunscreen texture designed to spread easily and leave the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2104\">moisturized, comfortable, and protected</strong> without an excessively heavy finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2478\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2143\" data-end=\"2160\">Product Name:</strong> AXIS-Y Biome Double Defense Sunscreen<br data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2201\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2210\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2226\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+<br data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2250\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++<br data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2277\">Product Type:</strong> Daily Facial Sunscreen<br data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2303\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2321\">Main Benefits:</strong> UVA/UVB Protection • Hydration • Barrier Support • Microbiome Care<br data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2391\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2408\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2434\">Use:</strong> Every Morning + Reapply During Sun Exposure</p>',NULL,NULL,19,26,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'