90\">Complete Mini Routine</strong> – Provides convenient products for multiple skincare steps.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lho97q\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"919\">\r\n✈️ <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"875\">Travel-Friendly</strong> – Compact sizes make the set easy to carry.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"94xfc2\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"940\">Typical Routine</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"993\">The set is centered around a simple routine such as:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1061\"><strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1012\">1. Cleanse 🫧</strong><br data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\nRemove dirt, excess oil, and daily impurities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1077\">2. Tone 💦</strong><br data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\nRefresh the skin and prepare it for treatment products.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1221\"><strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1151\">3. Treat ✨</strong><br data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\nUse a brightening serum/essence to target dullness and uneven tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1294\"><strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1243\">4. Moisturize 🧴</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\nLock in hydration and keep the skin comfortable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1358\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1313\">5. Protect ☀️</strong><br data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with sunscreen.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"14rl593\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1382\">Key Skincare Focus</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vrywjp\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1400\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and supports the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tjxsej\" data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1507\">Botanical extracts</strong> – Provide soothing and conditioning care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mt1pg9\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1577\">Hydrating ingredients</strong> – Help maintain moisture and softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdiara\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1646\">Brightening ingredients</strong> – Help promote a more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1714\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1728\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1773\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqykcb\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\nBeginners who want to try an AXIS-Y routine\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z7sh2\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\nTravelers looking for a compact skincare set\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1932\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1997\">Use the products in order from <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1996\">lightest to heaviest texture</strong>:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2073\"><strong data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2073\">Cleanser → Toner → Serum/Treatment → Moisturizer → Sunscreen (AM only)</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2139\">Use consistently according to the individual product directions.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2449\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2158\">Product Name:</strong> AXIS-Y The Mini Glow Set<br data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2203\">Product Type:</strong> Mini Skincare Set<br data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2242\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Hydration • Soothing • Glow • Skin Conditioning<br data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2320\">Best For:</strong> Dull &amp; Uneven-Looking Skin<br data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2367\">Suitable For:</strong> Most Skin Types<br data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2400\">Ideal For:</strong> Travel • Beginners • Trial Size Skincare Routine</p>',NULL,NULL,43,26,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ylDxMuRWYyi3cn7vgvk0DpJAYEC5o89cGlAkuapo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:24:23','2026-09-17 16:38:28'),(116,'Day-Light Protection Airy Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF50 5ml (mini)','day-light-protection-airy-sunscreen-broad-spectrum-spf50-5ml-mini','<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"430\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Day-Light Protection Airy Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF50 is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"293\">broad-spectrum protection against UVA and UVB rays</strong> while keeping the skin comfortable and moisturized. The <strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"367\">5ml mini size</strong> is convenient for travel, trial use, or carrying in a handbag.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"448\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dd8a7x\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"483\">Broad-Spectrum Protection</strong> – Helps protect the skin from UVA and UVB rays.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iyh9eb\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"622\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"558\">SPF50 Protection</strong> – Provides high-level UVB protection for everyday sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yk8wcd\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"702\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"649\">Moisturizing Care</strong> – Helps maintain skin hydration and prevent dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2ng4r\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"732\">Skin-Comforting Care</strong> – Designed for comfortable daily wear.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzapga\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"796\">Lightweight Feel</strong> – Helps avoid a heavy, greasy sensation on the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"84v10a\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"892\">Helps Prevent UV-Related Dullness</strong> – Consistent sunscreen use helps reduce sun-induced tanning and pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g6k0gu\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n✈️ <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1002\">Mini &amp; Travel-Friendly</strong> – 5ml size is convenient for sampling and on-the-go application.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1088\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jcli2r\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1122\">Chemical/organic UV filters</strong> – Help absorb and protect against UVA and UVB radiation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r427yu\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1197\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"soziwo\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1309\">Moisturizing ingredients</strong> – Help maintain skin softness and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6nguva\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1382\">Botanical ingredients</strong> – Provide additional conditioning and antioxidant-focused care.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1464\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1478\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g5ch5w\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1496\">Normal skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1538\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gz55u7\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1565\">\r\nEveryday sunscreen users\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xasvgp\" data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\nPeople who prefer a <strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1621\">lightweight sunscreen texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1637\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ecsr67\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\nApply a generous amount evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ruybe2\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1791\">last step of your skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvbacd\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\nApply around <strong data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1843\">15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c5sn41\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1873\">2 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"namuu2\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\nReapply after sweating, swimming, or towel drying.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1984\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2128\">An <strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2019\">airy, lightweight sunscreen</strong> designed to spread easily and absorb comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2127\">soft, moisturized, and fresh</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2555\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2147\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Day-Light Protection Airy Sunscreen Broad Spectrum SPF50<br data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2233\">Size:</strong> 5ml (Mini)<br data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2264\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Sunscreen<br data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2292\">SPF:</strong> SPF50<br data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2319\">Main Benefits:</strong> Broad-Spectrum UV Protection • Hydration • Lightweight Feel • Skin Conditioning<br data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2402\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2419\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2437\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2450\">Best For:</strong> Daily &amp; Travel Use<br data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2472\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2488\">Application:</strong> Face &amp; Neck<br data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2511\">Use:</strong> Every Morning + Reapply During Sun Exposure</p>',NULL,NULL,19,79,NULL,'[\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AKGkAahIiLA\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/NowgMu09sIZ4UfaR0bsN6lEUjr4d9tR2EYbXt6lv.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:27:33','2026-09-13 17:26:53'),(117,'Real Niacinamide 15% Serum 10ml (Mini)','real-niacinamide-15-serum-10ml-mini','<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"395\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Niacinamide 15% Serum is a high-concentration <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"204\">brightening, pore-care, and sebum-balancing serum</strong> formulated with <strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"240\">15% Niacinamide</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dark spots, excess oil, and visible pores while supporting a smoother, healthier-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"413\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fjl2vv\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"502\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"438\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16v644b\" data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"593\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"526\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and post-acne marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17vz912\" data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"612\">Pore Care</strong> – Helps minimize the appearance of enlarged or visible pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hh895b\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"757\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"701\">Skin Texture Care</strong> – Helps promote smoother and more refined-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn5v1f\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"780\">Sebum Control</strong> – Helps manage excess oil and maintain a more balanced complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bzqa0g\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"940\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"873\">Barrier Support</strong> – Niacinamide helps support the skin\'s natural protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pqla0z\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"962\">Healthy Glow</strong> – Helps the skin look clearer, smoother, and more radiant.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1042\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1208\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1063\">15% Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\nA high-strength concentration designed to target multiple concerns, including <strong data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1207\">uneven skin tone, excess sebum, visible pores, and dullness</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1315\"><strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1243\">Skin-Conditioning Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\nHelp maintain skin comfort and support a smoother-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1407\"><strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1345\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\nHelp prevent excessive dryness and maintain skin hydration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1425\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1442\">Best suited for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3mco4\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1458\">Oily skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1477\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rczgr2\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\nDark spots and post-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1724\">Because <strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1644\">15% Niacinamide is a relatively high concentration</strong>, sensitive or beginner skin should introduce it gradually and patch-test first.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1740\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kws9x9\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1801\">2–3 drops</strong> of serum to the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tm27og\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\nGently spread over the face, focusing on areas with visible pores or uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvspkr\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1939\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1967\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4g4rr\" data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\nDuring the daytime, apply <strong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2021\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"151fxm9\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\nStart <strong data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2046\">once daily</strong> if your skin is new to high-concentration niacinamide; increase according to tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2156\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2288\">A lightweight serum texture designed to absorb comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2287\">smooth, hydrated, balanced, and refreshed</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2709\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2307\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Niacinamide 15% Serum<br data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2363\">Size:</strong> 10ml (Mini)<br data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2378\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2395\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Serum<br data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2411\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2430\">Key Ingredient:</strong> 15% Niacinamide<br data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2449\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2467\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Pore Care • Sebum Control • Dark Spot Care • Skin Smoothing<br data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2561\">Suitable For:</strong> Oily, Combination &amp; Uneven Skin<br data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2609\">Best For:</strong> Pores, Excess Oil, Dark Spots &amp; Dullness<br data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\