mplexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"174qx2p\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"828\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"778\">Moisturizing</strong> – Helps keep the skin hydrated, soft, and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vhnjos\" data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"855\">Skin Texture Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of rough and uneven texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10nklkh\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"948\">Antioxidant Protection</strong> – Helps defend the skin from environmental oxidative stress.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n13heg\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\nHelps support a <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1066\">smooth, healthy-looking complexion</strong> with regular use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1105\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1124\">Vitamin C 22%</strong> 🍊<br data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\nA high-concentration vitamin C-focused formula designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1279\">dark spots, dullness, uneven tone, and loss of radiance</strong> while providing antioxidant care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1330\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1333\">\r\nHelps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1441\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\">\r\nHelp maintain hydration and reduce the feeling of dryness or tightness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1533\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1547\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"113pqme\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1563\">Dull skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7qse9e\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\nPost-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1627\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1657\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vusi5h\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\nSkin lacking radiance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1812\"><strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1702\">Sensitive skin:</strong> Because of the high vitamin C concentration, introduce gradually and perform a patch test before regular use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1828\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tqqp8k\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1908\">\r\nApply your serum/essence if using one.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ry7brn\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2088\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always finish with <strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2087\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3asbkg\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\nIf you are new to strong vitamin C products, start with <strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2181\">once daily or every other day</strong> and increase according to your skin\'s tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2252\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2358\">A nourishing cream texture designed to leave the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2357\">soft, moisturized, smooth, and radiant</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2775\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2377\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Vita C 22% Cream<br data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2428\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2436\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2453\">Product Type:</strong> Vitamin C Face Cream<br data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2477\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2496\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Vitamin C 22%<br data-start=\"2510\" data-end=\"2513\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2531\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Antioxidant Care • Hydration • Skin Smoothing<br data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2628\">Suitable For:</strong> Most Skin Types<br data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2647\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2660\">Best For:</strong> Dullness, Uneven Tone, Dark Spots &amp; Loss of Radiance<br data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2716\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2724\">Use:</strong> Preferably Evening; daytime use requires sunscreen</p>',NULL,NULL,16,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/UiDzmiJCpECUQHNK0BkUoqxDo