 blemish care patch</strong> designed to protect individual breakouts while helping soothe irritated-looking skin. The patch creates a protective barrier over the blemish, helping prevent touching and external contamination while supporting the skin\'s recovery.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"426\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12l1nti\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"511\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"457\">Targeted Blemish Care</strong> – Designed for individual pimples and breakout areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfg506\" data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"534\">Soothing Care</strong> – Helps calm redness and irritated-looking blemishes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14n1zsd\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"617\">Protective Barrier</strong> – Covers the affected area and helps protect it from external impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgmr42\" data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n🙅 <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"722\">Helps Prevent Picking</strong> – Creates a physical barrier against touching or squeezing pimples.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15c1k12\" data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"819\">Moisture Protection</strong> – Helps maintain a suitable environment around the treated area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eiduia\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"993\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"910\">Post-Blemish Care</strong> – Helps minimize the chance of irritation caused by repeatedly touching breakouts.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yfkbvk\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n👌 <strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1023\">Discreet Application</strong> – Thin patch design can be worn conveniently during daily activities.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1111\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1122\">Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npai4a\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1143\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1143\">Active pimples</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ii391\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\nAcne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhg9ce\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\nRed or irritated-looking blemishes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fogibu\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1226\">\r\nSmall localized breakouts\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199xp2e\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\nPeople who frequently touch or pick at pimples\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1291\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cx59kj\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\nCleanse your face and <strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1353\">dry the affected area completely</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9cfyz\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\nDo not apply cream or oil underneath the patch.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lgnsne\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\nSelect a patch that adequately covers the blemish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k0i5rx\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1524\">\r\nPlace it directly over the pimple and gently press the edges.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ntyb8t\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\nLeave it on for the recommended time or until it becomes visibly swollen/opaque.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ycnkmm\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\nCarefully remove and replace with a fresh patch if needed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1802\"><strong data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1680\">Tip:</strong> For best adhesion, apply the patch to clean, completely dry skin before applying other skincare products around the area.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dm2vyl\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1824\">Texture &amp; Design</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1968\">A thin, adhesive <strong data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1875\">hydrocolloid-style spot patch</strong> designed to stay securely over individual blemishes while providing discreet, targeted care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"2330\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1970\" data-end=\"1987\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY A-Clear Aid Soothing Spot Patch<br data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2052\">Quantity:</strong> 24 patches (24EA)<br data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2090\">Product Type:</strong> Acne / Blemish Spot Patch<br data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2119\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2137\">Main Benefits:</strong> Blemish Care • Soothing • Protection • Anti-Picking • Targeted Care<br data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2225\">Suitable For:</strong> Acne-Prone &amp; Blemish-Prone Skin<br data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2276\">Application:</strong> Directly on Individual Blemishes<br data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2320\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Use:</strong> As Needed</p>',NULL,NULL,44,79,NULL,'[\"https://youtu.be/tsVowp60qLk?si=7-caHrog3Jf8knLa\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/s5vRCQCfqrDsr18J3hZcZupxmPfIJnCPMf3ILbQR.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:40:30','2026-09-13 17:33:24'),(123,'Pore Eraser Pink Ampoule 16ml','pore-eraser-pink-ampoule-16ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"347\" class=\"