\"894\">Skin Conditioning</strong> – Supports healthier-looking skin with regular use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"967\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1064\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"997\">Pore-Refining Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\nHelp improve the appearance of visible pores and uneven texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1097\">Sebum-Balancing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\nHelp control excess oil and reduce the look of oily buildup.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1301\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1203\">Niacinamide / Brightening Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\nHelp improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dullness while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1401\"><strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1331\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\nHelp maintain hydration and keep skin feeling soft and comfortable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1419\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1430\">Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3mco4\" data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1446\">Oily skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1496\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fnvp4e\" data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\nRough or uneven texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ii391\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1560\">\r\nAcne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1576\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16haur2\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1656\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aed9kb\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\nApply evenly over the face, focusing on areas with visible pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz298d\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15yekzm\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1844\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1843\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1876\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1875\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1898\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"2051\">A lightweight, silky <strong data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1939\">ampoule texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2050\">smooth, hydrated, fresh, and refined</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2397\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2070\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Pore Eraser Pink Ampoule<br data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2124\">Size:</strong> 16ml<br data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2132\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2149\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Ampoule<br data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2185\">Main Benefits:</strong> Pore Care • Sebum Control • Skin Refining • Hydration • Brightening<br data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2273\">Suitable For:</strong> Oily, Combination &amp; Acne-Prone Skin<br data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2325\">Best For:</strong> Visible Pores, Excess Oil &amp; Uneven Texture<br data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2371\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2379\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,12,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/H4w4Lp58lrZZvsjKFzfyuEz4njPzwhwqtb7YsDeO.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:42:35','2026-09-13 17:26:14'),(124,'Real Bakuchiol Firming Serum 10ml (Mini)','real-bakuchiol-firming-serum-10ml-mini','<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"435\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Bakuchiol Firming Serum is an anti-aging and firming serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"195\">Bakuchiol</strong>, a plant-derived skincare ingredient often used as a gentle alternative to retinol. It is designed to help improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"329\" data-end=\"391\">fine lines, loss of firmness, uneven texture, and dullness</strong> while keeping the skin hydrated and smooth.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"453\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crl9wf\" data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"475\">Firming Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of skin firmness and elasticity.\