p the skin feeling comfortable and supple.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1402\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1416\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u8gu7b\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1442\">Mature-looking skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2pwp\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1468\">\r\nFine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46ymop\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\nLoss of firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn6xcb\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\nUneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pvjg7r\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\nDry or dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1567\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6g0dea\" data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\nSkin looking dull or tired\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1699\">It can also be a good option for people who want a <strong data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1672\">retinol alternative</strong> in their skincare routine.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1715\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z3fy1\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of serum to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cswpb4\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\nGently spread and pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bazxp\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fczb3p\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always apply <strong data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1945\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zarjkt\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\nIf you are new to bakuchiol, start with <strong data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2004\">once daily</strong> and increase according to your skin\'s tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2075\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2195\">A lightweight, silky serum that absorbs comfortably and leaves the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2194\">smooth, hydrated, soft, and supple</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2607\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2214\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Bakuchiol Firming Serum<br data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2263\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2272\">Size:</strong> 10ml (Mini)<br data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2304\">Product Type:</strong> Firming / Anti-Aging Serum<br data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2353\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Bakuchiol<br data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2384\">Main Benefits:</strong> Firming • Fine-Line Care • Smoothing • Hydration • Radiance<br data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2464\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types, especially mature &amp; dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2532\">Best For:</strong> Fine Lines, Loss of Firmness &amp; Uneven Texture<br data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2589\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,11,79,NULL,'[\"https://youtu.be/qQL-ICoOgkM?si=j4ofnw4JJ8TiWAqL\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/98yGbgNjh9fCy6zooELckhmlXcurlMKM0sZV4tds.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:43:56','2026-09-13 17:32:07'),(125,'Real Niacinamide 15% Serum 30ml','real-niacinamide-15-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"400\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Niacinamide 15% Serum is a concentrated <strong data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"191\">brightening, pore-care, and sebum-balancing serum</strong> formulated with <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"227\">15% Niacinamide</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of dark spots, uneven skin tone, visible pores, excess oil, and rough texture while supporting a smoother and healthier-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"418\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qx47qt\" data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"489\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"443\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16v644b\" data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"513\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and post-acne marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y85peo\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"599\">Pore Care</strong> – Helps minimize the appearance of enlarged and visible pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mdcdq4\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"755\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"685\">Sebum Control</strong> – Helps manage excess oil and maintain a balanced-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1az7toy\" data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"842\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"782\">Skin Texture Care</strong> – Helps make rough and uneven-looking skin appear smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v5n4gr\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"944\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"873\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> – Niacinamide helps strengthen and support the skin\'s natural barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pp89tr\" data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"966\">Healthy Glow</strong> – Helps promote a clearer, smoother, and more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1060\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1253\"><strong data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1081\">15% Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\nA high-concentration form of niacinamide that helps target <strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1218\">uneven skin tone, dark spots, excess sebum, visible pores, and dullness</strong> while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1271\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1288\">Best suited for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3mco4\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1304\">Oily skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hwpfzx\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\nVisible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1354\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rczgr2\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1406\">\r\nDark spots and post-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1546\">For sensitive or beginner skin, introduce it gradually because <strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1545\">15% niacinamide is a relatively high concentration</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1562\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sr2dgl\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1623\">2–3 drops</strong> of serum evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gxl2p\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1720\">\r\nFocus on areas with visible pores, dark spots, or uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz298d\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15yekzm\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1838\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"surokl\" data-start=\"1840\" data-end=\"1951\">\r\nStart <strong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1863\">once daily</strong> if your skin is new to high-strength niacinamide, then increase according to tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1973\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2118\">A lightweight serum texture that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2117\">smooth, hydrated, balanced, and refreshed</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2540\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2137\">Product Name:<