 data-end=\"1654\">\r\nApply essence or serum if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19vcxq9\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aczcm\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u1i9ks\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1768\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1799\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4i1ndv\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1860\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1883\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"2036\">A nourishing <strong data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1919\">dual-texture cream</strong> designed to provide comfortable hydration while leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2035\">soft, smooth, moisturized, and radiant</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2405\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2055\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY White Dual Cream<br data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2101\">Size:</strong> 80ml<br data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2126\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening Face Cream<br data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2170\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Hydration • Radiance • Skin Smoothing<br data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2256\">Key Focus:</strong> Dual Brightening + Moisturizing Care<br data-start=\"2293\" data-e