ish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"2006\">A lightweight, silky <strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1886\">prep serum</strong> that absorbs comfortably and leaves the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1981\">hydrated, smooth, soft, and refreshed</strong>, without a heavy finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2330\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2025\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Next Glow Prep Serum<br data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2066\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2075\">Size:</strong> 32ml<br data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2083\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2100\">Product Type:</strong> Prep / Hydrating Serum<br data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2126\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2144\">Main Benefits:</strong> Hydration • Brightening • Glow • Skin Smoothing • Skin Preparation<br data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2231\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2262\">Best For:</strong> Dull, Dehydrated &amp; Uneven-Looking Skin<br data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2312\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,11,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/BzKhgYx4m2mtKlldLPRfBrP5PaksGxArFXKZPYtZ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:50:35','2026-09-13 17:36:09'),(128,'Next Clear Spot Solution 32ml','next-clear-spot-solution-32ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"375\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Next Clear Spot Solution is a targeted <strong data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"165\">blemish and spot-care treatment</strong> designed to help improve the appearance of active breakouts, excess oil, redness, and post-blemish marks. It provides focused care for pr