3\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p5nr0w\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\nPour an appropriate amount of toner into your palms or onto a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqlu9\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvspkr\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1838\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"awcou4\" data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\nFollow with serum/essence and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbzib5\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\nIn the morning, finish with <strong data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1940\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1973\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1972\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2052\">For additional hydration, you can apply a second layer if your skin needs it.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2074\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2253\">A lightweight <strong data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2111\">essence-like toner</strong> with a slightly more nourishing feel than a simple watery toner. It leaves the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2252\">hydrated, smooth, refreshed, and comfortable</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2561\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2272\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN Next Clear Essence Toner<br data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2316\">Size:</strong> 210ml<br data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2325\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2342\">Product Type:</strong> Essence Toner<br data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2377\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Hydration • Pore Care • Skin Smoothing • Soothing<br data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2444\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2458\">Key Focus:</strong> Clear, Hydrated &amp; Refined-Looking Skin<br data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2500\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2517\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2543\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</p>',NULL,NULL,6,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/11aM3wzGc8hpdMpKp2PIUFP5T3a1ciEZmSlvClmQ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:55:59','2026-09-13 17:34:12'),(131,'Real Vita C Serum 10ml (Mini)','real-vita-c-serum-10ml-mini','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"367\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Vita C Serum is a <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"161\">vitamin C brightening and antioxidant serum</strong> designed to improve the appearance of dullness, dark spots, uneven skin tone, and post-acne marks. The <strong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"283\">10ml mini size</strong> is convenient for travel or for trying the product before purchasing the full size.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"385\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m45gh4\" data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"474\">\r\n🍊 <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"411\">Brightening Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14k0zg6\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"497\">Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qhtu35\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"589\">Radiance Boost</strong> – Helps promote a clearer and more luminous-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mlxtr2\" data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"766\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"680\">Antioxidant Care</strong> – Vitamin C helps protect skin from oxidative stress caused by environmental factors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d92nlx\" data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"795\">Post-Acne Mark Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of lingering blemish marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mzl6s\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"925\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"881\">Hydration Support</strong> – Helps keep the skin soft and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6fkti3\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"952\">Texture Smoothing</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of rough and uneven skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1038\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1171\"><strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1053\">Vitamin C</strong> 🍊<br data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\nA powerful antioxidant commonly used to target <strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1170\">dullness, dark spots, uneven skin tone, and loss of radiance</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1309\"><strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1220\">Niacinamide / Skin-Conditioning Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1223\">\r\nHelp support a healthy-looking skin barrier and improve the appearance of uneven tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1339\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\nHelp maintain hydration and leave the skin feeling smooth and supple.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1429\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1443\">Suitable for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"113pqme\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1459\">Dull skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2m7867\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\nDark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7qse9e\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\nPost-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1523\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1542\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vusi5h\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\nSkin lacking radiance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1667\">For sensitive skin or beginners, patch testing and gradual introduction are recommended.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1683\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"148nvdd\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1743\">2–3 drops</strong> of serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19e9zw\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\nGently apply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lvspkr\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1831\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xiqvzq\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always apply <strong data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1920\">SPF 30–50+ sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7afe2n\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2041\">\r\nIf you\'re new to vitamin C, start <strong data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1992\">once daily or every other day</strong> and increase according to your skin\'s tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2063\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2203\">A lightweight serum texture that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2202\">smooth, hydrated, fresh, and radiant</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2609\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2222\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Real Vita C Serum<br data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2269\">Size:</strong> 10ml (Mini)<br data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2301\">Product Type:</strong> Vitamin C Facial Serum<br data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2327\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2346\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Vitamin C<br data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2359\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2377\">Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Antioxidant Protection • Radiance • Skin Smoothing<br data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2462\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2479\">Suitable For:</strong> Most Skin Types<br data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2511\">Best For:</strong> Dullness, Dark Spots &amp; Uneven Skin Tone<br data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2554\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2562\">Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening, according to skin tolerance</p>',NULL,NULL,11,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/xou2PTxYS1nzCByTKjGrkeza2VHSJvV1C5LgFXqU.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:57:09','2026-09-13 17:30:03'),(132,'Calming Cica Tree Micellar Cleansing Water 400ml','calming-cica-tree-micellar-cleansing-water-400ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:de25e8a2-d4b8-45b4-89f8-1b195c107848-36\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:de25e8a2-d4b8-45b4-89f8-1b195c107848-36\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:de25e8a2-d4b8-45b4-89f8-1b195c107848-36\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-74\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4d593257-9cc1-4742-ada0-39259764131e\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"429\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">NEOGEN DERMALOGY Calming Cica Tree Micellar Cleansing Water is a gentle <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"205\">micellar cleanser and makeup remover</strong> designed to remove makeup, sunscreen, excess oil, and daily impurities while providing soothing and hydrating care. Its Cica-focused formula is suitable for skin that needs a <strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"428\">calm, fresh, and comfortable cleansing step</strong>.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"447\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nyw69\" data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"473\">Gentle Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dirt, impurities, and excess sebum without harsh rubbing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8nvjzu\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n💄 <strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"570\">Makeup Removal</strong> – Helps remove light makeup and daily cosmetic residue.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l345nu\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"703\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"653\">Sunscreen Removal</strong> – Helps cleanse away sunscreen and daily buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xc3ayu\" data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"726\">Soothing Care</strong> – Cica helps calm stressed and sensitive-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5qwmn\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n🌱 <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"811\">Skin-Comforting Care</strong> – Helps reduce the feeling of dryness or tightness after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fk5pf3\" data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"906\">Hydration Support</strong> – Helps keep the skin feeling soft and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mi4i7d\" data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"979\">Fresh Finish</strong> – Leaves skin feeling clean, refreshed, and balanced.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1054\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1215\"><strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1084\">Cica / Centella Asiatica</strong> 🌿<br data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort stressed-looking skin and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1333\"><strong data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1229\">Tea Tree</strong> 🌱<br data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\nProvides purifying and skin-conditioning care, making it suitable for blemish-prone and oily skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1449\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1347\">Micelles</strong><br data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\nTiny cleansing molecules that attract and lift <strong data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1434\">makeup, oil, dirt, and impurities</strong> from the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1554\"><strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1479\">Moisturizing Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\nHelp maintain skin comfort and reduce excessive dryness after cleansing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndqsoc\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1572\">Suitable for</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1583\">Ideal for:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14er7tn\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1604\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1604\">Sensitive skin</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1615\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"larihw\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\nNormal skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1648\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6e9t0\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1660\">\r\nOily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qwghqg\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\nBlemish-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l4mk8c\" data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\nSkin that feels easily irritated\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1732\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v228e0\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\nPour an adequate amount onto a <strong data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1781\">cotton pad</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"143h42a\" data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1858\">\r\nGently wipe across the face to remove makeup, sunscreen, and impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmguop\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\nFor eye or lip makeup, hold the soaked cotton pad over the area for a few seconds before gently wiping.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1etp8z4\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\nRepeat with a clean cotton pad if necessary.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b9qobh\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\nFollow with a gentle facial cleanser if using it as the <strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2117\">first step of a double-cleansing routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2164\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2272\"><strong data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2186\">Recommended Use:</strong> Morning and/or evening, especially as the first step of an evening cleansing routine.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2294\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2448\">A lightweight, watery <strong data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2345\">micellar cleansing water</strong> that feels refreshing and non-greasy, leaving the skin feeling <strong data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2447\">clean, calm, soft, and comfortable</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2896\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2467\">Product Name:</strong> NEOGEN DERMALOGY Calming Cica Tree Micellar Cleansing Water<br data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2539\">Size:</strong> 400ml<br data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2548\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2565\">Product Type:</strong> Micellar Cleansing Water / Makeup Remover<br data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2630\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Cica (Centella Asiatica) • Tea Tree • Micelles<br data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2698\">Main Benefits:</strong> Cleansing • Makeup Removal • Soothing • Hydration • Skin Conditioning<br data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2788\">Suitable For:</strong> All Skin Types, especially sensitive &amp; blemish-prone skin<br data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2849\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2857\">Use:</strong> Daily / First Step of Double Cleansing</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,4,79,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/RfKqRYl98xh9nd7w1AGk0ChXO9HY72XiUn2IGzKI.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-20 12:59:11','2026-09-13 17:54:21'),(133,'Azulene Soothing Cream 15ml (mini)','azulene-soothing-cream-15ml-mini','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:370047bf-ea87-45d2-9ab4-5e3ce225e691-1\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:370047bf-ea87-45d2-9ab4-5e3ce225e691-1\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:370047bf-ea87-45d2-9ab4-5e3ce225e691-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"405f3886-eb8b-4ed4-a35f-a2990231dbf1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"571\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SUR.MEDIC Azulene Soothing Cream is a calming moisturizer designed to help <strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"466\">soothe sensitive and irritated skin while providing hydration</strong>. It helps comfort skin that feels dry, tight, or stressed and supports a healthier-looking skin barrier.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"589\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xvq262\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"619\">Soothes Sensitive Skin:</strong> Helps calm skin that feels irritated or uncomfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1moc6m2\" data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"702\">Helps Reduce Redness:</strong> Provides a calming effect for visibly red or stressed skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfu4ba\" data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"843\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"787\">Intense Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prevent excessive dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s7s3oa\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"871\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain the skin’s moisture barrier and improve overall skin comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ymdtz\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"973\">Softens &amp; Smooths:</strong> Leaves the skin feeling soft, smooth, and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x7qt9e\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1058\">Comforts Stressed Skin:</strong> Suitable for skin affected by dryness or environmental stress.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qmgibc\" data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1136\">Ideal For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1287\">✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\n✔ Irritated or stressed skin<br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\">\r\n✔ Redness-prone skin<br data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1244\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1264\">\r\n✔ Weakened skin barrier</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1300\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1448\">A <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1339\">soft, moisturizing cream texture</strong> that spreads easily over the skin and provides lasting comfort without making the skin feel excessively dry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1464\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1fe01\" data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner/essence as usual.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vt7ls\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1563\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"62orgp\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\nGently spread it over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f38i7b\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\nPat lightly until completely absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jw8rev\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1724\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1680\">morning and evening</strong> as the final step of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lt6zs5\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1774\">Why Choose SUR.MEDIC Azulene Soothing Cream?</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1978\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">It is a good choice when your skin needs <strong data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1856\">calming, hydration, and barrier care</strong> in one simple moisturizing step. It can be especially useful when the skin feels sensitive, dry, tight, or uncomfortable.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div>',NULL,NULL,16,65,NULL,'[\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/DRQU3-kLrME\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/gFNf7WzrOHdWyJwIzpZI9fEA5lsuIcOyNJMi4XX5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:14:37','2026-09-13 17:10:55'),(134,'Perfection 100 All in One Facial Eye Cream 35ml','perfection-100-all-in-one-facial-eye-cream-35ml','<p data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"665\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SUR.MEDIC+ Perfection 100 All in One Facial Eye Cream is a multifunctional cream designed to provide <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"532\">hydration and intensive care for both the face and delicate eye area</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of dryness, dullness, fine lines, and loss of firmness while keeping the skin soft and moisturized.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"683\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3wixr\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"706\">Deeply Hydrates:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prevent dry, tight-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p321y2\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"792\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8lbnmb\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"877\">Anti-Aging Care:</strong> Helps reduce the visible appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxk9sx\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"963\">Firms the Skin:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of skin elasticity and firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9fh3we\" data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1118\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1046\">Eye Area Care:</strong> Provides moisture and nourishment to the delicate skin around the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yxxjya\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1148\">All-in-One Moisturizer:</strong> Can be used on the face as well as around the eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jy236k\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1232\">Smooths Skin Texture:</strong> Helps leave skin feeling softer, smoother, and more supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lag18\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1318\">Nourishes Dry Skin:</strong> Provides rich moisture for skin that feels dehydrated or rough.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1400\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1562\">✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1451\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1473\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1493\">\r\n✔ Mature skin<br data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n✔ Skin concerned with fine lines and loss of firmness</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1575\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1701\">A <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1612\">rich, nourishing cream texture</strong> that spreads smoothly over the skin and helps provide long-lasting moisture and comfort.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1717\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlo0f2\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner/essence/serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5z5fd\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqlu9\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7wr9gz\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\nFor the eye area, use a small amount and gently pat around the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g8amkz\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1984\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1952\">morning and evening</strong> as the final moisturizing step.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2002\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2092\"><strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2092\">Face + Eye Care • Hydration • Brightening • Firming • Anti-Wrinkle Care • Nourishment</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2108\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2103\">Size:</strong> 35ml</p>',NULL,NULL,28,65,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/fX393Nf6ls2PrrscNi6jm4ilyQyJzrFCFKjgiJeH.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:16:43','2026-09-13 17:21:33'),(135,'Super Peptide 100™ Collagen Lifting Cream 50ml','super-peptide-100-collagen-lifting-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"656\" class=\"PDq2pG_se