enly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xmeghc\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\nLightly pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1unee6j\" data-start=\"2110\" data-end=\"2148\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2180\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2179\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2198\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2318\"><strong data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2318\">Ceramide Care • Barrier Support • Deep Hydration • Moisture Lock • Soothing • Skin Texture Care • Lightweight Serum</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2344\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2329\">Size:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 oz</p>',NULL,NULL,11,65,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ibC6hle9ax9xaQY0kB14xA4GznlFICoCr1dsRBPm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:45:50','2026-09-13 17:11:50'),(140,'Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel 160ml','moringa-brightening-cool-soothing-gel-160ml','<p data-start=\"341\" data-end=\"633\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTE Moringa Brightening Cool Soothing Gel is a lightweight gel moisturizer designed to provide <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"494\">instant cooling, soothing, and refreshing hydration</strong>. Enriched with moringa-focused skincare, it helps comfort dry and stressed skin while supporting a brighter, healthier-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"651\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"1317\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i40zpz\" data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"675\">Brigh