=\"1428\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n✔ Stressed or overheated skin<br data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n✔ Skin needing lightweight hydration</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1531\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1656\">A <strong data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1573\">lightweight, refreshing gel texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or sticky feeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1672\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1710\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1idbimx\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1761\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the soothing gel.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1801\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7hpqsv\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\nGently massage or pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yhk2dc\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1873\">morning and evening</strong> or whenever your skin needs extra cooling and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1948\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2054\"><strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2054\">Moringa Care • Brightening • Cooling • Soothing • Hydration • Refreshing • Lightweight Moisturization</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2071\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2065\">Size:</strong> 160ml</p>',NULL,NULL,15,28,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/eeUqvrLQ0k7BexmfkDfcuZBGYpnscEVVFGfXCbGe.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'20