end=\"1135\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps keep pores looking cleaner by removing excess oil and buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s5wbvz\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1230\">Refreshing Cleanse:</strong> Leaves skin feeling clean, fresh, and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1av2kpl\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1307\">Helps Prepare Skin:</strong> Cleansed skin is better prepared for the rest of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1397\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1563\">✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1420\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1476\">\r\n✔ Congested-looking pores<br data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\n✔ Rough skin texture<br data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n✔ Skin needing exfoliating cleansing</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1576\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1730\">A <strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1604\">rich foaming cleanser</strong> that creates a soft lather when mixed with water, helping remove impurities and excess oil without requiring harsh scrubbing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1746\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o7e0wd\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\nTake a small amount of cleanser onto your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wd69l9\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\nAdd water and gently work into a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jcxsw6\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1947\">\r\nMassage gently over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"1948\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2178\"><strong data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2052\">Recommended:</strong> Start with <strong data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2078\">once daily</strong>, especially if your skin is sensitive or new to AHA/BHA products. Use sunscreen during the daytime.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2196\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2309\"><strong data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2309\">AHA + BHA • Brightening • Exfoliating • Deep Cleansing • Pore Care • Excess Sebum Care • Smooth Skin Texture</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2326\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2320\">Size:</strong> 160ml</p>',NULL,NULL,3,28,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ku01naBO8IGJ7txMuGvNO4DfGiNcSGc9n9zh16S6.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:51:45','2026-09-17 16:56:03'),(142,'Melasma-X Vita-Collagen Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA+++ – 45ml','melasma-x-vita-collagen-tone-up-sun-cream-spf50-pa-45ml','<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"745\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTE Melasma-X Vita-Collagen Tone-Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA+++ is a daily sunscreen designed to provide <strong data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"547\">high-level protection against UV rays</strong> while giving the skin a brighter, more even-looking appearance. Its tone-up effect helps create a fresh, naturally radiant complexion, while moisturizing ingredients help keep the skin comfortable.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\