/li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1550\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1716\">✔ All skin types<br data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\">\r\n✔ Uneven-looking skin tone<br data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\n✔ Anyone looking for tone-up + sun protection</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1738\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1913\">A <strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1777\">smooth, creamy sunscreen texture</strong> that spreads easily across the skin. It provides a brightening tone-up finish while leaving the complexion looking fresh and more even.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1929\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2267\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112qqe\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\nTake an adequate amount of sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15rwplg\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2073\">\r\nApply evenly to the face, neck, and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a3f65\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\nGently pat until evenly distributed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag89fp\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2176\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x19qrz\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2267\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2287\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2457\">Tone-up sunscreens can sometimes appear brighter on deeper skin tones if too much product is applied at once. Apply gradually and blend evenly for a more natural finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2475\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2587\"><strong data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2587\">SPF50+ • PA+++ • Tone-Up • UV Protection • Brightening Care • Vitamin Care • Collagen Care • Moisturization</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2603\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2598\">Size:</strong> 45ml</p>',NULL,NULL,19,28,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/YpVdgNo0FnrxlTBFxfhoLVxJL8UbpwAP3Wstqo17.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:55:33','2026-09-17 16:55:32'),(143,'Repair Serum : Ginseng +Snail Mucin 30ml','repair-serum-ginseng-snail-mucin-30ml','<p data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"746\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Revive Serum: Ginseng + Snail Mucin is a nourishing facial serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"564\">ginseng and snail mucin</strong> to provide intensive hydration and revitalizing care. It helps improve the appearance of dry, dull, and tired-looking skin while supporting a smoother, healthier-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"764\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5lwh8w\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"846\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"786\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and keep the skin soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1abvjzz\" data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<strong data-s