6\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2474\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2473\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2492\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2614\"><strong data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2614\">Ginseng • Snail Mucin • Hydration • Barrier Care • Soothing • Firming • Elasticity • Anti-Aging • Skin Revitalization</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2630\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2625\">Size:</strong> 30ml</p>',NULL,NULL,11,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/bEEfrZO9Q5sSy42LvCurZCnirtnTswQgD6ap70ub.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 09:59:11','2026-09-16 11:27:36'),(144,'Red Bean Water Gel 100ml','red-bean-water-gel-100ml','<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"720\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Red Bean Water Gel is a lightweight gel moisturizer specially designed to provide <strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"529\">hydration without a heavy or greasy feeling</strong>. It combines red bean extract with peptide-focused skincare to help maintain moisture balance, improve the appearance of skin texture, and leave the complexion feeling fresh and comfortable.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"738\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ct9tj1\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"816\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"767\">Lightweight Hydration:</strong> Provides moisture without feeling heavy or oily.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yc750s\" data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"837\">Sebum Bala