atures</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2488\"><strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2488\">Red Bean Extract • Peptide Care • Lightweight Hydration • Sebum Balance • Skin Texture Care • Soothing • Fresh Finish</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2505\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2499\">Size:</strong> 100ml</p>',NULL,NULL,15,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/TuwTu7a3wGLOBd7wOTsfTuG5kmwR6HjO06jqdaEy.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:01:14','2026-09-16 11:27:20'),(145,'Ginseng Essence Water 150ml','ginseng-essence-water-150ml','<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"684\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Ginseng Essence Water is a nourishing essence toner formulated with <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"506\">ginseng root water</strong> to provide hydration and revitalizing care. Its lightweight formula helps replenish moisture after cleansing while supporting a smooth, balanced, and healthy-looking complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"702\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aq0lmx\" data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"780\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"724\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and keep skin soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ysd6w2\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"875\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"803\">Nourishing Care:</strong> Provides skin-conditioning benefits for a healthier-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i68e73\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"891\">Soothing:</strong> Helps calm dry and stressed-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"piym0n\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n<strong