\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"of3l7b\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1295\">Smooth Skin Texture:</strong> Helps maintain softer and smoother-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13b9aex\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1424\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1367\">Nourishing Care:</strong> Helps support a healthy, revitalized-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1445\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1571\"><strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1463\">Rice Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\nProvides moisturizing and nourishing benefits and helps support a brighter, healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1742\"><strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1590\">Alpha-Arbutin</strong><br data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1593\">\r\nA well-known brightening ingredient that helps target the appearance of hyperpigmentation and dark spots by supporting a more even-looking skin tone.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1760\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1905\">✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n✔ Dark spots<br data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1819\">\r\n✔ Post-acne marks<br data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1868\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1889\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1918\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2063\">A <strong data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1957\">lightweight, silky serum texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably without leaving the skin feeling excessively heavy or greasy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2079\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103nyzs\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2153\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2139\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70njb\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2234\">\r\nApply evenly over the face, focusing on areas with dark spots or uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2270\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cas9gp\" data-start=\"2271\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2338\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2478\"><strong data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2353\">Daytime:</strong> Always follow with a broad-spectrum sunscreen to help protect the skin and prevent dark spots from becoming more noticeable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2496\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2625\"><strong data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2625\">Rice Extract • Alpha-Arbutin • Brightening • Dark Spot Care • Even Skin Tone • Radiance • Hydration • Post-Blemish Mark Care</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2641\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2636\">Size:</strong> 30ml</p>',NULL,NULL,11,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/kDF8qP0q2zeYi0RNdxhE3A52ev2byvkEmJTVvy5D.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:04:52','2026-09-16 11:26:41'),(147,'Glow Serum : Propolis +Niacinamide 30ml','glow-serum-propolis-niacinamide-30ml','<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"743\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Glow Serum: Propolis + Niacinamide is a lightweight serum designed to help achieve <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"582\">hydrated, smooth, and naturally glowing skin</strong>. It combines nourishing propolis with niacinamide to help calm stressed-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone, and maintain a balanced complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"761\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lrd5x8\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"832\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"781\">Natural Glow:</strong> Helps give the skin a healthy, fresh-looking glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdpdm5\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"853\">Soothing Care:</strong> Propolis helps comfort skin that feels stressed or irritated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7tzwxo\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"939\">Brightening Care:</strong> Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mjtg8\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1030\">Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and maintain soft, supple skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eotkoj\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1108\">Sebum Balance:</strong> Helps manage the appearance of excess oil and maintain a balanced complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ucha2b\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1203\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of enlarged or noticeable pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nvmpos\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1337\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1285\">Skin Texture:</strong> Helps make the skin feel smoother and more refined.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzf1yv\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1360\">Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain a healthy-looking skin moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1437\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1589\"><strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1459\">Propolis Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\nKnown for its nourishing and soothing properties. It helps moisturize the skin and supports a calm, healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1769\"><strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1606\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1609\">\r\nA versatile form of vitamin B3 that helps brighten the appearance of uneven skin tone, support the skin barrier, and improve the look of pores and excess sebum.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1771\" data-end=\"1787\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1965\">✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1839\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n✔ Enlarged-looking pores<br data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1909\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n✔ Sensitive or stressed-looking skin</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1978\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2156\">A <strong data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2028\">slightly viscous, lightweight serum texture</strong> that spreads smoothly and absorbs comfortably, leaving the skin hydrated and naturally dewy without feeling excessively greasy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2172\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2232\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ph3sq1\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2254\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6d5ee\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya5vg0\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhs00a\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2413\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2488\"><strong data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2428\">Daytime:</strong> Finish with sunscreen to protect the skin from UV exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2490\" data-end=\"2506\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2623\"><strong data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2623\">Propolis • Niacinamide • Glow • Hydration • Soothing • Brightening • Sebum Balance • Pore Care • Barrier Support</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2639\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2634\">Size:</strong> 30ml</p>',NULL,NULL,11,2,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/LnkohqLop5GD5GZCFQ7wsTUCw3rKsuXSeoBDzCEc.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:06:59','2026-09-16 11:26:20'),(148,'Calming Serum : Green Tea+ Panthenol 30ml','calming-serum-green-tea-panthenol-30ml','<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"725\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">BEAUTY OF JOSEON Calming Serum: Green Tea + Panthenol is a gentle serum formulated to provide <strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"565\">soothing and hydrating care</strong> for sensitive, irritated, or stressed-looking skin. Green tea provides antioxidant-focused care, while panthenol helps moisturize and support the skin barrier.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1463\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hmw93f\" data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"839\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"773\">Soothes Sensitive Skin:</strong> Helps calm skin that feels irritated, stressed, or uncomfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wce9ap\" data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"935\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"859\">Redness Care:</strong> Helps reduce the appearance of temporary redness and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ajdpef\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1016\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"957\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and relieve dryness or tightness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"169x5ue\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1044\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Panthenol helps maintain a healthy moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pufrl\" data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1121\">Antioxidant Care:</strong> Green tea helps provide antioxidant protection against environmental stressors.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nnl5m7\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1221\">Skin Comfort:</stro