41\">A <strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1555\">lightweight, smooth serum texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably without leaving a heavy or greasy finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1657\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1717\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imskbl\" data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\nDispense <strong data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1743\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s2njqw\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck, focusing on areas with dark spots and visible pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akqr6e\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1886\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhs00a\" data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1955\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1954\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"2117\"><strong data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1969\">Daytime:</strong> Apply sunscreen as the final step of your morning routine to help protect against UV exposure and prevent dark spots from becoming more noticeable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2135\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2259\"><strong data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2259\">Dark Spot Care • Brightening • Pore Care • Post-Acne Mark Care • Even Skin Tone • Hydration • Smooth Texture • Radiance</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2275\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2261\" d