nd soften the skin while cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1209d3\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1349\">Smooth Skin Texture:</strong> Helps leave skin feeling softer and smoother after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bywb9\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1431\">Fresh Finish:</strong> Helps remove impurities without leaving an excessively greasy residue when properly emulsified.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1547\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1726\"><strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1563\">Jojoba Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1566\">\r\nA skin-conditioning oil that closely resembles the skin\'s natural sebum. It helps dissolve oil-based impurities while providing moisturizing and softening care.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1744\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1892\">✔ Blackhead-prone skin<br data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1784\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1805\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n✔ Congested-looking pores<br data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\n✔ Excess sebum<br data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\n✔ Makeup &amp; sunscreen users</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1905\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"2067\">A <strong data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1944\">lightweight, silky cleansing oil</strong> that glides smoothly over the skin. When mixed with water, it emulsifies into a milky texture and rinses away more easily.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2083\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u59eqw\" data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\nUse the cleansing oil on <strong data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2140\">dry hands and a dry face</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"agoquo\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\nPump an appropriate amount onto your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"987jlv\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2275\">\r\nGently massage over the face, especially around the nose and areas with blackheads.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3gwtzh\" data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\nAdd a small amount of lukewarm water and continue massaging until the oil turns milky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2406\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kamjhz\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser if you use a double-cleansing routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17uig59\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2499\">Usage Tips</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10h07bf\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2569\">\r\nMassage gently—<strong data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2568\">do not scrub or squeeze blackheads aggressively</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pnpexr\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\nFocus on the nose and other congested areas for a little longer, but avoid excessive rubbing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g4blsy\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\nFor best results, use consistently as part of a regular cleansing routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2760\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2895\"><strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2895\">Jojoba Oil • Blackhead Care • Pore Cleansing • Makeup Removal • Sunscreen Removal • Sebum Care • Gentle Cleansing • Skin Softening</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2912\" data-is-last-node=\