\"105fiti\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112qqe\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1938\">\r\nTake an adequate amount of sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10jt7nr\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2028\">\r\nGently blend and pat until evenly distributed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrtcuq\" data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2089\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j5ifiw\" data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\nReapply throughout the day, particularly after sweating, wiping the face, or prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2216\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2325\"><strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2325\">SPF50+ • PA++++ • Pink Tone-Up • UV Protection • Brightening • Hydration • Tone Correction • Makeup Base</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2341\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2336\">Size:</strong> 40ml</p>',NULL,NULL,19,56,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/DvCjDhivNzOXjq2bwcf8WyZcgLn91vT9wedEpYHq.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:23:19','2026-09-16 12:22:38'),(156,'Derma Nature Glutathione Longlasting Tone-Up Cream 35ml','derma-nature-glutathione-longlasting-tone-up-cream-35ml','<p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"705\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CELIMAX Derma Nature Glutathione Longlasting Tone-Up Cream is a brightening cream designed to provide an <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"514\">instant tone-up effect</strong> while helping the complexion look more even, fresh, and radiant.