face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15o4nvj\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2218\">\r\nBlend gently, especially around the hairline and jawline.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kz9v6p\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\nPat lightly for an even finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g0dm1m\" data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2324\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2323\">morning or whenever you want a brighter-looking complexion</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2417\"><strong data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2334\">Tip:</strong> Start with a small amount and build gradually to achieve a natural tone-up effect.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2437\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2628\">This is a <strong data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2476\">tone-up cosmetic product</strong>, so the brightening effect on application is primarily cosmetic. For daytime use, apply a dedicated sunscreen underneath or use a sunscreen separately.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2646\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2769\"><strong data-start=\"2647\" data-end=\"2769\">Glutathione • Tone-Up • Brightening • Long-Lasting Radiance • Hydration • Even Skin Tone • Smooth Finish • Makeup Base</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2785\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2780\">Size:</strong> 35ml</p>',NULL,NULL,16,56,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/n0HFZN9mpEzI1vdSBJrcQZz00MNM9ae10JZgosWk.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:24:59','2026-09-17 02:33:34'),(157,'Brightening Pore + Dark Spot Sunscreen 50ml','brightening-pore-dark-spot-sunscreen-50ml','<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"716\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CELIMAX Brightening Pore + Dark Spot Sunscreen is a daily sun