d=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2246\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2245\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2264\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2388\"><strong data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2388\">Noni Extract • Eye Hydration • Fine-Line Care • Firming • Nourishment • Antioxidant Care • Brightening • Skin Smoothing</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2404\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2399\">Size:</strong> 20ml</p>',NULL,NULL,28,56,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/BAnfyz7FTrcksMyZ6nb5y2T47PJZ9V52h07IKOV6.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:28:26','2026-09-17 02:32:37'),(159,'Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil 30ml','madagascar-centella-light-cleansing-oil-30ml','<p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"736\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil is a <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"503\">lightweight cleansing oil</strong> formulated to gently remove makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and daily impurities. With Madagascar Centella Asiatica, it provides soothing and skin-conditioning care while helping leave the skin feeling clean, soft, and comfortable.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"754\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzgl43\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"776\">Removes Makeup:</strong> Helps dissolve and remove makeup effectively.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105vxy\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"847\">Sunscreen Removal:</strong> Helps remove sunscreen and other oil-based residue.\r\n</li>