\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\n✔ Makeup users<br data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n✔ Sunscreen users<br data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\n✔ Skin prone to clogged-looking pores</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1812\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1971\">A <strong data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1847\">thin, lightweight, silky oil</strong> that spreads easily across the face. When mixed with water, it emulsifies into a milky texture and rinses away comfortably.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1987\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bgvrzh\" data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\nStart with <strong data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2030\">dry hands and a dry face</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j63l74\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\nPump an appropriate amount of cleansing oil into your palms.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ptsak\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\nGently massage over the entire face to dissolve makeup, sunscreen, and impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3i6y1\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\nAdd a small amount of lukewarm water and massage until the oil turns milky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2301\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nvjppc\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\nFollow with a gentle water-based cleanser if using a double-cleansing routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2401\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2549\"><strong data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2549\">Madagascar Centella • Lightweight Cleansing Oil • Makeup Removal • Sunscreen Removal • Pore Cleansing • Soothing • Hydration • Double Cleansing</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2565\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2560\">Size:</strong> 30ml</p>',NULL,NULL,2,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/M8HVRXfTY8B4AIczWZMUEcosNgnYIvqB4EWSbd6Q.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:44:15','2026-09-16 10:59:27'),(160,'Tone brightening cleansing Gel Foam 125ml','tone-brightening-cleansing-gel-foam-125ml','<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"662\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Tone Brightening Cleansing Gel Foam is a gentle daily facial cleanser designed to remove <strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"511\">dirt, excess sebum, impurities, and daily buildup</strong> while providing brightening and moisturizing care. Its gel-to-foam texture helps cleanse the skin without leaving it feeling excessively dry or tight.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"680\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b18x0l\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"753\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"704\">Gentle Cleansing:</strong> Removes dirt, oil, and impurities from the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i40zpz\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"838\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"777\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kanh7c\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"911\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"860\">Even Skin Tone:</strong> Supports a more fresh and even-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vg8dmc\" data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"928\">Hydration:</strong> Helps maintain moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1euglt7\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1028\">Sebum &amp; Pore Care:</strong> Helps remove excess oil and buildup from pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"122etux\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1157\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1103\">Smooth Skin Texture:</strong> Helps leave the skin feeling clean, soft, and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3amh58\" data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1186\">Barrier-Friendly Care:</strong> Helps maintain comfortable skin after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x8il1h\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1260\">Refreshing Finish:</strong> Leaves the complexion feeling fresh and clean without excessive tightness.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1353\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1504\">✔ All skin types<br data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1430\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1459\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n✔ Uneven-looking skin tone</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1517\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1697\">A <strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1554\">clear, lightweight gel texture</strong> that creates a soft, rich foam when mixed with water. The foam gently cleanses the skin while helping maintain a comfortable moisture balance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1713\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol da