emizing-deep-cleansing-foam-125ml','<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"704\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Deep Cleansing Foam is a pore-focused facial cleanser designed to remove <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"581\">excess oil, dirt, impurities, and buildup from the skin and pores</strong>. It helps keep oily and congested skin feeling clean and refreshed while providing soothing care with Madagascar Centella.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"722\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dso6xe\" data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"749\">Deep Pore Cleansing:</strong> Helps remove impurities and excess sebum from pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yl8ksb\" data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"823\">Sebum Control:</strong> Helps cleanse excess oil and maintain a fresher-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmiem\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"973\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"913\">Blackhead Care:</strong> Helps loosen oil and impurities associated with blackheads.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjbp0k\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1057\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"990\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps reduce the appearance of enlarged and clogged-looking pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17jvnvk\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1084\">Dead Skin Cell Care:</strong> Helps remove surface buildup for smoother-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozyurz\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1161\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps calm and comfort skin after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fok9pe\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1234\">Refined Skin Texture:</strong> Helps leave rough and uneven-feeling skin softer and smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n68jl0\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1322\">Refreshing Finish:</strong> Leaves skin thoroughly cleansed without a heavy residue.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1397\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1565\">✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\n✔ Blackhead-prone skin<br data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n✔ Congested pores<br data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1478\">\r\n✔ Excess sebum<br data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n✔ Rough skin texture<br data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1518\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n✔ Skin needing deeper cleansing</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1578\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1762\">A <strong data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1612\">rich, creamy cleansing foam</strong> that creates a dense lather when mixed with water. The soft foam helps lift away dirt, oil, and impurities while reducing the need for harsh rubbing.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1778\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"2191\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o7e0wd\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\nTake a small amount of cleanser onto your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"37yq6x\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\nAdd water and create a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2sprmz\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1970\">\r\nGently massage the foam over your face using circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vlnw0q\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2043\">\r\nPay extra attention to the nose, forehead, and other congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xnjnmk\" data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\nAvoid the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9gbfix\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2116\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1comszu\" data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2145\">\r\nGently pat your face dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10v79xx\" data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2191\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6l2c6i\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2217\">Usage Recommendation</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2218\" data-end=\"2375\">Use <strong data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2245\">once or twice daily</strong> depending on your skin type. If your skin is dry or sensitive, start with once daily and adjust according to how your skin feels.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2393\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2519\"><strong data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2519\">Deep Cleansing • Pore Care • Sebum Care • Blackhead Care • Dead Skin Cell Care • Soothing • Smooth Texture • Fresh Finish</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2536\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2530\">Size:</strong> 125ml</p>',NULL,NULL,3,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/fzvfj2Dv5DT8UqVCR2AS8p0JeA7CIXk1h7DJwGPw.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 10:58:04','2026-09-16 10:58:28'),(162,'Centella Signature Soothing Ampoule 100ml','centella-signature-soothing-ampoule-100ml','<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"716\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule is a minimalist facial ampoule formulated around <strong data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"509\">Centella Asiatica from Madagascar</strong>. It is designed to provide gentle soothing and hydration for skin that feels sensitive, dry, irritated, or stressed. The lightweight formula helps keep the complexion comfortable, moisturized, and balanced.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"734\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gdrbx2\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"819\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"755\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps calm sensitive, stressed, and uncomfortable-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qcrnz0\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"904\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"839\">Redness Care:</strong> Helps reduce the appearance of temporary redness and irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fp2yb\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"921\">Hydration:</strong> Provides lightweight moisture without feeling heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khkbw7\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1002\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain a healthy-looking moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x7th2p\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1128\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1080\">Sensitive Skin Care:</strong> Provides gentle care for easily irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6lnwz\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1148\">Skin Comfort:</strong> Helps relieve the feeling of dryness and tightness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"umqg9q\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1274\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1229\">Improves Skin Texture:</strong> Helps keep skin feeling softer and smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wg95ky\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1299\">Refreshing Finish:</strong> Absorbs comfortably and leaves the skin feeling hydrated and calm.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1386\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1629\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1428\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\nCentella Asiatica is widely used in skincare for its <strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1544\">soothing, moisturizing, and skin-conditioning properties</strong>. It helps comfort stressed-looking skin and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1647\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1825\">✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1718\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n✔ Redness-prone skin<br data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1744\">\r\n✔ Irritated or stressed-looking skin<br data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\n✔ Weakened skin barrier<br data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\n✔ All skin types</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1838\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1963\">A <strong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1880\">lightweight, watery ampoule texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or greasy feeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1979\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2012\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2039\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6k8mf\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aczcm\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2125\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akqr6e\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhs00a\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2229\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2248\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2372\"><strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2372\">Madagascar Centella • Soothing • Hydration • Redness Care • Barrier Support • Sensitive Skin Care • Lightweight Texture</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2389\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2383\">Size:</strong> 100ml</p>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/mWVeCAKgIA5uW9JOnvTT7yt0xaIaRqceUJsqU9yU.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:00:22','2026-09-16 10:57:59'),(163,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule 50ml','madagascar-centella-probio-cica-intensive-ampoule-50ml','<p data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"719\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule is an intensive ampoule designed for <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"544\">sensitive, dry, stressed, and weakened skin barriers</strong>. It combines Madagascar Centella-based care with Probio-Cica technology to help soothe discomfort, replenish moisture, and support a stronger, healthier-looking skin barrier.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></