y Ingredient Technology</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1516\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort stressed skin and supports a healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1852\"><strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1666\">Probio-Cica</strong><br data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\nA specialized Centella-focused ingredient complex designed to provide <strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1792\">intensive soothing and barrier-strengthening care</strong>, particularly for skin that feels sensitive or compromised.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1870\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"2069\">✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1890\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\n✔ Irritated or stressed-looking skin<br data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n✔ Redness-prone skin<br data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\">\r\n✔ Weakened skin barrier<br data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2011\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\n✔ Skin needing intensive barrier care</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2082\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2278\">A <strong data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2131\">lightweight yet nourishing ampoule texture</strong> that spreads smoothly and provides a comfortable moisturizing layer. It absorbs well while leaving the skin feeling soft, hydrated, and protected.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2294\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2327\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6k8mf\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6d5ee\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya5vg0\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2477\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbml86\" data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2524\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer or barrier cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2555\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2574\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2722\"><strong data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2722\">Madagascar Centella • Probio-Cica • Intensive Soothing • Barrier Support • Deep Hydration • Redness Care • Moisture Retention • Skin Resilience</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2738\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2733\">Size:</strong> 50ml</p>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/dpU8yLA5MXESIK1GgoNYvvd7lQ2OTsbgTEfkeAOJ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:02:08','2026-09-16 10:56:40'),(164,'Centella Signature Soothing Ampoule 55ml','centella-signature-soothing-ampoule-55ml','<p data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"698\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Centella Signature Soothing Ampoule is a lightweight, minimalist ampoule formulated with <strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"530\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong>. It is designed to provide gentle soothing and hydration for sensitive, dry, irritated, or stressed-looking skin while helping maintain a hea