redient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1596\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1395\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\nCentella Asiatica is widely used in skincare for its <strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1511\">soothing, moisturizing, and skin-conditioning properties</strong>. It helps comfort stressed-looking skin and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1614\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1792\">✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1688\">\r\n✔ Redness-prone skin<br data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n✔ Irritated or stressed-looking skin<br data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n✔ Weakened skin barrier<br data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n✔ All skin types</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1805\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1929\">A <strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1847\">lightweight, watery ampoule texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or sticky finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1945\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2005\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6k8mf\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2051\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6d5ee\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya5vg0\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fhs00a\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2166\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2196\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2215\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2339\"><strong data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2339\">Madagascar Centella • Soothing • Hydration • Redness Care • Barrier Support • Sensitive Skin Care • Lightweight Texture</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2355\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2350\">Size:</strong> 55ml</p>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ciT4UsTfcy2XedfktefO3zJfdrqA9udq3km86qxP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:03:50','2026-09-16 10:55:50');
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (165,'Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule 100ml','madagascar-centella-poremizing-fresh-ampoule-100ml','<p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"669\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule is a lightweight ampoule designed to provide <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"519\">pore care and refreshing hydration</strong> while helping soothe the skin. It is especially suitable for skin concerned with excess sebum, enlarged-looking pores, rough texture, and congestion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"687\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f6yn9h\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"767\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"704\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of enlarged and noticeable pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g31qk7\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"788\">Sebum Balance:</strong> Helps manage excess oil and maintain a balanced-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b23ycj\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"878\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Provides moisture without making the skin feel overly heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c9oq09\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"960\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps calm stressed and sensitive-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxrgr\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1036\">Smooths Skin Texture:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of rough and uneven skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4wper\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1171\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1114\">Fresh Skin Feel:</strong> Leaves the complexion feeling refreshed and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34qzhi\" data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1212\">Helps Reduce Congested Appearance:</strong> Supports cleaner-looking pores by helping maintain oil balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xopwx4\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1299\">Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain a healthy-looking moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"li1xo4\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1378\">Key Ingredients &amp; Care</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1540\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1412\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1415\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort the skin and supports a healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1709\"><strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1567\">Pore-Care Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\nThe formula is designed to provide targeted care for excess sebum and visible pores, helping create a smoother and more refined appearance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1727\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1898\">✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n✔ Enlarged-looking pores<br data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n✔ Excess sebum<br data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n✔ Congested-looking skin<br data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n✔ Rough skin texture<br data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated oily skin<br data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1911\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1912\" data-end=\"2064\">A <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1951\">fresh, lightweight watery ampoule</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly. It provides hydration without leaving a heavy, oily, or sticky feeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2080\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6k8mf\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aczcm\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2226\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akqr6e\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2262\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kpcsol\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2313\">\r\nFollow with a lightweight moisturizer or cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2344\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2363\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2491\"><strong data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2491\">Madagascar Centella • Pore Care • Sebum Balance • Hydration • Soothing • Skin Texture Care • Fresh Finish • Barrier Support</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2508\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2502\">Size:</strong> 100ml</p>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/GZF0ipn24v3gREgHpQPHjzv3hjGZwaU7ZIVgJAMk.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:05:57','2026-09-16 10:50:34'),(166,'Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Capsule Cream 75ml','madagascar-centella-tone-brightening-capsule-cream-75ml','<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"733\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Capsule Cream is a moisturizing cream designed to provide <strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"523\">brightening and soothing care</strong> while helping maintain a healthy skin barrier. Its capsule-infused texture delivers nourishing moisture and helps improve the appearance of dull, uneven-looking skin for a smoother and more radiant complexion.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"751\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i40zpz\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"775\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cp9up4\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"905\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"859\">Tone Correction:</strong> Helps promote a more even-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y5avex\" data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"927\">Radiance Boost:</strong> Supports a fresh, healthy-looking glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqt3o7\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"984\">Hydration:</strong> Provides lasting moisture to keep skin soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r4y4h5\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1061\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps comfort sensitive and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e7bgmy\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1140\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18f8hsv\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1219\">Smooth Skin Texture:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of rough and uneven-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bv7ikn\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1315\">Nourishing Moisturization:</strong> Helps keep skin comfortable and hydrated throughout the day.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1397\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1567\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1431\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\nKnown for soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps calm stressed-looking skin and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1723\"><strong data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1596\">Brightening Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1599\">\r\nDesigned to help improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting a more radiant-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1741\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1917\">✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1785\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1798\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1834\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\n✔ Skin needing brightening and barrier care</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1930\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2121\">A <strong data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1986\">smooth, creamy texture with moisturizing capsules</strong> that spreads easily across the skin. It provides nourishing hydration while absorbing comfortably without an excessively heavy finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2137\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgtya5\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2283\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wpedgo\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2360\">\r\nMassage or pat lightly until the capsules are fully blended and absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dm1v38\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2391\">morning and evening</strong> as the final step of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2509\"><strong data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2449\">Daytime:</strong> Finish with sunscreen to protect the skin from UV exposure.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2527\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2650\"><strong data-start=\"2528\" data-end=\"2650\">Madagascar Centella • Brightening • Tone Care • Capsule Cream • Hydration • Soothing • Barrier Support • Skin Radiance</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2666\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2661\">Size:</strong> 75ml</p>',NULL,NULL,16,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/r5oAkC3dvdTzg2KWJPoj4o5euVYn1P1IOWABpBLb.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:07:36','2026-09-16 10:50:01'),(167,'Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel Cream 75ml','madagascar-centella-poremizing-light-gel-cream-75ml','<p data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"712\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Light Gel Cream is a lightweight gel moisturizer designed for skin concerned with <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"561\">visible pores, excess sebum, uneven texture, and dehydration</strong>. Its fresh gel texture provides comfortable hydration without a heavy or greasy finish, while Centella-focused care helps soothe and support the skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"730\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f6yn9h\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"747\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of enlarged and noticeable pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g31qk7\" data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"899\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"831\">Sebum Balance:</strong> Helps manage excess oil and maintain a balanced-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"imslv9\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"979\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"928\">Lightweight Hydration:</strong> Provides moisture without feeling heavy or greasy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q59rvo\" data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1048\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1000\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps calm sensitive and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vu3x9u\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1073\">Skin Texture Care:</strong> Helps leave rough and uneven-feeling skin smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fav9na\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1227\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1145\">Fresh Finish:</strong> Provides a refreshing, comfortable finish suitable for oily and combination skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pii1jr\" data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1259\">Moisture Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain a healthy-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrdd66\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1338\">Non-Heavy Moisturization:</strong> Ideal for those who prefer a light gel-type moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1413\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1577\">✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1428\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1449\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n✔ Enlarged-looking pores<br data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1492\">\r\n✔ Excess sebum<br data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1509\">\r\n✔ Congested-looking skin<br data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated oily skin<br data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1561\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1590\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1762\">A <strong data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1632\">light, refreshing gel-cream texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly. It leaves the skin feeling hydrated and fresh without an overly sticky or greasy finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1778\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgtya5\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1843\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ixb712\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of gel cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9vchq\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya5vg0\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dm1v38\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2003\">morning and evening</strong> as the final step of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80rvwq\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2064\">When to Use</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dzci17\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2103\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2079\">Morning:</strong> Apply before sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3gxu\" data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2155\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2118\">Evening:</strong> Use as your final moisturizing step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"weo2k8\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\nCan be especially comfortable during <strong data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2220\">warm or humid weather</strong> when rich creams feel too heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2271\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2415\"><strong data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2415\">Madagascar Centella • Pore Care • Sebum Balance • Lightweight Hydration • Soothing • Skin Texture Care • Fresh Gel Finish • Barrier Support</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2431\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2426\">Size:</strong> 75ml</p>',NULL,NULL,15,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ApTxUvbvNLh5uAEDU03RUFTnovGsSr9e5aFqIjG9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:09:13','2026-09-14 08:49:28'),(168,'Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncreen Plus Spf 50+ Pa++++ 50ml','madagascar-centella-air-fit-suncreen-plus-spf-50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"741\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncream Plus SPF50+ PA++++ is a high-protection daily sunscreen formulated to help protect the skin from <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"620\">UVA and UVB rays</strong> while providing soothing and moisturizing care. It is designed with a lightweight, comfortable texture for everyday use.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"759\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sunlfj\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"785\">High UV Protection:</strong> SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA++++ provides strong UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ty0qbj\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"998\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"900\">Broad-Spectrum Sun Care:</strong> Helps protect skin from sun exposure that can contribute to premature aging and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lken76\" data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1019\">Soothing Care:</strong> Madagascar Centella helps calm and comfort stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6f6lt8\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1162\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1102\">Hydration:</strong> Helps maintain skin moisture and prevent excessive dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o5dx9l\" data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1186\">Lightweight Feel:</strong> Designed for comfortable everyday wear without an overly heavy sensation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ydf4k\" data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1288\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain healthy-looking, balanced skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lnq08\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1428\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1359\">Daily Protection:</strong> Suitable for use as the final step of your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15trp6c\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1451\">Makeup-Friendly:</strong> Can be used underneath makeup as part of a daytime skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1540\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1582\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort the skin while supporting a healthy-looking moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1738\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1907\">✔ All skin types<br data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1758\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1777\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1841\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n✔ Daily outdoor and indoor sun-care routines</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1929\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2107\">A <strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1969\">lightweight, smooth cream texture</strong> that spreads easily over the skin and absorbs comfortably. It is designed to provide a fresh, non-heavy finish suitable for everyday use.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2123\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckocmq\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\nApply an adequate amount of sunscreen to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tduyib\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\nSpread evenly and gently pat into the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hz7lbq\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2355\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2339\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>, before makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffv6w6\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, wiping the face, or prolonged sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2478\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2691\">For reliable protection, use an adequate amount and reapply when needed. Sunscreen should be combined with other sun-protective measures such as shade, protective clothing, and avoiding prolonged direct sunlight.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2709\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2834\"><strong data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2834\">SPF50+ • PA++++ • UVA/UVB Protection • Madagascar Centella • Soothing • Hydration • Lightweight Texture • Daily Sun Care</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2850\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2845\">Size:</strong> 50ml</p>',NULL,NULL,19,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/6nDdSctwQfbpqsMTG10h5CrnDe11Cq3YBOSh2Swm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:10:49','2026-09-16 10:49:23'),(169,'Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Tone-Up Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml','madagascar-centella-tone-brightening-tone-up-sunscreen-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"763\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Tone-Up Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ is a daily sunscreen that combines <strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"633\">high UV protection with brightening and tone-up skincare</strong>. It helps protect the skin from UVA and UVB rays while giving the complexion an instantly brighter, more even-looking appearance.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"781\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sunlfj\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"891\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"807\">High UV Protection:</strong> SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA++++ provides strong UVA protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yt30ml\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"914\">Instant Tone-Up:</strong> Helps visibly brighten the complexion immediately after application.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i40zpz\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1007\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ze87v0\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1098\">Even-Looking Skin Tone:</strong> Helps create a smoother, more uniform-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1anal8y\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1177\">Soothing Care:</strong> Madagascar Centella helps comfort and calm stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q4irhj\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1260\">Hydration:</strong> Helps maintain comfortable moisture throughout the day.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8tvsv5\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1338\">Radiance Boost:</strong> Gives the skin a fresh, naturally luminous appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oi4y8l\" data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1462\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1412\">Makeup Base:</strong> Can work as a brightening base underneath makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1483\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1665\"><strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1525\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps calm stressed-looking skin and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1801\"><strong data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1699\">Brightening Care Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\nHelp improve the appearance of dullness and uneven-looking skin tone for a more radiant complexion.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1819\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1993\">✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1863\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1879\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1932\">\r\n✔ Anyone wanting tone-up + sunscreen<br data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n✔ Daily sun protection</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2015\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2197\">A <strong data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2055\">smooth, lightweight cream texture</strong> that spreads easily and blends into the skin. It provides a <strong data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2162\">brightened, natural-looking tone-up finish</strong> without feeling excessively heavy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2213\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"112qqe\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\nTake an adequate amount of sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2337\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gllfqo\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2389\">\r\nBlend carefully around the hairline and jawline.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t181zg\" data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\nGently pat until evenly distributed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"75tyoh\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2490\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8uiluw\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2605\">\r\nReapply throughout the day, particularly after sweating, swimming, wiping the face, or prolonged sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2625\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2848\">The tone-up effect is primarily <strong data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2684\">cosmetic and immediate</strong>, while consistent sunscreen use helps protect against UV-related pigmentation and premature skin aging. Apply gradually and blend well to achieve a natural finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2866\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"3001\"><strong data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"3001\">SPF50+ • PA++++ • UVA/UVB Protection • Tone-Up • Brightening • Madagascar Centella • Soothing • Hydration • Radiance • Makeup Base</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3017\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3003\" data-end=\"3012\">Size:</strong> 50ml</p>',NULL,NULL,19,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/7PePjoaAQZOejNlFDfsihtUo7g0Nwwyju3WEDvaP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:13:32','2026-09-16 10:48:59'),(170,'Madagascar Centella Cream 75ml','madagascar-centella-cream-75ml','<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"682\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Cream is a soothing moisturizer designed to provide <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"515\">hydration and barrier-supporting care</strong> for dry, sensitive, and stressed-looking skin. Formulated with Madagascar Centella, it helps calm the skin while keeping it soft, smooth, and comfortably moisturized.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"700\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17pa18p\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"721\">Soothing Care:</strong> Helps calm sensitive and stressed-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yjqcj7\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"791\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Provides moisture and helps relieve dryness and tightness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1khkbw7\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"878\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain a healthy-looking moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"123rzps\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1012\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"949\">Redness Care:</strong> Helps reduce the appearance of visible redness and discomfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2ac81\" data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1032\">Skin Comfort:</strong> Helps keep sensitive skin feeling calm and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wis3im\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1169\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1116\">Smooths Skin Texture:</strong> Helps improve the feel of rough and dehydrated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r950va\" data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1195\">Moisture Retention:</strong> Helps prevent excessive moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ncefc\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1267\">Nourishing Moisturization:</strong> Leaves the skin feeling soft, supple, and well moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1347\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1532\"><strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1389\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort stressed-looking skin and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1550\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1712\">✔ Sensitive skin<br data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\n✔ Dry skin<br data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1583\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1619\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n✔ Redness-prone skin<br data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1663\">\r\n✔ Stressed-looking skin<br data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n✔ Weakened skin barrier</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1725\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1896\">A <strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1767\">smooth, creamy moisturizing texture</strong> that spreads e