id=\"8hj23j\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\nApply an adequate amount to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tduyib\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\nSpread evenly and gently pat into the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ubsuab\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2285\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffv6w6\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2389\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, wiping the face, or prolonged sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2409\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2620\">SPF30 PA++++ provides meaningful daily UV protection, but for <strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2502\">prolonged outdoor exposure</strong>, frequent reapplication and additional sun-protection measures such as shade and protective clothing are recommended.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2638\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2762\"><strong data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2762\">SPF30 • PA++++ • UVA/UVB Protection • Madagascar Centella • Soothing • Hydration • Lightweight Texture • Daily Sun Care</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2778\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2773\">Size:</strong> 50ml</p>',NULL,NULL,19,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/exnUgvnZ7Hg4akVMcLqTA8ywUzgfjAPgtkj7QeiK.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:16:42','2026-09-16 10:48:00'),(172,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule - 95ml','madagascar-centella-probio-cica-intensive-ampoule-95ml','<p data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"689\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule is an intensi