ovides a comfortable moisturizing layer. It leaves the skin feeling soft, hydrated, and supple without an excessively greasy finish.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2309\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2342\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"khinis\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\nApply toner or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h6k8mf\" data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2415\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aczcm\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2455\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akqr6e\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbml86\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2538\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer or barrier cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqy3ek\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2569\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pli6j2\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2585\">Usage Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2722\">For very dry or stressed-looking skin, apply a slightly thicker layer or follow with a nourishing moisturizer to help lock in hydration.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2740\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2888\"><strong data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2888\">Madagascar Centella • Probio-Cica • Intensive Soothing • Barrier Support • Deep Hydration • Redness Care • Moisture Retention • Skin Resilience</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2904\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2899\">Size:</strong> 95ml</p>',NULL,NULL,12,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/4lrH8ZUSwSoxe0JvosDrV1h2H1vcjl1MBcJjAs2Y.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:18:49','2026-09-16 10:47:32'),(173,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Bakuchiol Eye Cream 20ml','madagascar-centella-probio-cica-bakuchiol-eye-cream-20ml','<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"817\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Bakuchiol Eye Cream is a nourishing eye cream formulated to provide <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"620\">anti-aging, firming, soothing, and moisturizing care</strong> for the delicate skin around the eyes. The combination of Centella-based ingredients and bakuchiol helps support smoother, firmer, and healthier-looking skin while providing comfortable hydration.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"835\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kxm7b7\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"857\">Fine-Line Care:</strong> Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dbqj1t\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"933\">Firming Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of firmness and skin elasticity around the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hridn2\" data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1033\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prevent dryness around the delicate eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ijaxd\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1124\">Soothing:</strong> Helps calm sensitive and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10cc2r8\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1195\">Barrier Support:</strong> Helps maintain the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186y1fm\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1263\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull-looking skin around the eyes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1muau5g\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1357\">Smooth Skin Texture:</strong> Helps make the eye area feel softer and smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aplvek\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1430\">Nourishing Care:</strong> Provides rich conditioning without requiring excessive rubbing.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1515\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1688\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1549\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\nKnown for soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort the delicate eye area and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1860\"><strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1705\">Probio-Cica</strong><br data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\nA Centella-based complex designed to provide intensive soothing and barrier-supporting care, helping sensitive skin feel more comfortable and resilient.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"2037\"><strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1875\">Bakuchiol</strong><br data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\nA plant-derived skincare ingredient commonly used as a retinol alternative. It helps support smoother-looking skin, firmness, and the appearance of fine lines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2055\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2224\">✔ Fine lines<br data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\n✔ Loss of firmness<br data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2092\">\r\n✔ Dry under-eye area<br data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n✔ Mature-looking skin<br data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n✔ Sensitive eye area<br data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\n✔ Dull-looking eye area<br data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n✔ All skin types</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2237\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2437\">A <strong data-start=\"2240\" data-end=\"2276\">smooth, nourishing cream texture</strong> that spreads easily and provides comfortable moisture. It is designed to feel rich enough for the delicate eye area while absorbing without excessive heaviness.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2453\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2724\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rvgnpp\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2499\">\r\nComplete your cleansing and toner routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgtya5\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2526\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kf5uaf\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\nTake a small amount of eye cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fad9v3\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2627\">\r\nGently apply around the orbital bone using your ring finger.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5969s2\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\nLightly pat until absorbed—avoid pulling or rubbing the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2693\" data-end=\"2724\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2723\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pli6j2\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2739\">Usage Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2929\">Because the eye area is delicate, use a small amount and introduce the product gradually if your skin is sensitive. During daytime, finish with sunscreen around the eye area as appropriate.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2947\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3081\"><strong data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3081\">Madagascar Centella • Probio-Cica • Bakuchiol • Fine-Line Care • Firming • Hydration • Soothing • Barrier Support • Eye-Area Care</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3097\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3092\">Size:</strong> 20ml</p>',NULL,NULL,28,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/WevcMOiPsbECIf4VknWEkYBKXJ1SwiZFlJVhxeg9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:21:49','2026-09-16 10:47:03'),(174,'Madagascar Centella Toning Toner 210ml','madagascar-centella-toning-toner-210ml','<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"723\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner is a lightweight daily toner formulated to provide <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"557\">gentle exfoliation, hydration, and soothing care</strong>. It combines Madagascar Centella with a mild PHA exfoliant to help remove dead skin-cell buildup and improve the appearance of dull, uneven, and rough-textured skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"741\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mqos4d\" data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"767\">Gentle Exfoliation:</strong> Helps remove dead skin cells and surface buildup without harsh scrubbing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jn3pn\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"866\">Skin Texture Care:</strong> Helps make rough and uneven-feeling skin smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i40zpz\" data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"941\">Brightening Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glu4tj\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1019\">Pore Care:</strong> Helps keep pores looking cleaner and more refined by reducing surface buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17arqic\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1115\">Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prepare skin for subsequent skincare steps.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17z8klj\" data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1204\">Soothing:</strong> Madagascar Centella helps calm and comfort stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppbg29\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1300\">Even-Looking Skin Tone:</strong> Helps promote a smoother and more uniform-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ieduk\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1464\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1391\">Daily Skin Refinement:</strong> Mild exfoliating care can help maintain a fresh and polished appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1485\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1527\">Madagascar Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1530\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties. It helps comfort the skin while supporting a healthy-looking barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1890\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1684\">PHA (Polyhydroxy Acid)</strong><br data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\nA gentle exfoliating ingredient that helps remove dead skin cells and surface buildup. PHA is generally considered milder than stronger chemical exfoliants and can help improve skin texture and radiance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1908\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"2107\">✔ Dull-looking skin<br data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n✔ Rough skin texture<br data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n✔ Uneven-looking skin tone<br data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\n✔ Combination skin<br data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2004\">\r\n✔ Oily skin<br data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n✔ Normal skin<br data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin needing gentle exfoliation<br data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2080\">\r\n✔ Skin with surface buildup</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2120\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2235\">A <strong data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2152\">lightweight, watery toner</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or sticky feeling.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2237\" data-end=\"2251\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fpmh33\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2356\">\r\nPour an appropriate amount of toner onto your hands or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oovexs\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\nGently apply across the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18n7glr\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\nAvoid the immediate eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2471\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xt0qzb\" data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\nFollow with serum, ampoule, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bsd80u\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2550\">once or twice daily</strong>, depending on your skin\'s tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1pli6j2\" data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2602\">Usage Tip</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2843\">Because this toner contains an exfoliating ingredient, start <strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2697\">once daily or every other day</strong> if your skin is sensitive. Avoid combining it in the same routine with several strong exfoliating products if your skin becomes dry or irritated.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1iz91iu\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2861\">Key Features</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2987\"><strong data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2987\">Madagascar Centella • PHA • Gentle Exfoliation • Brightening • Hydration • Soothing • Pore Care • Skin Texture Refinement</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3004\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"2998\">Size:</strong> 210ml</p>',NULL,NULL,6,9,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/796g26ZyzmdyvNEMALR6rYBgnGZTsA7Q37QcoDEc.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-21 11:23:24','2026-09-16 10:46:42'),(175,'Full Fit Propolis Synergy Toner 150ml','full-fit-propolis-synergy-toner-150ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"394\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Full Fit Propolis Synergy Toner is a nourishing and hydrating toner formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"225\">72.6% Propolis Extract, 10.7% Honey Extract, and Panthenol</strong>. It helps moisturize, soothe, smooth, and improve the appearance of dull, dehydrated skin while leaving a healthy, glowing finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"357\" data-content-reference-end=\"389\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"837\"><strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"417\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"420\">\r\nCOSRX Full Fit Propolis Synergy Toner is a daily boosting toner designed to provide deep hydration and nourishment while helping the skin look plump, smooth, and radiant. Its formula contains <strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"648\">72.6% Black Bee Propolis Extract</strong> to nourish and soothe tired-looking skin, <strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"714\">10.7% Honey Extract</strong> for added nourishment, and <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"755\">Panthenol</strong> to support a comfortable, moisturized feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"795\" data-content-reference-end=\"814\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"1097\">The toner is suitable for <strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"883\">all skin types</strong>, including dull and dehydrated skin. It helps reduce the appearance of redness, improve skin texture, and create a smooth, hydrated base for the rest of your skincare routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1037\" data-content-reference-end=\"1056\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1115\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5hcz2m\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\nDeeply hydrates and moisturizes the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"189ra7x\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\nHelps soothe and calm irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17exof5\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\nNourishes tired and dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9dhqn4\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\nPromotes a plump, healthy-looking glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3i41ps\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\nHelps improve skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3cikc\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1416\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1338\" data-content-reference-end=\"1357\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1437\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"750ndi\" data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1526\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1466\">72.6% Propolis Extract</strong> – Nourishes and helps leave skin looking healthy and plump.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11a8h5\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1552\">10.7% Honey Extract</strong> – Provides nourishing and revitalizing benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t87gzr\" data-start=\"1602\" data-end=\"1669\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1622\">0.2% Panthenol</strong> – Helps keep skin moisturized and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17djkcy\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1759\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1694\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Supports skin hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1663\" data-content-reference-end=\"1682\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1775\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1981\">After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the face and gently massage or pat until fully absorbed. Use <strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1908\">morning and evening</strong> as the first step after cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1867\" data-content-reference-end=\"1886\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2091\"><strong data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"1992\">Size:</strong> 150ml<br data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2015\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2033\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2046\">Best For:</strong> Dull, dehydrated, dry and redness-prone skin</p>',NULL,NULL,6,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/5II8KbnBiaH7nUuosiGtzhCOUdeAtPPu6zcfb76j.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:40:03','2026-09-15 10:12:36'),(176,'Ultra Light Invisible Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ 50ml','ultra-light-invisible-sunscreen-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"368\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ is a lightweight daily sunscreen that provides high UVA/UVB protection without leaving a white cast. Its sheer, fast-absorbing formula helps keep skin hydrated, comfortable, and naturally fresh. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"331\" data-content-reference-end=\"363\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"703\"><strong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"391\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\">\r\nCOSRX Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen SPF50 PA++++ is designed for comfortable everyday sun protection with a lightweight, transparent finish. It provides <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"581\">SPF50+ and PA++++ protection</strong> against UVB and UVA rays while absorbing quickly without a heavy or greasy feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"661\" data-content-reference-end=\"693\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"1049\">Formulated with <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"816\">Aloe Vera Leaf Water, Niacinamide, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Adenosine, and Tocopherol</strong>, it helps hydrate and comfort the skin while supporting a healthy-looking complexion. The invisible finish makes it suitable for different skin tones and ideal for wearing alone or under makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1002\" data-content-reference-end=\"1034\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1067\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t10wqd\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\nSPF50+ PA++++ broad-spectrum sun protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mcjy7\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\nLightweight and fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi8ner\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\nInvisible finish with no noticeable white cast\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njxjj1\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\nHelps keep skin hydrated\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hkl4na\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\nNon-greasy, comfortable texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svbvmg\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\nSuitable for daily use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1297\" data-content-reference-end=\"1329\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1370\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3cd67\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1441\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1404\">Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water</strong> – Helps soothe and hydrate the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1onn030\" data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1502\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1459\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps support an even-looking skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63objz\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1527\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p65m19\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1568\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10s2m17\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1693\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1623\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Provides antioxidant support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1636\" data-content-reference-end=\"1668\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1709\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1931\">Apply an adequate amount to the face and neck as the final step of your skincare routine, before sun exposure. Reapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or towel drying. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1869\" data-content-reference-end=\"1888\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2060\"><strong data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1942\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1958\">SPF:</strong> 50+<br data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1972\">PA:</strong> PA++++<br data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1996\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2025\">Finish:</strong> Invisible, lightweight, non-greasy</p>',NULL,NULL,19,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/2g4VBtgG8XQvRd5YIJ0ELAcj3AzwVQP1TQrTuShh.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:46:57','2026-09-15 10:12:09'),(177,'Low pH Niacinamide Micellar Cleansing Water 100ml','low-ph-niacinamide-micellar-cleansing-water-100ml','<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"389\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Low pH Niacinamide Micellar Cleansing Water is a gentle, low-pH cleanser that effectively removes makeup, sunscreen, dirt, and excess sebum while helping keep the skin hydrated and comfortable. It is especially suitable for sensitive and easily irritated skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"352\" data-content-reference-end=\"384\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"412\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"415\">\r\nCOSRX Low pH Niacinamide Micellar Cleansing Water 100ml is a gentle daily cleansing water designed to remove impurities and makeup without leaving the skin feeling dry or stripped. Its low-pH, skin-friendly formula helps maintain the skin\'s natural balance while providing a fresh and comfortable finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"715\" data-content-reference-end=\"734\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"1125\">Formulated with <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"858\">Niacinamide, Zinc PCA, Panthenol, Hyaluronic Acid, Allantoin, and Madecassoside</strong>, it helps control excess sebum, hydrate the skin, and soothe sensitive or irritated-looking skin. The lightweight micellar formula gently lifts away makeup and impurities and can be used as the first step of a cleansing routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1065\" data-content-reference-end=\"1084\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1143\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1by46fi\" data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\nGently removes makeup, sunscreen, dirt, and impurities\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejexln\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\nHelps control excess oil and sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wz2efu\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\nMaintains a skin-friendly low pH\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z5df6\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1324\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive and irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e264hz\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\nProvides hydration during cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pr7zd\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\nHelps prevent a dry or tight feeling after cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svbvmg\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\nSuitable for daily use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188fz51\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\nSuitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1447\" data-content-reference-end=\"1479\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1546\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qvdu0g\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1648\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1576\">Niacinamide (1,000ppm):</strong> Helps control excess sebum and supports a more even-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vwqrqj\" data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1664\">Zinc PCA:</strong> Helps with oil control and pore care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14lfvh\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1719\">Panthenol:</strong> Helps hydrate and support the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3az2yx\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1786\">Hyaluronic Acid:</strong> Helps maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19zdkmu\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1849\">Allantoin &amp; Madecassoside:</strong> Help soothe and comfort the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1838\" data-content-reference-end=\"1857\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1937\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2306\">Pour an adequate amount onto a cotton pad and gently wipe across the face until makeup and impurities are removed. For long-wearing or heavy makeup, hold the cotton pad over the area for around <strong data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2146\">10 seconds</strong> before wiping. It does not require rinsing, but you may rinse or follow with a second cleanser according to your routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2205\" data-content-reference-end=\"2224\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2541\"><strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2317\">Size:</strong> 100ml<br data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2326\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2340\">Skin Type:</strong> Sensitive, Dry, Oily, Acne-Prone &amp; All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2405\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight Micellar Water<br data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2435\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2442\">pH:</strong> Low pH / Skin-friendly<br data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2481\">Best For:</strong> Makeup removal, excess sebum, sensitive and dehydrated skin</p>',NULL,NULL,4,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/An5MApR6Xs56lelAAC5374DnJQZl3upQubwYFAu7.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:49:26','2026-09-15 09:56:37'),(178,'Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream 25ml','advanced-snail-peptide-eye-cream-25ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"400\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream is a lightweight, fast-absorbing eye cream formulated with <strong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"220\">73.6% Snail Secretion Filtrate and 5 peptides</strong>. It helps hydrate, brighten, firm, and smooth the delicate eye area while reducing the appearance of dark circles, puffiness, and fine lines. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"363\" data-content-reference-end=\"395\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"840\"><strong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"423\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\">\r\nCOSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream 25ml is a nourishing yet lightweight eye treatment designed to care for the delicate skin around the eyes. Its formula combines <strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"692\">Snail Secretion Filtrate, Niacinamide, Adenosine, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, and five peptides</strong> to provide hydration, improve the appearance of firmness, and promote a brighter, healthier-looking eye area. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"798\" data-content-reference-end=\"817\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"1135\">The fast-absorbing texture helps moisturize without feeling heavy or overly greasy. With regular use, it helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1042\">fine lines, wrinkles, puffiness, dullness, and dark circles</strong>, making the eye area look smoother and more refreshed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1075\" data-content-reference-end=\"1107\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1153\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ummb5\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\nHelps brighten the under-eye area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bhhqg\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\nReduces the appearance of dark circles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3i9qe\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\nHelps improve the look of fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qq8qg6\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\nSupports firmer-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u22sdb\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1347\">\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21xm1v\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of puffiness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19480wi\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\nLightweight and fast absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1491\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1426\" data-content-reference-end=\"1445\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1512\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lwx74m\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1549\">73.6% Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong> – Helps moisturize, nourish, and support a healthier-looking eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1saxq0\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1686\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1637\">5 Peptides</strong> – Help support firmer and smoother-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3oehv\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1689\" data-end=\"1704\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mwiiiy\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1776\">Adenosine</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of fine lines.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t451cz\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1844\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Helps retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7jba8\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1971\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1885\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps keep the skin hydrated and comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1888\" data-content-reference-end=\"1907\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1987\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2184\">After applying essence, serum, or ampoule, apply a small amount around the eye area. Gently massage and lightly tap with your fingertips until fully absorbed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2083\" data-content-reference-end=\"2102\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2384\"><strong data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2195\">Size:</strong> 25ml / 0.85 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2217\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2231\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2261\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, moisturizing, fast-absorbing<br data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2319\">Best For:</strong> Dark circles, puffiness, fine lines, wrinkles, dryness, dullness</p>',NULL,NULL,28,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/iRZecmrjIzTEJdL4psJM31PQJsuoTmtUE9sKQ9Tp.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:51:30','2026-09-15 09:59:07'),(179,'BHA Blackhead Power Liquid 100ml','bha-blackhead-power-liquid-100ml','<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"341\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX BHA Blackhead Power Liquid is an exfoliating liquid formulated with <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"180\">Betaine Salicylate and Niacinamide</strong> to help unclog pores, reduce blackheads, control excess oil, and improve the appearance of skin texture and blemish marks. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"304\" data-content-reference-end=\"323\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"671\"><strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"364\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"367\">\r\nCOSRX BHA Blackhead Power Liquid 100ml is designed for oily, combination, and blemish-prone skin that experiences clogged pores, blackheads, and excess sebum. Its exfoliating formula helps remove buildup from pores while supporting smoother and clearer-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"616\" data-content-reference-end=\"635\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"1023\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"736\">Willow Bark Water + Betaine Salicylate</strong> to help clear clogged pores and improve the appearance of skin texture, while <strong data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"830\">Niacinamide</strong> helps reduce the appearance of blemish marks and promote a brighter-looking complexion. <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"955\">Panthenol and Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> help maintain skin hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"950\" data-content-reference-end=\"969\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1041\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0pc4p\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1069\">\r\nHelps clear clogged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xu75vt\" data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\nReduces the appearance of blackheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qovq70\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1135\">\r\nHelps control excess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0ikp2\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1161\">\r\nHelps prevent breakouts\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r9xzsf\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\nImproves the appearance of skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6tl4m\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of blemish marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"orweao\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\nSupports a smoother, clearer-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1492idq\" data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\nIdeal for oily and acne-prone skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1284\" data-content-reference-end=\"1303\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1396\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16o00cz\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1421\">Betaine Salicylate</strong> – Helps exfoliate and clear pore-clogging buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v8vtii\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1496\">Willow Bark Water</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10zo1wj\" data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1562\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of spots and supports brighter-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctkn6\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1653\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab9mea\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1782\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1719\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1673\" data-content-reference-end=\"1692\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1798\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"2146\">After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the face, focusing on areas with clogged pores or blackheads. Allow it to absorb before applying the rest of your skincare routine. Start <strong data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2007\">2–3 times per week</strong> and gradually increase according to your skin\'s tolerance. During the daytime, always use sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2019\" data-content-reference-end=\"2038\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2344\"><strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2157\">Size:</strong> 100ml / 3.38 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2180\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2194\">Skin Type:</strong> Oily, Combination, Blemish-Prone<br data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2243\">Best For:</strong> Blackheads, clogged pores, excess oil, breakouts &amp; uneven texture<br data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2321\">Type:</strong> BHA Exfoliating Liquid</p>',NULL,NULL,11,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/F3eALBDQQ7YX5ZJXudvZoypB5bURA0knOEjsFSII.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:53:20','2026-09-15 10:02:09'),(180,'Full Fit Propolis Light Cream 65ml','full-fit-propolis-light-cream-65ml','<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"397\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Cream is a lightweight, nourishing moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"233\">64% Propolis Extract, 1% Honey Extract, and 1% Royal Jelly Extract</strong>. It helps replenish moisture, nourish the skin, enhance radiance, and leave the complexion soft, smooth, and healthy-looking. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"360\" data-content-reference-end=\"379\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"739\"><strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"420\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"423\">\r\nCOSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Cream 65ml is a moisturizing cream designed to provide hydration and nourishment without feeling overly heavy. Its lightweight, gel-like texture absorbs comfortably into the skin and helps improve the appearance of dull, dehydrated, and rough skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"684\" data-content-reference-end=\"703\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"1064\">The formula features the <strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"790\">Full Fit Pro Complex</strong>, combining Propolis Extract, Honey Extract, and Royal Jelly Extract to nourish the skin and provide antioxidant benefits. With regular use, it helps maintain a plump, moisturized appearance and enhances the skin\'s natural-looking glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"991\" data-content-reference-end=\"1010\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1082\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ltosr\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1115\">\r\nProvides long-lasting moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"84bzf9\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\nNourishes dry and tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rkc7d8\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\nHelps enhance natural-looking radiance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zaiuiu\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of rough skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qp8rb5\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\nSupports softer, smoother-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1labsil\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uwbemw\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\nLightweight and easily absorbed\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1336\" data-content-reference-end=\"1355\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1448\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ddurk3\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1475\">64% Propolis Extract</strong> – Helps nourish and moisturize the skin while providing antioxidant benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"npvaln\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1576\">1% Honey Extract</strong> – Helps provide nourishment and moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vji4xt\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1647\">1% Royal Jelly Extract</strong> – Helps support a healthy, nourished-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7a48ng\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1720\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k4wcpa\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1772\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1738\" data-content-reference-end=\"1757\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1863\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"2100\">After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. Gently pat the skin to help the cream absorb. It can be used both morning and evening. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1973\" data-content-reference-end=\"1992\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2280\"><strong data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2111\">Size:</strong> 65ml / 2.19 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2147\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2165\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2177\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, gel-like cream<br data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2208\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2221\">Best For:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, dullness, rough texture &amp; fine lines</p>',NULL,NULL,16,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/XUluRlWDSav2r57jJqW6GtuKJOyKZyOZtJ7VdI6H.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:55:45','2026-09-15 10:11:35'),(181,'Full fit Propolis Light Ampoule 30ml','full-fit-propolis-light-ampoule-30ml','<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"375\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Ampoule is a lightweight, nourishing ampoule formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"189\">83.3% Propolis Extract</strong>. It helps deeply hydrate, soothe, nourish, and improve the appearance of dull, dehydrated skin while leaving a smooth, plump, healthy-looking glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"338\" data-content-reference-end=\"357\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"707\"><strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"398\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"401\">\r\nCOSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Ampoule 30ml is an intensive nourishing treatment designed to give dull and dehydrated skin a healthy, radiant appearance. Its lightweight texture absorbs comfortably without a sticky or heavy feeling, making it suitable for everyday use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"652\" data-content-reference-end=\"671\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"1018\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"756\">83.3% Propolis Extract</strong>, along with <strong data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"825\">Glycerin, Betaine, Sodium Hyaluronate, and Panthenol</strong>, which help provide hydration, nourishment, and soothing care. With regular use, it helps skin look smoother, plumper, softer, and more naturally glowing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"945\" data-content-reference-end=\"977\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1036\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lg498c\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\nProvides intense hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17lssjv\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\nNourishes tired and dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vsm2xy\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\nHelps soothe redness and irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9dhqn4\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\nPromotes a plump, healthy-looking glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4v52fy\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1243\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17syvs0\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\nLightweight and non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1leaysp\" data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\nHelps keep skin soft and smooth\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1374\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1296\" data-content-reference-end=\"1315\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1395\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvtbv\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1424\">83.3% Propolis Extract</strong> – Helps nourish, soothe, and promote a healthy-looking glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o2o304\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1510\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture and improve hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"twiqxb\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1611\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1572\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and maintain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctkn6\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1668\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1627\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ewsofc\" data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1766\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1682\">Betaine</strong> – Helps maintain skin hydration and softness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1670\" data-content-reference-end=\"1689\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1782\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1973\">After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face. Gently massage and pat until fully absorbed, then follow with moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1859\" data-content-reference-end=\"1878\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2157\"><strong data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"1984\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2006\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2020\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2050\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, nourishing ampoule<br data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2098\">Best For:</strong> Dullness, dehydration, dryness, redness &amp; lack of radiance</p>',NULL,NULL,12,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/dlAotFy9G4eJ8HL9ToMmVdhb7uOH01d0QVt4gYhM.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:57:37','2026-09-15 10:11:13'),(182,'Full Fit Propolis Lip Sleeping Mask 20ml','full-fit-propolis-lip-sleeping-mask-20ml','<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"375\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Full Fit Propolis Lip Sleeping Mask is an overnight lip treatment formulated with <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"217\">Propolis, Honey, Royal Jelly, and nourishing oils</strong>. It helps deeply moisturize, soften, and smooth dry, rough lips, leaving them feeling plump and comfortable by morning. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"338\" data-content-reference-end=\"370\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"697\"><strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"398\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"401\">\r\nCOSRX Full Fit Propolis Lip Sleeping Mask is designed to provide intensive overnight care for dry and dehydrated lips. Its rich, honey-jam-like texture creates a moisturizing layer that helps protect lips from dryness while delivering nourishing ingredients. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"655\" data-content-reference-end=\"674\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"972\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"831\">Propolis Extract, Honey Extract, Royal Jelly Extract, Shea Butter, Sunflower Seed Oil, and Moringa Seed Oil</strong> to nourish and moisturize the lips. It can also be used during the daytime as a moisturizing lip balm. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"912\" data-content-reference-end=\"931\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"990\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o1yd7y\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1020\">\r\nDeeply moisturizes dry lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jsfrgc\" data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\nHelps soften rough and flaky lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t9f9je\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\nNourishes and revitalizes the lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i28mpq\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\nHelps maintain smooth, supple-looking lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l3ovao\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\nCreates a protective moisture layer overnight\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87w11k\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\nGives lips a plump, healthy-looking appearance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1990b9l\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\nCan be used as a daytime lip balm\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1obwnpu\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1310\">\r\nSuitable for dry and dehydrated lips\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1331\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nv6xoj\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1354\">Propolis Extract</strong> – Helps nourish and moisturize the lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wqhjlr\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1415\">Honey Extract</strong> – Helps soften and hydrate dry lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqtwcm\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1506\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1478\">Royal Jelly Extract</strong> – Provides nourishing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sfnlgl\" data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1524\">Shea Butter</strong> – Helps lock in moisture and soften rough lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b45zm9\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1640\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1597\">Sunflower Seed Oil</strong> – Helps nourish and maintain lip softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dz6981\" data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1663\">Moringa Seed Oil</strong> – Helps provide moisturizing and conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1679\" data-content-reference-end=\"1698\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1773\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"2038\">Apply an adequate amount evenly over the lips before going to bed. Leave it on overnight and gently rinse or wipe away any remaining product the next morning. For daytime use, apply a thinner layer whenever your lips feel dry. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1942\" data-content-reference-end=\"1961\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2239\"><strong data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2049\">Size:</strong> 20ml / 20g<br data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2077\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2107\">Texture:</strong> Rich, honey-jam-like texture<br data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2152\">Best For:</strong> Dry, rough, flaky and dehydrated lips<br data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2193\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2201\">Use:</strong> Overnight Lip Mask / Daytime Lip Balm</p>',NULL,NULL,30,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/SvflUV5WnqvbBJ867PNz2SApRir2kBoShtcSyVK5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 06:59:50','2026-09-15 10:10:41'),(183,'ALL ABOUT SNAIL KIT (4-Step)','all-about-snail-kit-4-step','<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"338\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX ALL ABOUT SNAIL KIT 4-Step is a complete mini skincare routine powered by <strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"157\">Snail Mucin</strong> to help hydrate, soothe, nourish, and support healthier-looking skin. It is especially suitable for <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"299\">dehydrated, acne-prone, and dull skin</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"301\" data-content-reference-end=\"320\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"710\"><strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"361\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"364\">\r\nCOSRX ALL ABOUT SNAIL KIT 4-Step contains four best-selling snail-based skincare essentials designed to work together as a simple daily routine. The products help replenish moisture, soothe stressed-looking skin, support the skin barrier, and leave the complexion looking smoother, plumper, and more radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"655\" data-content-reference-end=\"674\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e8zys4\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"735\">4-Step Kit Includes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"878\"><strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"784\">1. Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser – 20ml</strong><br data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"787\">\r\nA gentle cleanser that removes impurities while helping maintain skin moisture and comfort.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"1088\"><strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"931\">2. Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence – 30ml</strong><br data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\">\r\nA hydrating essence with <strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"991\">96% Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong> that helps moisturize, soothe, and improve the appearance of dehydrated or damaged-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1135\">3. Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream – 5ml</strong><br data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\nAn eye treatment containing snail mucin and peptides that helps hydrate the delicate eye area and improve the appearance of fine lines and dark circles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1493\"><strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1339\">4. Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream – 20g</strong><br data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\nA nourishing moisturizer with snail mucin that helps hydrate, soothe, and support a healthy-looking skin barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1420\" data-content-reference-end=\"1439\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1511\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"56piqs\" data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\nDeeply hydrates dry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5erit\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive or stressed-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv5vpr\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1631\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"171k84n\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1676\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dahi5y\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1753\">\r\nPromotes a smoother, plumper complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f89mqu\" data-start=\"1754\" data-end=\"1799\">\r\nSuitable for acne-prone and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ivp3cf\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1881\">\r\nPerfect as a travel-friendly skincare set <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1790\" data-content-reference-end=\"1822\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1901\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2159\"><strong data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1944\">Snail Secretion Filtrate (Snail Mucin)</strong> – Helps replenish moisture, soothe the skin, and support the appearance of a healthy skin barrier. The eye cream also contains multiple peptides for firming and smoothing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2063\" data-content-reference-end=\"2082\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2175\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2545\"><strong data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2187\">Step 1:</strong> Cleanse with Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser and rinse thoroughly.<br data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2270\">Step 2:</strong> Apply Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence evenly over the face.<br data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2339\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2350\">Step 3:</strong> Apply Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream around the eye area and gently pat.<br data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2428\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2439\">Step 4:</strong> Finish with Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream to lock in moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2431\" data-content-reference-end=\"2450\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2830\"><strong data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2560\">Kit Type:</strong> 4-Step Mini/Travel Skincare Set<br data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2608\">Best For:</strong> Dehydrated, dry, dull &amp; acne-prone skin<br data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2671\">Main Ingredient:</strong> Snail Mucin<br data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2686\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2699\">Benefits:</strong> Hydrating • Soothing • Nourishing • Skin Barrier Care<br data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2773\">Kit Contents:</strong> Cleanser 20ml + Essence 30ml + Eye Cream 5ml + Cream 20g</p>',NULL,NULL,43,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/m8AnZJ0CSmz0R6BPjYAfW0DYK7m7A47Ggs95ceNP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:02:29','2026-09-15 09:58:44'),(184,'Acne Pimple Master Patch','acne-pimple-master-patch','<p data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"336\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Acne Pimple Master Patch is a hydrocolloid spot patch designed to protect troubled areas, absorb impurities and fluid, and support faster-looking healing. It helps prevent touching, picking, and further irritation of active pimples. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"299\" data-content-reference-end=\"331\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"680\"><strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"362\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"365\">\r\nCOSRX Acne Pimple Master Patch is an easy-to-use <strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"441\">hydrocolloid acne patch</strong> that provides targeted care for pimples and problematic areas. The patch creates a moist protective environment that helps absorb discharge while protecting the affected area from external irritation. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"638\" data-content-reference-end=\"657\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"936\">It comes in <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"745\">three different sizes—Small, Medium, and Large—</strong> allowing you to choose the most suitable patch for different-sized blemishes. The patch can be used overnight or whenever targeted protection is needed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"876\" data-content-reference-end=\"895\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"954\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nrpvgl\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\nHelps absorb fluid and impurities from pimples\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nabu0k\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\nProtects acne-prone areas from external irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1922w0i\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\nHelps support faster healing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tv7b4w\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1145\">\r\nHelps reduce the risk of picking and further irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e8qv1m\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\nHelps protect against worsening of troubled areas\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hv2gnx\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\nMaintains a moist environment for the affected area\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svcgs6\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1284\">\r\nAvailable in 3 different sizes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4mm69m\" data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\nConvenient for targeted spot care <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1280\" data-content-reference-end=\"1312\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1378\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1556\"><strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1395\">Hydrocolloid</strong> – Absorbs discharge from problematic areas while maintaining a moist environment that supports the skin\'s healing process. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1473\" data-content-reference-end=\"1492\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1572\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z3j4hs\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\nCleanse the skin around the pimple and <strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1642\">dry the area completely</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zs3waj\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1704\">\r\nChoose a patch slightly larger than the problematic area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14dv2pv\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1749\">\r\nApply the patch directly onto the pimple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1erxoor\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\nLeave it on until the patch becomes white or swollen from absorbed fluid, then replace it with a fresh patch. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1799\" data-content-reference-end=\"1832\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"2103\"><strong data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1915\">Quantity:</strong> 24 Patches<br data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1929\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1939\">Sizes:</strong> 9 Large + 5 Medium + 10 Small<br data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1981\">Type:</strong> Hydrocolloid Acne/Pimple Patch<br data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2015\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2028\">Best For:</strong> Active pimples, blemishes &amp; troubled areas<br data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2088\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types</p>',NULL,NULL,44,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ixNo8Ew5o4RJyEVdnYUFioHdR46W7cyCzBINx4Go.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:04:18','2026-09-15 10:09:43'),(185,'Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream 100ml','hyaluronic-acid-intensive-cream-100ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"432\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream is a deeply hydrating yet non-greasy moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"234\">57.8% Hippophae Rhamnoides Water (Sea Buckthorn Water)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"270\">3,000ppm Sodium Hyaluronate</strong>. It helps replenish moisture, lock hydration into the skin, and leave dry, dehydrated skin soft, smooth, and plump-looking. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"395\" data-content-reference-end=\"427\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"852\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"455\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"458\">\r\nCOSRX Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream 100ml is a nourishing moisturizer specially designed for <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"580\">dry and dehydrated skin</strong>. Its rich yet comfortable formula provides long-lasting hydration without leaving the skin feeling excessively oily or heavy. It helps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier and keeps the complexion feeling supple throughout the day. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"810\" data-content-reference-end=\"829\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1169\">The formula combines <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"924\">3,000ppm Sodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluronic Acid)</strong> with <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"966\">57.8% Hippophae Rhamnoides Water</strong>, along with Glycerin, Betaine, Panthenol, and Allantoin. These ingredients help attract and retain moisture while keeping the skin soft, comfortable, and nourished. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1109\" data-content-reference-end=\"1128\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1187\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dsy265\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\nProvides intense, long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhp6j9\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\nHelps lock moisture into the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"em8ukd\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1299\">\r\nRelieves dryness and tightness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqz3nm\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines caused by dehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"108ct3a\" data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and plump-looking\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x742wz\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\nNourishes dry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s0hku9\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\nNon-greasy and comfortable texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14x9il2\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\nCan be used as an overnight moisturizing cream <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1494\" data-content-reference-end=\"1526\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1593\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"980ug9\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1632\">57.8% Hippophae Rhamnoides Water</strong> – Helps moisturize and nourish the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16l2znx\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1707\">3,000ppm Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture for a plumper, smoother appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"24j2ve\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1794\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps maintain skin hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctkn6\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1843\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4icabg\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1887\" data-end=\"1900\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and calm the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1889\" data-content-reference-end=\"1921\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"1988\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2239\">After cleansing, toner, essence, or serum, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face. Gently massage or pat until fully absorbed. Use <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2153\">morning and evening</strong> as the final moisturizing step of your routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2151\" data-content-reference-end=\"2170\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2490\"><strong data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2250\">Size:</strong> 100ml / 100g<br data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2280\">Skin Type:</strong> Dry &amp; Dehydrated Skin<br data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2317\">Texture:</strong> Rich, moisturizing, non-greasy cream<br data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2370\">Best For:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, tightness, fine lines &amp; moisture loss<br data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2433\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2453\">Main Ingredient:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid / Sodium Hyaluronate</p>',NULL,NULL,16,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/YUU5fJ5m71mZURny0bDTBZ3WFFCiUfdLfPWXA1L6.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:06:01','2026-09-15 10:09:08'),(186,'AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 150ml','ahabha-clarifying-treatment-toner-150ml','<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"429\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner is a gentle exfoliating toner formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"254\">Glycolic Acid (AHA), Betaine Salicylate (BHA), Willow Bark Water, and Apple Fruit Water</strong>. It helps remove dead skin cells, clear congested pores, balance excess oil, and improve the appearance of rough or uneven skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"392\" data-content-reference-end=\"411\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"777\"><strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"452\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"455\">\r\nCOSRX AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner 150ml is designed to provide gentle daily exfoliation while keeping the skin fresh, smooth, and hydrated. Its AHA + BHA formula helps remove surface buildup and impurities while supporting clearer-looking pores and a more refined skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"722\" data-content-reference-end=\"741\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"1143\">The formula combines <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"817\">Glycolic Acid</strong> to exfoliate the skin\'s surface with <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"877\">Betaine Salicylate</strong> to help clear congested pores and balance oil production. <strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"979\">Willow Bark Water and Apple Fruit Water</strong> provide additional clarifying and skin-refreshing benefits, while <strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1073\">Panthenol and Allantoin</strong> help keep the skin comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1070\" data-content-reference-end=\"1089\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1161\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfwwm1\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ob4w3v\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\nHelps unclog congested pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9srb9a\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\nReduces the appearance of blackheads and whiteheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kd9ckd\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\nHelps balance excess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"itli4\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1342\">\r\nSmooths and softens rough skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47s698\" data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1391\">\r\nImproves the appearance of uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n6tl4m\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1438\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of blemish marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p538cg\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1472\">\r\nProvides a fresh, clean feeling\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pdk4bl\" data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1559\">\r\nSuitable for beginners to chemical exfoliation <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1468\" data-content-reference-end=\"1487\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1580\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1odzodc\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1606\">Glycolic Acid (AHA)</strong> – Exfoliates the surface of the skin and helps improve smoothness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9vs8bn\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1704\">Betaine Salicylate (BHA)</strong> – Helps clear clogged pores and balance excess oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cx98do\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1836\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1780\">Willow Bark Water</strong> – Helps provide gentle exfoliating and clarifying care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mvv56i\" data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1860\">Apple Fruit Water</strong> – Helps refresh and improve the appearance of dull skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vdi4c\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1945\">Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong> – Help moisturize and soothe the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1913\" data-content-reference-end=\"1932\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2038\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2406\">After cleansing, spray the toner onto a cotton pad and gently wipe over the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. Follow with the rest of your skincare routine. If used during the daytime, apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen afterward. COSRX advises avoiding use together with other <strong data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2358\">AHAs, BHAs, retinol, or vitamin C</strong> products. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2279\" data-content-reference-end=\"2298\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2634\"><strong data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2417\">Size:</strong> 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2454\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types, including Sensitive Skin<br data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2498\" data-end=\"2511\">Best For:</strong> Blackheads, clogged pores, excess oil, rough texture &amp; dullness<br data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2587\">Type:</strong> AHA/BHA Exfoliating Toner<br data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2628\">Made in:</strong> Korea</p>',NULL,NULL,7,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ClN3PMCjtRJtY6UfC9nu2bnpaLxRX1VVPNlXsVZl.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:07:52','2026-09-15 10:00:13'),(187,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence 100ml','hyaluronic-acid-hydra-power-essence-100ml','<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"399\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence is a lightweight, oil-free gel essence formulated with <strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"214\">Sodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluronic Acid)</strong> to provide long-lasting hydration. It helps replenish moisture, smooth rough and dry skin, and leave the complexion soft, plump, and dewy-looking. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"362\" data-content-reference-end=\"394\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"731\"><strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"422\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"425\">\r\nCOSRX Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence 100ml is a highly hydrating essence designed especially for <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"562\">dry, dehydrated, and rough skin</strong>. Its lightweight gel texture absorbs comfortably into the skin while helping retain moisture for a softer and smoother appearance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"689\" data-content-reference-end=\"708\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"1012\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"851\">Sodium Hyaluronate, Hippophae Rhamnoides Water (Sea Buckthorn Water), Glycerin, and Panthenol</strong>. Together, these ingredients help replenish moisture, maintain skin hydration, and support a healthy-looking skin barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"952\" data-content-reference-end=\"971\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1030\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u22sdb\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x543k7\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1104\">\r\nHelps relieve dry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mtbnpo\" data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1148\">\r\nMakes rough skin feel softer and smoother\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xag2i\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\nHelps create a plump, dewy-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eqz3nm\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines caused by dehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i97aq6\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\nLightweight and oil-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"whb7wb\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1319\">\r\nFast-absorbing gel texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nrjt7i\" data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types, especially dry and dehydrated skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1345\" data-content-reference-end=\"1364\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1444\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7k426i\" data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1487\">Sodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluronic Acid)</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture for hydrated, plump-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18zkgzv\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1560\" data-end=\"1612\">Hippophae Rhamnoides Water (Sea Buckthorn Water)</strong> – Helps nourish and moisturize the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pfd8u6\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1668\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvywph\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1716\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps hydrate and comfort the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1696\" data-content-reference-end=\"1715\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1808\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"2013\">After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount evenly over the entire face. Gently pat with your fingertips until fully absorbed, then follow with your moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1899\" data-content-reference-end=\"1918\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2248\"><strong data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2024\">Size:</strong> 100ml / 3.38 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2061\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2079\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2092\">Best For:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, rough texture &amp; dullness<br data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2142\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2154\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, oil-free gel essence<br data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2191\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2211\">Main Ingredient:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid / Sodium Hyaluronate</p>',NULL,NULL,13,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/8SNlHhBukoPk0WnDpUrctBCmlGftoBA6x5sWqmac.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:09:26','2026-09-15 10:07:37'),(188,'Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing Essence 100ml','galactomyces-95-tone-balancing-essence-100ml','<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"389\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing Essence is a lightweight, fast-absorbing essence formulated with <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"219\">95% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate</strong>. It helps hydrate, nourish, soothe, and brighten dull-looking skin while improving the appearance of rough and uneven skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"352\" data-content-reference-end=\"371\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"722\"><strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"412\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"415\">\r\nCOSRX Galactomyces 95 Tone Balancing Essence 100ml is a multi-action essence designed for <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"541\">dull, rough, and dehydrated skin</strong>. Its lightweight formula absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or sticky feeling, helping the skin look smoother, clearer, and more radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"667\" data-content-reference-end=\"686\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"1047\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"782\">95% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate</strong>, along with <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"877\">Niacinamide, Panthenol, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, and Adenosine</strong>. These ingredients help maintain hydration, support a smooth-looking complexion, and improve the appearance of tired and dull skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"974\" data-content-reference-end=\"1006\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1065\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22xmrw\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\nProvides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rt2nhu\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17xw4ls\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1231\">\r\nSmooths the appearance of rough skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t5t5wj\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\nHelps soothe and comfort the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"obfjob\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\nSupports a healthy, radiant-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13xaa5b\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\nFast-absorbing and lightweight\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1339\" data-content-reference-end=\"1358\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1438\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ifyq3u\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1533\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1478\">95% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate</strong> – Helps nourish and brighten tired, dull-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3g7zd\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1603\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1551\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ekje0\" data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1667\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1619\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps maintain moisture and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vajyjw\" data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1751\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1692\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture for hydrated, smooth-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k0463o\" data-start=\"1752\