trong data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1613\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps maintain moisture and comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpqre9\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1707\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1668\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and condition the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab9mea\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1732\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1712\" data-content-reference-end=\"1744\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1811\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"2042\">After cleansing, spray the toner onto a cotton pad and gently wipe over the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. It can also be used directly as a refreshing facial mist throughout the day. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1954\" data-content-reference-end=\"1973\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2341\"><strong data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2053\">Size:</strong> 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2090\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types, especially Sensitive Skin<br data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2147\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, watery mist<br data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2188\">Best For:</strong> Sensitivity, redness, dryness, dehydration &amp; irritation<br data-start=\"2244\" data-end=\"2247\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2247\" data-end=\"2267\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Centella Asiatica Leaf Water + Jeju Mineral Water<br data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2337\">Alcohol-Free:</strong> Yes</p>',NULL,NULL,6,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/JquyUK961ZCGtqbAyXMAzCf1ZM93u6RAWVBUMvoS.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:12:28','2026-09-15 10:00:58'),(190,'Ultimate Nourishing Rice Overnight Spa Mask 60ml','ultimate-nourishing-rice-overnight-spa-mask-60ml','<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"435\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Ultimate Nourishing Rice Overnight Spa Mask is an intensive overnight moisturizing mask enriched with <strong data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"214\">68.9% Rice Extract</strong> and <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"234\">Niacinamide</strong>. It deeply nourishes and hydrates the skin while helping improve the appearance of dull, rough, and flaky skin for a softer, smoother, radiant-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"398\" data-content-reference-end=\"417\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"796\"><strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"458\">Description:</strong><br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\">\r\nCOSRX Ultimate Nourishing Rice Overnight Spa Mask 60ml is a cream-type sleeping mask designed to provide intensive nourishment and deep moisturization while you sleep. Its rich yet comfortable formula helps replenish moisture and leaves the skin feeling softer, smoother, and refreshed by morning. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"741\" data-content-reference-end=\"760\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"1130\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"841\">68.9% Rice Extract</strong>, a well-known ingredient for moisturizing and softening the skin, along with <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"980\">Niacinamide, Glycerin, Betaine, Allantoin, and Tocopherol</strong>. Together, these ingredients help support hydration, nourishment, and a brighter, healthier-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1057\" data-content-reference-end=\"1076\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1148\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dokuoh\" data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1189\">\r\nProvides intensive overnight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z3l8h\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\nHelps nourish dry and tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dtky7o\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\nSoftens rough and flaky skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4v52fy\" data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dj2a63\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\nLeaves skin smoother and more supple\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3o93rz\" data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1428\">\r\nHelps maintain a healthy moisture balance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"znkepp\" data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\nCan also be used as a nighttime moisturizer <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1421\" data-content-reference-end=\"1440\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1533\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cz4996\" data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1608\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1558\">68.9% Rice Extract</strong> – Helps moisturize, nourish, and soften the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"40i0ll\" data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1626\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3r8wj\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1705\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"45f379\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1756\">Betaine</strong> – Helps maintain skin hydration and softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7a48ng\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1818\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10s2m17\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1884\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Provides antioxidant support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1845\" data-content-reference-end=\"1864\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1970\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"2184\">After completing your nighttime skincare routine, apply a <strong data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2049\">pea-sized amount</strong> evenly over the face as the final step. Gently massage until absorbed and leave it on overnight. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2057\" data-content-reference-end=\"2076\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2430\"><strong data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2195\">Size:</strong> 60ml / 2.02 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2217\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2231\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2261\">Texture:</strong> Cream-type overnight mask<br data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2290\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2303\">Best For:</strong> Dryness, dullness, rough texture, dehydration &amp; flaky skin<br data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2385\">Main Ingredient:</strong> 68.9% Rice Extract<br data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2407\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2415\">Use:</strong> PM / Overnight</p>',NULL,NULL,25,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/2hDyYVGpbFkV8hEsCo6ZE3gLADhfgkA513Srz96y.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:14:04','2026-09-15 10:04:45'),(191,'Oil-Free Ultra-Moisturizing Lotion with Birch Sap 100ml','oil-free-ultra-moisturizing-lotion-with-birch-sap-100ml','<p data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"429\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Oil-Free Ultra-Moisturizing Lotion with Birch Sap is a lightweight daily moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"251\">70% Birch Sap (Betula Platyphylla Japonica Juice)</strong>. It helps restore moisture, soothe irritated-looking skin, and leave the skin fresh, soft, and silky smooth without a heavy or greasy feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"392\" data-content-reference-end=\"411\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"765\"><strong data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"452\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"455\">\r\nCOSRX Oil-Free Ultra-Moisturizing Lotion with Birch Sap 100ml is a lightweight, fast-absorbing moisturizer suitable for <strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"593\">all skin types</strong>, especially oily and combination skin. Its weightless texture helps replenish hydration without making the skin feel heavy or greasy. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"710\" data-content-reference-end=\"729\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"1202\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"805\">70% Birch Sap</strong>, which helps prevent moisture loss and maintain hydrated-looking skin. It also includes <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"963\">Panthenol, Allantoin, Sodium Hyaluronate, Betaine, and Tocopherol</strong> to provide moisturizing, soothing, and skin-conditioning benefits. The current formula has also been reformulated to exclude fragrance ingredients and includes <strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1139\">4-Terpineol</strong> to help soothe the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1129\" data-content-reference-end=\"1148\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1220\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15taax6\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\nProvides lightweight, lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7x84h\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1305\">\r\nHelps restore and maintain skin moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1u5gk\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1338\">\r\nSoothes irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u4y5cu\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\nAbsorbs quickly into the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"to128m\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1414\">\r\nLeaves skin fresh, soft, and silky smooth\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nx8gxq\" data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1447\">\r\nNon-heavy, comfortable texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pwkmak\" data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\nSuitable for oily and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1465\" data-content-reference-end=\"1484\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1577\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yluh66\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1651\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1597\">70% Birch Sap</strong> – Helps prevent moisture loss and maintain hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctkn6\" data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1708\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1667\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rpqre9\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1724\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and condition the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1owoln5\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1825\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1788\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"45f379\" data-start=\"1826\" data-end=\"1885\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1839\">Betaine</strong> – Helps maintain skin hydration and softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ngnva\" data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1914\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Provides antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15xd56t\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"2035\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1964\">4-Terpineol</strong> – Added to help soothe the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1926\" data-content-reference-end=\"1945\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2051\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2328\">After cleansing, toning, and applying chemical exfoliants or other treatments, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face. Gently pat until fully absorbed. It can be used <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2252\">morning and evening</strong>, before your cream step or sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2201\" data-content-reference-end=\"2220\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2620\"><strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2339\">Size:</strong> 100ml / 3.38 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2362\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2376\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types, especially Oily &amp; Combination Skin<br data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2430\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2442\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, fast-absorbing lotion<br data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2480\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2493\">Best For:</strong> Dehydration, dryness, irritation &amp; moisture loss<br data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2565\">Main Ingredient:</strong> 70% Birch Sap<br data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2593\">Finish:</strong> Fresh, soft &amp; silky smooth</p>',NULL,NULL,17,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/oD71UnpTMrFkCOrci75VPl6WZ4CMGGdfrZXo9PxX.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:18:05','2026-09-15 10:01:17'),(192,'Centella Blemish Cream 30ml','centella-blemish-cream-30ml','<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"347\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Centella Blemish Cream is a targeted soothing cream formulated with <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"194\">50.79% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water and 7% Zinc Oxide</strong>. It helps calm irritated, red, and blemish-prone skin while helping reduce the appearance of post-acne dark marks. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"310\" data-content-reference-end=\"329\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"671\"><strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"370\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">\r\nCOSRX Centella Blemish Cream 30ml is a spot-care cream designed for <strong data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"489\">blemished, irritated, and redness-prone skin</strong>. Its rich yet comfortable formula can be applied directly to troubled areas to help soothe the skin and support a healthier-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"616\" data-content-reference-end=\"635\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"1008\">The formula combines <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"836\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Centella Asiatica Extract, Zinc Oxide, Zinc PCA, Tea Tree Leaf Oil, and Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract</strong>. These ingredients provide soothing, conditioning, and blemish-care benefits while helping the skin feel moisturized and comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"935\" data-content-reference-end=\"954\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1026\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fdv0mq\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\nHelps soothe irritated and sensitive-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sql0em\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1112\">\r\nCalms the appearance of redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lfulrz\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\nHelps care for blemish-prone areas\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fc6s2h\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1199\">\r\nHelps prevent the appearance of dark acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32lapg\" data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\nSupports smoother-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wti6i\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\nProvides moisture to troubled areas\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fewdgr\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\nIdeal for targeted spot care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1369\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1278\" data-content-reference-end=\"1310\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1390\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fei3ae\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1480\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1432\">50.79% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water</strong> – Helps soothe and calm irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8vqilh\" data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1550\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1500\">7% Zinc Oxide</strong> – Provides protective and skin-soothing benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kqs1wp\" data-start=\"1551\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1582\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong> – Helps comfort blemish-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s6zdb9\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1633\">Zinc PCA</strong> – Supports oil and blemish care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojkch0\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1690\">Tea Tree Leaf Oil</strong> – Helps provide targeted care for troubled skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hlaisc\" data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1782\">Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract</strong> – Helps soothe and condition the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1763\" data-content-reference-end=\"1782\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1875\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"2167\">After cleansing and applying your toner/serum, take an appropriate amount and apply a <strong data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"2019\">thick layer directly onto troubled or blemished areas</strong>. Gently pat until absorbed. It can be used as the final step of your skincare routine, particularly at night. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2053\" data-content-reference-end=\"2072\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2416\"><strong data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2178\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 30g<br data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2206\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2236\">Texture:</strong> Rich, soothing cream<br data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2273\">Best For:</strong> Blemishes, redness, irritated skin &amp; post-acne dark marks<br data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2334\" data-end=\"2355\">Main Ingredients:</strong> Centella Asiatica + Zinc Oxide<br data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2389\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2397\">Use:</strong> Targeted Spot Care</p>',NULL,NULL,16,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ulZ05SJtx7o0Latx8DZVlZ4d30tvLmzOOfyS1yJ9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:21:09','2026-09-15 10:01:45'),(193,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid 100ml','aha-7-whitehead-power-liquid-100ml','<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"374\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid is an exfoliating treatment formulated with <strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"175\">7% Glycolic Acid (AHA)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"195\">Niacinamide</strong>. It helps remove dead skin cells, clear whiteheads, refine uneven texture, and reveal a smoother, brighter, more radiant-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"337\" data-content-reference-end=\"356\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"738\"><strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"397\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"400\">\r\nCOSRX AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid 100ml is a chemical exfoliating treatment designed to improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"576\">whiteheads, rough texture, dullness, and uneven skin tone</strong>. The formula contains 7% Glycolic Acid, which gently exfoliates the skin\'s surface and supports natural skin cell turnover. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"683\" data-content-reference-end=\"702\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"1015\">It also contains <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"826\">Apple Fruit Water, Niacinamide, Panthenol, and Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> to help brighten, hydrate, and keep the skin feeling comfortable. With regular use, it can help create a smoother and more refined-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"942\" data-content-reference-end=\"961\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1033\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uin03m\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\nHelps remove dead skin cells\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90d860\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1108\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of whiteheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqx4lq\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\nImproves rough and uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"720xmt\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\nPromotes smoother-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11gagp8\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\nHelps refine the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1niggun\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\nSupports natural skin cell turnover\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pshwvy\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1384\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of post-blemish marks <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1293\" data-content-reference-end=\"1312\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1405\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5dkzjx\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1512\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1434\">7% Glycolic Acid (AHA)</strong> – Exfoliates dead skin cells and helps improve uneven texture and whiteheads.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wgcwah\" data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1595\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1536\">Apple Fruit Water</strong> – Helps refresh and support a brighter-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tm2f3j\" data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1678\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1613\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of uneven tone and blemish marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ctkn6\" data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1735\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1694\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgl8oa\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1760\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps retain moisture and maintain hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1737\" data-content-reference-end=\"1756\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1862\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"2160\">After cleansing, soak a cotton pad with the product and gently swipe a thin layer over the face, avoiding the <strong data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1996\">eye and mouth areas</strong>. Start gradually according to your skin\'s tolerance. During the daytime, use a <strong data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2121\">broad-spectrum sunscreen SPF 30 or higher</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2033\" data-content-reference-end=\"2052\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2343\"><strong data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2176\">Important:</strong> Avoid using it in the same routine with other <strong data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2260\">AHAs, BHAs, retinol, or Vitamin C</strong> products to minimize the risk of irritation. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2198\" data-content-reference-end=\"2217\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2614\"><strong data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2354\">Size:</strong> 100ml / 3.38 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2377\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2391\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types; especially Dry &amp; Combination Skin<br data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2444\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2457\">Best For:</strong> Whiteheads, dullness, rough texture, uneven tone &amp; clogged pores<br data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2525\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2537\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight exfoliating liquid<br data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2571\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2591\">Main Ingredient:</strong> 7% Glycolic Acid (AHA)</p>',NULL,NULL,11,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/LR5SIuUcyurGx5FfhKjmPWBB1GSUfPnoAugxgCvu.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:24:36','2026-09-15 10:00:34'),(194,'Hydrium Green Tea Aqua Soothing Gel Cream 50ml','hydrium-green-tea-aqua-soothing-gel-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"413\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Hydrium Green Tea Aqua Soothing Gel Cream is a lightweight, cooling moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"242\">Green Tea Extract, 5,000ppm D-Panthenol, and Allantoin</strong>. It provides refreshing hydration while helping soothe redness, irritation, and heat-stressed skin without a heavy or greasy finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"376\" data-content-reference-end=\"395\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"815\"><strong data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"436\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"439\">\r\nCOSRX Hydrium Green Tea Aqua Soothing Gel Cream 50ml is a refreshing gel-type moisturizer designed to provide <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"602\">deep hydration, cooling relief, and soothing care</strong>. Its jelly-like texture absorbs quickly into the skin and leaves a fresh, comfortable finish, making it especially suitable for oily, combination, and irritated-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"760\" data-content-reference-end=\"792\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"1085\">The formula features <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"859\">Green Tea Extract</strong> to help soothe redness and provide cooling relief, while <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"941\">5,000ppm D-Panthenol</strong> helps moisturize and comfort the skin. <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"994\">Allantoin</strong> further supports soothing and smoother-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1025\" data-content-reference-end=\"1044\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1103\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k5fseh\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\nProvides refreshing and long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8puko\" data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1196\">\r\nHelps cool and soothe heated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tueghf\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\nHelps calm redness and irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqrvqq\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\nLightweight, non-greasy gel texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lozrk\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\nAbsorbs quickly without heaviness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mxp9n\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\nHelps maintain soft and smooth skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8kks88\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\nIdeal for oily and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1372\" data-content-reference-end=\"1404\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1471\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17kxfy9\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1577\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1495\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Helps provide cooling and soothing care for redness and irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cahlv7\" data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1604\">D-Panthenol 5,000ppm</strong> – Helps moisturize, soothe, and support comfortable-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bv000\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1722\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1686\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps soothe and smooth the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3r8wj\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1774\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1737\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"123a49m\" data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1804\">Aloe Ferox Leaf Extract</strong> – Helps provide additional soothing and moisturizing benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1822\" data-content-reference-end=\"1841\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1921\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2126\">After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount evenly over the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. Gently pat the skin until the cream is fully absorbed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2025\" data-content-reference-end=\"2044\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2464\"><strong data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2137\">Size:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz<br data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2173\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types, especially Oily &amp; Combination Skin<br data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2227\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2239\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, jelly-like gel cream<br data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2289\">Best For:</strong> Dehydration, redness, irritation, heat-stressed skin &amp; oily skin<br data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2378\">Main Ingredients:</strong> Green Tea Extract + D-Panthenol + Allantoin<br data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2425\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2436\">Finish:</strong> Fresh, cooling &amp; non-greasy</p>',NULL,NULL,15,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/apTlFU77o27ZFOPSxwQ2cSDf1hhDyjAUTQbWJdnX.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:27:18','2026-09-15 09:58:24'),(195,'Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+/ PA+++ 50ml','aloe-soothing-sun-cream-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"371\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+/PA+++ is a lightweight daily sunscreen enriched with <strong data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"200\">Aloe Arborescens Leaf Extract</strong>. It helps protect the skin from UVA/UVB rays while providing soothing and moisturizing care without leaving a noticeable white cast. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"334\" data-content-reference-end=\"353\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"670\"><strong data-start=\"373\" data-end=\"394\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"397\">\r\nCOSRX Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+/PA+++ 50ml combines high sun protection with a moisturizing, comfortable texture. Its formula is designed to feel more like a moisturizer than a heavy sunscreen, making it suitable for everyday use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"615\" data-content-reference-end=\"634\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"900\">The key ingredient is <strong data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"720\">Aloe Complex 55,000ppm</strong>, which helps soothe and hydrate the skin. The lightweight formula spreads easily and leaves the skin looking fresh and naturally moisturized. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"827\" data-content-reference-end=\"846\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"918\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q9r4f3\" data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"955\">\r\nSPF50+ protection against UVB rays\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13gsnjn\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"978\">\r\nPA+++ UVA protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wykcfn\" data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1017\">\r\nHelps protect skin from sun exposure\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"71jlaq\" data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1052\">\r\nSoothes and moisturizes the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7ivae\" data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\nLightweight and comfortable texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ace62w\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\nDoes not leave a noticeable white cast\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"712d7p\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\nHelps prevent dryness caused by sun exposure\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svbvmg\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\nSuitable for daily use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wk2fnq\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\nIdeal for dehydrated skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1178\" data-content-reference-end=\"1197\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1289\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rmnak\" data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1318\">Aloe Complex 55,000ppm</strong> – Helps soothe and hydrate the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1284\" data-content-reference-end=\"1303\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1409\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1610\">Apply a generous amount evenly to the face <strong data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1487\">30 minutes before sun exposure</strong>. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged outdoor exposure. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1483\" data-content-reference-end=\"1502\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1621\">Size:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz<br data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1651\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+<br data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1661\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1668\">PA:</strong> PA+++<br data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1677\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1691\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1721\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, moisturizing<br data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1763\">Best For:</strong> Daily sun protection, dehydration &amp; dry skin<br data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1811\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1831\">Main Ingredient:</strong> Aloe Arborescens Leaf Extract<br data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1864\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1875\">Finish:</strong> Moisturized, comfortable &amp; no noticeable white cast</p>',NULL,NULL,19,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/MmxqAO5LhPerJcHYwO7HvJfYzhM9PZ79u5pUPqV4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:29:07','2026-09-15 10:02:30'),(196,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser 150ml','advanced-snail-mucin-gel-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"365\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser is a gentle, moisturizing gel cleanser enriched with <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"206\">10,000ppm Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong>. It effectively removes impurities while helping prevent dryness and leaving the skin feeling clean, soft, and hydrated. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"328\" data-content-reference-end=\"347\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"735\"><strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"388\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"391\">\r\nCOSRX Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser 150ml is a gentle daily facial cleanser designed to cleanse the skin without leaving it feeling stripped or excessively dry. Its rich, elastic gel texture creates a smooth lather that helps remove impurities from the skin and pores while providing moisturizing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"680\" data-content-reference-end=\"699\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"1000\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"796\">10,000ppm Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong>, which helps maintain moisture while cleansing. The cleanser is particularly suitable for people who want effective cleansing with a softer, more comfortable finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"927\" data-content-reference-end=\"946\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1018\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c3f5sg\" data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1068\">\r\nGently removes dirt, impurities, and excess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9dytm\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\nHelps cleanse deep into pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pr7zd\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\nHelps prevent a dry or tight feeling after cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vwjyj0\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\nProvides moisturizing care while cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzosbz\" data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\nHelps keep skin soft and comfortable\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lln4h2\" data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1271\">\r\nCreates a smooth, rich lather\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qsng7c\" data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\nSuitable for sensitive and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vnvo1\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1376\">\r\nIdeal for daily use <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1285\" data-content-reference-end=\"1304\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eqaqj8\" data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1396\">Key Ingredient</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pr0371\" data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1437\">Snail Secretion Filtrate 10,000ppm</strong> – Helps maintain moisture and protect the skin from feeling stripped during cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1453\" data-content-reference-end=\"1472\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1578\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1819\">Wet your face and squeeze a <strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1627\">pea-sized amount</strong> of cleanser into your palms. Lather well, then gently massage the foam over your face from the forehead to the jaw. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1692\" data-content-reference-end=\"1711\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2132\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1830\">Size:</strong> 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz<br data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1867\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types, especially Sensitive &amp; Dehydrated Skin<br data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1925\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1937\">Texture:</strong> Elastic Gel with Rich Lather<br data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1982\">Best For:</strong> Daily cleansing, dryness, sensitivity &amp; dehydration<br data-start=\"2034\" data-end=\"2037\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2057\">Main Ingredient:</strong> 10,000ppm Snail Secretion Filtrate<br data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2106\">Finish:</strong> Clean, soft &amp; moisturized</p>',NULL,NULL,3,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/lf4waiFCE002wZExOnk4FuUEAa4GAzeGYj7DKnVt.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:31:37','2026-09-15 09:56:14'),(197,'AC Collection Ultimate Spot Cream 30ml','ac-collection-ultimate-spot-cream-30ml','<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"451\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX AC Collection Ultimate Spot Cream is a targeted spot treatment designed to care for <strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"210\">active acne, blemishes, and troubled areas</strong>. Its soothing formula combines <strong data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"330\">Aloe Vera Leaf Water, Zinc Oxide, Calamine, Tea Tree Oil, and Centella AC-Rx Complex</strong> to help calm, absorb excess sebum, and reduce the appearance of visible blemishes. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"414\" data-content-reference-end=\"446\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"474\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"477\">\r\nCOSRX AC Collection Ultimate Spot Cream 30ml is a concentrated spot-care cream that adheres well to areas affected by acne and blemishes. The formula is designed to provide targeted care while helping soothe and protect stressed-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"715\" data-content-reference-end=\"734\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"1143\">The formula contains <strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"810\">46.5% Aloe Vera Leaf Water</strong> for soothing and cooling care, while <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"900\">Zinc Oxide, Calamine, and Dimethyl Sulfone (MSM)</strong> help absorb excess sebum and care for problematic areas. The <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"986\">CentellAC-Rx Complex</strong>, featuring Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, and Asiatic Acid, provides additional soothing and skin-protective benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1083\" data-content-reference-end=\"1102\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1161\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8g4lfk\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\nHelps target active pimples and blemishes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"olvq8i\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1233\">\r\nHelps absorb excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w1u5gk\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\nSoothes irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zt8smy\" data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\nProvides cooling and calming care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3cikc\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1343\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1fa48\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\nSupports recovery of troubled-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x5aezk\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\nIdeal for targeted day and night spot care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1423\" data-content-reference-end=\"1455\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1522\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m126zu\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1555\">46.5% Aloe Vera Leaf Water</strong> – Helps soothe, hydrate, and provide a cooling sensation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ain2f8\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1683\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1630\">Zinc Oxide</strong> – Helps provide protective and sebum-absorbing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6brrd\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1698\">Calamine</strong> – Helps soothe and absorb excess oil from troubled areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o489ib\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1785\">Dimethyl Sulfone (MSM)</strong> – Helps provide targeted blemish care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wrkgtn\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1853\">Centella AC-Rx Complex</strong> – Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, and Asiatic Acid help soothe and support the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8iu6lp\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1961\">Tea Tree Leaf Oil</strong> – Provides additional care for blemish-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1967\" data-content-reference-end=\"1999\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2066\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2330\">After cleansing and applying your toner or serum, apply an appropriate amount <strong data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2178\">directly to the affected area</strong>. Gently spread and allow it to absorb. It can be used during both your <strong data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2273\">morning and evening</strong> skincare routines. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2242\" data-content-reference-end=\"2274\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2601\"><strong data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2341\">Size:</strong> 30g / 1.05 oz<br data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2372\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2402\">Texture:</strong> Cream-type spot treatment<br data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2444\">Best For:</strong> Acne, blemishes, excess sebum &amp; redness<br data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2508\">Main Ingredients:</strong> Aloe Vera + Zinc Oxide + Calamine + Centella AC-Rx<br data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2570\">Use:</strong> Targeted Day &amp; Night Spot Care</p>',NULL,NULL,16,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/8GSiH4kGuUDD9wbOh8DBCxeIBnptOQIMSedUMUeP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:34:07','2026-09-15 09:57:43'),(198,'Relief Kit (3-Step)','relief-kit-3-step','<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"360\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">COSRX CICA-7 RELIEF KIT is a 3-step soothing skincare set specially designed for <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"185\">sensitive, dry, and redness-prone skin</strong>. Powered by the <strong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"220\">CICA-7 Complex</strong>, it helps calm, hydrate, strengthen, and support the skin barrier for a healthier-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"323\" data-content-reference-end=\"342\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"383\">Description</strong><br data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"386\">\r\nCOSRX CICA-7 RELIEF KIT – 3 Step is a convenient travel-friendly skincare set from the Pure Fit Cica range. The routine combines a toner, serum, and cream to provide comprehensive soothing and moisturizing care for sensitive and stressed-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"620\" data-content-reference-end=\"639\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"33mxjn\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"700\">3-Step Kit Includes</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"845\"><strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"735\">1. Pure Fit Cica Toner – 30ml</strong><br data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"738\">\r\nA gentle toner that helps hydrate and soothe sensitive skin while preparing it for the next skincare steps.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"993\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"880\">2. Pure Fit Cica Serum – 10ml</strong><br data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\">\r\nA lightweight serum designed to calm and moisturize the skin while supporting a stronger-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1028\">3. Pure Fit Cica Cream – 15ml</strong><br data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1031\">\r\nA nourishing moisturizer that helps soothe, hydrate, and protect dry or redness-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1087\" data-content-reference-end=\"1106\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1178\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7z5df6\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1230\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive and irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w5pngf\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\nHelps calm the appearance of redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oenvtr\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\nProvides hydration and nourishment\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv5vpr\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1334\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q07yp1\" data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\nHelps strengthen and comfort stressed-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15qxomt\" data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\nSuitable for dry and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hwiuw4\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1501\">\r\nConvenient travel-size skincare set <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1410\" data-content-reference-end=\"1429\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1522\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1853\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1541\">CICA-7 Complex</strong> – Contains 7 Centella-based ingredients, including Centella Asiatica Extract, Centella Leaf Extract, Centella Root Extract, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid, and Madecassoside. These ingredients help soothe, hydrate, and support sensitive and redness-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1744\" data-content-reference-end=\"1763\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1948\"><strong data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1886\">Pinus Pinaster Bark Extract</strong> – Helps provide additional soothing and skin-protective care.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1964\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2334\"><strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1984\">Step 1 – Toner:</strong> After cleansing, apply Pure Fit Cica Toner using your hands or a cotton pad and gently pat until absorbed.<br data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2094\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2113\">Step 2 – Serum:</strong> Apply 2–3 drops of Pure Fit Cica Serum evenly over the face.<br data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2196\">Step 3 – Cream:</strong> Apply an appropriate amount of Pure Fit Cica Cream as the final step and gently pat until absorbed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2207\" data-content-reference-end=\"2226\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2598\"><strong data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2349\">Kit Type:</strong> 3-Step Travel Skincare Set<br data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2379\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2392\">Best For:</strong> Sensitive, Dry &amp; Redness-Prone Skin<br data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2448\">Main Complex:</strong> CICA-7 Complex<br data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2466\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2479\">Benefits:</strong> Soothing • Calming • Hydrating • Strengthening • Barrier Care<br data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2544\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2561\">Kit Contents:</strong> Toner 30ml + Serum 10ml + Cream 15ml</p>',NULL,NULL,43,1,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/O5FE5lEb0wTk24qyMZGHv1ZXfaIUeS8P7tQO8Jyk.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-24 07:35:51','2026-09-15 09:57:22'),(199,'Quick Sunstick Protection Bar SPF50+ PA++++ 22ml','quick-sunstick-protection-bar-spf50-pa-22ml','<p data-start=\"327\" data-end=\"612\