a-end=\"1146\">\r\nPerfect for travel, sports, beach days, and outdoor use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1176\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1176\">Skin-Friendly Formula</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"165vvef\" data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\nLightweight texture that glides smoothly on skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13edqzf\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1272\">\r\nDoes not leave a heavy or greasy feeling.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mx86qy\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1291\">Main Features</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jmf391\" data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1341\">SPF50+ PA++++ broad-spectrum sun protection</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1acy4o7\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1373\">Portable sun stick design</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"53bsje\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1411\">Smooth, transparent application</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pijfa8\" data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1446\">Convenient for face and body</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u64ta8\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1490\">Suitable for daily outdoor protection</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h11ir6\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1536\">No need to use hands during application</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1552\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"131o7mz\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\nTwist up the sun stick.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14u63vv\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1634\">\r\nApply evenly to exposed areas of the face and body.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hf7ubt\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1726\">\r\nReapply every 2–3 hours, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qmgibc\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1741\">Ideal For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1927\">✅ Outdoor activities<br data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n✅ Travel and commuting<br data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\n✅ Sports and beach use<br data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1815\">\r\n✅ People who need frequent sunscreen reapplication<br data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1868\">\r\n✅ Oily/combination skin looking for a lightweight sunscreen</p>',NULL,NULL,20,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/c66ibKgSAqHtle4bpQZZOZnU3ccqsC8CifBOqOd3.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-29 10:31:55','2026-09-16 10:09:52'),(200,'Glutathiosome Dark Spot Serum Vita Drop 50ml','glutathiosome-dark-spot-serum-vita-drop-50ml','<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"451\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"102\">Abib Glutathiosome Dark Spot Serum Vita Drop</strong> is a lightweight Korean brightening serum formulated to target <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"231\">dark spots, hyperpigmentation, uneven skin tone, and dullness</strong>. Its formula combines <strong data-start=\"254\" data-end=\"297\">Glutathione, Niacinamide, and Vitamin C</strong> with soothing and barrier-supporting ingredients to help create a brighter, smoother, and more hydrated complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"414\" data-content-reference-end=\"446\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"469\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cpkf4q\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"572\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"492\">Dark Spot Care:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dark spots, pigmentation, and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ey0bve\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"598\">Brightening Effect:</strong> Niacinamide, Glutathione, and Vitamin C derivatives help promote a more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qxh5tg\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"943\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"730\">Glutathiosome Technology:</strong> Abib describes Glutathiosome as a plant-derived lipid-layer delivery approach combining glutathione with an exosome-like structure to help deliver the ingredient effectively. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"901\" data-content-reference-end=\"921\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16y27ok\" data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1073\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"960\">Hydrating:</strong> Contains Betaine, Glycerin, Beta-Glucan, and other moisturizing ingredients to help keep skin soft and hydrated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2i2wiv\" data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1213\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1101\">Skin Barrier Support:</strong> Ceramide NP, Cholesterol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, and Madecassoside help support a healthy-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kl6tj2\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1234\">Soothing Care:</strong> Centella Asiatica, Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, and Allantoin help comfort sensitive or irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1szfj5a\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1494\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">Lightweight Texture:</strong> The water-based formula absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or greasy feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1435\" data-content-reference-end=\"1454\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m11if8\" data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1601\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1517\">Makeup-Friendly:</strong> Its fast-absorbing texture can be layered under moisturizer, sunscreen, and makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1622\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1733\"><strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1653\">Niacinamide (Vitamin B3):</strong> Helps brighten the appearance of dull skin and improve the look of uneven tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1864\"><strong data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1751\">Glutathione:</strong> An antioxidant ingredient used in the formula to support brightening and improve the appearance of pigmentation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"2005\"><strong data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1880\">Vitamin C:</strong> The formula contains Ascorbic Acid, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, and Ascorbyl Glucoside to support bright, radiant-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2079\"><strong data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2045\">Centella Asiatica &amp; Madecassoside:</strong> Help soothe and comfort the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2155\"><strong data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2097\">Ceramide NP:</strong> Supports the skin barrier and helps reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2267\"><strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2184\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Glycerin:</strong> Provide moisturizing and hydrating benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2190\" data-content-reference-end=\"2209\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2285\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i888i1\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\nDull and tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2335\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"meyham\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\nDark spots and pigmentation concerns\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bcouyd\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2438\">\r\nSensitive or redness-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2454\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppgq1w\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70njb\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\nApply evenly over the face, focusing on areas with dark spots or uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2654\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2682\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywkxll\" data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2728\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2749\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"3093\"><strong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2761\">Brand:</strong> Abib<br data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2769\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2786\">Product Name:</strong> Glutathiosome Dark Spot Serum Vita Drop<br data-start=\"2826\" data-end=\"2829\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2829\" data-end=\"2840\">Volume:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.<br data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2880\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Dark Spot Serum<br data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2913\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2925\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, water-based serum<br data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2959\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2977\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, hyperpigmentation, dullness, uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3038\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3049\">Origin:</strong> Korea</p>',NULL,NULL,11,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/IBK9ZCvW6IC5wUfJpvqGZbOf1O7iioWTP2Od40Qe.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-29 10:34:28','2026-09-16 10:09:33'),(201,'Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum Calming Drop 50ml','heartleaf-teca-capsule-serum-calming-drop-50ml','<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"429\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"106\">ABIB Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum Calming Drop</strong> is a soothing Korean serum specially designed for sensitive, irritated, and acne-prone skin. Formulated with Heartleaf Extract and TECA (Centella Asiatica active complex), it helps calm redness, repair the skin barrier, and improve troubled skin while providing lightweight hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"392\" data-content-reference-end=\"424\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"454\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"472\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"467\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19bzdpe\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"534\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"492\">Product Name:</strong> Heartleaf TECA Capsule Serum Calming Drop\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpv5wz\" data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"546\">Size:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"565\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aixsk6\" data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"594\">Skin Type:</strong> Sensitive, acne-prone, combination, oily, and irritated skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"652\" data-content-reference-end=\"685\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"715\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"145ttsg\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"805\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"761\">Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract:</strong> Helps soothe irritation and reduce redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1luzh4r\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"878\">TECA (Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid):</strong> Supports skin repair and strengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1febqkv\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"952\">Niacinamide:</strong> Brightens skin tone and helps fade acne marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rj0eqi\" data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1016\">Panthenol:</strong> Deeply hydrates and calms sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13di63x\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1106\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1075\">Allantoin:</strong> Softens and protects the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4e0di\" data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1134\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Ectoin:</strong> Provide moisture and improve skin resilience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1172\" data-content-reference-end=\"1204\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5y7puq\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1232\">Benefits</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1551\">✔ Calms redness and irritation<br data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1266\">\r\n✔ Helps reduce acne and breakouts<br data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\n✔ Strengthens the skin barrier<br data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\n✔ Fades post-acne marks and uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n✔ Provides deep hydration without stickiness<br data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1429\">\r\n✔ Lightweight, fast-absorbing texture<br data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\n✔ Suitable for daily use and sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1500\" data-content-reference-end=\"1532\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1564\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1788\">The serum has a lightweight, watery texture with tiny TECA capsules that melt into the skin upon application, delivering active ingredients effectively without leaving a greasy feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1732\" data-content-reference-end=\"1751\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1804\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2mw5o\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\nCleanse and tone your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mlp684\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1880\">\r\nApply 2–3 drops of the serum to the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo7ms0\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bazxp\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yz0twz\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\nUse morning and night. Apply sunscreen during daytime. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1966\" data-content-reference-end=\"1998\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2058\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q56xcr\" data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\nSensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ii391\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\nAcne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2nj8fm\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2118\">\r\nRedness and irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lcivid\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\nDamaged skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhw36u\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2219\">\r\nPost-acne marks and uneven skin tone. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2140\" data-content-reference-end=\"2172\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2241\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2520\">Water, Niacinamide, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Panthenol, Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Allantoin, Beta-Glucan, Ectoin, Glycerin, Betaine, Succinic Acid, Tocopherol, and other skin-soothing botanical extracts. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2436\" data-content-reference-end=\"2469\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2642\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2535\">Best for:</strong> People looking for a gentle calming serum to reduce redness, soothe acne, and strengthen the skin barrier.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/b3qLTizcChTcnpaGwXNNiUZGNfzKentlGGMtKCbr.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:47:05','2026-09-16 10:09:12'),(202,'Acne Heartleaf Foam Cleanser 150ml','acne-heartleaf-foam-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"494\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"91\">ABIB Acne Foam Cleanser Heartleaf Foam</strong> is a gentle, low-acid Korean facial cleanser formulated for <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"220\">acne-prone, oily, combination, sensitive, and redness-prone skin</strong>. It creates a soft, fine foam that removes excess sebum, dirt, and impurities while helping maintain the skin’s moisture balance. ABIB states that the product has been tested for acne-care efficacy and completed a skin irritation test. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"457\" data-content-reference-end=\"489\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"519\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"537\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"532\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zm185u\" data-start=\"538\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"557\">Product Name:</strong> Acne Foam Cleanser Heartleaf Foam\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0imyr\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"605\">Volume:</strong> 150ml / 5.07 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"640\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mcyxx\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"672\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Foam Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zplxti\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"775\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"710\">Skin Type:</strong> Oily, combination, acne-prone, sensitive, and redness-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15fxf1f\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"790\">Texture:</strong> Soft, creamy, fine foam\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l5y1vt\" data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"895\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"824\">pH:</strong> Mildly acidic / skin-friendly pH <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"853\" data-content-reference-end=\"885\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"916\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"960\">Heartleaf Extract (Houttuynia Cordata)</strong><br data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"963\">\r\nHelps soothe irritated skin and supports a healthier-looking complexion, making it particularly suitable for blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1201\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1111\">Salicylic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1114\">\r\nHelps cleanse pores and remove excess oil and buildup, supporting clearer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1314\"><strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1232\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\nKnown for its soothing properties and helps comfort sensitive or stressed skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1423\"><strong data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1329\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\nHelps moisturize and soothe the skin while reducing the feeling of dryness after cleansing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1573\"><strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1437\">Glycerin</strong><br data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1440\">\r\nA humectant that helps attract and retain moisture for a more comfortable cleansing experience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1526\" data-content-reference-end=\"1559\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1591\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wzpvur\" data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\nHelps cleanse clogged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yfxnwd\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1664\">\r\nRemoves excess oil, dirt, and impurities\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tf733q\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1695\">\r\nHelps manage acne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzozez\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\nSoothes redness and irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l2zprp\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\nSupports a balanced skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i17y6\" data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1814\">\r\nProvides a soft, refreshing cleansing experience\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8fa2x4\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\nHelps maintain moisture during cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i675g0\" data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1926\">\r\nSuitable for daily cleansing <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1875\" data-content-reference-end=\"1908\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1942\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e75nnv\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\nTake a small amount of cleanser onto your wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ft4ahs\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\nWork it into a rich, soft foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yqy417\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2127\">\r\nGently massage over the face, avoiding the eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2255\">For daytime use, finish with sunscreen.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2277\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2740\">Water, Sodium Cocoyl Isethionate, Glycerin, Coco-Betaine, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Butylene Glycol, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Potassium Cocoyl Glycinate, <strong data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2451\">Salicylic Acid</strong>, Sodium Chloride, Caprylyl Glycol, <strong data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2517\">Houttuynia Cordata Extract</strong>, Tromethamine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Disodium EDTA, Polyquaternium-67, <strong data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2596\">Panthenol</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2627\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong>, <strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2681\">Gaultheria Procumbens (Wintergreen) Leaf Extract</strong>, Ethylhexylglycerin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2685\" data-content-reference-end=\"2717\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2754\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2850\"><strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2850\">Acne &amp; Breakouts • Excess Oil • Clogged Pores • Sensitive Skin • Redness • Combination Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,3,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/cxQuuSjDjlorx3GtKsFGAZVebaXP9CXJJsismPQo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:50:00','2026-09-16 10:08:54'),(203,'Pore Cleansing Oil Heartleaf Oil Wash 200ml','pore-cleansing-oil-heartleaf-oil-wash-200ml','<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"556\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"174\">ABIB Pore Cleansing Oil Heartleaf Oil-Wash</strong> is a lightweight Korean cleansing oil designed to provide gentle yet effective deep cleansing while caring for pores. Enriched with <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"401\">Heartleaf Extract, six plant-based oils, PHA, Chestnut Shell Extract, and Lavender Extract</strong>, it helps dissolve makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and impurities without leaving the skin feeling excessively dry. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"519\" data-content-reference-end=\"551\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"581\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"594\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xuvjc4\" data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"619\">Product Name:</strong> Pore Cleansing Oil Heartleaf Oil-Wash\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgwbds\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"671\">Volume:</strong> 200ml / 6.76 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"706\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rm4d3x\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"738\">Product Type:</strong> Cleansing Oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5p43u4\" data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"772\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially combination, oily, sensitive, and acne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"smrikx\" data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"864\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, silky, water-like oil texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"928\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1074\"><strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"972\">Heartleaf Extract (Houttuynia Cordata)</strong><br data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"975\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive and irritated skin while supporting a cleaner, healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1246\"><strong data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1106\">6 Plant-Based Natural Oils</strong><br data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\nIncludes Sunflower, Jojoba, Macadamia, Rice Bran, Avocado, and Camellia oils to help cleanse while maintaining skin comfort and moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1360\"><strong data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1272\">PHA (Gluconolactone)</strong><br data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\nProvides gentle exfoliation and helps remove dead skin cells without harsh scrubbing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1539\"><strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1407\">Chestnut Shell Extract &amp; Lavender Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\nUsed in ABIB\'s pore-clearing complex to help remove excess sebum and impurities from pores. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1497\" data-content-reference-end=\"1529\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1557\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mwrv6\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1581\">\r\nDeeply cleanses pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1izfmd\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\nRemoves makeup and sunscreen\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"snz1vk\" data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\nHelps dissolve excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wkettg\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\nHelps remove blackhead and whitehead buildup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sfwwm1\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1725\">\r\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8i04p\" data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\nSoothes sensitive and irritated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187jkf6\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1795\">\r\nHelps maintain skin moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f57hic\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1824\">\r\nLightweight and non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k1zx9b\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\nSuitable for acne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xmp1sp\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\nRinses away easily without a heavy oily residue\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"2120\">ABIB reports testing for <strong data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"2041\">pore impurity cleansing, blackhead/whitehead improvement, acne-prone skin suitability, and eye irritation</strong>; results can vary from person to person. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2073\" data-content-reference-end=\"2105\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2136\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fshob7\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2158\">2–3 pumps</strong> onto dry hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"58wexx\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2201\">dry face</strong> and gently massage in circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsjalw\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2316\">\r\nFocus on areas with makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and clogged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e2csxx\" data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2388\">\r\nAdd a little water and continue massaging until the oil turns milky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2429\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u1wi2d\" data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser for <strong data-start=\"2472\" data-end=\"2492\">double cleansing</strong>, especially after heavy makeup or sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2559\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"3301\">Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Triethylhexanoin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Isopropyl Palmitate, Polyisobutene, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Camellia Japonica Seed Oil, Gluconolactone, Castanea Crenata (Chestnut) Shell Extract, Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Flower Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Salvia Sclarea (Clary) Oil, Anthemis Nobilis Flower Oil, Water, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Tocopherol. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3249\" data-content-reference-end=\"3268\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3315\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3457\"><strong data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3457\">Clogged Pores • Blackheads • Whiteheads • Excess Sebum • Makeup &amp; Sunscreen Removal • Acne-Prone Skin • Combination Skin • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,2,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/V7lMu9P2a2mhN07GA8UHcq1c6Zx2aLqoGF1iG8a2.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:52:12','2026-09-16 10:08:34'),(204,'Sedum Hyaluron Sunscreen Watery Tube 50ml','sedum-hyaluron-sunscreen-watery-tube-50ml','<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"488\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"112\">ABIB Sedum Hyaluron Sunscreen Watery Tube</strong> is a lightweight Korean sunscreen that combines <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"209\">high-level UV protection with deep hydration</strong>. Its serum-like watery gel texture spreads easily, absorbs quickly, and leaves a comfortable finish without a noticeable white cast or heavy, sticky feeling. It is especially suitable for dry, combination, sensitive, and redness-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"451\" data-content-reference-end=\"483\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"513\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"531\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"526\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5b4wlc\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"551\">Product Name:</strong> Sedum Hyaluron Sunscreen Watery Tube\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"191ntgz\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"600\">Size:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pj877g\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"631\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87s7f9\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"662\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"655\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"676\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hththo\" data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"740\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"708\">Product Type:</strong> Hydrating Sunscreen / Sun Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ize6b0\" data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"755\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, watery gel-serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zgkss2\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"923\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"805\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially dry, combination, sensitive, and redness-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"881\" data-content-reference-end=\"913\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"944\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1068\"><strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"975\">Sedum Sarmentosum Extract</strong><br data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"978\">\r\nHelps provide hydration and supports the skin against moisture loss caused by UV exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1204\"><strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1092\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\nA moisturizing ingredient that helps attract and retain water, leaving skin feeling hydrated and comfortable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1221\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\nHelps brighten the appearance of dull skin and supports a more even-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1400\"><strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1326\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\nHelps moisturize and soothe the skin while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1555\"><strong data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1422\">Acetyl Glutamine</strong><br data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1425\">\r\nA moisturizing ingredient included to provide additional hydration and improve skin comfort. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1508\" data-content-reference-end=\"1540\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1573\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ghrjl\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1596\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> broad-spectrum UV protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozsvt1\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n💧 Provides long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkv5ef\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\n✨ Lightweight, serum-like texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pcpl7q\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1743\">\r\n🤍 Leaves minimal to no visible white cast\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wgc7zr\" data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\n🌿 Comfortable for sensitive and reactive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j6s266\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\n💄 Works well under makeup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vuxbpe\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1859\">\r\n🚫 Non-sticky and non-greasy finish\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1l0mp\" data-start=\"1860\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\n🛡️ Helps protect against UV-related dryness and photoaging\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3cnna\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"2023\">\r\n🌊 Helps maintain a hydrated skin barrier throughout the day. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1964\" data-content-reference-end=\"1996\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2045\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2404\">The sunscreen has a <strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2104\">transparent, watery serum texture</strong> rather than a thick cream texture. It spreads smoothly and absorbs quickly, making it comfortable for everyday use. ABIB also describes it as suitable for use before makeup because it creates a smooth, hydrated base without causing noticeable pilling or caking. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2340\" data-content-reference-end=\"2372\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2420\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a2s46b\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount as the final step of your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c6x208\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the face, neck, and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ebkoy1\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2621\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2620\">15–30 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bxp7u8\" data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2749\">\r\nReapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor exposure. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2680\" data-content-reference-end=\"2699\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2771\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"3468\">Water, Propanediol, Dibutyl Adipate, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Butyloctyl Salicylate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Polysilicone-15, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Diisopropyl Sebacate, Niacinamide, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Methylene Bis-Benzotriazolyl Tetramethylbutylphenol, Butylene Glycol, Pentylene Glycol, Sedum Sarmentosum Extract, Panthenol, Sorbitol, Behenyl Alcohol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Decyl Glucoside, Adenosine, Glycerin, Tocopherol, Saccharide Isomerate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Acetyl Glutamine, Hamamelis Virginiana Extract, and other supporting ingredients. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3381\" data-content-reference-end=\"3413\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3482\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3606\"><strong data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3606\">Dry Skin • Combination Skin • Sensitive Skin • Redness-Prone Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Daily UV Protection • Makeup Prep</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,19,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/M9DBWT74qfLqpXE68DTFwv90dAxzTlfo4COJH23F.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:53:44','2026-09-16 10:08:17'),(205,'Heartleaf Mild Sunscreen Relief Tube 50ml','heartleaf-mild-sunscreen-relief-tube-50ml','<p data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"518\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"112\">ABIB Heartleaf Mild Sunscreen Relief Tube</strong> is a gentle Korean <strong data-start=\"132\" data-end=\"153\">mineral sunscreen</strong> formulated with <strong data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"193\">non-nano Zinc Oxide</strong> and a high concentration of Heartleaf Extract. It provides <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"270\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> UV protection while helping soothe redness, calm sensitive skin, and maintain a comfortable skin barrier. Its lightweight, creamy texture leaves a soft, smooth finish and is designed to work well under makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"481\" data-content-reference-end=\"513\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"543\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"561\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"556\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hfqjvp\" data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"618\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"581\">Product Name:</strong> Heartleaf Mild Sunscreen Relief Tube\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"191ntgz\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"650\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"630\">Size:</strong> 50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pj877g\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"661\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3g13zm\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"685\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"678\">PA:</strong> PA++++\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q7i7ac\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"697\">Type:</strong> Mineral / Physical Sunscreen\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xm5jyo\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"743\">UV Filter:</strong> Zinc Oxide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"780\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"768\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dptyly\" data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"862\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"797\">Skin Type:</strong> Sensitive, oily, combination, acne-prone, and redness-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"883\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"914\">Heartleaf Extract – 49.8%</strong><br data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"917\">\r\nHelps soothe irritated skin, calm redness, and provide a refreshing, comfortable feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"999\" data-content-reference-end=\"1018\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1226\"><strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1057\">Zinc Oxide</strong><br data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1060\">\r\nA mineral UV filter that helps protect the skin from UVA and UVB rays. ABIB describes this formula as using non-nano Zinc Oxide. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1166\" data-content-reference-end=\"1185\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1339\"><strong data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1267\">Centella Asiatica + TECA Components</strong><br data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1270\">\r\nHelp calm stressed skin and support a healthier-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1404\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1354\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\nHelps hydrate and soothe dry or sensitive skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1473\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1419\">Allantoin</strong><br data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\nHelps comfort irritated skin and maintain softness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1604\"><strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1511\">Ceramide NP + Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\nHelp support the skin barrier and maintain moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1526\" data-content-reference-end=\"1545\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1622\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9mp6ug\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1645\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> high-level UV protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m03tnh\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1721\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1676\" data-end=\"1703\">49.8% Heartleaf Extract</strong> for soothing care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n3cikc\" data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1762\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybrtch\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\nHelps calm sensitive and irritated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lrt5r\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1840\">\r\nMineral sunscreen with Zinc Oxide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e7cjyl\" data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1866\">\r\nNon-comedogenic formula\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f57hic\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\nLightweight and non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ghk0h\" data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1922\">\r\nSoft, creamy application\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iobahk\" data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\nLight green tone helps visually correct redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ut0jzi\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2020\">\r\nSmooth finish suitable for makeup application\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"92v6u6\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\nHelps support the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1gew5\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\nSuitable for acne-prone and sensitive skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2039\" data-content-reference-end=\"2071\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2138\" data-end=\"2158\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2465\">The sunscreen has a <strong data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2206\">smooth, creamy texture</strong> that spreads evenly without the heavy, dry feeling often associated with mineral sunscreens. Its subtle light-green tone is designed to help neutralize the appearance of redness and create a more even-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2363\" data-content-reference-end=\"2382\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2481\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jntl9j\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2547\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2546\">final step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"688g7m\" data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\nTake an adequate amount and spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ebkoy1\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2664\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2663\">15–30 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1drd0\" data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2787\">\r\nReapply regularly during prolonged sun exposure, sweating, or outdoor activities. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2667\" data-content-reference-end=\"2699\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2809\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"3430\">Water, Zinc Oxide (CI 77947), Butyloctyl Salicylate, Propylheptyl Caprylate, Propanediol, C15-19 Alkane, Disiloxane, Isododecane, Cetyl Diglyceryl Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)silylethyl Dimethicone, Caprylyl Methicone, Isopropyl Myristate, Sodium Chloride, Triethylhexanoin, Glycerin, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, 1,2-Hexanediol, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Allantoin, Ceramide NP, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Centella Asiatica Extract, Tocopherol, and other supporting ingredients. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3305\" data-content-reference-end=\"3324\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3432\" data-end=\"3444\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3561\"><strong data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3561\">Sensitive Skin • Redness • Acne-Prone Skin • Oily Skin • Combination Skin • Irritated Skin • Daily UV Protection</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,19,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/rQYh52ReasBQ8ea3IHsqWlRdRuuw6LMwPXZTJ1M5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:55:17','2026-09-16 10:07:59'),(206,'Protective lip balm Block stick SPF15 3.3ml','protective-lip-balm-block-stick-spf15-33ml','<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"447\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"100\">ABIB Protective Lip Balm Block Stick SPF15</strong> is a nourishing Korean lip balm designed to provide <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"192\">all-day hydration and UV protection</strong> for dry, chapped, and sun-exposed lips. It combines <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"313\">Shea Butter, Sweet Almond Oil, Jojoba Esters, and botanical oils</strong> to help soften lips and prevent moisture loss, while SPF15 helps protect lips from UV exposure. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"410\" data-content-reference-end=\"442\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"472\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo5pd\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"490\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"485\">Brand:</strong> ABIB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1741v3q\" data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"548\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"510\">Product Name:</strong> Protective Lip Balm Block Stick SPF15\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwfi6\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"560\">Size:</strong> 3.3g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"579\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ho137a\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"611\">Product Type:</strong> Lip Balm\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x26gae\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"631\">SPF:</strong> SPF15\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aaiikz\" data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"657\">Suitable For:</strong> All lip types, especially dry and chapped lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9lod4t\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"756\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"718\">Finish:</strong> Smooth, moisturizing, non-tinted balm\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"777\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"893\"><strong data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"794\">Shea Butter</strong><br data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">\r\nProvides rich moisturization and helps prevent moisture loss, leaving lips soft and comfortable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"952\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"915\">Sweet Almond Oil</strong><br data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"918\">\r\nHelps nourish and soften dry lips.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1040\"><strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"971\">Jojoba Esters</strong><br data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\">\r\nHelp condition the lips and support a smooth, comfortable texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1241\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1060\">Botanical Oils</strong><br data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\nThe formula contains several plant-derived oils, including olive, evening primrose, camellia, apricot kernel, sunflower, and safflower oils. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1199\" data-content-reference-end=\"1218\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1257\">UV Filters</strong><br data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1260\">\r\nEthylhexyl Methoxycinnamate and Ethylhexyl Salicylate provide the product\'s SPF15 UV protection. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1334\" data-content-reference-end=\"1367\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1412\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11ycm6\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1456\">\r\n💧 Provides all-day moisture for dry lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16og5zj\" data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1471\">SPF15</strong> helps protect lips from UV exposure\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"522xd5\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1537\">\r\nHelps prevent moisture loss\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iutedb\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1570\">\r\nSoftens rough and chapped lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tny7ie\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\nNourishes lips with botanical oils\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k0ya9a\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\nCreates a smooth protective layer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ymj3ez\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1690\">\r\nConvenient stick format for easy application\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ei5e8w\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\nCan be used during the day and at night\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bhmvni\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1803\">\r\nSuitable for everyday lip care <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1738\" data-content-reference-end=\"1757\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1819\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejpbnc\" data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1872\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount directly to the lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qocpu4\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\nGlide the stick evenly across the upper and lower lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17pr2m2\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1991\">\r\nReapply whenever lips feel dry or after eating/drinking.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19mjeum\" data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\nUse during the daytime for added UV protection and at night for moisturizing care.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2099\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2693\"><strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2655\">Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Diisostearyl Malate, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Octyldodecanol, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Microcrystalline Wax, Ceresin, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Meadowfoam Delta-Lactone, Candelilla Wax, Ozokerite, Paraffin, Polybutene, Jojoba Esters, Olive Fruit Oil, Sweet Almond Oil, Evening Primrose Oil, Camellia Japonica Seed Oil, Meadowfoam Seed Oil, Apricot Kernel Oil, Safflower Seed Oil, Sunflower Seed Oil, Rosa Damascena Flower Oil, Tocopherol, and other supporting ingredients.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2610\" data-content-reference-end=\"2629\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2707\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2806\"><strong data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2806\">Dry Lips • Chapped Lips • Sun-Exposed Lips • Rough Lips • Daily Lip Care • Moisture Protection</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,30,22,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/a5Kkwbv7Bf2mMHI9C4yq9XmwbM6hSXUmWq9dlOtp.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 04:57:41','2026-09-16 10:07:37'),(207,'Peach 77 Niacin Essence Toner 250ml','peach-77-niacin-essence-toner-250ml','<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"433\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"85\">ANUA Peach 77 Niacin Essence Toner</strong> is a lightweight Korean <strong data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"127\">essence toner</strong> formulated with <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"253\">77% Peach Fruit Water, Niacinamide, Alpha-Arbutin, Vitamin C, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, and Ceramide NP</strong>. It provides hydration, gently smooths the skin, supports the moisture barrier, and helps create a brighter, more radiant-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"396\" data-content-reference-end=\"428\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"458\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"476\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"471\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwesx5\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"526\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"496\">Product Name:</strong> Peach 77 Niacin Essence Toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tucrvl\" data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"538\">Size:</strong> 250ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"570\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"558\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j2gqzd\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"590\">Product Type:</strong> Hydrating Essence Toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6yy6z\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"657\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"629\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, watery essence\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytvz0o\" data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"752\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"677\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, including dry, dehydrated, combination, and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"773\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"887\"><strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"800\">77% Peach Fruit Water</strong><br data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\">\r\nHelps hydrate, soften, and refresh the skin while supporting a healthy-looking glow.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"1003\"><strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"904\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"907\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1034\">Alpha-Arbutin &amp; Vitamin C</strong><br data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\nBrightening ingredients that help promote a more even and radiant-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1221\"><strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1143\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin feeling plump and hydrated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1355\"><strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1250\">Panthenol &amp; Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1253\">\r\nHelp moisturize and support the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1313\" data-content-reference-end=\"1332\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1373\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ozsvt1\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1410\">\r\n💧 Provides long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zd82d\" data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\n🍑 Contains <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1450\">77% Peach Fruit Water</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17trizz\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n✨ Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ndofh4\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1525\">\r\n🌟 Promotes a healthy, radiant glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bghbo4\" data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\nSmooths rough-looking skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12eopov\" data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1600\">\r\nHelps remove dead skin cells gently\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1glhw3k\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1670\">\r\nHelps improve makeup adherence\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhvzpn\" data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1702\">\r\nLightweight and easy to layer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18aszvl\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1779\">\r\nSuitable for daily skincare routines <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1716\" data-content-reference-end=\"1748\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1781\" data-end=\"1801\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"2048\">The toner has a <strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1855\">lightweight essence-like texture</strong> that feels hydrating without being overly heavy. It can be layered as part of a moisturizing routine and used as a prep step before serum and moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1980\" data-content-reference-end=\"1999\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2064\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2097\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s32hl0\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of toner to your face using your hands or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykg86y\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2214\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rc234q\" data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2252\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzby6\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2284\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2283\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2410\">It can also be applied with cotton pads as a short <strong data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2351\">toner mask</strong> for extra hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2324\" data-content-reference-end=\"2356\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2412\" data-end=\"2432\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"3164\"><strong data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"3126\">Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Water (77%), 2,3-Butanediol, Water, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Lactobacillus Ferment, Methylpropanediol, Streptococcus Thermophilus Ferment, Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Juice, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Bacillus Ferment, Phellinus Linteus Extract, Xylose, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Alpha-Arbutin, Prunus Persica (Peach) Flower Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane, Adenosine, Panthenol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Ceramide NP, Allantoin, Cyanocobalamin, Polyglutamic Acid, Tocopherol, Betaine Salicylate, Ascorbic Acid, Ascorbyl Glucoside, and other supporting ingredients.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3073\" data-content-reference-end=\"3092\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3178\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3287\"><strong data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3287\">Dull Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Uneven Skin Tone • Rough Texture • Dryness • Loss of Glow • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,6,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/XAhChPBJslzgghzsv1orrJs0hbATmZMpvaPQg5Co.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:00:32','2026-09-16 09:52:46'),(208,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA++++ 50ml','heartleaf-silky-moisture-sun-cream-spf-50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"567\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"122\">ANUA Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++</strong> is a lightweight Korean sunscreen designed to provide high-level daily UV protection while keeping the skin hydrated, calm, and comfortable. Formulated with <strong data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"358\">Heartleaf Extract, Niacinamide, Panthenol, and multiple botanical extracts</strong>, it helps soothe sensitive skin, reduce the feeling of dryness, and control excess oil. Its silky texture works well under makeup without leaving a noticeable white cast. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"530\" data-content-reference-end=\"562\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=