07\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive and irritated skin while supporting a comfortable, balanced complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1097\" data-content-reference-end=\"1116\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1255\"><strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1156\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1371\"><strong data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1270\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\nProvides moisturizing and soothing benefits, helping the skin feel comfortable after sun exposure.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1606\"><strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1395\">Botanical Extracts</strong><br data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\nThe formula contains grape, coffee, green tea, chestnut, safflower, persimmon leaf, and other plant extracts to provide additional skin-conditioning and antioxidant care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1546\" data-content-reference-end=\"1565\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1624\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i7e42b\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1647\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> high UV protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l2ka6z\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1707\">\r\n🌿 Soothes sensitive and stressed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51svnw\" data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n💧 Helps maintain skin hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sdqmt4\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1788\">\r\n✨ Helps improve the appearance of dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qlzoft\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1830\">\r\nHelps control excess sebum and oiliness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w44crc\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1869\">\r\nLeaves skin feeling smooth and silky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y65rwb\" data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1896\">\r\nNo noticeable white cast\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ialsvp\" data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1927\">\r\nComfortable for everyday use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"joag29\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\nWorks well underneath makeup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvgkbu\" data-start=\"1959\" data-end=\"2026\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1946\" data-content-reference-end=\"1978\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2048\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2377\">The sunscreen has a <strong data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2095\">silky, creamy texture</strong> that spreads easily across the skin and absorbs comfortably. It is designed to provide moisture without the heavy or greasy sensation commonly associated with richer sunscreens. Its smooth finish also makes it suitable as a base before makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2292\" data-content-reference-end=\"2324\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2379\" data-end=\"2393\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fpweu\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\nApply after your moisturizer and as the final step of your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"688g7m\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\nTake an adequate amount and spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfwmn4\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\nApply before sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ut0bfr\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2662\">\r\nReapply during prolonged outdoor exposure, sweating, or after wiping the face.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2684\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"3194\"><strong data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"3156\">Water, Houttuynia Cordata Extract (300,000 ppm), Dibutyl Adipate, Propanediol, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Terephthalylidene Dicamphor Sulfonic Acid, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Caprylyl Methicone, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Tromethamine, Polyglyceryl-3 Distearate, Cetearyl Alcohol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Pentylene Glycol, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Polysilicone-15, Panthenol, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Adenosine, and various botanical extracts.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3104\" data-content-reference-end=\"3123\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3208\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3328\"><strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3328\">Sensitive Skin • Dry Skin • Combination Skin • Oily Skin • Dull Skin • Redness • Daily Sun Protection • Makeup Base</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,19,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/AtrZMAEPwp7ZsP3p7rxpxGPZie0ZyGCU5kP4oKUZ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:02:18','2026-09-16 09:52:23'),(209,'Peach 70% Niacin Serum 30ml','peach-70-niacin-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"375\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"70\">ANUA Peach 70% Niacin Serum</strong> is a lightweight Korean brightening and hydrating serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"183\">70% Peach Extract and 5% Niacinamide</strong>. It is designed to improve the appearance of dullness and uneven texture while providing intense hydration for a smooth, radiant, glass-skin-like finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"338\" data-content-reference-end=\"370\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"400\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"745\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"418\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"413\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o7hqu5\" data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"461\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"438\">Product Name:</strong> Peach 70% Niacin Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtv1a3\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"493\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"473\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"507\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"65j0m9\" data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"574\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"539\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Hydrating Face Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"epnugf\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"615\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"589\">Texture:</strong> Watery, lightweight serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o76vlo\" data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"628\">Color:</strong> Natural light pink\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n2nv0d\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"745\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"667\">Suitable For:</strong> Especially dry and dehydrated skin; suitable for dull and uneven-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"766\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"907\"><strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"789\">70% Peach Extract</strong><br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\">\r\nHelps moisturize the skin and improve the appearance of dullness, leaving the complexion looking fresh and radiant.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1039\"><strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"927\">5% Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"930\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and texture while supporting a healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1056\">Vitamin B12</strong><br data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\nProvides moisturizing benefits and gives the serum its natural pink color without artificial coloring.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1189\">Triple Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture at different levels of the skin for a plumper, more hydrated appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1317\">Alpha-Arbutin</strong><br data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1320\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven pigmentation and dull-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1423\">Panthenol &amp; Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\nHelp moisturize and support the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1486\" data-content-reference-end=\"1505\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1546\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofib4m\" data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1582\">\r\n🍑 Contains <strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1582\">70% Peach Extract</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fa9ik5\" data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n✨ Contains <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1614\">5% Niacinamide</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u0zylj\" data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1649\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17z2ujx\" data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1698\">\r\nPromotes a radiant, glass-skin-like appearance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tt01gi\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lg498c\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\nProvides intense hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xp0g34\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1810\">\r\nHelps soften rough-feeling skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mcjy7\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1880\">\r\nLightweight and fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4v2az3\" data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1918\">\r\nNatural pink color from Vitamin B12\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jg93p3\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\nSuitable for layering in a daily skincare routine <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1947\" data-content-reference-end=\"1979\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2030\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2261\">The serum has a <strong data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2079\">watery, lightweight texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably into the skin. Its natural light-pink color comes from Vitamin B12 rather than artificial coloring. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2195\" data-content-reference-end=\"2214\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2277\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2315\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103nyzs\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\nTake <strong data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2337\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nzufr3\" data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck, avoiding the eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5zvif\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\nUse sunscreen during the daytime.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1agii3s\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\nCan be used <strong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2552\">up to twice daily</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2507\" data-content-reference-end=\"2526\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2613\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"3515\"><strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"3477\">Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Lactobacillus Ferment, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sphingomonas Ferment Extract, Alpha-Arbutin, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil, Salvia Hispanica Seed Oil, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Chamaecyparis Obtusa Leaf Extract, Prunus Persica (Peach) Flower Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Artemisia Princeps Leaf Extract, Pentylene Glycol, Betaine Salicylate, Panthenol, Polyglutamic Acid, Linoleic Acid, Linolenic Acid, Cyanocobalamin, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Ceramide NP, Lactobionic Acid, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Xanthan Gum, Fragrance (Parfum).</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3413\" data-content-reference-end=\"3432\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3529\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3643\"><strong data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3643\">Dull Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Uneven Skin Tone • Rough Texture • Dry Skin • Loss of Glow • Glass Skin Routine</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/3unKk4f6j0iuvmINleCgpjAPzqtI6aNCCm5yZ94W.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:05:19','2026-09-16 09:52:05'),(210,'PDRN Hyaluronic Acid Capsule 100 Serum 30ml','pdrn-hyaluronic-acid-capsule-100-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"528\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"55\" data-end=\"102\">ANUA PDRN Hyaluronic Acid Capsule 100 Serum</strong> is a lightweight Korean hydrating serum formulated with a <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"231\">Triple Revitalizing Complex of PDRN, Hyaluronic Acid, and Collagen</strong>. It is designed to deeply hydrate, improve the appearance of plumpness and radiance, and support the skin\'s moisture barrier. The serum has a naturally emerald tint from its ingredients and uses microcapsule technology for a lightweight, fast-absorbing feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"491\" data-content-reference-end=\"510\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"553\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"571\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"566\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xd2pjt\" data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"630\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"591\">Product Name:</strong> PDRN Hyaluronic Acid Capsule 100 Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"642\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"661\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r59cpp\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"720\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"693\">Product Type:</strong> Hydrating &amp; Plumping Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nuad67\" data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"735\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, watery serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g3i9ko\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"774\">Color:</strong> Natural emerald tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16vd2gq\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"869\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"812\">Skin Type:</strong> Normal, dry, dehydrated, combination, and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e7saz\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"886\">Fragrance:</strong> Fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wqmi2u\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"916\">Formula:</strong> Non-comedogenic and low-irritation tested <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"941\" data-content-reference-end=\"973\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1017\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1215\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1040\">PDRN (Sodium DNA)</strong><br data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\nThe PDRN in this formula is derived from salmon DNA. It is included as part of the serum\'s skin-conditioning and revitalizing complex. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1155\" data-content-reference-end=\"1174\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1420\"><strong data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1236\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\nThe formula contains multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid to help attract and retain moisture, supporting a hydrated and plump-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1342\" data-content-reference-end=\"1361\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1571\"><strong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1445\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong><br data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\nHelps provide moisturizing and skin-conditioning benefits while contributing to a smoother, more supple-looking appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1676\"><strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1588\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1591\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and supports a healthy-looking skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1748\"><strong data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1693\">Glutathione</strong><br data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1696\">\r\nProvides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1766\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g251dl\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n💧 Provides intensive hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vm5emd\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\n💦 Helps improve the appearance of skin plumpness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6s29dl\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\n✨ Creates a fresh, luminous glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xoaftf\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\n🧬 Contains PDRN derived from salmon DNA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkgyzg\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\n💧 Contains multiple types of Hyaluronic Acid\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iav278\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2022\">\r\nHelps support the skin\'s moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nro27s\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\nHelps skin feel smoother and softer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2mcjy7\" data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\nLightweight and fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fzklf\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2111\">\r\nNon-comedogenic\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mis0en\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\nLow-irritation tested\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"754fad\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\nFragrance-free <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2090\" data-content-reference-end=\"2122\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2192\" data-end=\"2212\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2500\">The serum has a <strong data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2261\">lightweight, watery texture</strong> designed to absorb quickly without feeling heavy. Its naturally emerald color comes from the ingredients rather than artificial colorants. It leaves the skin looking <strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2461\">dewy, hydrated, and refreshed</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2395\" data-content-reference-end=\"2414\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2516\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qr8lpf\" data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\nApply a few drops of the serum to the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m7cizq\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\nGently pat with your fingertips until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18dlp16\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer or facial oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkbwuy\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2725\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2724\">morning and night</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hbdrb6\" data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2820\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with <strong data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2781\">SPF 30 or higher</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2697\" data-content-reference-end=\"2729\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2957\"><strong data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2830\">Tip:</strong> For extra hydration at night, the serum can be layered <strong data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2899\">2–3 times</strong> before moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2829\" data-content-reference-end=\"2848\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2979\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3793\"><strong data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3755\">Water, Butylene Glycol, Propanediol, Glycerin, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Glyceryl Oleate, Lauryl Glucoside, Myristyl Glucoside, Polyglyceryl-6 Laurate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Glutathione, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Sodium Hyaluronate, Coptis Japonica Root Extract, Adenosine, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Coccinia Indica Fruit Extract, Sodium DNA, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydroxypropyltrimonium Hyaluronate, Potassium Hyaluronate, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Citric Acid, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Sodium Citrate, Pentylene Glycol.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3647\" data-content-reference-end=\"3666\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3807\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3926\"><strong data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3926\">Dry Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Dull Skin • Loss of Elasticity • Rough Texture • Moisture Barrier Care • Glowing Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/trKJR9nXIBgVxpeIFxgkOl0ravwHfPf0HvAOETV9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:08:13','2026-09-14 17:29:22'),(211,'Peach 77 Niacin Enriched Cream 50ml','peach-77-niacin-enriched-cream-50ml','<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"428\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"86\">ANUA Peach 77 Niacin Enriched Cream</strong> is a lightweight Korean moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"246\">77% Peach Fruit Water, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Ceramide NP, Collagen, Pectin, and fermented ingredients</strong>. It provides deep hydration while helping smooth and soften the skin, support the moisture barrier, and create a healthy, radiant-looking glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"391\" data-content-reference-end=\"423\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"453\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"466\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8x9egx\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"491\">Product Name:</strong> Peach 77 Niacin Enriched Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpv5wz\" data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"534\">Size:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"553\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b460z3\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"585\">Product Type:</strong> Moisturizing &amp; Brightening Face Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l4vhy0\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"638\">Texture:</strong> Bouncy, pudding-like gel cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hve6pi\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"715\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"683\">Finish:</strong> Soft, smooth, fresh, non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytvz0o\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"735\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, including dry, dehydrated, combination, and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"831\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"942\"><strong data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"858\">77% Peach Fruit Water</strong><br data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"861\">\r\nHelps replenish moisture and leaves the skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"1078\"><strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"959\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"962\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven-looking skin tone while supporting a healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1168\"><strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1093\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\nHelps hydrate and soothe the skin while supporting the moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1264\"><strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1185\">Ceramide NP</strong><br data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\nHelps maintain the skin\'s natural moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1397\"><strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1287\">Collagen &amp; Pectin</strong><br data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\nProvide moisturizing and skin-conditioning benefits, helping create a plump and radiant-looking appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1636\"><strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1424\">Fermented Ingredients</strong><br data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1427\">\r\nLactobacillus Ferment, Saccharomyces Ferment Filtrate, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, and Bifida Ferment Lysate provide additional skin-conditioning and moisturizing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1594\" data-content-reference-end=\"1613\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1654\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2zd82d\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1694\">\r\n🍑 Contains <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1694\">77% Peach Fruit Water</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x5wk8q\" data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1732\">\r\n💧 Provides deep, lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17trizz\" data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\n✨ Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qrysgv\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1807\">\r\n🌸 Promotes a healthy, radiant glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t8wogn\" data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1841\">\r\nHelps smooth rough-feeling skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jgoth0\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\nHelps soothe dryness and dehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17syvs0\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\nLightweight and non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9petko\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1976\">\r\nBouncy pudding-like texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1whld6u\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2014\">\r\nSuitable for daily AM &amp; PM skincare\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19rl6cq\" data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\nCan be layered for additional moisture during dry seasons <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2049\" data-content-reference-end=\"2068\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2134\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2414\">The cream has a unique <strong data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2191\">bouncy, pudding-like texture</strong> that spreads smoothly across the skin and absorbs without a heavy or sticky feeling. Its natural pink color comes from <strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2343\">Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin)</strong> rather than artificial coloring. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2333\" data-content-reference-end=\"2352\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2430\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2681\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vgtya5\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2495\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2535\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2576\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2639\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2638\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufgsuj\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2681\">\r\nIn the morning, finish with sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2683\" data-end=\"2796\">For very dry skin, the cream can be layered to provide additional moisture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2697\" data-content-reference-end=\"2716\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2818\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"3694\"><strong data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"3656\">Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Water (77%), Glycerin, Methylpropanediol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Isododecane, Lactobacillus Ferment, Propanediol, Panthenol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Coptis Japonica Root Extract, Prunus Persica (Peach) Fruit Extract, Prunus Persica (Peach) Flower Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Soluble Collagen, Jojoba Esters, Vinyl Dimethicone, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Water, Dimethiconol, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Hydroxyacetophenone, Tromethamine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Butylene Glycol, Adenosine, Disodium EDTA, Cyanocobalamin, Saccharomyces Ferment Filtrate, Tocopherol, Ceramide NP, Pectin, Maltodextrin, Hydrolyzed Vegetable Protein, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Bifida Ferment Lysate, Fragrance.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3577\" data-content-reference-end=\"3596\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3708\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3828\"><strong data-start=\"3709\" data-end=\"3828\">Dry Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Dull Skin • Uneven-Looking Skin • Rough Texture • Loss of Glow • Moisture Barrier Care</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/8263guD2blzB2QJ7u5LnKPN6L82F5UAv1kd8Jrtz.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:10:24','2026-09-16 09:51:41'),(212,'Heartleaf Centella Red Spot Cream 30ml','heartleaf-centella-red-spot-cream-30ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"448\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"92\">ANUA Heartleaf Centella Red Spot Cream</strong> is a lightweight Korean soothing cream designed for <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"216\">redness, blemish-prone skin, irritation, and weakened skin barriers</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"322\">Heartleaf, Centella/Cica, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Squalane, and a multi-Ceramide complex</strong> to calm the appearance of troubled areas while providing hydration and barrier support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"411\" data-content-reference-end=\"443\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"473\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"491\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"486\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t57gkx\" data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"511\">Product Name:</strong> Heartleaf Centella Red Spot Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"562\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"557\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"563\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"576\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dcltyb\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"639\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"608\">Product Type:</strong> Spot Care / Moisturizing Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cuyn63\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"696\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"654\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, smooth, fast-absorbing cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"48gwp7\" data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"713\">Skin Type:</strong> Sensitive, oily, combination, normal, and blemish-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1theqbw\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"789\">Formula:</strong> Non-comedogenic and fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"845\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"983\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"881\">Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata)</strong><br data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"884\">\r\nHelps soothe the appearance of redness and provides calming care for sensitive, blemish-prone skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1160\"><strong data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1021\">Centella Asiatica / Cica Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\nContains <strong data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1099\">Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, and Asiatic Acid</strong>, which help calm stressed skin and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1175\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\nProvides moisturizing and soothing benefits while helping maintain a healthy skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1386\"><strong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1285\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1288\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and marks while supporting balanced-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1608\"><strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1408\">Ceramide Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1411\">\r\nIncludes multiple ceramides such as <strong data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1487\">Ceramide NP, NG, NS, AS, AP, and EOP</strong>, together with cholesterol and phytosphingosine, to support moisture-barrier care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1566\" data-content-reference-end=\"1585\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1626\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14uztzz\" data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\nHelps calm the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1671\">red spots</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d9x403\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\nSoothes irritated and sensitive-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikn7bp\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1757\">\r\nSupports the skin\'s moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22xmrw\" data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1790\">\r\nProvides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ypirv2\" data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1846\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of blemish-related marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kix5p\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\nHelps reduce excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nus311\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\nNon-greasy and fast absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fzklf\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1924\">\r\nNon-comedogenic\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zmcp5k\" data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1983\">\r\nSuitable for targeted spot care or all-over moisturizing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11rvjmi\" data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\nWorks well under makeup <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1987\" data-content-reference-end=\"2006\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2069\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2355\">The cream has a <strong data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2118\">lightweight, smooth texture</strong> that absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or greasy feeling. It can be applied to the entire face as a daily moisturizer or used more generously on areas where redness or blemishes are a concern. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2277\" data-content-reference-end=\"2296\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2371\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19vcxq9\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2491\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzoxs1\" data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\nApply evenly over the face as the final skincare step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tf6zwt\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\nFor targeted care, apply a <strong data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2606\">slightly thicker layer</strong> to areas of redness or concern.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11dar3z\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y2kp4\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2784\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2699\">morning and evening</strong>. Apply sunscreen afterward during the daytime. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2688\" data-content-reference-end=\"2707\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2806\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"3429\"><strong data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"3391\">Water, Houttuynia Cordata Flower/Leaf/Stem Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, 2,3-Butanediol, Panthenol, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Tocopherol, Methyl Trimethicone, Niacinamide, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Squalane, Pentylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-6 Caprylate, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Madecassic Acid, Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Sorbitol, Ceramide NP, Ceramide NG, Ceramide NS, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP, Cholesterol, Phytosphingosine, Allantoin, Adenosine, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Tocopherol, and other supporting ingredients.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3315\" data-content-reference-end=\"3347\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3431\" data-end=\"3443\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3570\"><strong data-start=\"3444\" data-end=\"3570\">Redness • Blemish-Prone Skin • Sensitive Skin • Irritation • Excess Sebum • Uneven Skin Tone • Weak Skin Barrier • Dryness</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Lkj7Dv0cBFB0iHH9skprggBnAicjDgN7neqFQ7R3.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:14:03','2026-09-16 09:51:21'),(213,'Rice 70+ Glow Milky Toner 250ml','rice-70-glow-milky-toner-250ml','<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"419\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"75\">ANUA Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner</strong> is a lightweight, milky Korean toner formulated with <strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"217\">71% Rice Bran Water, Niacinamide, Panthenol, Hyaluronic Acid, Arbutin, and Ceramides</strong>. It provides hydration, helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven skin, supports the moisture barrier, and leaves the skin looking soft, smooth, and radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"382\" data-content-reference-end=\"414\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"444\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"777\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"462\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"457\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gkv6b3\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"507\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"482\">Product Name:</strong> Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tucrvl\" data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"525\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"519\">Size:</strong> 250ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"539\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10yk204\" data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"607\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"571\">Product Type:</strong> Milky Hydrating &amp; Brightening Toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckwxjf\" data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"622\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, creamy-milky toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e7saz\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"671\">Fragrance:</strong> Fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uvt7ml\" data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"777\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"706\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially dry, dehydrated, dull, and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"798\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"970\"><strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"825\">Rice Bran Water – 71%</strong><br data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"828\">\r\nHelps hydrate and nourish the skin while promoting a clearer, brighter, more radiant-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"928\" data-content-reference-end=\"947\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"987\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"990\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting balanced-looking skin and moisture retention.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1222\"><strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1129\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\nHelps soothe and moisturize the skin while supporting the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1360\"><strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1243\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">\r\nMultiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid help attract and retain moisture, leaving the skin feeling plumper and hydrated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1500\"><strong data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1382\">Ceramide Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1385\">\r\nCeramide NP, Ceramide AP, Ceramide EOP, Cholesterol, and Phytosphingosine help support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1623\"><strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1525\">Arbutin &amp; Vitamin C</strong><br data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1528\">\r\nHelp promote a brighter and more even-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1563\" data-content-reference-end=\"1582\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1641\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ot821y\" data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n💧 Provides intense hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sydcmx\" data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\n🍚 Contains <strong data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1711\">71% Rice Bran Water</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17trizz\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1748\">\r\n✨ Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ndofh4\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n🌟 Promotes a healthy, radiant glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rt2nhu\" data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1837\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uvgl89\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1919\">\r\nHelps soften and smooth rough-feeling skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kd9ckd\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1946\">\r\nHelps balance excess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rgampk\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1963\">\r\nFragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12qqveg\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\nLightweight and comfortable for daily use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"139ttg2\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2090\">\r\nSuitable for a glass-skin skincare routine <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2009\" data-content-reference-end=\"2041\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2112\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2369\">The toner has a <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2159\">lightweight milky texture</strong> that provides more nourishment than a typical watery toner while remaining comfortable on the skin. It leaves the complexion feeling hydrated, soft, smooth, and refreshed. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2283\" data-content-reference-end=\"2302\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2385\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2419\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ymmmgk\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\nPour an appropriate amount onto your hands or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5fztg\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2560\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"107i4bf\" data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tp28g0\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2629\">morning and evening</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2564\" data-content-reference-end=\"2583\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2690\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"3432\"><strong data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"3394\">Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Water (71%), Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Dipropylene Glycol, Niacinamide, Propanediol, Water, 1,2-Hexanediol, Methyl Gluceth-20, Panthenol, Betaine, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Hydroxyacetophenone, Diphenyl Dimethicone, Triethylhexanoin, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Adenosine, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Xanthan Gum, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Hyaluronic Acid, Dextrin, Hydrolyzed Rice Protein, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Protein, Ceramide NP, Sodium Lauroyl Lactylate, Arbutin, Ascorbic Acid, Allantoin, Ceramide AP, Phytosphingosine, Cholesterol, Ceramide EOP.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3310\" data-content-reference-end=\"3329\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3446\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3570\"><strong data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3570\">Dull Skin • Dry Skin • Dehydrated Skin • Uneven Skin Tone • Rough Texture • Excess Oil • Weak Skin Barrier • Glass Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,6,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/EVJLkv6y4S9oQV0iRu2omfsgghLB2retd5kgqoXH.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:16:04','2026-09-16 09:50:59'),(214,'Nano Retinol 0.3%+Niacin Renewing Serum 30ml','nano-retinol-03niacin-renewing-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"475\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"110\">ANUA Nano Retinol™ 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum</strong> is a Korean anti-aging and skin-renewing serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"267\">Retinol, 5% Niacinamide, peptides, ceramides, Centella Asiatica, and soothing ingredients</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven texture, enlarged pores, dark spots, and post-breakout marks while maintaining skin hydration and barrier support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"438\" data-content-reference-end=\"470\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"500\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qo2uq\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"518\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"513\">Brand:</strong> ANUA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v48goz\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"581\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"538\">Product Name:</strong> Nano Retinol™ 0.3% + Niacin Renewing Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"593\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"612\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1baf2zw\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"644\">Product Type:</strong> Retinol / Anti-Aging Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vbcknv\" data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"686\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, moisturizing serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e7saz\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"735\">Fragrance:</strong> Fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3uasgw\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"770\">Suitable For:</strong> Dull, uneven, mature, textured, and blemish-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"846\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1124\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"865\">Nano Retinol™</strong><br data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\">\r\nHelps support skin renewal and improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven texture, pores, and dark spots. The formula uses nano-liposome technology to help deliver retinol while reducing the potential for irritation. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1082\" data-content-reference-end=\"1101\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1249\"><strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1144\">Niacinamide 5%</strong><br data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1270\">Peptide Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\nContains multiple peptides that provide skin-conditioning and firming care, helping improve the appearance of fine lines and loss of firmness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1514\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1430\">Ceramides</strong><br data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\nMultiple ceramides help strengthen the moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1604\"><strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1553\">Centella Asiatica &amp; Madecassoside</strong><br data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\nHelp soothe and comfort skin during retinol use.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1737\"><strong data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1643\">Panthenol, Beta-Glucan &amp; Squalane</strong><br data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\nProvide moisturizing and barrier-supporting benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1677\" data-content-reference-end=\"1709\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1755\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wafbl1\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1812\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"47s698\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1861\">\r\nImproves the appearance of uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eeeq4\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\nHelps minimize the look of enlarged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwmc6\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1935\">\r\nBrightens dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jl4l6q\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1999\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of dark spots and post-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qq8qg6\" data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\nSupports firmer-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi93om\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2056\">\r\nProvides deep hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xtvn81\" data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k5djbd\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2135\">\r\nSoothes skin during retinol use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riirjq\" data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2160\">\r\nFragrance-free formula\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3spar\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\nSuitable for a beginner-friendly retinol routine <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2184\" data-content-reference-end=\"2203\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2271\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2530\">The serum has a <strong data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2329\">lightweight yet moisturizing texture</strong> that absorbs comfortably into the skin. It is formulated with soothing and barrier-supporting ingredients to help minimize the dryness and discomfort that can sometimes occur when introducing retinol.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2546\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2566\"><strong data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2566\">For beginners:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zrbytv\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\nCleanse and dry your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"169veca\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2671\">\r\nApply a small amount of serum during your <strong data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2670\">evening skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1frnj\" data-start=\"2672\" data-end=\"2735\">\r\nGently spread over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93jfrg\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dbzeu\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2889\">\r\nDuring the first <strong data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2822\">two weeks, use every other night</strong> to allow the skin to adjust. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2806\" data-content-reference-end=\"2825\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xy7iwe\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2965\">\r\nGradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"3068\"><strong data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2981\">Important:</strong> Use sunscreen every morning because retinol can increase skin sensitivity to sunlight.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3090\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3541\">The formula includes <strong data-start=\"3113\" data-end=\"3328\">Niacinamide (5%), Retinol, Ceramide NP, Ceramide AS, Ceramide AP, Ceramide NS, Ceramide NG, Ceramide EOP, Panthenol, Beta-Glucan, Squalane, Madecassoside, Centella Asiatica Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Adenosine</strong>, and multiple peptides including <strong data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3502\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and Hexapeptide-9</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3440\" data-content-reference-end=\"3472\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3543\" data-end=\"3555\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3695\"><strong data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3695\">Fine Lines • Wrinkles • Dark Spots • Uneven Skin Tone • Enlarged Pores • Rough Texture • Dull Skin • Loss of Firmness • Post-Acne Marks</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/rL2KGi1C62D9OyxwUXeLMQ7mP3Nt7Kkk7wWITtbI.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:19:03','2026-09-16 09:50:38'),(215,'Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Ampoule Serum 40ml','tranexamic-acid-niacinamide-ampoule-serum-40ml','<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"475\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"108\">APLB Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Ampoule Serum</strong> is a Korean brightening and moisturizing ampoule designed to target <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"259\">dark spots, hyperpigmentation, uneven skin tone, dullness, and post-acne marks</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"328\">Tranexamic Acid, Niacinamide, and Centella Asiatica</strong> with hydrating and soothing ingredients to help create a clearer, smoother, more radiant-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"438\" data-content-reference-end=\"470\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"500\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qoeae\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"518\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"513\">Brand:</strong> APLB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y2fvqu\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"538\">Product Name:</strong> Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Ampoule Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lz1brv\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"612\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"592\">Size:</strong> 40ml / 1.35 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"626\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gmlkr\" data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"684\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"658\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening Ampoule Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggoepe\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"699\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, fast-absorbing ampoule\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tqbij\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"796\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"755\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, including sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eij1q1\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"874\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"817\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, uneven tone, dullness, pigmentation, dryness\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"895\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"1102\"><strong data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"930\">Tranexamic Acid 34.8% Complex</strong><br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\">\r\nA key brightening ingredient in the formula, designed to help improve the appearance of discoloration and uneven-looking skin tone. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1060\" data-content-reference-end=\"1092\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1224\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1119\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1359\"><strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1247\">Centella Asiatica</strong><br data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\nProvides soothing and calming care, making the ampoule suitable for skin prone to sensitivity and irritation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1469\"><strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1386\">Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong><br data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1389\">\r\nHelp moisturize and soothe the skin while supporting a comfortable skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1582\"><strong data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1501\">Squalane &amp; Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1504\">\r\nHelp replenish moisture and leave the skin feeling soft, smooth, and hydrated.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1600\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17trizz\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n✨ Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qr7h05\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1697\">\r\n🎯 Targets the appearance of dark spots and discoloration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tuibna\" data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\nHelps improve uneven-looking skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66t231\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1775\">\r\nSupports a more radiant complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tve6dy\" data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n💧 Provides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dr3fg\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1856\">\r\n🌿 Helps soothe sensitive or stressed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d5jbf4\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\nHelps support the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ppjo6v\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1941\">\r\nImproves the appearance of rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b2f4tz\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1976\">\r\nFast-absorbing and easy to layer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riirjq\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2001\">\r\nFragrance-free formula\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18aszvl\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\nSuitable for daily skincare routines <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2028\" data-content-reference-end=\"2060\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2100\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2335\">The ampoule has a <strong data-start=\"2120\" data-end=\"2151\">lightweight, smooth texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs without leaving a heavy or greasy feeling. It can be layered with other hydrating products and works well as part of both morning and evening routines.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2351\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16haur2\" data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of ampoule.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7dft4\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\nApply evenly to the face and neck, focusing on areas with uneven tone or visible spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bz298d\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2553\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5zvif\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2618\">\r\nUse sunscreen during the daytime.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2732\">If you are new to active brightening products, start once daily and increase according to your skin\'s tolerance.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2754\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"3448\"><strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"3410\">Water, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Butylene Glycol, Propanediol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycerin, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, Panthenol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Allantoin, Tranexamic Acid, Niacinamide, Cellulose Gum, Disodium EDTA, Citric Acid, Styrene/Acrylates Copolymer, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Xanthan Gum, Inulin, Squalane, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiatic Acid, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tea Tree Leaf Extract, Sea Buckthorn Fruit Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Beta-Glucan, Lotus Flower Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Rice Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Eggplant Fruit Extract, and other supporting ingredients.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3393\" data-content-reference-end=\"3412\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3462\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3592\"><strong data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3592\">Dark Spots • Hyperpigmentation • Uneven Skin Tone • Dull Skin • Post-Acne Marks • Dry Skin • Sensitive Skin • Dehydrated Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,12,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/NhU3waNpTGRSM8EiXYPpZQ0S1RMKKhRC7DkilnLh.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:24:01','2026-09-17 16:26:46'),(216,'Retinol Vitamin C Vitamin E Facial Cream 55ml','retinol-vitamin-c-vitamin-e-facial-cream-55ml','<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"449\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"106\">APLB Retinol Vitamin C Vitamin E Facial Cream</strong> is a multifunctional Korean moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"233\">Retinol, Vitamin C, Vitamin E, and 21.6% Centella Asiatica Extract</strong>. It is designed to provide anti-aging, brightening, soothing, and moisturizing care while helping improve the appearance of fine lines, dullness, uneven tone, and rough texture. <span class=\"content