\r\nHelps soothe sensitive-looking skin and support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1111\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"979\">Retinol – 1,000ppb</strong><br data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"982\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, uneven texture, and loss of firmness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1069\" data-content-reference-end=\"1088\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1220\"><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1137\">Vitamin C – 3,000ppb</strong><br data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin and improve the appearance of uneven skin tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1331\"><strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1246\">Vitamin E – 8,000ppb</strong><br data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\nProvides antioxidant and moisturizing care while helping support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1478\"><strong data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1356\">Centella 3X Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\nContains Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, and Asiatic Acid to provide additional soothing and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1644\"><strong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1526\">Sodium Hyaluronate, Squalane &amp; Beta-Glucan</strong><br data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\">\r\nHelp replenish moisture and leave skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1584\" data-content-reference-end=\"1616\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1662\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pyubvb\" data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1722\">\r\n✨ Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ydi2k4\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1760\">\r\n💎 Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sr2vlq\" data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1804\">\r\n🌟 Supports a more even-looking skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3zj2ee\" data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\n🔄 Helps improve rough and uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mleq00\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\n💧 Provides moisturizing and nourishing care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12dr3fg\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1945\">\r\n🌿 Helps soothe sensitive or stressed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kamamq\" data-start=\"1946\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\n🛡️ Supports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18nk3oa\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2034\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of skin firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13vanhq\" data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\nProvides antioxidant care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f57hic\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\nLightweight and non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yzcjuz\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2154\">\r\nFragrance-free formula <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2083\" data-content-reference-end=\"2115\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2176\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2426\">The cream has a <strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2225\">smooth, lightweight texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably without leaving a heavy or greasy finish. It is suitable for use as the final moisturizing step in a skincare routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2350\" data-content-reference-end=\"2369\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2442\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2519\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2600\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pqiita\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2758\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2758\">If you are new to retinol, start gradually—such as 2–3 nights per week—and increase according to your skin\'s tolerance.</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geblxy\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\nUse sunscreen every morning.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2812\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"3852\"><strong data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"3814\">Water, Centella Asiatica Extract (21.6%), Glycerin, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Retinol (1,000ppb), Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, BHT, Tocopheryl Acetate (8,000ppb), Ascorbic Acid (3,000ppb), Sodium Hyaluronate, Stearic Acid, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Silica, Glyceryl Stearate, Beeswax, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Betaine, Trehalose, Citric Acid, Sodium Citrate, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Squalane, Beta-Glucan, Dipropylene Glycol, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Dextrin, Gardenia Florida Fruit Extract, Disodium EDTA, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3758\" data-content-reference-end=\"3790\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3866\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3985\"><strong data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3985\">Fine Lines • Wrinkles • Dull Skin • Uneven Skin Tone • Rough Texture • Loss of Firmness • Dryness • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/SsTGbtRtaAZmKIaiXFn0UVBK4IfPqP4ptYL2numm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:30:58','2026-09-17 16:26:08'),(217,'Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Facial Cream 55ml','tranexamic-acid-niacinamide-facial-cream-55ml','<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"446\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"106\">APLB Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Facial Cream</strong> is a Korean brightening and moisturizing cream formulated with <strong data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"242\">Tranexamic Acid, Niacinamide, and 28.1% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"344\">dark spots, hyperpigmentation, dullness, and uneven skin tone</strong> while providing soothing hydration and barrier-supporting care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"409\" data-content-reference-end=\"441\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"471\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qoeae\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"489\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"484\">Brand:</strong> APLB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vcjwv1\" data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"550\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"509\">Product Name:</strong> Tranexamic Acid Niacinamide Facial Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115bg5z\" data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"562\">Size:</strong> 55ml / 1.86 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"596\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lrg4mm\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"628\">Product Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Moisturizing Facial Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5tjpt1\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"683\">Texture:</strong> Smooth, lightweight cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tqbij\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"729\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, including sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e7saz\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"787\">Fragrance:</strong> Fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"823\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"992\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"865\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water – 28.1%</strong><br data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive or irritated-looking skin while providing refreshing hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"950\" data-content-reference-end=\"969\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1152\"><strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1024\">Tranexamic Acid – 1,000ppm</strong><br data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1027\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of pigmentation, dark spots, and uneven-looking skin tone. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1092\" data-content-reference-end=\"1111\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1323\"><strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1180\">Niacinamide – 1,000ppm</strong><br data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1183\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone, and support the skin barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1245\" data-content-reference-end=\"1264\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1359\">Squalane &amp; Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong><br data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1362\">\r\nHelp moisturize and condition the skin, leaving it feeling softer and smoother.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1541\"><strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1472\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Shea Butter</strong><br data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\nHelp maintain moisture and provide additional comfort to dry skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1712\"><strong data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1566\">Centella 3X Complex</strong><br data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1569\">\r\nMadecassoside, Asiaticoside, and Asiatic Acid provide additional soothing and skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1616\" data-content-reference-end=\"1648\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1730\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17trizz\" data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\n✨ Helps brighten dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lqjg7u\" data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1831\">\r\n🎯 Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tuibna\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1872\">\r\nHelps improve uneven-looking skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fwfy75\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\n💧 Provides refreshing moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2jb1q3\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n🌿 Helps soothe sensitive and irritated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1990\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kqqk2u\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2038\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f57hic\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\nLightweight and non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rgampk\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\nFragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p7ieoh\" data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2114\">\r\nSuitable for daily skincare\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uoecal\" data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\nWorks well for sensitive skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2080\" data-content-reference-end=\"2112\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2206\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2208\" data-end=\"2431\">The cream has a <strong data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2255\">smooth, lightweight texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably without leaving a greasy residue. It leaves the skin feeling moisturized, soft, and balanced. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2322\" data-content-reference-end=\"2341\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2447\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2485\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2563\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e9vchq\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2642\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2673\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7ke6j\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always follow with sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2749\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"3657\"><strong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"3619\">Water, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water (28.1%), Glycerin, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Tranexamic Acid (1,000ppm), Niacinamide (1,000ppm), Stearic Acid, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Silica, Glyceryl Stearate, Beeswax, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Betaine, Trehalose, Citric Acid, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Squalane, Beta-Glucan, Dipropylene Glycol, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Disodium EDTA, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3530\" data-content-reference-end=\"3562\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3671\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3794\"><strong data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3794\">Dark Spots • Hyperpigmentation • Uneven Skin Tone • Dull Skin • Dryness • Sensitive Skin • Redness • Weak Skin Barrier</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/b4Wckj8mFpOFGPTZxe5Gp5ElzAJbk54IR0A0pV1K.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:33:15','2026-09-17 16:25:38'),(218,'Panthenol Retinol Facial Cream 55ml','panthenol-retinol-facial-cream-55ml','<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"455\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"86\">APLB Panthenol Retinol Facial Cream</strong> is a Korean anti-aging and moisturizing face cream formulated with <strong data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"181\">31.4% PANTHE RETIN CEN™</strong>, a combination of <strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"256\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Panthenol, and Retinol</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of fine lines, dullness, enlarged pores, uneven texture, and dehydration while providing soothing moisture and barrier support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"418\" data-content-reference-end=\"450\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"480\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qoeae\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"493\">Brand:</strong> APLB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jixv3e\" data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"549\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"518\">Product Name:</strong> Panthenol Retinol Facial Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpv8c6\" data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"566\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"561\">Size:</strong> 55ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"580\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"192ptxb\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"649\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"612\">Product Type:</strong> Anti-Aging &amp; Moisturizing Face Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzwzdi\" data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"664\">Texture:</strong> Smooth, creamy, moisturizing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13ihm7z\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"713\">Suitable For:</strong> Dry, dull, mature, textured, and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnd85b\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"825\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"776\">Formula:</strong> Fragrance-free, alcohol-free, essential-oil-free\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"846\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"1063\"><strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"877\">PANTHE RETIN CEN™ – 31.4%</strong><br data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"880\">\r\nA signature complex combining <strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"966\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Panthenol, and Retinol</strong> to provide moisturizing, soothing, and skin-renewing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1021\" data-content-reference-end=\"1053\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1164\"><strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1089\">Panthenol – 5,000ppm</strong><br data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\nHelps hydrate and soothe the skin while supporting the moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1318\"><strong data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1188\">Retinol – 1,000ppb</strong><br data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, uneven texture, and enlarged pores. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1271\" data-content-reference-end=\"1290\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1419\"><strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1352\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water</strong><br data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\nHelps calm stressed-looking skin and provides soothing moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1513\"><strong data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1443\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1446\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture for softer, plumper-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1597\"><strong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1541\">Squalane &amp; Beta-Glucan</strong><br data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1544\">\r\nHelp nourish the skin and support moisture retention.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1615\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hawwh9\" data-start=\"1616\" data-end=\"1674\">\r\n✨ Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"128r6j6\" data-start=\"1675\" data-end=\"1718\">\r\n🔄 Supports smoother-looking skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dkipsk\" data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\n💧 Provides refreshing and lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hlrvze\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n🌿 Helps soothe sensitive and stressed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hhjkxj\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1860\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of enlarged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pxee95\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1897\">\r\nHelps revitalize dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hicncq\" data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\nSupports skin elasticity and firmness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13sr147\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\nHelps maintain oil-water balance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"2009\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yy2yz7\" data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2054\">\r\nLightweight, comfortable moisturizing care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yzcjuz\" data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2117\">\r\nFragrance-free formula <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2049\" data-content-reference-end=\"2081\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2139\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2375\">The cream has a <strong data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2189\">smooth, moisturizing texture</strong> that spreads easily over the skin and leaves it feeling soft and comfortable. It is designed to provide nourishment without an overly heavy finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2302\" data-content-reference-end=\"2321\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2391\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2430\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2431\" data-end=\"2468\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6i25v\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2677\">\r\nBecause it contains <strong data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2615\">retinol</strong>, beginners should start gradually, preferably in the evening.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cm3xy7\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\nApply sunscreen every morning while using retinol.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2753\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"3704\"><strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"3666\">Water, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water (31.3%), Glycerin, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Panthenol (5,000ppm), Retinol (1,000ppb), Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, BHT, Sodium Hyaluronate, Stearic Acid, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Silica, Glyceryl Stearate, Beeswax, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Betaine, Trehalose, Citric Acid, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Squalane, Beta-Glucan, Dipropylene Glycol, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Disodium EDTA, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3613\" data-content-reference-end=\"3632\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3718\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3855\"><strong data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3855\">Fine Lines • Wrinkles • Dull Skin • Enlarged Pores • Rough Texture • Dryness • Dehydrated Skin • Loss of Elasticity • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/qRUgg8SCzSlO66veeNm593wRclxw1YyqLX3ueY63.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:35:20','2026-09-17 16:25:04'),(219,'Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream 55ml','zinc-niacinamide-facial-cream-55ml','<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"465\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"84\">APLB Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream</strong> is a lightweight Korean moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"163\">34.3% ZINC NIACIN CEN™</strong>, a synergistic complex of <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"249\">Zinc PCA, Niacinamide, and Centella Asiatica Leaf Water</strong>. It is designed to help control excess sebum, refine the appearance of pores, soothe sensitive skin, and improve dull, uneven-looking skin while providing lightweight hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"428\" data-content-reference-end=\"462\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"490\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qoeae\" data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"508\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"503\">Brand:</strong> APLB\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ls722m\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"558\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"528\">Product Name:</strong> Zinc Niacinamide Facial Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"115bg5z\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"590\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"561\" data-end=\"570\">Size:</strong> 55ml / 1.86 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"616\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"604\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1a5x4\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"636\">Product Type:</strong> Face Cream / Moisturizer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqi3vi\" data-start=\"662\" data-end=\"707\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"676\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, lotion-like cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c5hylo\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"727\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially oily, combination, acne-prone, and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9e7saz\" data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"821\">Fragrance:</strong> Fragrance-free\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"857\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"989\"><strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"871\">Zinc PCA</strong><br data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"874\">\r\nHelps regulate excess sebum and reduce unwanted shine, making it particularly useful for oily and combination skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1123\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1006\">Niacinamide</strong><br data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone and texture, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1235\"><strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1157\">Centella Asiatica Leaf Water</strong><br data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1160\">\r\nProvides soothing and calming care for sensitive or irritated-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1335\"><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1259\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture for softer, more hydrated-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1467\"><strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1363\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Squalane</strong><br data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1366\">\r\nHelp maintain moisture and support comfortable, nourished skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1427\" data-content-reference-end=\"1460\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1485\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ejexln\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1522\">\r\nHelps control excess oil and sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16k2cc5\" data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1572\">\r\nHelps minimize the appearance of enlarged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwmc6\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1602\">\r\nBrightens dull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"111qpig\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1647\">\r\nHelps improve uneven skin tone and texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzozez\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\nSoothes redness and irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22xmrw\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\nProvides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"51m46y\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\nHelps maintain oil-and-moisture balance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uv5vpr\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1783\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1onkd8q\" data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1818\">\r\nLeaves skin smooth and refreshed\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tah3v8\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1853\">\r\nNon-sticky and non-greasy finish\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"riirjq\" data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\nFragrance-free formula\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k043lx\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1961\">\r\nSuitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1917\" data-content-reference-end=\"1949\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1983\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2214\">The cream has a <strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2031\">light, lotion-like texture</strong> that spreads easily and absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky or greasy residue. It leaves the skin feeling moisturized, fresh, and balanced. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2165\" data-content-reference-end=\"2185\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2230\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2268\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kerpx4\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9jh83\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2387\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uji6ai\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\nPat lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dths71\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2449\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ufgsuj\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\nIn the morning, finish with sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2514\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"3405\"><strong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"3367\">Water, Centella Asiatica Leaf Water, Glycerin, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Butylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Zinc PCA, Niacinamide, Sodium Hyaluronate, Stearic Acid, Sodium Polyacryloyldimethyl Taurate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Trideceth-10, Silica, Glyceryl Stearate, Beeswax, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Betaine, Trehalose, Citric Acid, Nelumbo Nucifera Extract, Artemisia Annua Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Saccharomyces Ferment, Solanum Melongena (Eggplant) Fruit Extract, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Squalane, Beta-Glucan, Dipropylene Glycol, Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Extract, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Disodium EDTA, Propanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate.</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3339\" data-content-reference-end=\"3359\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"3407\" data-end=\"3419\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3548\"><strong data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3548\">Oily Skin • Combination Skin • Acne-Prone Skin • Enlarged Pores • Excess Sebum • Dull Skin • Uneven Texture • Sensitive Skin</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,16,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/aw4CxorjyOGjVvjyn53K1JUQFF91LwMwWPx1lwqY.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:39:06','2026-09-17 16:24:31'),(220,'Glutathione Niacinamide Body Wash 300ml','glutathione-niacinamide-body-wash-300ml','<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"408\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"93\">APLB Glutathione Niacinamide Body Wash</strong> is a Korean brightening and moisturizing body cleanser formulated with <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"248\">Glutathione, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica, and soothing botanical ingredients</strong>. It gently cleanses the skin while helping improve the appearance of dullness and uneven-looking skin tone, leaving the body feeling fresh, soft, and hydrated.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"433\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n<li data-s