 calming care for dry or sensitive-feeling skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1106\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1109\">\r\nHelps replenish moisture and maintain comfortable, hydrated skin after cleansing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1311\"><strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1214\">Botanical Extracts</strong><br data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\nPlant-derived ingredients provide additional antioxidant, soothing, and conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1329\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"del8m9\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n✨ Helps cleanse and refresh the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2nqjkw\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1417\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dull body skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13jyuzw\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\nPromotes a more even-looking skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15y15jq\" data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\nHelps maintain skin hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"199thfm\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n🌿 Soothes dry and sensitive-feeling skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oxpbq9\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\nSupports the skin moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltzju1\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1606\">\r\nHelps leave skin soft and smooth\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5gtark\" data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1643\">\r\nCreates a rich, comfortable lather\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13m8tts\" data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1671\">\r\nSuitable for everyday use\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bvm3t4\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1715\">\r\nIdeal for a brightening body-care routine\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1em04x8\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1737\">Texture &amp; Finish</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1978\">The body wash has a <strong data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1793\">smooth, easy-to-lather texture</strong> that effectively removes sweat, excess oil, dirt, and impurities without leaving the skin feeling excessively dry or tight. After rinsing, skin feels clean, refreshed, and comfortable.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1994\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2408\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w360nu\" data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2032\">\r\nWet your body with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vqeao6\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount onto your hands, a shower sponge, or body towel.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sxhgpm\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2179\">\r\nGently massage over the entire body to create a rich lather.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iayxa3\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2259\">\r\nPay extra attention to areas such as the neck, elbows, knees, and underarms.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a47co0\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with clean water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i5qr8k\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2367\">\r\nFollow with a body lotion or moisturizer for additional hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"doeskw\" data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2408\">\r\nUse daily during your shower routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zmk2l\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2422\">Best For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2546\"><strong data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2546\">Dull Body Skin • Uneven Skin Tone • Dry Skin • Rough Texture • Body Hydration • Daily Cleansing • Brightening Body Care</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,37,23,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/jRubp0eFQHBuI7iA3zy0MK4FhWYc5ltQwyeGG5lX.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:46:56','2026-