e)</strong> to enhance ingredient absorption into the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"868\" data-content-reference-end=\"901\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"n2rxyd\" data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\">Key Ingredients &amp; Benefits</h1>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1iscwak\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"926\">✨ Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"940\"><strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"940\">Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"130tk09\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6w4j6k\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\nHelps improve uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1vje5\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\nSupports a brighter and clearer complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3pkcw\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1121\">\r\nHelps prevent excess melanin production\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1236\">TXA is especially popular for addressing:<br>\r\n✔ Melasma appearance<br data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1188\">\r\n✔ Post-acne marks<br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\n✔ Sun-induced pigmentation</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"e36mrf\" data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1272\">✨ Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1286\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1286\">Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ege2ik\" data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1308\">\r\nBrightens dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3gs73\" data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"omuhnx\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\nImproves uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1njnrpj\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1413\">\r\nHelps minimize the appearance of pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fokwaw\" data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\nControls excess sebum production\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rb1nbg\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1488\">✨ Spicules (Hydrolyzed Sponge)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1502\"><strong data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1502\">Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1he3l8r\" data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\nTiny mineral-like micro structures that help improve absorption\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c130yd\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1622\">\r\nHelps active ingredients penetrate more effectively\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kq8cf5\" data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\nSupports smoother skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1773\">The serum contains spicule technology designed to enhance ingredient delivery. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1774\" data-content-reference-end=\"1793\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"aag4r3\" data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1809\">✨ Exosomes (Milk Exosomes)</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1823\"><strong data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1823\">Benefits:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1emueq5\" data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\nSupports skin renewal\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hn5tal\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1877\">\r\nHelps improve skin vitality\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4wu4h9\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1915\">\r\nProvides skin-conditioning benefits\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gfng8v\" data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1953\">\r\nHelps achieve smoother-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1958\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u8clsr\" data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1987\">💧 Hydrating Ingredients</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4tm9lz\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2001\">Glycerin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lsv85f\" data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2031\">\r\nAttracts and locks moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3j2oxd\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\nPrevents dryness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dl42pa\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2078\">\r\nKeeps skin soft and plump\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jdz811\" data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2102\">Sodium Hyaluronate</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xi93om\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\nProvides deep hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5lb8l7\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2162\">\r\nHelps maintain moisture balance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2190\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lx83se\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\nSoothes skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ixf57\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2236\">\r\nSupports skin barrier repair\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2241\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1hsz36o\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2279\">Additional Brightening Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yle5jc\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2298\">Alpha-Arbutin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"573h03\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2342\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of dark spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u2nnw7\" data-start=\"2343\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\nSupports a more even skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"109rgcv\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2406\">Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"df9tko\" data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\nProvides antioxidant protection\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17qyaq5\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2467\">\r\nHelps brighten dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"wmqu8j\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2493\">Gluconolactone (PHA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9iqol\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\nGentle exfoliation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3i41ps\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\nHelps improve skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2558\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ui7g8\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2602\">\r\nSupports smoother and firmer-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2641\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2623\" data-content-reference-end=\"2655\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2643\" data-end=\"2646\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"184hfs9\" data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2663\">Main Benefits</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2934\">✅ Brightens dull complexion<br data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\n✅ Helps fade the appearance of dark spots<br data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n✅ Improves uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2769\">\r\n✅ Refines skin texture<br data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\n✅ Helps minimize visible pores<br data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2827\">\r\n✅ Provides hydration and glow<br data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2859\">\r\n✅ Supports skin barrier health<br data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2892\">\r\n✅ Gives a smooth \"glass skin\" appearance</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2973\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2950\" data-content-reference-end=\"2969\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2989\">Texture</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9qtbw5\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3018\">\r\nLightweight serum texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pt4dzb\" data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\nFast absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aaroci\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\nNon-greasy finish\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bgdu4l\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\nMay provide a slight tingling sensation due to spicules\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3118\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tqc5ik\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3134\">Suitable For</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3327\">✔ Dull skin<br data-start=\"3147\" data-end=\"3150\">\r\n✔ Uneven skin tone<br data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3171\">\r\n✔ Hyperpigmentation-prone skin<br data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\n✔ Post-acne marks<br data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3224\">\r\n✔ Rough skin texture<br data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3247\">\r\n✔ Enlarged pores<br data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\n✔ Dehydrated skin<br data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3286\">\r\n✔ Sensitive skin (patch test recommended)</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3332\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1czlq6m\" data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3346\">How To Use</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3559\"><strong data-start=\"3348\" data-end=\"3359\">Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your face.<br data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3381\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3392\">Step 2:</strong> Apply toner if needed.<br data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3418\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3418\" data-end=\"3429\">Step 3:</strong> Apply 2–3 drops of serum on dry skin.<br data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3470\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3481\">Step 4:</strong> Gently massage until absorbed.<br data-start=\"3512\" data-end=\"3515\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3526\">Step 5:</strong> Apply moisturizer and sunscreen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3685\"><strong data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3581\">Recommended use:</strong> Once daily at first, then increase according to skin tolerance.<br data-start=\"3645\" data-end=\"3648\">\r\n<span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3644\" data-content-reference-end=\"3663\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3690\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"oodwz7\" data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3720\">Full Ingredient Highlights</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"4013\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w6oziw\" data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3736\">\r\nWater (Aqua)\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17e4rim\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3750\">\r\nNiacinamide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1paqhxx\" data-start=\"3751\" data-end=\"3768\">\r\nTranexamic Acid\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dmo3t5\" data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3779\">\r\nGlycerin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zddr4y\" data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3797\">\r\nButylene Glycol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3zedl\" data-start=\"3798\" data-end=\"3828\">\r\nHydrolyzed Sponge (Spicules)\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c0h5xn\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3849\">\r\nSodium Hyaluronate\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueksti\" data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3865\">\r\nAlpha-Arbutin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxf6ht\" data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3893\">\r\nAscorbic Acid (Vitamin C)\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d4zspx\" data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3910\">\r\nGluconolactone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"129klnt\" data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3931\">\r\nBetaine Salicylate\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dalpfn\" data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3943\">\r\nPanthenol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19q7iag\" data-start=\"3944\" data-end=\"3955\">\r\nAdenosine\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h82xcu\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3971\">\r\nMilk Exosomes\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gl9g07\" data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"4013\">\r\nsh-Oligopeptide-1 (EGF-related peptide)\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"4015\" data-end=\"4052\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3993\" data-content-reference-end=\"4025\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4057\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1e3qa1l\" data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4087\">Who Should Use This Serum?</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4247\"><strong data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4102\">Best for:</strong><br>\r\n⭐ Dark spot care routine<br data-start=\"4127\" data-end=\"4130\">\r\n⭐ Brightening routine<br data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4154\">\r\n⭐ Korean glass skin routine<br data-start=\"4181\" data-end=\"4184\">\r\n⭐ Uneven skin tone correction<br data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4216\">\r\n⭐ Post-acne pigmentation care</p>',NULL,NULL,12,81,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/06xOBBUF16PqpR6FmcoOZvuJnWRCUajFn3DMMQda.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 05:56:08','2026-09-18 07:50:45'),(223,'Carrotene IPMP Hydromelt Cleansing Balm 90ml','carrotene-ipmp-hydromelt-cleansing-balm-90ml','<p data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"475\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"156\">APRILSKIN Carrotene IPMP™ Hydromelt Cleansing Balm</strong> is a Korean cleansing balm designed to remove makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and pore impurities while helping care for blackheads, whiteheads, and sebaceous filaments. Its sorbet-like texture melts smoothly on the skin and emulsifies into a milky texture when mixed with water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"571\" data-content-reference-end=\"603\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"493\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1an04h1\" data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"598\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"533\">Deeply removes makeup &amp; sunscreen</strong> — melts away foundation, waterproof makeup, and daily sunscreen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6pfr7\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"630\">Helps clear clogged pores</strong> — targets blackheads, whiteheads, and sebaceous filaments.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"feoj9f\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"712\">Oil &amp; sebum care</strong> — Carrotene IPMP™ is designed to help manage excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bicggh\" data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"801\">Non-comedogenic formula</strong> — suitable for users concerned about clogged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvthxf\" data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"950\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"882\">Smooth melting texture</strong> — transforms from a balm into a milky emulsion when water is added.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uj5a8l\" data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1054\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"990\">Doesn\'t leave a heavy greasy film</strong> — rinses away comfortably while helping maintain skin softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3kmjzp\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1087\">Carrot-derived ingredients</strong> — contains carrot root water, carrot extract, carrot seed oil and beta-carotene.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13u3wc4\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1213\">Vegan certified &amp; dermatologist-tested</strong> according to the brand. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1366\" data-content-reference-end=\"1385\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1296\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1786\"><strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1317\">Carrotene IPMP™:</strong> Helps with excess sebum and pore impurities and is positioned by APRILSKIN as an acne-care ingredient.<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1447\">Coconut-derived oil:</strong> Helps dissolve makeup and sunscreen without aggressively stripping the skin.<br data-start=\"1524\" data-end=\"1527\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1562\">Beta-Carotene &amp; Carrot Extract:</strong> Antioxidant-supporting ingredients that contribute to the product\'s characteristic carrot color.<br data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1686\">Glycerin &amp; Sorbitol:</strong> Help provide a softer, more comfortable cleansing experience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1859\" data-content-reference-end=\"1891\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1804\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1856\"><strong data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1823\">All skin types</strong>, particularly skin dealing with:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i816by\" data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1882\">\r\nBlackheads &amp; whiteheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ex4d1t\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1904\">\r\nSebaceous filaments\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gvm3bt\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\nExcess oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4590y\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1933\">\r\nClogged pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fwah6u\" data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1969\">\r\nHeavy makeup or sunscreen buildup\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1985\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tlvkdi\" data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2042\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount with the included spatula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkeitm\" data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2084\">dry face with dry hands</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6epms\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2150\">\r\nGently massage, especially around makeup and congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v7uayp\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and massage until the balm becomes milky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2264\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wns0rj\" data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser if you prefer a <strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2347\">double-cleansing routine</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2454\" data-content-reference-end=\"2486\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2579\"><strong data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2397\">Size:</strong> 90ml / 3.04 fl. oz.<br data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2431\">Origin:</strong> South Korea<br data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2446\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2460\">Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types<br data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2490\">Texture:</strong> Sorbet-like cleansing balm<br data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2520\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2533\">Included:</strong> Spatula <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2642\" data-content-reference-end=\"2661\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2830\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2590\">Note:</strong> The official ingredient list includes several citrus/essential oils and fragrance-related components such as limonene and linalool, so very sensitive or fragrance-reactive skin should patch-test first.</p>',NULL,NULL,2,81,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/jnU1A5xCPGewVRECVOZmYifyWLWoKdvQ5FziJunq.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:36:59','2026-09-18 07:51:02'),(224,'TXA Niacinamide 99 Night Wrapping Mask 80ml','txa-niacinamide-99-night-wrapping-mask-80ml','<h1 style=\"margin: 1px 0px 2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Josefin Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\"><p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"500\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"152\">APRILSKIN TXA Niacinamide 99 Night Wrapping Mask</strong> is an overnight brightening and hydrating sleeping mask formulated with <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"266\">Niacinamide and Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</strong>. It is designed to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dullness, dark spots and enlarged-looking pores while providing overnight hydration. The product is <strong data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"443\">80ml</strong> and made in Korea. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"604\" data-content-reference-end=\"636\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n</h1><h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"518\">Key Benefits</h3><h1 style=\"margin: 1px 0px 2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Josefin Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"34r1r\" data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"594\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"554\">Brightens dull-looking skin</strong> and promotes a more radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uhe6dv\" data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"634\">Helps improve uneven skin tone</strong> and the appearance of dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sji8id\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"706\">Provides overnight hydration</strong> with multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12m8ief\" data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"781\">Supports the skin barrier</strong> with Ceramide NP.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"187xn0i\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"852\">Refines the look of skin texture and pores.</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5137m3\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n🌙 <strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"887\">Overnight wrapping effect</strong> helps keep the active ingredients in contact with the skin while sleeping.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s3r4a7\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1140\">\r\n🧬 Contains <strong data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1008\">5% Niacinamide (50,000 ppm)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1048\">1% Tranexamic Acid (10,000 ppm)</strong> according to the current official ingredient listing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1233\" data-content-reference-end=\"1252\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</h1><h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1161\">Key Ingredients</h3><h1 style=\"margin: 1px 0px 2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Josefin Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1285\"><strong data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1181\">Niacinamide 5%</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of skin, improve uneven tone and support a smoother-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1429\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1309\">Tranexamic Acid 1%</strong> – A brightening ingredient commonly used in skincare targeting the appearance of discoloration and uneven pigmentation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1543\"><strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1450\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – The formula contains several forms of hyaluronic acid to help attract and retain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1616\"><strong data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1560\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and maintain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1680\"><strong data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1631\">Allantoin</strong> – Helps provide a soothing and comfortable feel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1808\"><strong data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1711\">Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid)</strong> – Provides additional antioxidant and brightening support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1883\" data-content-reference-end=\"1902\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n</h1><h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1824\">How to Use</h3><h1 style=\"margin: 1px 0px 2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Josefin Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\n<ol data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuews7\" data-start=\"1825\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\nComplete your normal evening skincare routine with toner and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o70j0c\" data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1975\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of the wrapping mask evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8355af\" data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2013\">\r\nAvoid the <strong data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2012\">eye and mouth areas</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i19u98\" data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\nAllow the mask to <strong data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2075\">dry completely for around 15 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"133cyjp\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2102\">\r\nLeave it on overnight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jo2x8s\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\nIn the morning, gently remove the dried mask or rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2286\" data-content-reference-end=\"2305\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</h1><h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2250\">Product Details</h3><h1 style=\"margin: 1px 0px 2px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); font-family: &quot;Josefin Sans&quot;, sans-serif;\">\r\n<ul data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmqkvk\" data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2273\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2263\">Brand:</strong> APRILSKIN\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y74am6\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2327\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2288\">Product:</strong> TXA Niacinamide 99 Night Wrapping Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137fd8s\" data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2365\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2339\">Type:</strong> Overnight / Sleeping Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq6nku\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2382\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2377\">Size:</strong> 80ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15l4p32\" data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2464\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2402\">Key Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, uneven tone, dullness, dehydration, visible pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2496\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2481\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90x4jb\" data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2499\" data-end=\"2511\">Made in:</strong> Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2594\" data-content-reference-end=\"2626\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2716\"><strong data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2570\">Best for:</strong> Those looking for an overnight treatment to target <strong data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2715\">dark spots, uneven skin tone and dullness while keeping the skin hydrated and comfortable</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2976\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><em data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2938\">Note: Despite the product name “TXA Niacinamide 99,” the official ingredient listing shows <strong data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2851\">5% niacinamide and 1% tranexamic acid</strong>; “99” is part of the product/range name rather than indicating 99% TXA concentration.</em></p></h1>',NULL,NULL,23,81,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/tPoo1WrZjDPkXNLxzChGqqAgaMnnRMQs6FTqzHOW.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:39:00','2026-09-18 07:51:22'),(225,'Real Calendula Peel Off Pack 100ml','real-calendula-peel-off-pack-100ml','<p data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"449\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"132\">APRILSKIN Real Calendula Peel Off Pack</strong> is a gentle exfoliating peel-off mask designed to remove dead skin cells, excess sebum, dirt, and pore impurities while helping soothe and brighten the skin. It contains <strong data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"355\">real Calendula Flower, Niacinamide, PHA, and BHA</strong> to improve the appearance of skin texture and radiance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"569\" data-content-reference-end=\"601\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"467\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w238q1\" data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"563\">\r\n🌼 <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"498\">Soothes &amp; Calms Skin</strong> – Calendula helps calm the appearance of redness and irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbzbmb\" data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"663\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"591\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Niacinamide helps promote a more even and radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xj3t5n\" data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"696\">Removes Dead Skin Cells</strong> – PHA and BHA provide gentle exfoliation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e5bvqg\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"837\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"765\">Helps Clean Pores</strong> – Helps remove excess oil, dirt, blackheads, and other pore impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bacfta\" data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"877\">Leaves Skin Smooth &amp; Refreshed</strong> – Helps improve rough-looking texture and reveal softer skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9cyeyk\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"959\">Sebum Care</strong> – Helps control excess oil for a cleaner, fresher appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g0djf\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1051\">Refines Skin Texture</strong> – Regular use can help skin look smoother and more refined. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1258\" data-content-reference-end=\"1290\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1170\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1365\"><strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1192\">Calendula Flower</strong> – Rich in antioxidants and known for its soothing properties. APRILSKIN states that the formula contains <strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1326\">2,000 ppm real Calendula</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1469\" data-content-reference-end=\"1488\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1528\"><strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1387\">Niacinamide 0.1%</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of skin, improve uneven tone, and minimize the look of enlarged pores. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1614\" data-content-reference-end=\"1633\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1629\"><strong data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1543\">PHA + BHA</strong> – Help exfoliate dead skin cells and improve the appearance of rough, congested skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1643\">Caffeine</strong> – Helps soothe the skin and reduce the appearance of puffiness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1767\"><strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1735\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Provides antioxidant support.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1769\" data-end=\"1783\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dehyio\" data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1851\">\r\nCleanse your face and make sure the skin is <strong data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1850\">completely dry</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x2rewf\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\nApply an even layer to the face, avoiding the <strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1929\">eyes, lips, and hairline</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mrc92k\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2007\">\r\nLeave it on for approximately <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1981\">20–25 minutes</strong>, or until completely dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c8cgwb\" data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\nGently peel the mask from the outer edges.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"174a3b9\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2108\">\r\nWipe away any remaining residue with a clean towel.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1si6tj4\" data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2138\">1–2 times per week</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2245\" data-content-reference-end=\"2277\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2179\" data-end=\"2198\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmqkvk\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2222\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2212\">Brand:</strong> APRILSKIN\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p1w50w\" data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2237\">Product:</strong> Real Calendula Peel Off Pack\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5bosh\" data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2278\">Type:</strong> Peel-Off Face Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy6f5\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2309\">Size:</strong> 100g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yljoyj\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2337\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Calendula, Niacinamide, PHA, BHA, Caffeine\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pxp7lb\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2450\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2396\">Benefits:</strong> Exfoliating, soothing, brightening, pore &amp; sebum care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2451\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2467\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2496\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ki1sho\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2531\">Vegan Certified:</strong> Yes <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2636\" data-content-reference-end=\"2668\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2691\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2588\">Best for:</strong> Dull, rough, oily, or congested skin that needs gentle exfoliation and a smoother, fresher appearance.</p>',NULL,NULL,26,81,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/HSFQiQKo7lOqVUk9fX3m2t7xB0CnIsCBir30PDer.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:41:42','2026-09-18 07:51:43'),(226,'Real Carrotene Acne Foam Cleanser 120ml','real-carrotene-acne-foam-cleanser-120ml','<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"530\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"101\">APRILSKIN Real Carrotene Acne Foam Cleanser</strong> is a deep-cleansing facial foam specially formulated for <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"201\">oily, combination, and acne-prone skin</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"245\">Salicylic Acid (5,000 ppm)</strong> with carrot-derived ingredients to help remove excess sebum, impurities and dead skin cells while leaving the skin feeling fresh and clean. The official APRILSKIN listing identifies it as suitable for all skin types, particularly acne-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"493\" data-content-reference-end=\"525\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"548\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b34dii\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"648\">\r\n🥕 <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"577\">Carrot Complex Care</strong> – Contains Carrot Root Water, Carrot Root Extract and Carrot Seed Oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lmq010\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"672\">Deep Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dirt, excess oil and daily impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16spuoj\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"822\">\r\n🧪 <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"760\">Salicylic Acid 5,000 ppm</strong> – Helps exfoliate dead skin cells and care for clogged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ctm5za\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"953\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"863\">Helps Maintain Comfortable Skin</strong> – Glycerin and other conditioning ingredients support a comfortable cleansing experience.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"186ax1k\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"983\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave rough and uneven-looking skin feeling smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iys6im\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1068\">Sebum Control</strong> – Helps manage excess oil for a cleaner, fresher complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h23kcu\" data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n🌱 <strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1164\">Beta-Carotene &amp; Vitamin E</strong> – Provide antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1041twj\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1323\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1221\">Rich Creamy Foam</strong> – Creates a dense lather for a refreshing cleansing experience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1274\" data-content-reference-end=\"1307\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1344\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1531\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1374\">Salicylic Acid 5,000 ppm</strong> – A BHA that helps remove dead skin cells and excess sebum, making it particularly useful for congested and oily skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1478\" data-content-reference-end=\"1497\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1675\"><strong data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1565\">Carrot Root Water 10,000 ppm</strong> – One of the main carrot-derived ingredients in the formula, designed to support sebum and skin-texture care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1772\"><strong data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1718\">Carrot Root Extract &amp; Carrot Seed Oil</strong> – Help provide antioxidant and conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1861\"><strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1795\">Tea Tree Leaf Oil</strong> – Traditionally used in skincare for blemish-prone and oily skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1981\"><strong data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1905\">Beta-Carotene &amp; Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Antioxidant-supporting ingredients. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1910\" data-content-reference-end=\"1943\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"1997\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xfyju6\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2036\">\r\nWet your hands and face with water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6kcjf\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2095\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cleanser onto your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wzp7ei\" data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\nAdd water and create a rich lather.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ezmbdw\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2174\">\r\nGently massage over the entire face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3wnzba\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2253\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2178\" data-content-reference-end=\"2197\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2274\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cmqkvk\" data-start=\"2275\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2287\">Brand:</strong> APRILSKIN\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hy07rt\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2312\">Product:</strong> Real Carrotene Acne Foam Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttsngl\" data-start=\"2347\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2349\" data-end=\"2358\">Size:</strong> 120ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zmpla\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2397\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2376\">Type:</strong> Facial Foam Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hz9kw\" data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2457\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2414\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, especially acne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vm26k7\" data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2562\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2480\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Salicylic Acid, Carrot Root Water, Carrot Extract, Carrot Seed Oil, Beta-Carotene\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b4i2tr\" data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2583\">Main Concerns:</strong> Excess oil, clogged pores, blemishes, rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"truduq\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2650\">Made in:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2607\" data-content-reference-end=\"2639\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2853\"><strong data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2715\">Best for:</strong> Oily, combination and acne-prone skin looking for a cleanser that provides <strong data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2852\">deep cleansing, sebum control and gentle exfoliating care</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3005\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><em data-start=\"2855\" data-end=\"3005\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Note: Because the formula contains salicylic acid and several essential oils, very sensitive skin may benefit from patch testing before regular use.</em></p>',NULL,NULL,3,81,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/pckotMWVAO6uBafoELcWS6welOcJaBLeR0U2yvhr.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:45:05','2026-09-18 07:52:00'),(227,'TXA Booster Shot 30ml','txa-booster-shot-30ml','<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"442\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"62\">ARENCIA TXA Booster Shot</strong> is a concentrated Korean brightening treatment designed to target <strong data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"211\">dark spots, hyperpigmentation, post-acne marks, dullness, and uneven skin tone</strong>. It contains <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"253\">5% Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</strong> along with Niacinamide, peptides, ceramides, Panthenol, Glutathione, and a Vitamin C derivative to support brighter, smoother, healthier-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"405\" data-content-reference-end=\"437\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"460\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11frac7\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"583\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"503\">Targets Dark Spots &amp; Pigmentation</strong> – 5% TXA helps improve the appearance of discoloration and stubborn dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gm7aex\" data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"707\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"619\">Brightens Uneven Skin Tone</strong> – Niacinamide and Vitamin C derivative help promote a clearer, more radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15q461u\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"809\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"735\">Provides Hydration</strong> – Glycerin, Panthenol and Sodium Hyaluronate help maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wmazaw\" data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"845\">Supports the Skin Barrier</strong> – Contains <strong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"881\">5 types of Ceramides</strong> and Panthenol to help strengthen and protect the moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aj9x4i\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"977\">Firmer-Looking Skin</strong> – A <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1004\">10-peptide complex</strong> helps support smoother and more elastic-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5t321z\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1165\">\r\n🍇 <strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1084\">Antioxidant Care</strong> – Glutathione, pomegranate extract and Ferulic Acid provide antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ro6jb\" data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1194\">Lightweight Texture</strong> – Designed to absorb comfortably without a heavy or greasy feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1252\" data-content-reference-end=\"1284\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1321\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1450\"><strong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1358\">Tranexamic Acid 5% (50,000 ppm)</strong> – The hero ingredient, helping target the appearance of dark spots and uneven pigmentation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1562\"><strong data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1467\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten the complexion, improve the look of uneven tone and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1730\"><strong data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1586\">10-Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes peptides such as Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 and Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4 to support smoother and firmer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1827\"><strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1766\">Ceramides NP, NS, AS, AP &amp; EOP</strong> – Help strengthen the skin barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1926\"><strong data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1844\">Glutathione</strong> – An antioxidant ingredient that supports a brighter, clearer-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2029\"><strong data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"1952\">Ethyl Ascorbyl Ether</strong> – A Vitamin C derivative that provides brightening and antioxidant benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2139\"><strong data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2065\">Panthenol &amp; Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Help soothe and hydrate the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2086\" data-content-reference-end=\"2119\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2155\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2194\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2glge\" data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"2228\" data-end=\"2248\">TXA Booster Shot</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1807nrq\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\nApply evenly over the face or directly to areas with dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nw0wxx\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2364\">\r\nGently massage or pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2392\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pzlfoh\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2523\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2432\">Use sunscreen during the daytime</strong> for better protection against further discoloration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2466\" data-content-reference-end=\"2486\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2544\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2566\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2558\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o9w0va\" data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2581\">Product:</strong> TXA Booster Shot\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtv1a3\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2610\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t0zw4a\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2642\">Type:</strong> Brightening Treatment / Booster\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rc25ql\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2696\">Key Ingredient:</strong> 5% Tranexamic Acid\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l95s31\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2736\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, pigmentation, acne marks, dullness, uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2833\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2818\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17c8vj3\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2848\">Made in:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1an6wod\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2969\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2878\">Shelf Life:</strong> 36 months from manufacture; 12 months after opening. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2895\" data-content-reference-end=\"2914\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3148\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2984\">Best for:</strong> Those looking for a targeted brightening product to help improve <strong data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3099\">dark spots, pigmentation and uneven skin tone</strong> while also providing hydration and barrier care.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/zylnc259VPjTpuMhsdratFQoeU8VLYYecDIERyjM.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:55:15','2026-09-17 12:49:27'),(228,'Eraser Shot Glycolic Acid Booster 30ml','eraser-shot-glycolic-acid-booster-30ml','<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"458\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"96\">ARENCIA Eraser Shot Glycolic Acid Booster</strong> is a lightweight leave-on exfoliating treatment designed to improve <strong data-start=\"165\" data-end=\"246\">rough skin texture, clogged pores, dullness, uneven tone, and post-acne marks</strong>. Its multi-acid formula combines <strong data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"353\">Glycolic Acid (AHA), Salicylic Acid (BHA), and Lactobionic Acid (PHA)</strong> with soothing ingredients such as Centella Asiatica and Panthenol. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"421\" data-content-reference-end=\"453\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"476\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mv0axz\" data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"587\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"507\">Smooths Rough Texture</strong> – Glycolic Acid helps remove dead skin cells and refine uneven-looking texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rqluty\" data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"615\">Helps Unclog Pores</strong> – Salicylic Acid penetrates into pores to help clear excess sebum and buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u3dmw0\" data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"723\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Exfoliation helps reveal a fresher and more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"380p8w\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"898\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"836\">Helps Improve Post-Acne Marks</strong> – Supports a more even-looking skin tone with consistent use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9qt51c\" data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"938\">Refines Enlarged-Looking Pores</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of pores and skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbt37\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1018\">Soothes Skin</strong> – Centella Asiatica, Madecassoside and Panthenol help maintain skin comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10unghi\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1123\">Provides Hydration</strong> – Hyaluronic Acid, Glycerin and Panthenol help prevent the skin from feeling overly dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18yc39b\" data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1367\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1248\">Supports the Skin Barrier</strong> – Ceramide NP and soothing ingredients help maintain a healthy moisture barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1318\" data-content-reference-end=\"1350\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1388\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1499\"><strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1413\">Glycolic Acid (AHA)</strong> – Helps exfoliate dead skin cells from the surface, improving roughness and dullness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1589\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1525\">Salicylic Acid (BHA)</strong> – Helps penetrate pores and remove excess sebum and impurities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1700\"><strong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1617\">Lactobionic Acid (PHA)</strong> – Provides additional, gentler exfoliation while supporting smoother-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1796\"><strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1717\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of uneven skin tone and supports skin balance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1868\"><strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1835\">Centella Asiatica + Madecassoside</strong> – Help soothe and calm the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1940\"><strong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1883\">Panthenol</strong> – Provides hydration and helps support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2047\"><strong data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1969\">Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and maintain a hydrated, plump-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2147\"><strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2064\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps support the skin\'s moisture barrier. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2093\" data-content-reference-end=\"2125\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2163\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2202\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cim1ns\" data-start=\"2203\" data-end=\"2263\">\r\nApply a small amount of the booster evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykg86y\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2293\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93jfrg\" data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aeja35\" data-start=\"2324\" data-end=\"2503\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2355\">Start 2–3 times per week</strong>, especially if you are new to chemical exfoliants, and increase gradually according to your skin\'s tolerance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2444\" data-content-reference-end=\"2476\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e5vmi4\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2543\">sunscreen during the daytime</strong>, as exfoliating acids can increase sun sensitivity.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2616\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"3147\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2638\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2630\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nk4l4e\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2653\">Product:</strong> Eraser Shot Glycolic Acid Booster\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2690\" data-end=\"2699\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0zm9j\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2748\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2716\">Type:</strong> Exfoliating Booster / Treatment\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4c037v\" data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2765\">Key Acids:</strong> Glycolic Acid (AHA), Salicylic Acid (BHA), Lactobionic Acid (PHA)\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bl20rn\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2852\">Main Concerns:</strong> Rough texture, clogged pores, dullness, uneven tone, post-acne marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v9jhjs\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2936\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, fast-absorbing cream/booster\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dv8teb\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3083\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"2996\">Skin Types:</strong> Normal, combination, oily and sensitive skin according to retailer product information\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3147\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3097\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3083\" data-content-reference-end=\"3102\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3299\"><strong data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3162\">Best for:</strong> Oily, combination, acne-prone or textured skin that needs <strong data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3298\">gentle exfoliation, pore care and a smoother, brighter-looking complexion</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3525\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3315\">Important:</strong> Since this product contains multiple exfoliating acids, avoid combining it initially with other strong exfoliants or retinoids if your skin is sensitive. Patch testing and gradual introduction are recommended.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/dtYZJlPtc3NUBDAEzNgAcTU7a7xRWyFUZsEEt1ll.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 08:57:53','2026-09-17 12:49:05'),(229,'PDRN Booster Shot for Face & Eye Moisturizer 30ml','pdrn-booster-shot-for-face-eye-moisturizer-30ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"516\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"91\">ARENCIA PDRN Booster Shot</strong> is a multifunctional Korean moisturizer designed for both the <strong data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"184\">face and delicate eye area</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"316\">PDRN (Sodium DNA), Niacinamide, peptides, multiple types of Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, Ceramide NP, and Adenosine</strong> to provide intensive hydration while supporting firmer, smoother, brighter-looking skin. The official ARENCIA ingredient list confirms <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"477\">Sodium DNA at 100 ppm</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"479\" data-content-reference-end=\"511\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"534\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l46vvl\" data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"559\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid help replenish and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yu0wmd\" data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"730\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"655\">PDRN Skin Care</strong> – Sodium DNA helps support a healthier, more resilient-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi94z0\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"832\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"755\">Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"153lucx\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"948\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"861\">Firmer-Looking Skin</strong> – A multi-peptide complex supports the appearance of improved elasticity and firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9gjf4n\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n👁️ <strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"974\">Face &amp; Eye Care</strong> – Can be used around the delicate eye area as well as across the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t171v\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1142\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1071\">Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP and Panthenol help maintain the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jbpj83\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1170\">Smooths Fine Lines</strong> – Adenosine and peptides help improve the appearance of fine lines.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzd39q\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1394\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1268\">Plumper-Looking Skin</strong> – Hyaluronic Acid and moisturizing ingredients help skin appear softer and more supple. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1345\" data-content-reference-end=\"1377\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1415\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1512\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1446\">PDRN / Sodium DNA 100 ppm</strong> – Helps support skin recovery and a healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1529\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1826\"><strong data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1661\">Multi-Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes peptides such as Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4 and several other peptides to support smoother, firmer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1855\">Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Contains multiple molecular forms of Hyaluronic Acid for layered hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2023\"><strong data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1950\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2075\"><strong data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2038\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps hydrate and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2171\"><strong data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2090\">Adenosine</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and promotes smoother-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2283\"><strong data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2185\">Collagen</strong> – Helps condition the skin and support a supple appearance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2229\" data-content-reference-end=\"2248\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2299\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2338\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3n2dqq\" data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2394\">PDRN Booster Shot</strong> to the face and eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cswpb4\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\nGently spread and pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mvwr4\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\nFor targeted areas, apply <strong data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2505\">two layers</strong> and allow each layer to absorb.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yrkphc\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2689\">\r\nUse as the cream/moisturizer step in your skincare routine. The official ARENCIA instructions allow daily use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2617\" data-content-reference-end=\"2636\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2710\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"3158\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2724\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a4yhgp\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2747\">Product:</strong> PDRN Booster Shot for Face &amp; Eye Moisturizer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtv1a3\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2824\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2804\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d9kvie\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2869\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2836\">Type:</strong> Face &amp; Eye Moisturizer / Booster\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gzwm9u\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2892\">Key Ingredients:</strong> PDRN (Sodium DNA), Niacinamide, Peptides, Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide NP, Panthenol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15pq9d4\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3061\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2995\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dullness, fine lines, loss of firmness, uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3078\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c0026a\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3158\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3108\">Made in:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3068\" data-content-reference-end=\"3087\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3308\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3173\">Best for:</strong> Dry, dehydrated, dull, or mature-looking skin that needs <strong data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3292\">hydration, barrier support, brightening, and firming care</strong> in one product.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/u8nzbB8zfk611bO9Vd2akmte4ooxfDvwwKLZKtwZ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:00:14','2026-09-17 12:48:26'),(230,'NAD+ Booster Shot 30ml','nad-booster-shot-30ml','<p data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"455\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"64\">ARENCIA NAD+ Booster Shot</strong> is a Korean anti-aging and revitalizing treatment designed for <strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"183\">dull, tired-looking, dry, and loss-of-firmness skin</strong>. The formula combines <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"333\">NAD+ Complex, Niacinamide, Resveratrol, Adenosine, 5 types of Ceramides, Peptides, Squalane, Panthenol, and Hyaluronic Acid</strong> to support hydration, skin barrier care, elasticity, and a more radiant complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"418\" data-content-reference-end=\"451\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"473\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8b9i5r\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"504\">Revitalizes Dull Skin</strong> – Helps tired-looking skin appear fresher and more radiant.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xr6cwl\" data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"670\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"599\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – Peptides, Adenosine, and NAD+ support firmer, smoother-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ey6wp\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"694\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Squalane, Panthenol, Glycerin, and Sodium Hyaluronate help maintain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhdi2x\" data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"882\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"813\">Strengthens the Skin Barrier</strong> – Contains <strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"849\">5 types of Ceramides</strong> to support the moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ee0enb\" data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"985\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"908\">Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72y3xr\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1017\">Antioxidant Protection</strong> – Resveratrol and grape extract provide antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tt7nlx\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1103\">Anti-Aging Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of fine lines, loss of firmness, and rough texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t3lkqt\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1336\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1221\">Lightweight Cream Texture</strong> – Nourishing but designed to feel comfortable rather than heavy on the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1288\" data-content-reference-end=\"1320\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1357\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1479\"><strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1378\">NAD+ Complex 5%</strong> – The hero complex, formulated to support skin vitality and a refreshed, healthy-looking appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1588\"><strong data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1496\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten the complexion, improve uneven-looking tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1712\"><strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1605\">Resveratrol</strong> – An antioxidant ingredient that helps protect against oxidative stress and supports radiant-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1819\"><strong data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1729\">5 Ceramides</strong> – Ceramide NP, NS, AS, AP, and EOP help reinforce the skin barrier and maintain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2001\"><strong data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1840\">Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes several peptides such as Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and others to support smoother and firmer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2075\"><strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2016\">Adenosine</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2194\"><strong data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2101\">Squalane &amp; Panthenol</strong> – Provide moisturizing and skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2141\" data-content-reference-end=\"2160\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2210\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2249\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i27gz\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2305\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2304\">NAD+ Booster Shot</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2306\" data-end=\"2345\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7hpqsv\" data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\nGently massage or pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzby6\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2418\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2417\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10kt59g\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2502\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2431\" data-content-reference-end=\"2451\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2523\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2525\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2537\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13h628b\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2548\" data-end=\"2560\">Product:</strong> NAD+ Booster Shot\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qtv1a3\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2590\">Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0gkfe\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2622\">Type:</strong> Booster / Anti-Aging Treatment\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kmxca8\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2691\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2675\">Key Ingredient:</strong> 5% NAD+ Complex\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a95q0o\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2776\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2712\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, dryness, fine lines, loss of firmness, uneven texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2808\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2793\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2834\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2811\" data-end=\"2822\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s0s6af\" data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2852\">Shelf Life:</strong> 36 months from manufacture / 12 months after opening <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2855\" data-content-reference-end=\"2874\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"3074\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2958\">Best for:</strong> Skin that looks <strong data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3016\">dull, tired, dehydrated, or less firm</strong> and needs hydration, barrier support and anti-aging care.</p>',NULL,NULL,12,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/CwdqLhulcpoLjX3YZ4HWFtZFGKFeTQQWCRjgxcOc.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:02:27','2026-09-17 12:48:04'),(231,'Rice Mucin Glow Serum 30ml','rice-mucin-glow-serum-30ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-8\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-8\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-8\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-18\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"c6492002-fbc1-4004-9182-550735834bed\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"385\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"72\">ARENCIA Rice Mucin Glow Serum</strong> is a Korean brightening and hydrating serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"232\">fermented rice extract, niacinamide, hydrolyzed collagen, and multiple types of hyaluronic acid</strong>. It is designed to improve dullness, uneven-looking skin tone and rough texture while providing a soft, dewy glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"348\" data-content-reference-end=\"380\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"403\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iv9ycp\" data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"428\">Rice Glow Care</strong> – Fermented rice extract helps promote a naturally radiant, healthy-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32vhxg\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"544\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dullness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1acwo6c\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"648\">Intense Hydration</strong> – A multi-molecular Hyaluronic Acid complex helps attract and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rb1uyk\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"762\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – Hydrolyzed Collagen helps skin look smoother and more supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"en1l5q\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"909\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"851\">Glass-Skin Glow</strong> – Helps create a hydrated, plump and luminous appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1imq9ok\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"986\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"940\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Helps refine rough and uneven-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e58yxl\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1019\">Soothing &amp; Barrier Care</strong> – Panthenol and Beta-Glucan help keep skin comfortable and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1poxu6h\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1239\">\r\n💫 <strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1119\">Anti-Aging Support</strong> – Adenosine and Retinal provide additional care for the appearance of fine lines. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1190\" data-content-reference-end=\"1223\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1260\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1371\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1287\">Rice Ferment Filtrate</strong> – The main ingredient, helping nourish and enhance the appearance of skin radiance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1466\"><strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1388\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull skin, improve uneven tone and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1555\"><strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1491\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of skin firmness and elasticity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1701\"><strong data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1584\">Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Contains <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1666\">Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid and Hyaluronic Acid</strong> to provide long-lasting hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1716\">Adenosine</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and supports smoother-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1862\"><strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1826\">Panthenol &amp; Beta-Glucan</strong> – Help hydrate and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"2002\"><strong data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1906\">Tranexamic Acid &amp; Vitamin C Derivative</strong> – Provide additional brightening and antioxidant support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1949\" data-content-reference-end=\"1981\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2018\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2057\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppgq1w\" data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2101\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2141\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2177\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ioyg4z\" data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2208\">morning and evening</strong> as part of your daily skincare routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2228\" data-content-reference-end=\"2247\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2307\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2329\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2321\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kl5hxz\" data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2366\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2332\" data-end=\"2344\">Product:</strong> Rice Mucin Glow Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"2367\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2378\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x2re8b\" data-start=\"2384\" data-end=\"2425\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2395\">Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Hydrating Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xxxui4\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2448\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Ferment Filtrate, Niacinamide, Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5uf7cb\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2531\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, dryness, uneven tone, rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2594\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2623\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2597\" data-content-reference-end=\"2629\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2797\"><strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2688\">Best for:</strong> Dull, dehydrated or uneven-looking skin that needs <strong data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2796\">hydration, brightening and a healthy glass-skin glow</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"3038\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2808\">Note:</strong> The ingredient list also contains <strong data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2902\">retinal, retinyl palmitate and capryloyl salicylic acid</strong>, so if your skin is sensitive or you already use retinoids/acids, introduce this serum gradually.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,11,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/0UulfOhi4Px9DszICDd6z6K4e3G0BqyCaKlZR14h.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:05:21','2026-09-17 12:47:42'),(232,'Pore Melt Phyto PDRN Cleansing Balm 90ml','pore-melt-phyto-pdrn-cleansing-balm-90ml','<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"585\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"100\">ARENCIA Pore Melt Phyto PDRN Cleansing Balm</strong> is a gentle yet effective Korean cleansing balm designed to remove <strong data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"236\">makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, blackheads, and pore impurities</strong>. Its soft balm texture melts into a silky oil on dry skin and emulsifies with water for easy rinsing. The formula combines <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"477\">Phyto PDRN (Sodium DNA), Ceramide NP, Triple Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, Centella Asiatica, and digestive enzymes</strong> to cleanse while helping maintain skin hydration and barrier comfort. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"548\" data-content-reference-end=\"580\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"603\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zx82g2\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"640\">Removes Makeup &amp; Sunscreen</strong> – Effectively dissolves daily makeup, waterproof products, sunscreen, and oil-based impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bqro0o\" data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"829\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"767\">Pore &amp; Blackhead Care</strong> – Helps remove excess sebum and buildup from congested pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7mwkun\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"928\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"858\">Hydrating Cleansing</strong> – Triple Hyaluronic Acid helps keep skin moisturized after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a3kai6\" data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"953\">Phyto PDRN Care</strong> – Sodium DNA helps support skin moisture and comfort during cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mkttr\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1056\">Supports Skin Barrier</strong> – Ceramide NP and Panthenol help maintain the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxr1do\" data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1150\">Soothing Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica, Green Tea, and Houttuynia Cordata help keep skin feeling comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppfqr\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1276\">Gentle Exfoliating Support</strong> – Papain, Bromelain, and Protease help loosen dead skin and pore buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1918d6u\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1498\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1383\">Fresh, Non-Tight Finish</strong> – Designed to cleanse without leaving skin feeling excessively dry or tight. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1449\" data-content-reference-end=\"1481\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1519\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1620\"><strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1548\">Phyto PDRN / Sodium DNA</strong> – Helps support skin moisture and comfort during the cleansing process.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1697\"><strong data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1637\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps strengthen and protect the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1845\"><strong data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1725\">Triple Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Contains Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, and Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate for multi-level hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1900\"><strong data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1860\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps moisturize and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1995\"><strong data-start=\"1902\" data-end=\"1944\">Centella Asiatica &amp; Houttuynia Cordata</strong> – Provide soothing and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2089\"><strong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2030\">Papain + Bromelain + Protease</strong> – Enzymes that help loosen dead skin cells and impurities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2195\"><strong data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2112\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and soothing support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2141\" data-content-reference-end=\"2173\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2197\" data-end=\"2211\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8o6je\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount using the spatula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kkeitm\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2304\">\r\nApply to a <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2303\">dry face with dry hands</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uj803u\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2409\">\r\nGently massage over the face, focusing on areas with makeup, sunscreen, blackheads, and excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9wel5o\" data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\nAdd a little water and massage until the balm becomes a <strong data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2487\">milky emulsion</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ai47k\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser for a complete <strong data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2611\">double-cleansing routine</strong> if desired. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2602\" data-content-reference-end=\"2634\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2663\" data-end=\"2682\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2696\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jwwo5j\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2719\">Product:</strong> Pore Melt Phyto PDRN Cleansing Balm\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wq4e2n\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2772\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2767\">Size:</strong> 90ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15mwj9e\" data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2816\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2784\">Type:</strong> Cleansing Balm / Makeup Remover\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11kkqiu\" data-start=\"2817\" data-end=\"2910\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2839\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Phyto PDRN, Ceramide NP, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, Centella Asiatica\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k8yfeh\" data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2999\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2931\">Main Concerns:</strong> Blackheads, clogged pores, excess sebum, makeup &amp; sunscreen buildup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4xquuq\" data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3099\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3016\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, including sensitive skin according to retailer product information\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3163\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3113\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3099\" data-content-reference-end=\"3131\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3324\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3178\">Best for:</strong> Those looking for a cleansing balm that provides <strong data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3323\">deep pore cleansing and makeup removal while maintaining hydration and skin-barrier comfort</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,2,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/WuOPNJRhmKOWVUnD4LqvLQkvLC6lNUB8WNh7glsk.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:07:18','2026-09-17 12:47:22'),(233,'Green Tea + LHA Deep Pore Rice Cake Cleanser 150ml','green-tea-lha-deep-pore-rice-cake-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"484\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"118\">ARENCIA Green Tea + LHA Deep Pore Rice Cake Cleanser</strong> is a Korean deep-cleansing facial wash designed to remove <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"237\">excess sebum, dirt, dead skin cells, and pore impurities</strong> while helping improve the appearance of rough and congested skin. Its unique soft, stretchy <strong data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"353\">“rice cake” texture</strong> adheres gently to the skin and creates a rich lather for a thorough yet comfortable cleanse. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"447\" data-content-reference-end=\"479\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"502\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9da9cv\" data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"592\">\r\n🍵 <strong data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"532\">Deep Pore Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove excess oil, dirt, and impurities from pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"183ltpe\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"698\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"619\">Gentle Exfoliation</strong> – LHA and Salicylic Acid help remove dead skin cells and improve skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6rflh5\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"730\">Blackhead &amp; Sebum Care</strong> – Helps reduce pore buildup and excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t4q25u\" data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"809\">Soothing Green Tea Care</strong> – Green Tea Extract provides antioxidant and soothing benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ktc8wa\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"906\">Helps Maintain Moisture</strong> – Glycerin, Panthenol, and Allantoin help keep skin comfortable after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vaz9qg\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1018\">Smoother-Looking Skin</strong> – Helps refine rough and uneven skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xw3gc8\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1088\">Bakuchiol Care</strong> – Provides antioxidant support and helps promote a smoother, healthier-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ocumtj\" data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\n🍚 <strong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1213\">Unique Rice Cake Texture</strong> – The soft, chewy texture gently adheres to the skin to help lift impurities. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1280\" data-content-reference-end=\"1312\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1350\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1466\"><strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1386\">LHA (Capryloyl Salicylic Acid)</strong> – A gentle exfoliating acid that helps remove dead skin cells and pore buildup.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1646\"><strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1492\">Salicylic Acid (BHA)</strong> – Helps dissolve excess sebum and impurities within pores, making it especially useful for oily and congested skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1592\" data-content-reference-end=\"1611\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1768\"><strong data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1669\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and soothing benefits while helping maintain a balanced-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1859\"><strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1783\">Bakuchiol</strong> – An antioxidant ingredient that supports smoother and firmer-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1942\"><strong data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1886\">Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong> – Help soothe and moisturize the skin during cleansing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2085\"><strong data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1956\">Glycerin</strong> – A humectant that helps attract moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness after washing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2013\" data-content-reference-end=\"2045\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2101\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2140\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6kcjf\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cleanser onto your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xwa323\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\nAdd water and create a rich, soft foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kfn06g\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2312\">\r\nGently massage over the face, focusing on oily or congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2353\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mb0qkh\" data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\nUse as part of your daily cleansing routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2362\" data-content-reference-end=\"2381\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2460\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2464\" data-end=\"2474\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18z6nyo\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2542\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2497\">Product:</strong> Green Tea + LHA Deep Pore Rice Cake Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy29w\" data-start=\"2543\" data-end=\"2559\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2554\">Size:</strong> 150g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ckem8d\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2598\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2571\">Type:</strong> Deep Cleansing Facial Foam\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o85qjy\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2674\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2621\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Green Tea, LHA, Salicylic Acid, Bakuchiol, Panthenol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jsrvf7\" data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2765\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2695\">Main Concerns:</strong> Excess oil, clogged pores, blackheads, dead skin cells, rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l9bk58\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2818\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2780\">Texture:</strong> Soft, stretchy rice-cake-like texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ev2pfj\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2925\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2838\">Suitable For:</strong> Oily, combination, congested and acne-prone skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2830\" data-content-reference-end=\"2862\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"3063\"><strong data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2940\">Best for:</strong> Oily or combination skin that needs <strong data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"3062\">deep pore cleansing, gentle exfoliation, sebum control, and smoother-looking skin</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3260\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3074\">Note:</strong> Because the cleanser contains both <strong data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3136\">LHA and Salicylic Acid</strong>, very sensitive skin should introduce it gradually and avoid over-exfoliating with multiple acid products at the same time.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/EIfK2HA7QCMEBW8iwg9eo4yQMe5APuSrOUEw3Nd9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:10:35','2026-09-17 12:24:33'),(234,'Red Smoothie Serum 8 30ml','red-smoothie-serum-8-30ml','<p data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"452\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"38\" data-end=\"70\">ARENCIA Red Smoothie Serum 8</strong> is a lightweight Korean brightening and anti-aging serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"249\">8% Niacinamide, Arbutin, multiple forms of Vitamin C, Rosehip Extract, Soluble Collagen, and Peptides</strong>. It helps improve the appearance of dullness, uneven skin tone, visible pores, rough texture, and early signs of aging while providing hydration and a healthy glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"415\" data-content-reference-end=\"447\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"470\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16nu4mw\" data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"499\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Niacinamide, Arbutin, and Vitamin C derivatives help promote a brighter, more even-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jthq18\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n🎯 <strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"649\">Helps Reduce the Look of Dark Spots</strong> – Brightening ingredients help improve the appearance of uneven pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4y0wzd\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"756\">Pore &amp; Texture Care</strong> – <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"777\">8% Niacinamide</strong> helps refine the appearance of pores and improve uneven-looking texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w630nd\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"966\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"874\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Glycerin, Panthenol, and other moisturizing ingredients help keep skin soft and hydrated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1c90s\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1080\">\r\n🌹 <strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1000\">Rosehip Antioxidant Care</strong> – Rosehip Extract provides antioxidant support and helps enhance skin radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18kkloq\" data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1115\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – Soluble Collagen and Peptides support smoother, firmer-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzuzxz\" data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1208\">Healthy Glow</strong> – Helps create a fresh, dewy and luminous complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5516py\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1295\">Lightweight Daily Serum</strong> – Suitable for use in both morning and evening routines. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1341\" data-content-reference-end=\"1373\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1411\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1548\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1431\">Niacinamide 8%</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of skin, refine visible pores, improve uneven texture, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1658\"><strong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1561\">Arbutin</strong> – A brightening ingredient that helps improve the appearance of dark spots and uneven skin tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1886\"><strong data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1681\">Vitamin C Complex</strong> – Contains several forms including <strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1810\">3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Ascorbic Acid, and Ascorbyl Glucoside</strong> for antioxidant and brightening care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1832\" data-content-reference-end=\"1864\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1999\"><strong data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1907\">Rosehip Extract</strong> – Rich in antioxidant compounds and helps support a brighter, healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2095\"><strong data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2021\">Soluble Collagen</strong> – Helps maintain a smoother, plumper and more elastic-looking appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2169\"><strong data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2114\">Hexapeptide-2</strong> – Supports the appearance of firmer and smoother skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2244\"><strong data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2199\">Ferulic Acid + Vitamin E</strong> – Provide additional antioxidant protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2348\"><strong data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2271\">Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong> – Help moisturize and soothe the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2289\" data-content-reference-end=\"2321\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2364\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hko9ws\" data-start=\"2404\" data-end=\"2461\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2426\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum to the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g2u37u\" data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2508\">\r\nGently spread and pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8huwa0\" data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\nFollow with your favorite moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzby6\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2581\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18zrl95\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2692\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always finish with <strong data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2653\">broad-spectrum sunscreen</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2628\" data-content-reference-end=\"2660\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2713\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"3173\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2735\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2727\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6ntkw\" data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2750\">Product:</strong> Red Smoothie Serum 8\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2783\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2yh28\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2800\">Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Anti-Aging Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uoazp7\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2868\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2853\">Key Ingredient:</strong> 8% Niacinamide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fo7p4b\" data-start=\"2869\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2889\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, dullness, uneven skin tone, visible pores, rough texture, fine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cdcgi7\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3003\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2985\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3020\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3061\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3049\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y9x6j8\" data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3173\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3064\" data-end=\"3078\">Fragrance:</strong> No added fragrance listed in the ingredient information. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3104\" data-content-reference-end=\"3137\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3332\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3188\">Best for:</strong> Dull, uneven, dehydrated, or textured skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3306\">brightening, pore care, hydration, and firmer-looking skin</strong> in one lightweight serum.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/JK574xrf3xqFnEYIFVFjBuRe5j60Cxo8v9awsm0S.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:12:38','2026-09-17 12:24:13'),(235,'Deep Water Surge Serum 30ml','deep-water-surge-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"450\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"74\">ARENCIA Deep Water Surge Serum</strong> is a lightweight Korean hydrating serum designed to provide <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"200\">deep, long-lasting moisture while supporting the skin barrier</strong>. It combines multiple forms of <strong data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"346\">Hyaluronic Acid, Phyto PDRN (Hydrolyzed DNA), Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Niacinamide, and a multi-peptide complex</strong> to help dehydrated skin look plumper, smoother, and more radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"413\" data-content-reference-end=\"445\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"468\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\