1\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1389\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1616\"><strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1424\">Multi-Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Contains several forms of Hyaluronic Acid, including Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, Potassium Hyaluronate, and Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, for comprehensive hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1710\"><strong data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1649\">Hydrolyzed DNA / Phyto PDRN</strong> – Supports moisture retention and overall skin conditioning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1786\"><strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1727\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps strengthen the skin\'s protective moisture barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1845\"><strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1801\">Panthenol</strong> – Provides hydration and soothing benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1938\"><strong data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1862\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dullness, uneven tone, and visible pores.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2142\"><strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1959\">Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Tripeptide-1, and other peptides for firming and smoothing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2088\" data-content-reference-end=\"2107\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2158\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2197\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11cnnre\" data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2258\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2257\">Deep Water Surge Serum</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2334\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuu8ii\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\nLayer another application if your skin needs extra hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nbrtce\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2498\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer and sunscreen during the daytime. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2426\" data-content-reference-end=\"2445\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2500\" data-end=\"2519\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"3012\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2533\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vmw2k2\" data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2579\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2556\">Product:</strong> Deep Water Surge Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpwp9x\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2591\">Size:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v1s7b7\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2639\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2608\">Type:</strong> Hydrating / Barrier Care Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sou6gr\" data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2662\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid, Phyto PDRN, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Peptides\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ce9cr2\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2831\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2758\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, dullness, rough texture, weakened moisture barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b3v2vo\" data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2848\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, especially dry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p9xna9\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2948\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2914\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, fast-absorbing serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"3012\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2962\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2922\" data-content-reference-end=\"2955\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3162\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3027\">Best for:</strong> Dry, dehydrated, sensitive, or dull skin that needs <strong data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3161\">intensive hydration, barrier support, soothing care, and a plump healthy glow</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/viSEbeWga3bbeQf51iREZBs2V6aQn11G8RMbLSDV.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:13:57','2026-09-17 12:23:55'),(236,'Deep Water Surge Sun Serum SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml','deep-water-surge-sun-serum-spf50-pa-50ml','<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"479\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"96\">ARENCIA Deep Water Surge Sun Serum</strong> is a lightweight Korean sunscreen-serum hybrid that provides <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"244\">high UVA/UVB protection while delivering intensive hydration and skin-barrier care</strong>. With <strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"268\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong>, Niacinamide, Triple Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Sodium DNA, and a 5-Peptide Complex, it helps protect skin from sun damage while leaving a fresh, dewy finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"442\" data-content-reference-end=\"474\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"497\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnpcup\" data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"582\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"526\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ PA++++ helps protect against UVA and UVB rays.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bvd2k8\" data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"606\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Triple Hyaluronic Acid helps replenish and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi94z0\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"770\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"693\">Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12xikks\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"801\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP and Panthenol help maintain the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pnuni9\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"907\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – A 5-peptide complex helps support smoother and firmer-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r7pbiz\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1000\">Soothing Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica, Green Tea, and Chamomile extracts help calm and comfort the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mu9xtq\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1106\">PDRN Care</strong> – Sodium DNA provides additional skin-conditioning and hydration support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"orx12g\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1209\">No Heavy White Cast</strong> – The lightweight serum texture spreads easily and leaves a clear, fresh finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1280\" data-content-reference-end=\"1312\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1349\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1458\"><strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1366\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of skin, improve uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1601\"><strong data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1486\">Triple Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, and Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid provide multi-level hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1691\"><strong data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1618\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1743\"><strong data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1706\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps hydrate and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1929\"><strong data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1766\">5-Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and Hexapeptide-9 to support smoother and more elastic-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"2012\"><strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1952\">Sodium DNA (PDRN)</strong> – Helps condition and support a healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2130\"><strong data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2047\">Green Tea &amp; Centella Asiatica</strong> – Provide antioxidant and soothing benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2077\" data-content-reference-end=\"2110\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2146\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2190\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lo41tk\" data-start=\"2191\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\nApply an adequate amount evenly over the <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2252\">face and neck</strong> as the final skincare step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkruuc\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2319\">\r\nGently spread until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d0udif\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2349\">\r\nApply before sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6kho63\" data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2506\">\r\nReapply approximately <strong data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2394\">every 2–3 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure, and after sweating or wiping the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2449\" data-content-reference-end=\"2481\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2527\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2531\" data-end=\"2541\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19g5mi\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2591\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2564\">Product:</strong> Deep Water Surge Sun Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpv5wz\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2608\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2603\">Size:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pj877g\" data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2626\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2619\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87s7f9\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2650\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2643\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"114qr6d\" data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2684\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2662\">Type:</strong> Sunscreen / Sun Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yfw4p7\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2782\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2707\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Niacinamide, Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Sodium DNA, Peptides\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgu6fg\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2803\">Main Concerns:</strong> Sun protection, dryness, dehydration, dullness, uneven tone, weakened barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1xojv\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2896\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, serum-like, fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpe2c0\" data-start=\"2937\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2939\" data-end=\"2950\">Finish:</strong> Fresh, hydrated and dewy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3039\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2989\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2977\" data-content-reference-end=\"3009\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3213\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3054\">Best for:</strong> Dry, dehydrated, sensitive, combination, or normal skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3212\">high daily sun protection combined with hydration, soothing care, and barrier support</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,21,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/duiag7GJwn6rFg0QIrtGwzDuaHU0Xyz5SOzuPmq9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:17:38','2026-09-17 12:23:36'),(237,'Cloud Sun Stick 18ml','cloud-sun-stick-18ml','<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"363\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"73\">ARENCIA Cloud Sun Stick</strong> is a portable Korean sunscreen stick offering <strong data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"137\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> protection against UVA and UVB rays. Its silky balm texture glides smoothly over the skin and is designed for convenient reapplication throughout the day, with a soft, fresh matte finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"326\" data-content-reference-end=\"358\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"381\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxxfx1\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"472\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"410\">High UV Protection</strong> – SPF50+ PA++++ helps protect skin from UVA and UVB exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188ex3k\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n☁️ <strong data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"499\">Soft Matte Finish</strong> – Silica powder helps absorb excess oil and create a smooth, less sticky finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xbc0t8\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"607\">Hydrating Formula</strong> – Contains <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"649\">3 types of Hyaluronic Acid</strong> to help maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mxvcth\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"777\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"707\">Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP and Panthenol help support the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16fz2p1\" data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"885\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"801\">Cica PDRN Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica and Sodium DNA provide soothing and skin-conditioning benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"872vz\" data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n🍵 <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"911\">Antioxidant Care</strong> – Green Tea and other botanical extracts help support healthy-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1siyp\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n💄 <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1015\">Easy Reapplication</strong> – The stick format makes it convenient to reapply sunscreen without using your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dmtse\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1240\">\r\n🤍 <strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1130\">No Heavy White Cast</strong> – The silky formula is designed to apply transparently and comfortably. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1192\" data-content-reference-end=\"1224\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1261\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1341\"><strong data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1309\">Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate</strong> – Helps provide UVA protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1432\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1384\">Ethylhexyl Triazone &amp; Polysilicone-15</strong> – UV filters that contribute to UVB protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1553\"><strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1484\">Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine</strong> – A broad-spectrum UV filter supporting both UVA and UVB protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1635\"><strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1565\">Silica</strong> – Helps absorb excess sebum and create a smoother, more matte finish.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1771\"><strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1664\">Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid and Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate help provide hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1855\"><strong data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1800\">Ceramide NP + Panthenol</strong> – Help maintain the skin barrier and moisture balance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1933\"><strong data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1891\">Centella Asiatica + Sodium DNA</strong> – Provide soothing and conditioning care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2047\"><strong data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1968\">Green Tea Extract + Bisabolol</strong> – Offer antioxidant and calming support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1994\" data-content-reference-end=\"2013\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2063\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ju11ug\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\nApply the sun stick evenly over the face, neck and other exposed areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gec5xb\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2182\">\r\nGently glide the stick across the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qrlybr\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\nReapply <strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2213\">every 2–3 hours</strong> during prolonged outdoor exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o3rmb1\" data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2357\">\r\nIt can also be used for convenient sunscreen touch-ups over makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2286\" data-content-reference-end=\"2318\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2378\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2392\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2k4ex2\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2415\">Product:</strong> Cloud Sun Stick\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yylc6x\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2447\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2443\">Size:</strong> 18g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pj877g\" data-start=\"2448\" data-end=\"2465\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2458\">SPF:</strong> SPF50+\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3g13zm\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2482\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2475\">PA:</strong> PA++++\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ttxlbc\" data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2494\">Type:</strong> Sunscreen Stick\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xvt2ar\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2524\">Finish:</strong> Soft matte / fresh\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"afggtt\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2566\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, Centella Asiatica, Sodium DNA, Green Tea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ois5zf\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2669\">Main Concerns:</strong> UV protection, excess oil, dryness, skin-barrier support\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2790\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2740\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2714\" data-content-reference-end=\"2746\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2947\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2805\">Best for:</strong> Normal, combination, oily and sensitive skin looking for <strong data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2946\">high UV protection with easy reapplication and a lightweight, non-sticky finish</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,20,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/RGiqLJAQlSSc8sFLefDocEM8GIpF7druRzTQRFsG.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:19:03','2026-09-17 12:23:16'),(238,'Rosehip Mild pH Balancing Rice Cake Cleanser 150ml','rosehip-mild-ph-balancing-rice-cake-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"603\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"118\">ARENCIA Rosehip Mild pH Balancing Rice Cake Cleanser</strong> is a gentle Korean facial cleanser designed to cleanse the skin while helping maintain its natural moisture barrier. Its unique <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"283\">soft, bouncy “rice cake” texture</strong> creates a rich, cushiony foam that removes impurities without leaving the skin feeling overly dry or tight. The formula features <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"508\">Rosehip Extract, Rice Extract, Ceramide NP, Panthenol, and a 5-type Hyaluronic Acid complex</strong> for moisturizing, soothing, and barrier-supporting care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"566\" data-content-reference-end=\"598\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"621\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"geh63u\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"709\">\r\n🌹 <strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"656\">Rosehip Brightening Care</strong> – Helps promote a fresh, radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8tua9g\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"799\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"733\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Five types of Hyaluronic Acid help attract and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rjhdnp\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"908\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"830\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP helps strengthen the moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sah3u3\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\n🍚 <strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"944\">Rice-Based Nourishing Care</strong> – Rice ingredients help moisturize, soften, and improve the look of uneven texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vjbb47\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1131\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1059\">Gentle Deep Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dirt, excess sebum, makeup residue, and pore impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1afcg7g\" data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\n⚖️ <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1161\">pH-Balancing Formula</strong> – Designed for a comfortable daily cleanse while maintaining skin balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sccrk5\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1328\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1265\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave skin feeling softer, smoother, and more refined.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m2lk77\" data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1482\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1365\">Suitable for Sensitive Skin</strong> – Formulated as a mild cleanser particularly suited to dry and sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1434\" data-content-reference-end=\"1466\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1503\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1632\"><strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1524\">Rosehip Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and conditioning benefits while supporting a brighter, healthier-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1649\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Helps reinforce the skin barrier and maintain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1847\"><strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1743\">5-Type Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid provide layered hydration and help keep skin plump and comfortable.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1967\"><strong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1885\">Rice Extract &amp; Rice Lees Extract</strong> – Help nourish and moisturize the skin while supporting smoother-looking texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2019\"><strong data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1982\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps hydrate and soothe the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2121\"><strong data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2033\">Squalane</strong> – Helps soften the skin and reduce moisture loss. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2068\" data-content-reference-end=\"2101\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e97di3\" data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2151\">Unique Rice Cake Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2411\">The cleanser uses a traditional-inspired kneading process that gives it a <strong data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2275\">soft, stretchy, mochi/rice-cake-like texture</strong>. When mixed with water, it develops into a rich, cushiony foam for a gentle cleansing experience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2354\" data-content-reference-end=\"2373\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2427\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9qmg7\" data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2474\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount onto wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhzlji\" data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\nAdd a little water and work into a soft, rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"583y96\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\nGently massage onto the wet face using circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jl1qp\" data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2658\">\r\nPat the skin dry gently.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d2tim3\" data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2689\">morning and evening</strong> as your daily cleanser. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2676\" data-content-reference-end=\"2709\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2930\"><strong data-start=\"2753\" data-end=\"2766\">Optional:</strong> Some product listings also recommend applying a thin layer for a short <strong data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2876\">1–5 minute wash-off cleansing pack</strong> before rinsing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2851\" data-content-reference-end=\"2883\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2932\" data-end=\"2951\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"3441\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2973\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"2965\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bk87s4\" data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"3033\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"2988\">Product:</strong> Rosehip Mild pH Balancing Rice Cake Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy29w\" data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3045\">Size:</strong> 150g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qnm24r\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3062\">Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crk8ey\" data-start=\"3079\" data-end=\"3126\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3093\">Texture:</strong> Soft, stretchy rice-cake texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5x05wu\" data-start=\"3127\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3149\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rosehip Extract, Rice Extract, Ceramide NP, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nz4dpb\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3241\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, dullness, rough texture, weakened skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzb32i\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3377\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3327\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, especially dry and sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lig6d8\" data-start=\"3378\" data-end=\"3441\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3391\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3357\" data-content-reference-end=\"3390\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3579\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3443\" data-end=\"3456\">Best for:</strong> Dry, sensitive, dehydrated, or dull skin that needs <strong data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3578\">gentle cleansing, hydration, pH balance, and skin-barrier support</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/CMpivNw5EDPYZuCraxQjDVuByweaKslvXa15kLTr.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:21:05','2026-09-17 12:22:57'),(239,'Rice + LHA Pore Control Rice Cake Cleanser 150ml','rice-lha-pore-control-rice-cake-cleanser-150ml','<p data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"454\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"60\" data-end=\"114\">ARENCIA Rice + LHA Pore Control Rice Cake Cleanser</strong> is a Korean pore-care facial cleanser with a unique soft, stretchy <strong data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"203\">rice-cake texture</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"304\">LHA (Capryloyl Salicylic Acid), Salicylic Acid, Rice Extract, and Rice Lees Extract</strong> to help remove excess sebum, unclog pores, gently exfoliate dead skin cells, and improve rough-looking texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"417\" data-content-reference-end=\"449\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"472\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18l3lsi\" data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"559\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"502\">Deep Pore Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove excess oil, impurities, and pore buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bwzao2\" data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"586\">Gentle Exfoliation</strong> – LHA and Salicylic Acid help remove dead skin cells and smooth rough texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iok8i1\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"698\">Balances Oil &amp; Moisture</strong> – Cleanses excess sebum while helping maintain skin comfort.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cr9wp2\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"850\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"787\">Pore Refining Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of enlarged and congested pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dfxcyr\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"882\">Rice-Based Nourishment</strong> – Rice and Rice Lees Extract help soften and condition the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kuspg2\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"978\">Smoother Skin Texture</strong> – Regular use helps skin look clearer, smoother, and more refined.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lpk45l\" data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1155\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1071\">Rich Creamy Foam</strong> – The soft rice-cake texture transforms into a cushiony foam when mixed with water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1szkiat\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1161\" data-end=\"1186\">Non-Stripping Cleanse</strong> – Designed to leave skin feeling clean without excessive tightness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1243\" data-content-reference-end=\"1275\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1313\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1429\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1349\">LHA (Capryloyl Salicylic Acid)</strong> – A gentle exfoliating acid that helps loosen dead skin cells and unclog pores.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1560\"><strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1455\">Salicylic Acid (BHA)</strong> – Helps dissolve excess sebum and impurities inside pores, making it useful for oily and congested skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1667\"><strong data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1583\">Rice Lees Extract</strong> – Helps nourish and soften the skin while supporting a smoother-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1736\"><strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1685\">Rice Extract</strong> – Provides conditioning and moisturizing benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1852\"><strong data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1753\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1973\"><strong data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1879\">Panthenol &amp; Allantoin</strong> – Help moisturize and soothe the skin during cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1919\" data-content-reference-end=\"1952\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e97di3\" data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2003\">Unique Rice Cake Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2244\">The cleanser has a soft, stretchy <strong data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2065\">rice-cake-like texture</strong> created through a traditional kneading process. When mixed with water, it transforms into a rich, creamy foam that gently cleanses the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2186\" data-content-reference-end=\"2205\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2260\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2588\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9qmg7\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount onto wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iiryo1\" data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2347\">\r\nAdd water and work into a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"182a891\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\nGently massage onto the face in circular motions, focusing on oily or pore-congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2483\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w60t03\" data-start=\"2484\" data-end=\"2588\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2514\">morning and evening</strong> according to your skin\'s tolerance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2512\" data-content-reference-end=\"2544\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2743\"><strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2615\">For deeper pore care:</strong> Apply a thin layer to the face and leave for around <strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2681\">3 minutes</strong>, then rinse thoroughly. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2662\" data-content-reference-end=\"2681\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2745\" data-end=\"2764\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2786\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2778\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o0y3ud\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2801\">Product:</strong> Rice + LHA Pore Control Rice Cake Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy29w\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2861\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2856\">Size:</strong> 150g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9kt4e3\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2899\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2873\">Type:</strong> Pore-Care Facial Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3q4ya3\" data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"2988\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2922\">Key Ingredients:</strong> LHA, Salicylic Acid, Rice Extract, Rice Lees Extract, Niacinamide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f77a1t\" data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3074\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3009\">Main Concerns:</strong> Clogged pores, blackheads, excess sebum, rough texture, dullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crk8ey\" data-start=\"3075\" data-end=\"3122\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3089\">Texture:</strong> Soft, stretchy rice-cake texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11udmue\" data-start=\"3123\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3139\">Skin Type:</strong> Oily, combination, normal and pore-congested skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3128\" data-content-reference-end=\"3160\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqcx5o\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3291\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3241\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3187\" data-content-reference-end=\"3206\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3438\"><strong data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3306\">Best for:</strong> Oily, combination, and congested skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3437\">pore cleansing, sebum control, gentle exfoliation, and smoother-looking skin</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3598\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3449\">Note:</strong> Since it contains both <strong data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3499\">LHA and Salicylic Acid</strong>, avoid using it together with several other strong exfoliating products if your skin is sensitive.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/hjYjL6ylECdF6pygZ1Wo30svmFtAuKonuwPKeIBO.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:24:36','2026-09-17 12:22:37'),(240,'Red Smoothie Lotion 5-200ml','red-smoothie-lotion-5-200ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-17\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-17\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:155d6964-ad27-44a4-bb3c-17695aebf546-17\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-36\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"19aac90d-2208-4407-9be4-11dc2f65b722\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"433\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"73\">ARENCIA Red Smoothie Lotion 5</strong> is a lightweight Korean facial moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"253\">5% Niacinamide, 9 types of Peptides, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Beta-Glucan, Oat Extract, and a Red Smoothie Milk Complex™</strong>. It provides lightweight hydration while helping improve the appearance of uneven texture, visible pores, excess sebum, and loss of firmness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"396\" data-content-reference-end=\"428\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"451\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18t3ckc\" data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"558\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"488\">Brightens &amp; Evens Skin Tone</strong> – 5% Niacinamide helps improve dullness and uneven-looking skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lzprqx\" data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n🔍 <strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"577\">Pore Care</strong> – Helps refine the appearance of enlarged pores and uneven texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pc03jf\" data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"761\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"677\">Long-Lasting Hydration</strong> – Glycerin, Beta-Glucan, Betaine, and Collagen help keep skin soft and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dqtehj\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n⚖️ <strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"784\">Sebum Control</strong> – Niacinamide helps balance excess oil production.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rszrm2\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n💪 <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"870\">Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – A <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"896\">9-peptide complex</strong> helps support smoother, firmer-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u2t4pp\" data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1063\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"977\">Red Smoothie Milk Complex™</strong> – Combines oat-derived ingredients and collagen for nourishing and conditioning care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hcgj37\" data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1085\">Healthy Glow</strong> – Berry extracts including raspberry, cranberry, pomegranate, and wild cherry provide antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gyc2k5\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1340\">\r\n🧴 <strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1232\">Lightweight, Non-Sticky Finish</strong> – The milky lotion absorbs quickly and leaves a smooth, silky finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1292\" data-content-reference-end=\"1324\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1361\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1480\"><strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1381\">Niacinamide 5%</strong> – Helps brighten skin, refine the appearance of pores, improve texture, and regulate excess sebum.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1656\"><strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1503\">9-Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Copper Tripeptide-1, Hexapeptide-9 and other peptides to support firm, smooth-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1762\"><strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1681\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong> – Helps moisturize and improve the appearance of skin suppleness and elasticity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1841\"><strong data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1789\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Betaine</strong> – Provide hydration and help maintain skin comfort.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1940\"><strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1865\">Oat Kernel Extract</strong> – Helps condition and soothe the skin while supporting moisture retention.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2008\"><strong data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1962\">Moringa Seed Oil</strong> – Provides nourishing and emollient benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2187\"><strong data-start=\"2010\" data-end=\"2036\">Berry &amp; Fruit Extracts</strong> – Pomegranate, Raspberry, Cranberry and Wild Cherry extracts provide antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2134\" data-content-reference-end=\"2166\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2203\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3zq5m\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2280\">\r\nApply serum or ampoule if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gkubav\" data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of <strong data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2339\">Red Smoothie Lotion 5</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r6lmhf\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2381\">\r\nSpread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akqr6e\" data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2417\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r6itg\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2448\">morning and evening</strong>. During the daytime, finish with sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2472\" data-content-reference-end=\"2504\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2551\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2573\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2565\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ur7j4e\" data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2588\">Product:</strong> Red Smoothie Lotion 5\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tui43o\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2622\">Size:</strong> 200ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ua99xx\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2640\">Type:</strong> Facial Lotion / Moisturizer\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10hzx2\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2705\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2690\">Key Ingredient:</strong> 5% Niacinamide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9rnz2x\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2708\" data-end=\"2724\">Key Complex:</strong> Red Smoothie Milk Complex™\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gzsk8l\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2855\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2772\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, uneven texture, visible pores, excess sebum, dryness, loss of elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1msae\" data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2870\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight milky lotion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7doo3e\" data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2935\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2909\">Finish:</strong> Silky, smooth, non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zff7xd\" data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2962\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2949\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3121\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"2977\">Best for:</strong> Normal, combination, oily, or textured skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3034\" data-end=\"3120\">lightweight hydration, pore care, brightening, sebum control, and firming benefits</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><br></div></div></div></section></div></div>',NULL,NULL,36,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/1joHfxZ4oQjfNPsfYxc4a3ElyKkxukcTYStVsW3N.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:26:46','2026-09-17 12:22:17'),(241,'PDRN+Hyaluronic Deep Hydration Pad 200ml (90EA)','pdrnhyaluronic-deep-hydration-pad-200ml-90ea','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"526\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"110\">ARENCIA PDRN + Hyaluronic Deep Hydration Pad</strong> is a Korean hydrating toner pad designed to provide <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"239\">instant cooling, deep hydration, soothing care, and skin-barrier support</strong>. Each jar contains <strong data-start=\"259\" data-end=\"315\">90 soft, stretchable pads soaked in 200ml of essence</strong>. The formula features <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"487\">plant-derived PDRN from Centella Asiatica, multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Beta-Glucan, Panthenol, and Centella Asiatica extracts</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"489\" data-content-reference-end=\"521\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"544\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ko1oxb\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"641\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"569\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Multiple types of Hyaluronic Acid help replenish and retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14qhopl\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"754\">\r\n🧬 <strong data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"672\">Plant-Based PDRN Care</strong> – Centella-derived Sodium DNA helps condition and support healthier-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q1qiwk\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n❄️ <strong data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">Cooling &amp; Soothing</strong> – Provides a refreshing, cooling sensation for skin that feels hot or uncomfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fmmjsp\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"898\">Skin Barrier Support</strong> – Hyaluronic Acid, Beta-Glucan and moisturizing ingredients help maintain the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fi94z0\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1026\">Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10fyp7v\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1209\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1125\">Calming Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica and its active compounds help soothe the appearance of redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fezzf0\" data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1239\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave skin softer, smoother and more hydrated.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ox0pv7\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1401\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1326\">Instant Moisture Boost</strong> – Excellent for dry or dehydrated skin that needs an extra hydration step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i0e3gl\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1580\">\r\n🧖‍♀️ <strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1440\">Can Be Used as a Mini Mask</strong> – The flexible pads adhere closely to the skin and can be placed on dry areas for targeted hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1531\" data-content-reference-end=\"1563\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1601\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1748\"><strong data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1636\">Plant-Based PDRN / Sodium DNA</strong> – Derived from plant sources, particularly Centella Asiatica, and used for skin-conditioning and soothing care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"2000\"><strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1783\">Multi-Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Contains numerous forms of Hyaluronic Acid, including Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid and Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, helping provide multi-level hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1946\" data-content-reference-end=\"1965\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2103\"><strong data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2017\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull-looking skin, improve uneven tone and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2300\"><strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2134\">Centella Asiatica Complex</strong> – Includes Centella Asiatica Extract, Leaf Extract and Root Extract, along with Madecassoside, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid and Madecassic Acid for soothing skin care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2406\"><strong data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2337\">Beta-Glucan &amp; Polyglutamic Acid</strong> – Help attract and retain moisture for softer, plumper-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2537\"><strong data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2421\">Adenosine</strong> – Provides additional care for the appearance of fine lines and skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2465\" data-content-reference-end=\"2484\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2553\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5uj16\" data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2616\">\r\nAfter cleansing, take one pad using the included tweezers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fcnao1\" data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2684\">\r\nGently swipe the pad across the face following the skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jdfzsi\" data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2778\">\r\nFor extra hydration, place the pads on dry or dehydrated areas like a <strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2777\">mini sheet mask</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nk7vok\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2819\">\r\nLeave for a few minutes, then remove.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bad6mn\" data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2870\">\r\nGently pat the remaining essence into the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ypf66d\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2856\" data-content-reference-end=\"2875\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2967\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"2981\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k73bbl\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3041\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2992\" data-end=\"3004\">Product:</strong> PDRN + Hyaluronic Deep Hydration Pad\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tui43o\" data-start=\"3042\" data-end=\"3059\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3053\">Size:</strong> 200ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"188fhqe\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3083\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3075\">Quantity:</strong> 90 pads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19xh7fg\" data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3116\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3086\" data-end=\"3095\">Type:</strong> Hydrating Toner Pads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r3lzbm\" data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3206\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3139\">Key Ingredients:</strong> PDRN, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Centella Asiatica, Beta-Glucan\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90js7r\" data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3282\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3227\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dehydration, redness, dullness, rough texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ry4bq7\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3355\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3299\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, including sensitive and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8z6k\" data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3358\" data-end=\"3369\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3311\" data-content-reference-end=\"3343\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3568\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3434\">Best for:</strong> Dry, dehydrated, sensitive, or dull skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3567\">intensive hydration, soothing care, cooling comfort, and a fresh, dewy glow</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/HpzCcz8tPqhOLGDEKTCnbNkQZlpi09M8TaDVqsOK.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:30:11','2026-09-17 12:21:53'),(242,'Pore Melt Mochi Cleansing Oil 200ml','pore-melt-mochi-cleansing-oil-200ml','<p data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"401\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"48\" data-end=\"89\">ARENCIA Pore Melt Mochi Cleansing Oil</strong> is a lightweight Korean cleansing oil designed to gently dissolve <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"224\">makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, blackheads, and pore impurities</strong> without leaving the skin feeling stripped. Its non-comedogenic formula emulsifies with water into a milky texture and rinses away cleanly. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"364\" data-content-reference-end=\"396\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"419\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y91dgd\" data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n🧼 <strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"444\">Deep Cleansing</strong> – Effectively melts away makeup, sunscreen, excess oil, and daily impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wnuk21\" data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"553\">Pore &amp; Blackhead Care</strong> – Helps loosen pore buildup and excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ug7vbz\" data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"636\">Moisture-Friendly Cleansing</strong> – Helps maintain skin softness and moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i74lt2\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"719\">Rice Amino Acid Care</strong> – Helps hydrate and smooth the appearance of skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ty1vy\" data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"801\">Soothing Care</strong> – Centella Asiatica helps calm and condition the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5m0pz\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"882\">Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP helps support the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a5elvp\" data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"1111\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"971\">Non-Comedogenic</strong> – Formulated without 29 known pore-clogging ingredients according to the brand\'s product information. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1063\" data-content-reference-end=\"1095\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zt1vhh\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1140\">Easy Emulsification</strong> – Turns milky when mixed with water and rinses without a heavy greasy residue.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1240\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1265\">Rice Amino Acids HD</strong> – Helps hydrate, soften, and improve the appearance of skin texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1436\"><strong data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1372\">Rice Extract &amp; Rice Lees Extract</strong> – Help condition the skin and support smoother-looking texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1519\"><strong data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1464\">Vitamin E (Tocopherol)</strong> – Provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1586\"><strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1549\">Centella Asiatica (Cica)</strong> – Helps soothe and comfort the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1660\"><strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1603\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Supports the skin barrier and helps maintain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1849\"><strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1683\">Botanical Complex</strong> – Includes Green Tea, Mugwort, Tea Tree, Houttuynia Cordata, and Mung Bean extracts for antioxidant and skin-conditioning care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1795\" data-content-reference-end=\"1814\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1865\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ljnj1\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1889\">2–3 pumps</strong> to dry hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x915j8\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2017\">\r\nMassage gently over a <strong data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1941\">dry face</strong> for 30–60 seconds, concentrating on makeup, sunscreen, and congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r2au7i\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and massage until the oil becomes <strong data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2092\">milky</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2z5er8\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser for a complete <strong data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2216\">double-cleansing routine</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2183\" data-content-reference-end=\"2215\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2276\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2290\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w2m9ul\" data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2313\">Product:</strong> Pore Melt Mochi Cleansing Oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tui43o\" data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2361\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2355\">Size:</strong> 200ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14v40ne\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2373\">Type:</strong> Cleansing Oil / Makeup Remover\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tquk6o\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2407\" data-end=\"2427\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Amino Acids, Rice Extract, Vitamin E, Centella Asiatica, Ceramide NP\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ac35cw\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2581\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2522\">Main Concerns:</strong> Makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, clogged pores, blackheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sbr6wf\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2622\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2596\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight cleansing oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kca3ss\" data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2639\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, including oily, sensitive, and acne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2766\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2716\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2689\" data-content-reference-end=\"2721\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2937\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2781\">Best for:</strong> Anyone looking for a <strong data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2847\">gentle yet effective first-step cleanser</strong> that removes makeup and sunscreen while providing pore care and maintaining skin comfort.</p>',NULL,NULL,2,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/XckU7gTmHm7IhhuqfEYjbuA9wYPPGCJO02LzmvL2.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:35:52','2026-09-17 12:21:24'),(243,'Rice Mucin Cleanser 120ml','rice-mucin-cleanser-120ml','<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"468\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"68\">ARENCIA Rice Mucin Cleanser</strong> is a gentle Korean <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"117\">all-in-one cleansing foam</strong> with a unique soft, stretchy <strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"179\">rice-cake/mochi-like texture</strong>. It helps remove impurities, excess sebum, sunscreen residue and light makeup while leaving the skin feeling soft and moisturized. The formula contains <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"429\">Rice Powder, Rice Extract, Rice Bran Extract, Snail Secretion Filtrate and Cocoa Seed Extract</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"431\" data-content-reference-end=\"464\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"486\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r0yc82\" data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"524\">Rice-Based Brightening Care</strong> – Rice-derived ingredients help improve the appearance of dull, tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2rw9zc\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"639\">Gentle Deep Cleansing</strong> – Removes dirt, excess oil and everyday impurities without an overly stripped feeling.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgbqnz\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"812\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"755\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Rice powder provides gentle physical exfoliating care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18hleye\" data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"845\">Helps Maintain Moisture</strong> – Glycerin and conditioning ingredients help keep skin comfortable after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nd4w3q\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1013\">\r\n🐌 <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"949\">Mucin Care</strong> – Snail Secretion Filtrate helps condition and soften the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7y0q7f\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1040\">Pore &amp; Sebum Care</strong> – Helps cleanse pore buildup and excess oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yztxbn\" data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1261\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1111\">3-in-1 Cleansing</strong> – Can be used as a daily cleanser and gentle scrub; it can also help remove light makeup and sunscreen residue. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1214\" data-content-reference-end=\"1246\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gmd7ud\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1294\">Sensitive-Skin Friendly</strong> – The product has been reported as non-irritating in a primary irritation test for sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1378\" data-content-reference-end=\"1397\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1452\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1615\"><strong data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1482\">Rice Powder – 10,000 ppm</strong><br data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1485\">\r\nProvides gentle exfoliation while helping cleanse and smooth the appearance of skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1544\" data-content-reference-end=\"1564\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1734\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1653\">Rice Extract &amp; Rice Bran Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1656\">\r\nHelp condition the skin and support a softer, more radiant-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1850\"><strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1764\">Snail Secretion Filtrate</strong><br data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1767\">\r\nHelps moisturize and condition the skin, supporting a smooth and supple appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1947\"><strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1892\">Theobroma Cacao (Cocoa) Seed Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1895\">\r\nProvides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"2092\"><strong data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1961\">Glycerin</strong><br data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"1964\">\r\nA humectant that helps attract moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness after cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2004\" data-content-reference-end=\"2023\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e97di3\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2122\">Unique Rice Cake Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2343\">The cleanser has a thick, dense <strong data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2194\">mochi/rice-cake-like paste texture</strong>. When mixed with water, it transforms into a soft, rich foam that provides a comfortable cleansing experience. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2237\" data-content-reference-end=\"2257\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2359\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2644\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hes2ul\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2426\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount with clean, dry hands or a spatula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1suf1lg\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2488\">\r\nAdd a little water and work the cleanser into a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uua5o2\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2546\">\r\nGently massage onto a wet face using circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ewiull\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2644\">\r\nPat dry gently and follow with toner and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2813\"><strong data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2674\">Optional cleansing pack:</strong> Apply a thin layer to the face, leave for around <strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2739\">1–2 minutes</strong>, then add water, massage and rinse. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2690\" data-content-reference-end=\"2709\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2834\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2856\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2848\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1133ly1\" data-start=\"2857\" data-end=\"2891\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2871\">Product:</strong> Rice Mucin Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy4qr\" data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"2908\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2903\">Size:</strong> 120g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h8jk7o\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2957\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"2920\">Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser / Rice Cake Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"soy21n\" data-start=\"2958\" data-end=\"3005\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"2972\">Texture:</strong> Dense, stretchy mochi-like paste\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z6pkf7\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3119\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3008\" data-end=\"3028\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Powder, Rice Extract, Rice Bran Extract, Snail Secretion Filtrate, Cocoa Seed Extract\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssfjhn\" data-start=\"3120\" data-end=\"3202\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3140\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, excess oil, impurities, rough texture, pore buildup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2tqbij\" data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3263\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3222\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, including sensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqcx5o\" data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3327\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3266\" data-end=\"3277\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3186\" data-content-reference-end=\"3218\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3481\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3342\">Best for:</strong> Those who want a <strong data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3480\">gentle daily cleanser with rice-based brightening care, mild exfoliation, pore cleansing and a soft, hydrated finish</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/k3gJLvrCVjvNlYILxVJ7oVIfG2ky0XLsZiQW70cm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:38:21','2026-09-17 12:37:03'),(244,'Fresh Green Rice Mochi Cleanser 120ml','fresh-green-rice-mochi-cleanser-120ml','<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"429\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"92\">ARENCIA Fresh Green Rice Mochi Cleanser</strong> is a Korean 3-in-1 cleanser with a unique <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"172\">soft, stretchy mochi-like texture</strong>. It combines <strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"270\">rice powder, green tea, kaolin clay, witch hazel, mugwort, and Centella Asiatica</strong> to deeply cleanse pores, remove excess sebum, gently exfoliate dead skin cells, and leave the skin smoother and fresher. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"392\" data-content-reference-end=\"424\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"447\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hgcsn\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"540\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"477\">Deep Pore Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dirt, excess oil, and pore-clogging impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pk4a9m\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"646\">\r\n🍚 <strong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"568\">Gentle Exfoliation</strong> – Rice powder and almond seed meal help smooth rough, uneven-looking texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kyjz8s\" data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n🍵 <strong data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"670\">Green Tea Care</strong> – Helps refresh the skin and provides antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzmfn1\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"826\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"761\">Blackhead &amp; Sebum Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of pore congestion and excess oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1un9xl3\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"939\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"854\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Rice-derived ingredients help promote a smoother, more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f1ue00\" data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"962\">Soothing Care</strong> – Centella, mugwort, and botanical extracts help keep skin comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jhdq0c\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n🧖 <strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1058\">3-in-1 Formula</strong> – Can be used as a daily cleanser, gentle exfoliating cleanser, or short wash-off mask. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1136\" data-content-reference-end=\"1168\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sdfey7\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1361\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1217\">Helps Prevent Tightness</strong> – The cleansing formula is designed to clean thoroughly while maintaining a comfortable moisture balance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1307\" data-content-reference-end=\"1326\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1382\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1517\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1414\">Rice Powder &amp; Rice Extract</strong> – Help gently polish away dead skin cells while supporting a smoother and brighter-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1554\">Green Tea Extract &amp; Leaf Powder</strong> – Provide antioxidant and refreshing benefits while helping care for excess sebum.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1710\"><strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1654\">Kaolin Clay</strong> – Helps absorb excess oil and impurities from the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1798\"><strong data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1727\">Witch Hazel</strong> – Helps refine the appearance of pores and provides a refreshing feel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1860\"><strong data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1821\">Centella Asiatica</strong> – Helps soothe and condition the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"2001\"><strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1882\">Tea Tree Extract</strong> – Provides clarifying care, particularly useful for oily and blemish-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1929\" data-content-reference-end=\"1961\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fjoay\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2027\">Unique Mochi Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2029\" data-end=\"2358\">The cleanser has a dense, stretchy <strong data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2092\">green mochi-like texture</strong> that transforms into a rich, cushiony foam when mixed with water. ARENCIA says its Fresh Green Rice Mochi Cleanser is produced through a low-temperature aging process and extensive kneading to create its characteristic texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2281\" data-content-reference-end=\"2300\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2374\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2400\"><strong data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2400\">As a daily cleanser:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rngxch\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2439\">\r\nTake a small amount onto wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p395k6\" data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2476\">\r\nAdd water and create a soft foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e424rd\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2529\">\r\nGently massage over the face in circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2570\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2595\"><strong data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2595\">As a wash-off mask:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nshzwl\" data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\nApply a thin layer to damp skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lysan\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2675\">\r\nLeave for approximately <strong data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2674\">1–2 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mvf9ts\" data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\nGently massage with wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vtv9d8\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\nRinse thoroughly. Use <strong data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2757\">2–3 times per week</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2701\" data-content-reference-end=\"2720\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2798\" data-end=\"2817\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2819\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2831\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ky831w\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2886\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2854\">Product:</strong> Fresh Green Rice Mochi Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy4qr\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2903\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2898\">Size:</strong> 120g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pa3gxh\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2970\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2915\">Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser / Exfoliating Cleanser / Wash-Off Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b925n0\" data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3017\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2985\">Texture:</strong> Stretchy, soft mochi-like paste\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wsarm4\" data-start=\"3018\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3040\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Powder, Green Tea, Kaolin, Witch Hazel, Centella Asiatica, Tea Tree\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n06v5\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3199\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3134\">Main Concerns:</strong> Excess sebum, blackheads, clogged pores, rough texture, dullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qombh1\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3361\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3216\">Skin Type:</strong> Normal, combination, oily, and congested skin; the brand also positions it as suitable for sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3248\" data-content-reference-end=\"3280\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cqcx5o\" data-start=\"3362\" data-end=\"3425\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3364\" data-end=\"3375\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3307\" data-content-reference-end=\"3326\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3589\"><strong data-start=\"3427\" data-end=\"3440\">Best for:</strong> Oily, combination, dull, rough, or congested skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3588\">deep pore cleansing, gentle exfoliation, sebum control, and smoother-looking skin</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3771\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3600\">Note:</strong> The formula contains fragrance and several botanical extracts, so very sensitive or fragrance-reactive skin should patch-test first.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/p3uPGyBv3o6zbkvkfmYeCLOmBLLGBXwAVaZwPn8T.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:40:18','2026-09-17 12:36:39'),(245,'Fresh Rosehip Rice Mochi Cleanser 120ml','fresh-rosehip-rice-mochi-cleanser-120ml','<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"461\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"96\">ARENCIA Fresh Rosehip Rice Mochi Cleanser</strong> is a gentle Korean <strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"153\">2-in-1 cleanser and wash-off mask</strong> with a unique soft, bouncy <strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"203\">mochi-like texture</strong>. It is formulated with <strong data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"319\">Rosehip Extract, Rice Powder, Pink Aloe Vera, Chamomile, and finely milled Almond Powder</strong> to gently cleanse impurities, smooth rough texture, brighten dull-looking skin, and maintain hydration. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"424\" data-content-reference-end=\"456\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"479\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q3h731\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n🌹 <strong data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"509\">Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Rosehip Extract provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning care for a more radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3bw27\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n🍚 <strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"634\">Gentle Exfoliation</strong> – Rice Powder and finely milled Almond Powder help remove dead skin cells and rough buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q3qkvz\" data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"858\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"754\">Hydrating Cleanse</strong> – Pink Aloe Vera and Glycerin help maintain moisture and prevent an overly dry feeling after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kjh7ls\" data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"882\">Deep Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove dirt, excess sebum, impurities, and light makeup residue.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uavxz\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1062\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"978\">Soothing Care</strong> – Chamomile and Aloe Vera help calm and comfort sensitive or easily irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sccrk5\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1154\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1091\">Smooths Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave skin feeling softer, smoother, and more refined.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ec3rxf\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n🎭 <strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1186\">2-in-1 Cleanser &amp; Mask</strong> – Can be used as a daily cleanser or as a short wash-off mask 1–2 times per week. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1258\" data-content-reference-end=\"1290\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"72r7cu\" data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n⚖️ <strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1332\">Moisture Balance</strong> – Designed to cleanse while helping maintain the skin\'s natural moisture balance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1399\" data-content-reference-end=\"1418\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1473\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1607\"><strong data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1494\">Rosehip Extract</strong> – Rich in antioxidants and naturally occurring vitamins; helps nourish and brighten the appearance of dull skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1727\"><strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1637\">Rice Powder &amp; Rice Water</strong> – Help gently exfoliate buildup and promote a smoother, more luminous-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1851\"><strong data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1747\">Pink Aloe Vera</strong> – Provides hydration and soothing care, making the cleanser suitable for dry or sensitive-feeling skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1909\"><strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1874\">Chamomile Extract</strong> – Helps calm and comfort the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2046\"><strong data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1939\">Sweet Almond Seed Powder</strong> – Provides gentle physical exfoliation to help smooth rough texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1975\" data-content-reference-end=\"2007\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fjoay\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2072\">Unique Mochi Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2360\">The cleanser has ARENCIA\'s signature <strong data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2149\">stretchy, dough-like mochi texture</strong>. The brand says the cleanser undergoes extensive kneading and slow fermentation to create its characteristic texture, which develops into a soft foam when mixed with water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2284\" data-content-reference-end=\"2303\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2376\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2402\"><strong data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2402\">As a daily cleanser:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rngxch\" data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2441\">\r\nTake a small amount onto wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16cc2ca\" data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2484\">\r\nAdd water and create a soft, rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e424rd\" data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\nGently massage over the face in circular motions.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2603\"><strong data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2603\">As a wash-off mask:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2819\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ybn99o\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2651\">\r\nApply a slightly thicker layer to damp skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l6o272\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\nLeave on for approximately <strong data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2697\">1–2 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mvf9ts\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\nGently massage with wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100b0z2\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2819\">\r\nRinse thoroughly. Use <strong data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2780\">1–2 times per week</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2725\" data-content-reference-end=\"2757\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2840\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2862\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2854\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11hz71x\" data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2911\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2877\">Product:</strong> Fresh Rosehip Rice Mochi Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy4qr\" data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2928\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2923\">Size:</strong> 120g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ac0ri7\" data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2972\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2940\">Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser / Wash-Off Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"clg3vy\" data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2987\">Texture:</strong> Soft, stretchy mochi-like dough\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkepc2\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3113\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3042\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rosehip Extract, Rice Powder, Pink Aloe Vera, Chamomile, Almond Powder\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xgtrv6\" data-start=\"3114\" data-end=\"3193\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3116\" data-end=\"3134\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, dryness, rough texture, impurities, excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o4ru66\" data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3283\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3196\" data-end=\"3210\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types, especially dry, dull, sensitive, and uneven-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lig6d8\" data-start=\"3284\" data-end=\"3347\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3286\" data-end=\"3297\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3248\" data-content-reference-end=\"3280\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3513\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3362\">Best for:</strong> Dry, dull, sensitive, or rough-textured skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3512\">gentle cleansing, mild exfoliation, hydration, soothing care, and a natural-looking glow</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/4CxFndHTEBm4QL8H17i9i0vEQJxxKNKMZCRHGc0X.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:42:16','2026-09-17 12:36:08'),(246,'Blue Hyssop Rice Mochi Cleanser 120ml','blue-hyssop-rice-mochi-cleanser-120ml','<p data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"457\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"92\">ARENCIA Blue Hyssop Rice Mochi Cleanser</strong> is a Korean purifying facial cleanser with a unique <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"182\">soft, stretchy mochi-like texture</strong>. It is formulated with <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"295\">Hyssop Extract, Rice Powder, Kaolin Clay, Green Tea, Chaga Mushroom, and Black Barley</strong> to help remove excess sebum, unclog pores, gently exfoliate dead skin cells, and leave the skin feeling clean and hydrated. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"420\" data-content-reference-end=\"452\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"475\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nf375g\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"570\">\r\n🫧 <strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"505\">Deep Pore Cleansing</strong> – Helps remove excess oil, dirt, fine dust, and pore impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1cz3p\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n🖤 <strong data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"602\">Blackhead &amp; Sebum Care</strong> – Helps clear pore buildup and reduce excess shine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zacjfn\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"772\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"682\">Gentle Exfoliation</strong> – Rice Powder and Almond Seed Meal help remove dead skin cells and rough surface buildup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ht060n\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"795\">Soothing Care</strong> – Hyssop and Green Tea help keep the skin feeling refreshed and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3lj255\" data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"994\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"899\">Hydration Support</strong> – Chaga Mushroom, Sea Water Extract, and moisturizing ingredients help maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ya6mcx\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1082\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1024\">Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Helps make rough and uneven-looking skin feel smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11g4c3h\" data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n🧖 <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1114\">2-in-1 Cleanser &amp; Mask</strong> – Can be used as a daily cleanser or a short wash-off mask for deeper pore care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13p8wdp\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1357\">\r\n⚖️ <strong data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1236\">Helps Maintain Moisture Balance</strong> – Designed to cleanse excess oil without leaving the skin feeling excessively dry. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1309\" data-content-reference-end=\"1341\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1378\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1492\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1398\">Hyssop Extract</strong> – Helps provide soothing and conditioning care while supporting a cleaner-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1605\"><strong data-start=\"1494\" data-end=\"1509\">Rice Powder</strong> – Provides gentle physical exfoliation and helps remove surface impurities and dead skin cells.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1771\"><strong data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1632\">Kaolin/Bentonite Clay</strong> – Helps absorb excess oil and impurities, making it particularly useful for oily and congested skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1718\" data-content-reference-end=\"1750\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1849\"><strong data-start=\"1773\" data-end=\"1794\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1961\"><strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1877\">Chaga Mushroom Extract</strong> – Contains beta-glucan and helps support hydration and a supple-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2120\"><strong data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1987\">Black Barley Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and conditioning benefits while helping maintain a smooth skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2062\" data-content-reference-end=\"2081\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6fjoay\" data-start=\"2122\" data-end=\"2146\">Unique Mochi Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2422\">The cleanser has ARENCIA\'s signature <strong data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2227\">chewy, stretchy rice-cake-like texture</strong>. The brand describes its production as extensive kneading followed by fermentation, creating a texture that develops into a soft foam when mixed with water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2346\" data-content-reference-end=\"2378\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2438\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2464\"><strong data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2464\">As a daily cleanser:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h9qmg7\" data-start=\"2465\" data-end=\"2510\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount onto wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jsyaar\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\nAdd water and work into a soft, rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vvrdxv\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2625\">\r\nGently massage over the face, especially oily or congested areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2691\"><strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2691\">As a wash-off mask:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nshzwl\" data-start=\"2692\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\nApply a thin layer to damp skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16lysan\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2771\">\r\nLeave for approximately <strong data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2770\">1–2 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mvf9ts\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2805\">\r\nGently massage with wet hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2846\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o8wrm5\" data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2936\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2876\">1–2 times per week</strong> for deeper cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2855\" data-content-reference-end=\"2887\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2957\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wb64fu\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2979\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2961\" data-end=\"2971\">Brand:</strong> ARENCIA\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b8x8lx\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3026\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"2994\">Product:</strong> Blue Hyssop Rice Mochi Cleanser\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpy4qr\" data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3043\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3029\" data-end=\"3038\">Size:</strong> 120g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ac0ri7\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3087\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3046\" data-end=\"3055\">Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser / Wash-Off Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pr2lz4\" data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3136\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3102\">Texture:</strong> Soft, stretchy mochi-like texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"blzzis\" data-start=\"3137\" data-end=\"3227\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3159\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Hyssop Extract, Rice Powder, Kaolin Clay, Green Tea, Chaga Mushroom\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13n06v5\" data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3313\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3248\">Main Concerns:</strong> Excess sebum, blackheads, clogged pores, rough texture, dullness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rnl3a0\" data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3449\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3316\" data-end=\"3330\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types; particularly suitable for oily, combination, and congested skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3363\" data-content-reference-end=\"3396\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3463\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3644\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3477\" data-end=\"3490\">Best for:</strong> Oily, combination, congested, or rough-textured skin looking for <strong data-start=\"3556\" data-end=\"3643\">deep pore cleansing, gentle exfoliation, sebum control, and a fresh hydrated finish</strong>.</p>',NULL,NULL,3,24,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/fg0dmsHgBrWYmyrdBFDjWpjx0iky7RmpXFvXRBVp.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-30 09:44:10','2026-09-17 12:29:44'),(247,'Black Tea Rice Mochi Cleanser 120ml','black-tea-rice-mochi-cleanser-120ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:0b5a3540-1c85-4184-9e07-3d0cb20823a9-1\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" d