ionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"460\">Key Features</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"743\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6lll5t\" data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"495\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"495\">Gentle daily facial cleanser</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yq3b21\" data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"605\">\r\nRemoves:\r\n<ul data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j40gqr\" data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"515\">\r\nDirt\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hsq0zj\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"532\">\r\nExcess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gouqb9\" data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"554\">\r\nSunscreen residue\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16iila6\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"576\">\r\nMakeup impurities\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lcbirq\" data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"605\">\r\nEnvironmental pollutants\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18f8xao\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"668\">\r\nHelps skin feel:\r\n<ul data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"668\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16xd4y5\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"634\">\r\nClean\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66y53e\" data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"645\">\r\nSmooth\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4di06\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"654\">\r\nSoft\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"146jbv8\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"668\">\r\nRefreshed\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ckeh7\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"743\">\r\nDesigned to cleanse without excessive stripping of natural skin moisture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ct2xra\" data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"774\">Key Ingredients &amp; Benefits</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"98agiy\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"803\">1. Black Tea Extract 🍵</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"976\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i7tdkv\" data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"826\">\r\nRich in antioxidants\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jgq5ds\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"873\">\r\nHelps protect skin from environmental stress\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13rdewv\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"925\">\r\nSupports healthier-looking and more balanced skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"67xj2q\" data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"976\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of tired, dull skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"145geg\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1000\">2. Rice Extract 🌾</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63lkg\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1040\">\r\nTraditionally used in Korean skincare\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tk2c7s\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1070\">\r\nHelps improve skin radiance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lfanz0\" data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\nProvides a smoother skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k54ybi\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1144\">\r\nSupports a fresh, glowing appearance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xfcexs\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1180\">3. Moisturizing Cleansing Base</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"81qumy\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\nCreates a creamy foam\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uipj1q\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\nHelps reduce the tight, dry feeling after cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3659te\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1298\">\r\nLeaves skin comfortable after washing\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12btmte\" data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1323\">Texture &amp; Experience</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1odcz35\" data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\nThick, creamy mochi-like texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r1lv04\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1383\">\r\nSoft and cushiony foam\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d7wpow\" data-start=\"1384\" data-en