am<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Collagen Cream / Moisturizer / Tone-Up Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,35,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/9iaG9AVPXUJVHQSfUkykv9ALIvIIj1QqBz3LFqpQ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 09:49:11','2026-09-17 11:25:51'),(254,'Speed Whitening Ex Tone-Up Cream 50ml','speed-whitening-ex-tone-up-cream-50ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>DABO Speed Whitening EX Tone-Up Cream</strong> is a brightening and tone-up facial cream designed to make the skin look brighter, fresher, and more even-toned. It helps improve the appearance of dull-looking skin while providing a smooth and radiant finish.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps brighten the overall appearance of the skin</li><li>Provides an instant-looking <strong>tone-up effect</strong></li><li>Helps skin appear more even and radiant</li><li>Makes dull and tired-looking skin look fresher</li><li>Helps keep the skin soft and moisturized</li><li>Provides a smooth, clean-looking finish</li><li>Can be used as a tone-up base before makeup</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying your regular skincare products, take an appropriate amount of cream and apply evenly to the face and neck. Gently pat or massage until absorbed. For daytime use, apply sunscreen as the final step of your skincare routine.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for those who want a brighter, fresher-looking complexion and an instant tone-up effect, particularly for dull or uneven-looking skin.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> DABO Speed Whitening EX Tone-Up Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Tone-Up Cream / Brightening Cream / Facial Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,35,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/z7T8sVF8X9tlVSyRnZUWwrRRkHNvZXaHSP9ijRUk.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 09:5