ream</strong> is a moisturizing facial cream designed to provide refreshing hydration and nourishment while helping the skin feel soft, smooth, and comfortable. Its sherbet-like texture melts smoothly into the skin, providing a lightweight and refreshing moisturizing experience without feeling overly heavy.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides refreshing and lasting moisture</li><li>Helps relieve dryness and tightness</li><li>Keeps the skin soft, smooth, and supple</li><li>Helps maintain the skin’s moisture balance</li><li>Supports a healthy and hydrated-looking complexion</li><li>Provides nourishment for dry and tired-looking skin</li><li>Leaves the skin feeling fresh and comfortable</li><li>Lightweight texture suitable for everyday use</li></ul><h3>Sherbet Texture</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The unique <strong>sherbet-style texture</strong> feels fresh upon application and spreads easily over the skin. It melts comfortably as you massage it in, leaving the skin moisturized and smooth without a heavy, greasy feeling.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner or serum, take an appropriate amount of cream and gently apply it evenly over the face and neck. Pat lightly until absorbed. Use morning and evening as the final step of your skincare routine.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>normal, dry, combination, and dehydrated skin</strong> that needs refreshing moisture and daily nourishment. It is particularly suitable for those who prefer a lightweight yet moisturizing cream.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> DABO 7 in 1 Moisture Sherbet Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 80ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Moisturizing Cream / Hydrating Cream / Sherbet Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,35,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ROwTuGfYGbFxZJigq6rcct82VwpjSVqthbWx1UHG.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:09:24','2026-09-17 11: