shing facial cleanser formulated with amino acid-based cleansing ingredients to gently remove dirt, excess oil, impurities, and daily buildup. Its soft bubble texture helps cleanse the skin comfortably while maintaining a hydrated and smooth feel.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Gently cleanses dirt, impurities, and excess sebum</li><li>Amino acid-based formula provides gentle cleansing care</li><li>Helps maintain the skin’s natural moisture balance</li><li>Leaves skin feeling fresh, clean, and comfortable</li><li>Helps prevent the dry or tight feeling after cleansing</li><li>Supports soft and smooth-looking skin</li><li>Lightweight bubble texture is easy to apply and rinse</li><li>Suitable for everyday facial cleansing</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Wet your face with lukewarm water and dispense an appropriate amount of cleanser. Gently massage the bubbles over your entire face, avoiding the eye area. Rinse thoroughly with clean water and pat dry. Follow with toner and your regular skincare products.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>normal, dry, combination, and sensitive skin</strong> looking for a gentle daily cleanser. It is especially suitable for those who prefer a soft foaming cleanser that leaves the skin feeling clean without excessive dryness.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> DR.Althea Amino Acid Gentle Bubble Cleanser<br><strong>Size:</strong> 140ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Bubble Cleanser / Amino Acid Cleanser / Gentle Facial Cleanser</p>',NULL,NULL,3,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/PbYdaei9vWFi9sp4jlqLBPqFSItZ9XZsxJBUAtiE.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:29:33','2026-09-16 09:16:17'),(270,'345 Relief Cream Mist 100ml','345-relief-cream-mist-100ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea 345 Relief Cream Mist</strong> is a soothing and hydrating facial mist designed to provide instant moisture and comfort to the skin. Its convenient mist format makes it easy to refresh dry, stressed, or tired-looking skin throughout the day. It helps maintain a soft, smooth, and healthy-looking complexion while supporting the skin’s moisture balance.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides instant hydration and refreshing moisture</li><li>Helps soothe and comfort stressed-looking skin</li><li>Helps reduce the feeling of dryness and tightness</li><li>Supports a smooth and moisturized skin texture</li><li>Helps maintain the skin’s moisture balance</li><li>Refreshes dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Convenient for use throughout the day</li><li>Can be used before or after makeup</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Close your eyes and spray an appropriate amount evenly over the face from a suitable distance. Allow the mist to absorb naturally or gently pat it into the skin. Use whenever your skin feels dry or needs a refreshing boost of moisture.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>dry, dehydrated, sensitive, combination, and stressed-looking skin</strong>. It is especially useful for anyone who wants convenient hydration and soothing care throughout the day.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr.Althea 345 Relief Cream Mist<br><strong>Size:</strong> 100ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Facial Mist / Hydrating Mist / Soothing Cream Mist</p>',NULL,NULL,9,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Mzmsj9yRnG0p6vBZuTI3beK6uB5G6Lp5ddVlHbV4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:31:25','2026-09-16 09:04:30'),(271,'Gentle Vitamin C Serum 30ml','gentle-vitamin-c-serum-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea Gentle Vitamin C Serum</strong> is a lightweight brightening serum designed to help improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin. Formulated with Vitamin C, it provides antioxidant and brightening care while helping the skin look smoother, fresher, and more radiant.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps brighten dull-looking skin</li><li>Supports a more even and radiant-looking complexion</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone</li><li>Provides antioxidant care against environmental stressors</li><li>Helps promote a smoother-looking skin texture</li><li>Supports healthy and refreshed-looking skin</li><li>Provides lightweight hydration</li><li>Suitable for daily brightening skincare</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner, apply an appropriate amount of serum evenly over the face and neck. Gently pat until fully absorbed. Follow with moisturizer. During the daytime, always apply sunscreen as the final step.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Suitable for <strong>dull, uneven, normal, combination, and dry skin</strong> looking for gentle brightening and antioxidant care. If you have sensitive skin, introduce Vitamin C gradually and perform a patch test before regular use.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr.Althea Gentle Vitamin C Serum<br><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Vitamin C Serum / Brightening Serum / Antioxidant Serum</p>',NULL,NULL,11,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/nzKhgmARQW8Lt3ZssQymmVajyrjuRLkKnpbuvDJo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:32:54','2026-09-16 09:15:42'),(272,'Melaclear Cream 20ml','melaclear-cream-20ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Melaclear Cream</strong> is a targeted skincare cream designed to help improve the appearance of dark spots, uneven skin tone, and dull-looking skin. Its nourishing formula helps support a brighter, smoother, and more even-looking complexion while providing daily moisturizing care.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps improve the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation</li><li>Supports a brighter and more even-looking skin tone</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of dullness</li><li>Provides moisturizing and nourishing care</li><li>Supports smoother-looking skin texture</li><li>Helps maintain a healthy and radiant complexion</li><li>Convenient targeted cream for daily skincare</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner or serum, take a small amount of cream and gently apply it to areas of concern or evenly over the face, depending on your skincare routine. Pat lightly until absorbed. During daytime use, always apply sunscreen.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>dull, uneven, and pigmentation-prone-looking skin</strong> seeking targeted brightening and moisturizing care.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Melaclear Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 20ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Dark Spot Cream / Brightening Cream / Facial Treatment Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/3eMLd9AT3oCi0ZZEjonOoRQB70o24QBocu64MlH9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'inactive',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:35:09','2026-09-16 09:15:11'),(273,'Niathione Cream 30ml','niathione-cream-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Niathione Cream</strong> is a brightening and nourishing facial cream designed to help improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin. Its moisturizing formula helps keep the skin soft, smooth, and hydrated while supporting a brighter and more radiant complexion.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps brighten dull-looking skin</li><li>Supports a more even-looking skin tone</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of uneven complexion</li><li>Provides moisturizing and nourishing care</li><li>Helps keep skin soft, smooth, and supple</li><li>Supports a healthy and radiant-looking complexion</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of tired-looking skin</li><li>Suitable for daily skincare routines</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing, toner, and serum, take an appropriate amount of cream and gently apply it evenly over the face and neck. Pat lightly until fully absorbed. Use morning and evening as the final step of your skincare routine. During the daytime, finish with sunscreen.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>dull, uneven, dry, normal, and combination skin</strong> looking for brightening and moisturizing care.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Niathione Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Brightening Cream / Moisturizing Cream / Facial Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/WicgtP8C3Wq33jvQctAjVATsq5qb8JdJBf3nJJn7.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:37:39','2026-09-16 09:13:54'),(274,'Pure Grinding Cleansing Balm 50ml','pure-grinding-cleansing-balm-50ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Pure Grinding Cleansing Balm</strong> is a gentle yet effective cleansing balm designed to dissolve makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, and daily impurities. Its smooth balm texture melts easily upon contact with the skin and transforms into a lightweight cleansing oil when massaged with water, helping leave the skin feeling clean, soft, and refreshed.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Effectively removes makeup and sunscreen</li><li>Helps dissolve excess oil and impurities</li><li>Gently cleanses the skin without excessive rubbing</li><li>Helps keep the skin feeling soft and comfortable</li><li>Supports a smooth and clean-looking complexion</li><li>Melts easily over the skin for convenient cleansing</li><li>Helps prepare the skin for the next steps of skincare</li><li>Suitable for use as the first step of a double-cleansing routine</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Take an appropriate amount of cleansing balm with dry hands and gently massage it onto a dry face. Focus on areas with makeup, sunscreen, and excess sebum. Add a small amount of lukewarm water and massage until the balm emulsifies into a milky texture. Rinse thoroughly with water and follow with a water-based cleanser if desired.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Suitable for <strong>normal, dry, combination, and oily skin</strong>. Ideal for anyone looking for a convenient first-step cleanser to remove makeup, sunscreen, and daily impurities.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Pure Grinding Cleansing Balm<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Cleansing Balm / Makeup Remover / First-Step Cleanser</p>',NULL,NULL,2,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Ae6AZnOAfx86l5EZZ68p7wVEeEyYdn62jEiGWFTy.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:41:03','2026-09-16 09:13:13'),(275,'0.1% Gentle Retinol Serum 30ml','01-gentle-retinol-serum-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea 0.1% Gentle Retinol Serum</strong> is a mild anti-aging serum formulated with <strong>0.1% Retinol</strong> to help improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven skin texture, and dull-looking skin. Its gentle formulation is designed to provide retinol care while helping maintain a smooth, hydrated, and healthy-looking complexion.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Contains <strong>0.1% Retinol</strong> for gentle anti-aging care</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles</li><li>Supports smoother and more refined-looking skin texture</li><li>Helps brighten dull-looking skin</li><li>Supports a firmer and more elastic-looking complexion</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin texture</li><li>Provides nourishing and moisturizing skincare</li><li>Suitable for introducing retinol into a regular skincare routine</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner, take a small amount of serum and gently apply it to the face and neck. Start by using it <strong>2–3 times a week</strong>, then gradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol. Follow with a moisturizer.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">During the daytime, always apply <strong>broad-spectrum sunscreen</strong>, as retinol can increase the skin\'s sensitivity to sunlight.</p><h3>Important Tips</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Retinol may cause temporary dryness, redness, or sensitivity, especially when first introduced. Avoid combining it with multiple strong exfoliating or active products until your skin adjusts. Perform a patch test before regular use.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for those concerned about <strong>fine lines, uneven texture, dullness, and early signs of aging</strong> and who prefer a lower-strength retinol product.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr.Althea 0.1% Gentle Retinol Serum<br><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml<br><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> 0.1% Retinol<br><strong>Type:</strong> Retinol Serum / Anti-Aging Serum / Skin Texture Serum</p>',NULL,NULL,11,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/GZPzWkZh7jFnq9kIoZYbAsxHgupzy3zPSiVBoOIK.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:43:44','2026-09-16 09:12:44'),(276,'Pure Retinol 0.15% Cream 20ml','pure-retinol-015-cream-20ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Pure Retinol 0.15% Cream</strong> is an anti-aging treatment cream formulated with <strong>0.15% Retinol</strong> to help improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven skin texture, dullness, and visible signs of skin aging. Its nourishing cream formula helps support smoother, firmer, and more youthful-looking skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Contains <strong>0.15% Retinol</strong> for targeted anti-aging care</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles</li><li>Supports smoother and more refined-looking skin texture</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin</li><li>Supports a firmer and more elastic-looking complexion</li><li>Helps promote a healthier-looking skin appearance</li><li>Provides moisturizing and nourishing care</li><li>Ideal for a nighttime skincare routine</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner or serum, take a small amount and gently apply it evenly over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas. Start with <strong>2–3 applications per week</strong> and gradually increase usage as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol. Follow with a moisturizer if needed.</p><h3>Important Tips</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Retinol can cause dryness, redness, or sensitivity when first introduced. Avoid using it together with multiple strong exfoliating or active ingredients until your skin adjusts. Always use <strong>broad-spectrum sunscreen during the daytime</strong> when using retinol products.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for those concerned about <strong>fine lines, wrinkles, uneven texture, dullness, and early signs of aging</strong> who want a moderate-strength retinol treatment.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Pure Retinol 0.15% Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 20ml<br><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> 0.15% Retinol<br><strong>Type:</strong> Retinol Cream / Anti-Aging Cream / Skin Texture Treatment</p>',NULL,NULL,16,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Aq0xwOvyLaTZZdfC8dTf1SEszh8BCvfXb7HAq5wl.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:46:19','2026-09-16 09:12:11'),(277,'Aqua Marine Watery Cream 50ml','aqua-marine-watery-cream-50ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea Aqua Marine Watery Cream</strong> is a lightweight, refreshing moisturizer designed to provide intense hydration without leaving the skin feeling heavy or greasy. Its watery cream texture spreads smoothly over the skin and helps maintain a 