 and hydrated without feeling overly heavy.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps protect skin from harmful UV rays</li><li>Provides lightweight daily sun protection</li><li>Helps keep the skin hydrated and moisturized</li><li>Gives a fresh, healthy-looking glow</li><li>Helps prevent the skin from looking dull and dry</li><li>Leaves the skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortable</li><li>Lightweight texture suitable for everyday use</li><li>Works well as the final step of a morning skincare routine</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">As the final step of your morning skincare routine, apply an adequate amount evenly to the face, neck, and other exposed areas. Gently spread until absorbed. Apply before sun exposure and reapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor activities.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>normal, dry, combination, and dehydrated skin</strong>, especially for those who prefer a moisturizing sunscreen with a natural glowing finish.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Aqua Glowing Sunscreen<br><strong>Size:</strong> 45ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Sunscreen / Hydrating Sunscreen / Glow Sunscreen</p>',NULL,NULL,21,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/JZorvgs1IJ98XWelA2Oitpu3UOFxgD07d2noBcTD.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 10:54:26','2026-09-16 09:11:02'),(280,'Green Relief Amino Gel Cleanser 100ml','green-relief-amino-gel-cleanser-100ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Green Relief Amino Gel Cleanser</strong> is a gentle, refreshing facial cleanser formulated with amino acid-based cleansing ingredients to effectively remove dirt, excess oil, impurities, and daily buildup while helping maintain the skin’s natural moisture balance. Its soft gel texture provides comfortable cleansing without leaving the skin feeling excessively dry or tight.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3