orts a smooth and supple-looking complexion</li><li>Helps reduce the feeling of dryness and tightness</li><li>Maintains the skin’s moisture balance</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Leaves skin feeling fresh, soft, and comfortable</li><li>Lightweight texture suitable for daily use</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner, take an appropriate amount of serum and gently apply it over the face and neck. Pat lightly until fully absorbed. Follow with a moisturizer to help lock in moisture. Use morning and evening.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>dry, dehydrated, normal, and combination skin</strong> that needs additional hydration. It is especially suitable for those who prefer a lightweight serum with a refreshing, moisturizing finish.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Aqua Marine Deep Serum<br><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Hydrating Serum / Aqua Serum / Moisture Serum</p>',NULL,NULL,11,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/0w7JVvA2Eqv0xHpymYCLV7cxlOTlbqB9aAbjJ5xY.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 11:00:20','2026-09-16 09:10:06'),(282,'Green Tea Fresh Sunscreen 45ml','green-tea-fresh-sunscreen-45ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea Green Tea Fresh Sunscreen</strong> is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to help protect the skin from harmful UV exposure while providing refreshing and moisturizing skincare. Enriched with <strong>Green Tea</strong>, it helps support a fresh, comfortable, and healthy-looking complexion without feeling overly heavy on the skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps protect the skin from daily UV exposure</li><li>Provides lightweight and refreshing sun protection</li><li>Green Tea provides antioxidant skincare</li><li>Helps keep the skin hydrated and comfortable</li><li>Supports a fresh and healthy-looking complexion</li><li>Helps prevent skin from appearing dull due to sun exposure</li><li>Lightweight texture suitable for everyday use</li><li>Can be worn as the final step of a morning skincare routine</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Apply an adequate amount evenly over the face, neck, and other exposed areas as the final step of your morning skincare routine. Gently spread until absorbed. Apply before sun exposure and reapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor activities.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>normal, combination, oily, and dehydrated skin</strong> looking for lightweight daily sun protection with a fresh and comfortable finish.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr.Althea Green Tea Fresh Sunscreen<br><strong>Size:</strong> 45ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Sunscreen / Green Tea Sunscreen / Daily UV Protection</p>',NULL,NULL,19,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/CvCZcisXU1lsEH9C7nSrXqTc6fJKVF00sEbCQ9BL.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 11:02:59','2026-09-16 09:09:40'),(283,'Retinol Flat Iron Eye Roller 25ml','retinol-flat-iron-eye-roller-25ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr.Althea Retinol Flat Iron Eye Roller</strong> is an eye-care product designed to provide targeted care for the delicate skin around the eyes. Formulated with <strong>Retinol</strong>, it helps improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven texture, and tired-looking skin while supporting a smoother and more youthful-looking eye area.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles around the eyes</li><li>Retinol supports smoother and more refined-looking skin</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of tired-looking eyes</li><li>Supports a firmer and more youthful-looking eye area</li><li>Helps improve uneven-looking skin texture</li><li>Provides moisturizing care for the delicate eye area</li><li>Roller applicator offers convenient and targeted application</li><li>Helps leave the eye area looking smoother and refreshed</li></ul><h3>Roller Application</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The convenient <strong>eye roller applicator</strong> allows the product to be applied directly around the eye area while providing a cooling and refreshing massage-like sensation. Gently roll along the under-eye area without applying excessive pressure.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner or serum, gently apply an appropriate amount around the eye area using the roller applicator. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Start by using it a few times per week and gradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol. Follow with a moisturizer if needed.</p><h3>Important Tips</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Retinol can cause dryness or sensitivity, particularly when first introduced. Avoid combining it with multiple strong active ingredients around the eye area. During the daytime, use sunscreen to help protect the skin from UV exposure.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr.Althea Retinol Flat Iron Eye Roller<br><strong>Size:</strong> 25ml<br><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> Retinol<br><strong>Type:</strong> Retinol Eye Care / Eye Roller / Anti-Aging Eye Treatment</p>',NULL,NULL,28,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/hXpPOUapMTD5trEvSw9AERriIUtPtY0foqyFqqYx.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 11:06:01','2026-09-16 09:06:05'),(284,'Melaclear Cream 20ml','melaclear-cream-20ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea Melaclear Cream</strong> is a targeted brightening cream designed to help improve the appearance of <strong>dark spots, pigmentation, and uneven-looking skin tone</strong>. Its nourishing formula provides moisturizing care while supporting a brighter, smoother, and more radiant-looking complexion.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation</li><li>Supports a brighter and more even-looking skin tone</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of dull skin</li><li>Provides moisturizing and nourishing care</li><li>Helps promote a smoother-looking skin texture</li><li>Supports a healthy and radiant complexion</li><li>Suitable for targeted brightening skincare</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">After cleansing and applying toner or serum, take a small amount of cream and apply it evenly to the face or directly to areas of concern. Gently pat until absorbed. Use consistently as part of your skincare routine. During the daytime, always apply sunscreen.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ideal for <strong>dull, uneven, and pigmentation-prone-looking skin</strong> seeking targeted brightening and moisturizing care.</p><p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dr. Althea Melaclear Cream<br><strong>Size:</strong> 20ml<br><strong>Type:</strong> Dark Spot Cream / Brightening Cream / Pigmentation Care Cream</p>',NULL,NULL,16,36,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/BKvpHZfgxHULde0KJJgneaGVF7TIpmyNe0Zq10Yy.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-08-31 11:08:22','2026-09-16 09:07:43'),(285,'PDRN Reju 5000 Cream 20ml','pdrn-reju-5000-cream-20ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Dr. Althea PDRN Reju 5000 Cream</strong> is a revitalizing and nourishing facial cream designed to provide intensive moisture and support a smoother, firmer, and healthier-looking complexion. Formulated with <strong>PDRN</strong>, it helps provide skin-conditioning care while improving the appearance of dry, dull, and tired-looking skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps provide deep and lasting hydration</li><li>Supports a smoother and more supple-looking skin texture</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of dry and tired-looking skin</li><li>PDRN-b