e Line Care, Hydration &amp; Skin Smoothing</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,49,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/bA3l3qtrwWa4E1Lol1y1fAHKjl2JguoExgQkYtUN.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-03 11:53:43','2026-09-15 12:45:04'),(309,'Spicule Collagen PDRN Cream 15ml','spicule-collagen-pdrn-cream-15ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MARY &amp; MAY Spicule Collagen PDRN Cream</strong> is a targeted skincare cream designed to support smoother, firmer, and more youthful-looking skin. Formulated with <strong>Spicules, Collagen, and PDRN</strong>, it helps improve the appearance of fine lines, uneven texture, and loss of elasticity while providing moisture and nourishment. Its compact 15ml format makes it convenient for targeted anti-aging care and for gradually introducing active skincare into your routine.</p><h3>✨ Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>🧬 Helps support firmer and more elastic-looking skin</li><li>✨ Helps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles</li><li>💧 Provides moisturizing and nourishing care</li><li>🔄 Helps promote smoother-looking skin texture</li><li>💫 Supports a healthier, more youthful-looking complexion</li><li>🧴 Helps improve the appearance of skin lacking firmness</li><li>🌿 Helps maintain soft and supple skin</li></ul><h3>🌿 Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Spicules</strong> – Tiny mineral-based structures that help enhance the penetration of skincare ingredients and support a skin-renewing effect.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Collagen</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of skin firmness, elasticity, and smoothness while providing conditioning care.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>PDRN</strong> – A skin-conditioning ingredient commonly used in regenerative-focused skincare to support the appearance of healthier and more resilient skin.</p><h3>🧴 How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount to clean, dry skin.</li><li>Gently spread over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.</li><li>Pat lightly until absorbed.</li><li>Follow with a moisturizer if needed.</li><li>Start <strong>2–3 times per week</strong>, especially if your skin is new to spicule-based products, and gradually increase according to skin tolerance.</li><li>Use sunscreen during the daytime.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Avoid combining it with several strong exfoliating or irritating active ingredients when first introducing the product.</p><h3>👩‍🦰 Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Mature-looking skin</li><li>Fine lines and wrinkles</li><li>Loss of firmness and elasticity</li><li>Uneven or rough skin texture</li><li>Dull-looking skin</li><li>Normal to combination skin</li><li>Those seeking collagen and PDRN-focused skincare</li></ul><h3>📦 Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MARY &amp; MAY</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Spicule Collagen PDRN Cream</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 15ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Anti-Aging Facial Cream</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Firming, Elasticity Care, Skin Smoothing, Hydration &amp; Nourishment</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,49,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/RxqPp4iYmneI1jA02jamMFQqEumI02P3Wi2pX2M5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-03 11:59:59','2026-09-15 12:41:04'),(310,'Jeju Aloe Fresh Soothing Gel (Tube) 300ml','jeju-aloe-fresh-soothing-gel-tube-300ml','<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"463\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"104\">THE FACE SHOP Jeju Aloe Fresh Soothing Gel</strong> is a lightweight, multi-purpose soothing and moisturizing gel enriched with <strong data-start=\"181\" data-end=\"215\">95% Aloe Vera from Jeju Island</strong>. It is designed to provide refreshing hydration while helping calm dry, irritated, or sun-exposed skin. T