ion of subsequent skincare products. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"406\" data-content-reference-end=\"438\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"461\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"haaxej\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"533\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"486\">Deeply Hydrates</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and reduce dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nftq40\" data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"564\">Rice Extract Enriched</strong> – Helps improve dull-looking skin and promotes a healthy glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b3yptx\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"716\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"659\">Supports Skin Barrier</strong> – Ceramide helps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ju0eda\" data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"806\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"739\">Brightens Skin</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16ebdc0\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"836\">Softens Skin Texture</strong> – Leaves skin feeling smoother, softer, and more supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i9ttjh\" data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"975\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"922\">Non-Sticky Moisture</strong> – Provides hydration without a heavy, greasy finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kcoshq\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n🔄 <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"998\">Prepares Skin</strong> – Helps prepare the skin for serums, emulsions, and moisturizers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17mf6f8\" data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\n🔬 <strong data-sta