 cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fatmwv\" data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1910\">\r\nGently apply and pat over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xnu0u5\" data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"1944\">\r\nAllow it to absorb completely.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cgekpz\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\nFollow with serum, emulsion, or moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"1994\" data-end=\"2099\">Use <strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2021\">morning and evening</strong> as part of your daily skincare routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2040\" data-content-reference-end=\"2059\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2117\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2325\"><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2136\">All skin types</strong>, particularly <strong data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2193\">dry, dehydrated, dull, and uneven skin</strong>. The toner is especially useful when the skin needs additional hydration and barrier support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2248\" data-content-reference-end=\"2280\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tek5pd\" data-start=\"2327\" data-end=\"2350\">Product Information</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14gzrrp\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2377\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2363\">Brand:</strong> THE FACE SHOP\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eyayjz\" data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2432\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2397\">Product Name:</strong> Rice &amp; Ceramide Moisturizing Toner\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mimo7j\" data-start=\"2433\" data-end=\"2452\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2446\">Volume:</strong> 150ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"apyq72\" data-start=\"2453\" d