 data-section-id=\"1tom2hl\" data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"632\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"566\">Intense Moisturization</strong> – Helps replenish and lock in moisture for softer, smoother skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"og47b1\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"730\">\r\n🛡️ <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"664\">Supports Skin Barrier</strong> – Ceramides help maintain the skin’s protective moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ebhv7r\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"813\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"752\">Rice Extract</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull skin and uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19e0pfe\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"930\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"840\">Brightening Effect</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots, freckles, and pigmentation with regular use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27p3xv\" data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"1003\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"958\">Nourishes Dry Skin</strong> – Helps soften rough, dry, and patchy areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1atfxqh\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1103\">\r\n💦 <strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1032\">Lightweight Texture</strong> – Provides nourishing moisture without feeling overly heavy or sticky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c1hzer\" data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n🌟 <strong data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1125\">Healthy Glow</strong> – Leaves skin looking smoother, fresher, and more radiant.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xdxwz7\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1211\">Ideal for Daytime</strong> – Works as a lighter alternative to a richer face cream. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1258\" data-content-reference-end=\"1290\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1327\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1412\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1345\">Rice Extract</strong> – Helps hydrate and improve the appearance of dull or uneven skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1489\"><strong data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1431\">Rice Bran Oil</strong> – Provides nourishing moisture and helps soften the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1564\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1503\">Ceramide</strong> – Helps reinforce the skin barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1630\"><strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1578\">Glycerin</strong> – Attracts moisture to help keep the skin hydrated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1654\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Provides additional hydration and helps maintain skin moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1812\"><strong data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1737\">Shea Butter</strong> – Helps nourish and soften dry skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1759\" data-content-reference-end=\"1791\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1828\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1867\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19fdeak\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\nFollow with your serum or essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t495d6\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of emulsion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6d5ee\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ya5vg0\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2147\">It can be used <strong data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2065\">morning and evening</strong>. During the daytime, follow with sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2089\" data-content-reference-end=\"2121\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2149\" data-end=\"2165\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2409\"><strong data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2185\">All skin types</strong>, with particular suitability for <strong data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2262\">normal, dry, dehydrated, and rough skin</strong>. Its lightweight texture can also work for combination or oily skin when a lighter moisturizer is preferred. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2346\" data-content-reference-end=\"2378\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2430\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14gzrrp\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2458\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2444\">Brand:</strong> THE FACE SHOP\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vfs5y9\" data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2478\">Product Name:</strong> Ceramide &amp; Rice Lightweight Emulsion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttqe1u\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2533\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2527\">Size:</strong> 150ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w50m2b\" data-start=\"2534\" data-end=\"2575\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2553\">Product Type:</strong> Moisturizing Emulsion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7cjo49\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2666\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2598\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Rice Extract, Rice Bran Oil, Ceramide, Glycerin, Sodium Hyaluronate\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9zn778\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2712\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2681\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, milky, non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1802is5\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2733\">Skin Benefits:</strong> Hydrating, nourishing, barrier-supporting, brightening\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8z6k\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2802\">Origin:</strong> South Korea&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,17,76,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/CVKkFd6uDBFkjjBrF1RnuwCJ7oMIqA8NQRa1TB5V.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 03:40:13','2026-09-16 11:12:43'),(314,'Rice Water Bright Facial Massage Cream 200ml','rice-water-bright-facial-massage-cream-200ml','<p data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"480\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"62\" data-end=\"118\">THE FACE SHOP Rice Water Bright Facial Massage Cream</strong> is a nourishing facial massage cream designed to moisturize, soften, and refresh the skin while helping improve the appearance of dullness. Enriched with <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"329\">rice water/rice extract and rice-derived ingredients</strong>, it provides a smooth texture that allows comfortable facial massage and leaves skin feeling supple and radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"443\" data-content-reference-end=\"475\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"498\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"1291\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iiltoc\" data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"602\">\r\n🌾 <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"530\">Rice-Enriched Formula</strong> – Helps nourish and improve the appearance of dull, tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-secti