<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1499\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1423\">Rice Bran Oil</strong> – Provides nourishing moisture and helps maintain a soft, smooth skin feel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1550\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1513\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1658\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1565\">Adenosine</strong> – A skin-conditioning ingredient commonly used in skincare to support smoother-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1826\"><strong data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1709\">Saponaria Officinalis Leaf Extract (Soapwort)</strong> – A botanical extract used for its cleansing and skin-conditioning properties. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1772\" data-content-reference-end=\"1804\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1842\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rzfcaa\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1923\">\r\nAfter cleansing, apply an adequate amount of the cream evenly over dry skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ua9fgg\" data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\nGently massage the face using <strong data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1985\">outward circular motions</strong>, starting from the center of the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14yfgg1\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\nContinue massaging for several minutes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uoxd89\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2163\">\r\nRemove with a soft tissue or rinse with lukewarm water, depending on your preferred routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b69rtl\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2209\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2313\">For routine massage care, it can be used <strong data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2274\">2–3 times per week</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2254\" data-content-reference-end=\"2286\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zy7chl\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2326\">Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2513\">The product has a <strong data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2381\">rich, smooth and creamy texture</strong> that is designed to provide enough slip for facial massage while helping moisturize the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2449\" data-content-reference-end=\"2468\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2531\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i93wd\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\nAll skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dp2z8s\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2569\">\r\nDull-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pvjg7r\" data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2594\">\r\nDry or dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tjxrlq\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2637\">\r\nSkin needing extra softness and radiance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iyntj3\" data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2704\">\r\nThose who enjoy facial massage as part of their skincare routine\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2725\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14gzrrp\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2753\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2739\">Brand:</strong> THE FACE SHOP\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jsbq83\" data-start=\"2754\" data-end=\"2812\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2773\">Product Name:</strong> Rice Water Bright Facial Massage Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mhs1yh\" data-start=\"2813\" data-end=\"2832\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2826\">Volume:</strong> 200ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eaenme\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2852\">Product Type:</strong> Facial Massage Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ynr8x6\" data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2897\">Main Ingredients:</strong> Rice Extract, Rice Bran Oil, Glycerin, Adenosine\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t55mjv\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2961\">Texture:</strong> Rich, smooth cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1itnsua\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3050\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3001\">Skin Benefits:</strong> Moisturizing, nourishing, brightening, smoothing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cdjw65\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3053\" data-end=\"3075\">Country of Origin:</strong> South Korea&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,76,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/OfddNscCBi0MaxVFrQjWyRBgbBE5DTAARDru2ZhJ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 03:47:43','2026-09-16 11:12:21'),(315,'Jeju Aloe Ice Refreshing Soothing Gel 300ml','jeju-aloe-ice-refreshing-soothing-gel-300ml','<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"591\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"116\">THE FACE SHOP Jeju Aloe Ice Refreshing Soothing Gel</strong> is a refreshing, cooling, and moisturizing multi-purpose gel formulated with <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"232\">Jeju Island Aloe Vera Leaf Extract</strong>. It is specially designed to provide <strong data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"326\">3-in-1 benefits: moisturizing, soothing, and cooling</strong>. The gel can be refrigerated or briefly frozen to create a refreshing sorbet-like texture that melts on the skin and provides an enhanced cooling sensation, making it especially useful during hot weather or after sun exposure. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"554\" data-content-reference-end=\"586\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"609\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n22uo\" data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"718\">\r\n❄️ <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"642\">Instant Cooling Effect</strong> – Provides an intense, refreshing sensation when chilled or lightly frozen.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tj6r78\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"808\">\r\n🌿 <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"742\">Jeju Aloe Vera</strong> – Helps soothe and moisturize dry, heated, or uncomfortable skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4rfhr7\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n💧 <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"832\">Deep Hydration</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and leaves skin feeling soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyxwsm\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"974\">\r\n☀️ <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"924\">After-Sun Care</strong> – Helps cool and comfort skin after sun exposure.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k2y3nd\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1076\">\r\n🧊 <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1002\">Ice-to-Gel Texture</strong> – Develops a sherbet-like texture when frozen and melts upon application.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hnf4ag\" data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n💆 <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1108\">Soothes Irritated Skin</strong> – Suitable for dry, sensitive, or irritated areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmbmff\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1229\">\r\n🧖 <strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1186\">Multi-Purpose Use</strong> – Can be used on the face and entire body.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lr9b3e\" data-start=\"1230\" data-end=\"1346\">\r\n✨ <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1249\">Facial Pack</strong> – Can also be used as a refreshing moisturizing face pack. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1299\" data-content-reference-end=\"1331\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1367\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1455\"><strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1408\">Aloe Vera Leaf Extract (20,000 ppm)</strong> – Helps moisturize, soothe, and cool the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1537\"><strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1470\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps maintain moisture and provides skin-conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1588\"><strong data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1551\">Glycerin</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1669\"><strong data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1630\">Butylene Glycol &amp; Dipropylene Glycol</strong> – Help provide and maintain hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1746\"><strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1686\">Dimethicone</strong> – Helps create a smooth skin feel and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1904\"><strong data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1784\">For regular use:</strong><br data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount to dry, sensitive, or irritated areas of the face and body. Gently spread until absorbed.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1943\"><strong data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1941\">For an enhanced cooling effect:</strong></p>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aw1zrk\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"1992\">\r\nPlace the gel in the refrigerator or freezer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"to7nm3\" data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\nAround <strong data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2029\">20 minutes of freezing</strong> is generally enough.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y539cz\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2168\">\r\nIf the gel becomes completely solid, allow it to sit at room temperature for about <strong data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2151\">10 minutes</strong> before applying.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rxmr48\" data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2282\">\r\nApply to sun-exposed or heated areas for a refreshing cooling sensation. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2230\" data-content-reference-end=\"2249\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2300\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2443\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i93wd\" data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\nAll skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueib1d\" data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\nDry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1akd7xe\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\nSun-exposed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wnhqgc\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\nHeated or uncomfortable skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tifdk4\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2443\">\r\nThose looking for lightweight summer hydration\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2445\" data-end=\"2464\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14gzrrp\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2478\">Brand:</strong> THE FACE SHOP\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eyn48q\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2512\">Product Name:</strong> Jeju Aloe Ice Refreshing Soothing Gel\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tsffyd\" data-start=\"2551\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2562\">Size:</strong> 300ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"l82pe1\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2588\">Product Type:</strong> Soothing &amp; Cooling Gel\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8oicj8\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2661\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2633\">Key Ingredient:</strong> Jeju Aloe Vera Leaf Extract\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lhnlb\" data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2664\" data-end=\"2682\">Main Benefits:</strong> Moisturizing, Soothing &amp; Cooling\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yiyf3p\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2739\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2727\">Uses:</strong> Face &amp; Body\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1iaq1i8\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2754\">Texture:</strong> Translucent gel; sherbet-like when frozen\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xhxnx8\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2860\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2810\">Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,15,76,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/qfM9KsK8l1cjGVn63HeUiEJJ3jHRjYi4DEciOvwv.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 03:54:26','2026-09-16 11:12:00'),(316,'PDRN Pink Peptide Serum 30ml','pdrn-pink-peptide-serum-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE PDRN Pink Peptide Serum</strong> is a lightweight yet deeply moisturizing glow serum designed to improve the appearance of <strong>uneven skin tone, dullness, dryness, fine lines, and loss of firmness</strong>. Formulated with <strong>PDRN, a 5-type peptide complex, niacinamide, adenosine, and hydrating ingredients</strong>, it helps support a smoother, plumper, firmer-looking complexion with a healthy radiant glow.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The serum has a lightweight texture that absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy feeling, making it suitable for everyday skincare. MEDICUBE describes the formula as dermatologist-tested and low-irritating tested, with a pH range of 5.8–7.8.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>✨ <strong>Boosts Skin Radiance</strong> – Helps improve dull-looking skin and promotes a healthy, luminous glow.</li><li>💧 <strong>Intense Hydration</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and plump.</li><li>🧬 <strong>PDRN Care</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of resilient, healthy-looking skin.</li><li>💗 <strong>Improves Elasticity</strong> – Peptides help support firmer and more elastic-looking skin.</li><li>🌟 <strong>Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dullness.</li><li>👌 <strong>Fine Line Care</strong> – Adenosine and peptides help smooth the appearance of fine lines.</li><li>🛡️ <strong>Barrier Support</strong> – Helps maintain a stronger, more comfortable-looking skin barrier.</li><li>🌿 <strong>Soothing Care</strong> – Botanical ingredients help comfort skin that feels dry or irritated.</li><li>💦 <strong>Lightweight Texture</strong> – Absorbs quickly while providing long-lasting moisturization.</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>PDRN / Sodium DNA</strong> – Helps support skin barrier function and contributes to a firmer, healthier-looking complexion.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>5-Type Peptide Complex</strong> – A blend of peptides including Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Copper Tripeptide-1, and Acetyl Hexapeptide-8. Helps support the appearance of firmness, elasticity, and fine lines.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull-looking skin, improve uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Adenosine</strong> – Provides anti-aging care and helps improve the appearance of fine lines.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – A form of hyaluronic acid that helps attract and retain moisture for a hydrated, plump appearance.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong> – Helps condition the skin and support a smoother, supple feel.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Coenzyme Q10</strong> – Provides antioxidant skincare benefits and helps support healthy-looking skin.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and apply toner.</li><li>Dispense an appropriate amount of serum.</li><li>Apply evenly over the face and neck.</li><li>Gently pat until fully absorbed.</li><li>Follow with moisturizer.</li><li>During the daytime, finish with sunscreen.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">MEDICUBE recommends using the serum <strong>morning and night</strong> on clean, dry skin.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Dry skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Oily skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Uneven skin tone</li><li>Dry or dehydrated skin</li><li>Loss of firmness and elasticity</li><li>Fine lines</li></ul><h3>Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> PDRN Pink Peptide Serum</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Serum</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> PDRN, Peptides, Niacinamide, Adenosine</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Hydrating, Brightening, Firming, Elasticity &amp; Fine-Line Care</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight, moisturizing serum</li><li><strong>Skin Types:</strong> All skin types</li><li><strong>pH:</strong> 5.8–7.8</li><li><strong>Testing:</strong> Dermatologist-tested &amp; low-irritating tested</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/5rJ5d8EdJA8mWa37o9YJz7nBC40t40X2gZbKU8yt.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:03:02','2026-09-17 09:25:00'),(317,'Ultra Light PDRN Pink Peptide Serum 30ml','ultra-light-pdrn-pink-peptide-serum-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE Ultra Light PDRN Pink Peptide Serum</strong> is a lightweight, watery serum formulated with <strong>Salmon DNA PDRN, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Vitamin B12, and multiple peptides</strong>. Designed especially for oily and combination skin, it provides quick hydration without a sticky or heavy finish while helping improve the appearance of dullness, uneven skin tone, and loss of elasticity.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its <strong>Nano Dual Encapsulation System</strong> helps deliver hydration efficiently, leaving skin looking fresh, plump, smooth, and radiant. The fast-absorbing texture also makes it suitable for use underneath makeup and during hot or humid weather.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>💧 <strong>Lightweight Hydration</strong> – Provides quick moisture without a greasy or heavy feeling.</li><li>🧬 <strong>Salmon PDRN Care</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and improve the appearance of skin resilience.</li><li>✨ <strong>Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide and Vitamin B12 help enhance radiance and improve the look of uneven skin tone.</li><li>💦 <strong>Plumping Effect</strong> – Hyaluronic Acid helps attract and retain moisture for softer, fuller-looking skin.</li><li>🌟 <strong>Improves Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave skin looking smoother and more refined.</li><li>🛡️ <strong>Barrier Support</strong> – Ceramide NP, cholesterol, and PDRN help support a healthy-looking moisture barrier.</li><li>🌿 <strong>Soothing Care</strong> – Designed as a low-irritation formula for gentle daily skincare.</li><li>💄 <strong>Makeup-Friendly</strong> – Watery, fast-absorbing texture creates a smooth, hydrated base under makeup.</li><li>☀️ <strong>Ideal for Hot &amp; Humid Weather</strong> – Delivers lightweight hydration without excessive stickiness.</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Salmon DNA PDRN (Sodium DNA)</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and contributes to smoother, healthier-looking skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull-looking skin, improve uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Multiple forms of hyaluronic acid help attract and retain moisture for long-lasting hydration and a plump appearance.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin)</strong> – Gives the serum its characteristic pink tone and helps support a radiant-looking complexion.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Peptides</strong> – Includes Copper Tripeptide-1, Oligopeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and Tripeptide-1 to support firmer, smoother-looking skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Ceramide NP &amp; Cholesterol</strong> – Help support the skin\'s moisture barrier.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and apply toner.</li><li>Apply <strong>2–3 drops</strong> of the serum to the face.</li><li>Spread evenly over the face and neck.</li><li>Gently pat until fully absorbed.</li><li>Follow with moisturizer.</li><li>In the morning, finish with sunscreen.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The serum can be used <strong>both morning and night</strong> and can be layered when additional hydration is needed.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Oily skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dehydrated skin</li><li>Dull-looking skin</li><li>Uneven skin tone</li><li>Skin lacking elasticity</li><li>People who prefer lightweight, non-sticky serums</li><li>Hot and humid climates</li></ul><h3>Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Ultra Light PDRN Pink Peptide Serum</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml / 1.01 fl. oz.</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Serum</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Salmon DNA PDRN, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Vitamin B12, Peptides</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Hydrating, Brightening, Soothing, Barrier Support &amp; Elasticity Care</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Watery, lightweight and fast-absorbing</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> Fresh, hydrated glow</li><li><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Especially suitable for oily and combination skin</li><li><strong>Fragrance:</strong> No artificial fragrance</li><li><strong>Colorants:</strong> No artificial colorants</li><li><strong>Testing:</strong> Low-irritation tested</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/kZYxuwzggnoQwFJbSKErhroKwfoLjrCu1X3QJGI5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:05:51','2026-09-17 09:22:23'),(318,'PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream 30ml','pdrn-pink-peptide-eye-cream-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream</strong> is an advanced eye-care cream formulated with <strong>Salmon DNA PDRN, 99% purity Retinol, Peptides, and Niacinamide</strong>. It is designed to target common eye-area concerns such as <strong>fine lines, wrinkles, dark-looking circles, puffiness, dullness, uneven tone, and loss of elasticity</strong>. Its lightweight, non-sticky texture absorbs comfortably while providing hydration and nourishment to the delicate eye area.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>👁️ <strong>Fine Line &amp; Wrinkle Care</strong> – Retinol and peptides help improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.</li><li>🧬 <strong>PDRN Skin Care</strong> – Salmon DNA PDRN helps support smoother, healthier-looking skin around the eyes.</li><li>✨ <strong>Brightening Care</strong> – Niacinamide and PDRN help improve the appearance of dullness and uneven-looking skin tone.</li><li>💗 <strong>Firming &amp; Elasticity Care</strong> – Peptides and retinol help promote firmer, more elastic-looking skin.</li><li>💧 <strong>Deep Hydration</strong> – Hyaluronic acid and moisturizing ingredients help keep the delicate eye area hydrated.</li><li>🌙 <strong>Dark Circle Care</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull, dark-looking under-eye skin.</li><li>❄️ <strong>Puffiness Care</strong> – Caffeine and conditioning ingredients help refresh the appearance of tired-looking eyes.</li><li>🌿 <strong>Lightweight Texture</strong> – Absorbs quickly without leaving a heavy or sticky finish.</li><li>💆 <strong>Multi-Area Use</strong> – Can also be applied to other areas of the face showing early signs of aging.</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Salmon DNA PDRN (Sodium DNA)</strong> – Helps support the skin barrier and promotes a smoother, healthier-looking appearance.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Retinol</strong> – MEDICUBE highlights its 99% purity retinol as an ingredient for improving the appearance of fine lines and supporting elasticity around the eyes.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Peptide Complex</strong> – Includes Copper Tripeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, and Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1 to support firmness and smoother-looking skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Niacinamide</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven skin tone while supporting the skin barrier.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Sodium Hyaluronate, Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid, and Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate help attract and retain moisture.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Caffeine</strong> – Helps refresh the appearance of tired-looking under-eye skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Adenosine</strong> – Provides anti-aging skincare benefits and helps improve the appearance of fine lines.</p><h3>Clinical Results</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">According to MEDICUBE\'s clinical testing:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>2.87% improvement in firmness</strong> around the eye area after 1 week.</li><li><strong>22.5% improvement in moisture</strong> around the eye area after 1 week.</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Results can vary depending on individual skin conditions and usage.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Complete your regular skincare routine.</li><li>Take an appropriate amount of eye cream.</li><li>Gently apply around the eye contour, avoiding direct contact with the eyes.</li><li>Lightly pat with your fingertips until absorbed.</li><li>Use consistently as part of your daily eye-care routine.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Because this formula contains <strong>retinol</strong>, beginners or those with sensitive skin should introduce it gradually and monitor their skin\'s response. Avoid layering multiple strong retinol products around the same area unless your skin tolerates them well.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>All skin types</li><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Dull-looking eye area</li><li>Uneven skin tone</li><li>Dark-looking under-eye area</li><li>Fine lines and wrinkles</li><li>Loss of firmness and elasticity</li><li>Tired-looking eyes</li></ul><h3>Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> PDRN Pink Peptide Eye Cream</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Eye Cream / Eye Serum</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Salmon DNA PDRN, Retinol, Peptides, Niacinamide</li><li><strong>Additional Ingredients:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid, Caffeine, Adenosine</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening, Firming, Hydrating &amp; Anti-Aging Care</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight, silky and non-sticky</li><li><strong>Skin Concerns:</strong> Fine Lines, Wrinkles, Dark Circles, Puffiness, Dullness &amp; Uneven Tone</li><li><strong>Skin Type:</strong> All Skin Types</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,28,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/XxaGFUzrF1IrBTb33qAjKjYROCZdQQpHgYRGWXll.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:08:16','2026-09-17 09:21:32'),(319,'Zero Pore Blackhead Mud Mask 100ml','zero-pore-blackhead-mud-mask-100ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE Zero Pore Blackhead Mud Mask</strong> is a fast-acting deep-cleansing clay mask formulated with <strong>AHA, BHA, PHA, and five types of pore-purifying clay</strong>. It helps remove excess sebum, blackheads, whiteheads, dead skin cells, and pore impurities while leaving the skin feeling cleaner, smoother, and refreshed. MEDICUBE describes it as a <strong>3-minute quick-dry pore-care mask</strong> designed to target enlarged pores and excess oil.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>🖤 <strong>Blackhead &amp; Whitehead Care</strong> – Helps remove pore-clogging impurities and excess sebum.</li><li>🧼 <strong>Deep Pore Cleansing</strong> – Five types of clay help absorb oil and impurities from pores.</li><li>✨ <strong>Exfoliates Dead Skin Cells</strong> – AHA, BHA, and PHA help improve the appearance of rough, congested skin.</li><li>🧴 <strong>Sebum Control</strong> – Helps absorb excess oil, making it particularly useful for oily and combination skin.</li><li>🔍 <strong>Pore Refining Care</strong> – Helps reduce the appearance of enlarged and congested pores.</li><li>🌿 <strong>Smoother Skin Texture</strong> – Helps leave skin feeling softer, cleaner, and more refined.</li><li>❄️ <strong>Cooling &amp; Refreshing</strong> – Provides a refreshing sensation as the mask dries.</li><li>⚡ <strong>Quick Treatment</strong> – Designed to work in approximately <strong>3–5 minutes</strong>, making it convenient for weekly pore care.</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kaolin &amp; Bentonite</strong> – Mineral clays that help absorb excess sebum and draw impurities from the skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Canadian Colloidal Clay, Montmorillonite &amp; Illite</strong> – Additional clays that contribute to deep pore cleansing and oil absorption.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>AHA (Glycolic Acid)</strong> – Helps exfoliate dead skin cells and improve the appearance of uneven skin texture.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>BHA (Salicylic Acid)</strong> – Oil-soluble exfoliant that helps unclog pores and target blackheads.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>PHA (Gluconolactone)</strong> – A gentler exfoliating acid that helps improve skin texture while providing mild exfoliation.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture to prevent the skin from feeling excessively dry.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Allantoin</strong> – Helps condition and comfort the skin.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and pat the skin completely dry.</li><li>Apply an even layer of the mud mask, avoiding the <strong>eye and lip areas</strong>.</li><li>Focus on areas prone to blackheads and excess oil, such as the <strong>nose, forehead, and chin</strong>.</li><li>Leave on for approximately <strong>3–5 minutes</strong> until the mask dries.</li><li>Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</li><li>Follow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">MEDICUBE recommends adjusting the application time according to the amount used and individual skin type.</p><h3>Recommended Frequency</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Use approximately <strong>1–2 times per week</strong> as a deep pore treatment. If your skin is sensitive or already uses other exfoliating products, start less frequently.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Oily skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dry skin with congested pores</li><li>Blackheads and whiteheads</li><li>Enlarged-looking pores</li><li>Excess sebum</li><li>Rough skin texture</li><li>Pore congestion</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">MEDICUBE lists the product for <strong>all skin types</strong>, including oily, combination, and dry skin.</p><h3>Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Zero Pore Blackhead Mud Mask</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 100g / 3.52 oz.</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Clay / Mud Face Mask</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> AHA, BHA, PHA, Kaolin, Bentonite</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Blackhead Care, Deep Cleansing, Sebum Control &amp; Pore Care</li><li><strong>Skin Concerns:</strong> Blackheads, Whiteheads, Excess Oil, Enlarged Pores &amp; Rough Texture</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Creamy mud/clay</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> 1–2 times weekly</li><li><strong>Testing:</strong> Dermatologist-tested and low-irritation tested</li><li><strong>Free From:</strong> Alcohol and metals</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,24,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/goV2IVGoJDbr7NlFF19me618Y5JMWof2hnOwL8Bo.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:10:36','2026-09-17 09:20:51'),(320,'Deep Vita C Capsule Cream 55ml','deep-vita-c-capsule-cream-55ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE Deep Vita C Capsule Cream</strong> is a brightening and radiance-boosting facial cream designed to improve the appearance of <strong>dark spots, uneven skin tone, dullness, rough texture, and early signs of aging</strong>. It features a unique <strong>dual-texture capsule-and-gel formula</strong>, allowing you to customize the amount of vitamin capsule and transparent gel according to your skin\'s needs.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The golden vitamin capsules contain <strong>50% Sea Buckthorn Extract, 5% Niacinamide, and Pure Vitamin C</strong>, while the transparent gel contains <strong>Ferulic Acid, Vitamin E, and antioxidant ingredients</strong>. The encapsulated Vitamin C is designed to help protect its freshness until the capsule is mixed with the gel during application.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>✨ <strong>Brightens Dull Skin</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of dull, tired-looking skin.</li><li>🌟 <strong>Dark Spot Care</strong> – Helps reduce the visible appearance of spots and uneven pigmentation.</li><li>💛 <strong>Evens Skin Tone</strong> – Helps create a brighter and more even-looking complexion.</li><li>🍊 <strong>Vitamin C Care</strong> – Pure Vitamin C provides antioxidant and brightening benefits.</li><li>💧 <strong>Moisturizes Skin</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and leave skin soft and supple.</li><li>🛡️ <strong>Antioxidant Protection</strong> – Vitamin C, Sea Buckthorn, Vitamin E, and Ferulic Acid provide antioxidant skincare benefits.</li><li>💗 <strong>Firming Care</strong> – Vitamin C and niacinamide help support firmer, healthier-looking skin.</li><li>🔬 <strong>Pore &amp; Texture Care</strong> – Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of skin texture and pore visibility.</li><li>⚙️ <strong>Customizable Texture</strong> – Adjust the capsule-to-gel ratio depending on whether you prefer a lighter or richer finish.</li><li>🌿 <strong>Low-Irritation Formula</strong> – MEDICUBE states that the product has been tested for low irritation.</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>50% Sea Buckthorn Extract (Vitamin Tree Water)</strong> – Rich in antioxidants and helps provide nourishment and hydration for softer, healthier-looking skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>5% Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of uneven skin tone while supporting the skin barrier and improving the look of texture and pores.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Pure Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid)</strong> – Provides antioxidant benefits and helps improve the appearance of dullness, uneven tone, and pigmentation while supporting a radiant complexion.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Ferulic Acid</strong> – Provides antioxidant benefits and helps support the stability and effectiveness of Vitamin C.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Vitamin E</strong> – Helps nourish and moisturize the skin while providing antioxidant support.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Alpha-Arbutin</strong> – Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and pigmentation.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Helps attract and retain moisture for a hydrated and plumper-looking complexion.</p><h3>Unique Dual-Texture Formula</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The cream combines <strong>golden vitamin capsules with a transparent gel</strong>. The capsule contains concentrated brightening ingredients, while the gel provides hydration and antioxidant care.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You can customize the texture by adjusting the ratio:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>More gel:</strong> Lighter, fresher feel.</li><li><strong>More capsule:</strong> Richer hydration and elasticity-focused care.</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The capsule technology is designed to help protect Vitamin C from oxidation until application.</p><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>After cleansing, toner, and serum, take an appropriate amount of the cream.</li><li>Mix the <strong>vitamin capsule and transparent gel</strong> together.</li><li>Adjust the ratio according to your skin type and desired texture.</li><li>Apply evenly over the face and neck.</li><li>Gently pat until absorbed.</li><li>Use <strong>morning and evening</strong>.</li><li>During the daytime, finish with a broad-spectrum sunscreen.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Because this product contains Vitamin C and brightening ingredients, consistent daytime sunscreen use is recommended.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>All skin types</li><li>Dull-looking skin</li><li>Uneven skin tone</li><li>Dark spots and pigmentation concerns</li><li>Rough skin texture</li><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Skin lacking radiance</li><li>Early signs of aging</li><li>Combination and oily skin looking for customizable hydration</li></ul><h3>Product Details</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Deep Vita C Capsule Cream</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 55g / 1.94 oz.</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Brightening Facial Cream</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Sea Buckthorn Extract, 5% Niacinamide, Pure Vitamin C, Ferulic Acid, Vitamin E</li><li><strong>Additional Ingredients:</strong> Alpha-Arbutin, Hyaluronic Acid, Adenosine</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening, Dark Spot Care, Hydration, Radiance &amp; Antioxidant Care</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Dual capsule + transparent gel texture</li><li><strong>Skin Type:</strong> All skin types</li><li><strong>pH:</strong> 5.8–7.8</li><li><strong>Testing:</strong> Dermatologist-tested and low-irritation tested</li><li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/byAwCo9uyMyouZSk11nAT8wfZ1GHKG42mzN3z6RI.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:13:09','2026-09-17 09:19:52'),(321,'PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream 55ml','pdrn-pink-collagen-capsule-cream-55ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream 55g</strong> is an innovative dual-texture moisturizer designed to provide intense hydration, improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, and support a firmer, plumper-looking complexion. It combines <strong>Salmon DNA PDRN, collagen, hyaluronic acid, and niacinamide</strong> in a unique capsule-and-gel formula for a fresh, radiant “glass skin” finish.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The cream features pink <strong>PDRN capsules suspended in a transparent gel</strong>. Its encapsulation technology is designed to help preserve the PDRN’s hydrating and firming properties until application. You can also customize the texture by adjusting the amount of capsule cream and gel according to your skin’s needs.</p><h2>Key Benefits</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Deeply Hydrates Skin:</strong> Hyaluronic acid and moisturizing ingredients help replenish and retain moisture for soft, supple skin.</li><li><strong>Supports Firmness &amp; Elasticity:</strong> Salmon DNA PDRN and collagen help skin look more plump, smooth, and resilient.</li><li><strong>Brightens Dull Skin:</strong> Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and promotes a healthy-looking glow.</li><li><strong>Improves the Look of Uneven Tone:</strong> Designed to care for dullness, spots, pigmentation, and uneven-looking skin.</li><li><strong>Glass-Skin Glow:</strong> Leaves the complexion looking dewy, smooth, luminous, and well-hydrated.</li><li><strong>Customizable Texture:</strong> Add more gel for a lighter finish or more capsule cream for richer hydration and elasticity care.</li><li><strong>Multi-Hyaluronic Acid Care:</strong> Different forms of hyaluronic acid help provide layered hydration and maintain skin moisture.</li><li><strong>Daily Moisturizing Care:</strong> Suitable for use as the final moisturizing step in a regular skincare routine.</li></ul><h2>Key Ingredients</h2><h3>Salmon DNA PDRN</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A key ingredient in the pink capsules, Salmon DNA PDRN is used to support the appearance of firmer, healthier-looking skin and provide intensive moisture care.</p><h3>Collagen</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Helps support a smoother, plumper-looking complexion while providing moisturizing and elasticity-focused care.</p><h3>Hyaluronic Acid</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The formula contains multiple forms of hyaluronic acid to help attract and retain moisture, leaving skin hydrated and supple.</p><h3>Niacinamide</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">A well-known form of Vitamin B3 that helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone and dullness while supporting a healthy-looking complexion.</p><h3>Peptide Complex</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The formula includes peptides such as Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and Palmitoyl Hexapeptide-12 for additional firming and smoothing skincare support.</p><h3>Ceramide NP</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Helps support the skin barrier and maintain moisture for a smoother, more comfortable skin feel.</p><h2>Unique Dual-Texture Capsule Formula</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <strong>PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream</strong> combines two textures in one jar:</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Pink PDRN Capsule Cream + Transparent Hydrating Gel</strong></p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">You can mix them in different proportions depending on your preferred finish:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>More Gel:</strong> Lightweight, refreshing and comfortable feel</li><li><strong>Balanced Mix:</strong> Everyday hydration and glow</li><li><strong>More Capsule:</strong> Richer hydration and elasticity-focused care</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This customizable formula makes it easy to adjust the cream according to your skin condition, season, or personal preference.</p><h2>How to Use</h2><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>After cleansing, toner, and serum, take an appropriate amount of the capsule cream and transparent gel.</li><li>Mix them together in a suitable ratio.</li><li>Apply evenly over the face and neck.</li><li>Gently massage or pat until fully absorbed.</li><li>Use <strong>morning and evening</strong> as the moisturizing step of your routine.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For daytime use, finish with sunscreen.</p><h2>Suitable For</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">MEDICUBE lists this cream for <strong>all skin types</strong>, including dry, combination, normal, oily, and sensitive skin. It is particularly suitable for skin concerned with <strong>dryness, dullness, uneven tone, uneven texture, loss of firmness, dark spots, and visible pores</strong>.</p><h2>Clinical Study Results</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">According to MEDICUBE’s clinical testing, the product showed:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>102.4% improvement in hydration</strong> immediately after use</li><li><strong>19.4% improvement in uneven skin tone</strong> after 2 weeks</li><li><strong>1.5% improvement in pigmentation</strong> after 2 weeks</li><li><strong>33% improvement in skin elasticity</strong> after 2 weeks</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The testing was conducted by the <strong>Global Institute of Dermatological Sciences</strong>, and individual results may vary depending on skin type and condition.</p><h2>Product Details</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> PDRN Pink Collagen Capsule Cream</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 55g / 1.94 oz</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Dual capsule + transparent gel</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Salmon DNA PDRN, Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, Niacinamide, Peptides, Ceramide NP</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Dry, Combination, Normal, Oily &amp; Sensitive Skin</li><li><strong>Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dullness, uneven skin tone, uneven texture, loss of firmness, dark spots &amp; pores</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/JvD9mIzoT9NY1Hq2DhRUK2pEPwuzQn3sDJk2VWy2.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:16:13','2026-09-17 09:19:16'),(322,'Kojic Acid Turmeric Night Wrapping Mask 75ml','kojic-acid-turmeric-night-wrapping-mask-75ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE Kojic Acid Turmeric Night Wrapping Mask 75ml</strong> is an overnight peel-off gel mask designed to brighten dull-looking skin, improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, and provide long-lasting hydration while you sleep. Formulated with <strong>Kojic Acid, Turmeric Extract, Collagen, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, and Retinol</strong>, it provides intensive overnight care for a smoother, more radiant-looking complexion.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The mask forms a thin wrapping film over the skin that helps maintain moisture and supports prolonged contact with the formula throughout the night. After approximately 15 minutes, the mask dries into a removable film that can be gently peeled away the next morning.</p><h2>Key Benefits</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brightens Dull Skin:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of dullness and promotes a more radiant complexion.</li><li><strong>Dark Spot &amp; Uneven Tone Care:</strong> Kojic Acid helps improve the appearance of hyperpigmentation and uneven skin tone.</li><li><strong>Overnight Hydration:</strong> The wrapping film helps maintain moisture for a hydrated, plump-looking complexion.</li><li><strong>Improves Skin Texture:</strong> Helps refine the appearance of rough and uneven skin texture.</li><li><strong>Supports Firmness:</strong> Collagen and Retinol provide elasticity and firming-focused skincare.</li><li><strong>Enhances Radiance:</strong> Turmeric and Vitamin C help promote a fresh, luminous-looking glow.</li><li><strong>Peel-Off Convenience:</strong> Dries into a thin film that can be gently peeled away in the morning.</li><li><strong>Overnight Intensive Care:</strong> Provides approximately 8 hours of skincare while you sleep.</li></ul><h2>Key Ingredients</h2><h3>Kojic Acid</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kojic Acid is included to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dark spots, and hyperpigmentation, supporting a brighter and more even-looking complexion.</p><h3>Turmeric Extract</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Turmeric Root Extract provides antioxidant and skin-conditioning care while helping improve the appearance of dullness and uneven tone.</p><h3>Collagen</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Collagen helps provide moisturizing and skin-smoothing care, leaving the skin looking more supple, plump, and youthful.</p><h3>Retinol</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Retinol supports elasticity-focused skincare and helps improve the appearance of fine lines and uneven texture.</p><h3>Niacinamide</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Niacinamide helps brighten the appearance of dull skin and supports a smoother, more even-looking complexion.</p><h3>Vitamin C</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Ascorbic Acid (Vitamin C) provides antioxidant care and supports a brighter, more radiant-looking skin tone.</p><h2>Unique Overnight Wrapping Formula</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Unlike a traditional sleeping mask, the MEDICUBE Kojic Acid Turmeric Night Wrapping Mask dries into a <strong>thin protective film</strong> over the skin.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This wrapping effect helps keep the formula in contact with the skin during sleep while supporting moisture retention. After leaving it overnight, the film can be gently peeled from the edges in the morning or rinsed away with lukewarm water.</p><h2>Clinical Study Results</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">According to MEDICUBE\'s reported study results:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>24.7% improvement in uneven skin tone &amp; hyperpigmentation after 3 days</strong></li><li><strong>66.8% improvement in 24-hour long-lasting hydration and radiant glow after one use</strong></li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">These results are based on MEDICUBE\'s testing, and individual results may vary depending on skin type and condition.</p><h2>How to Use</h2><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and complete your regular evening skincare routine.</li><li>Apply an even layer of the wrapping mask as the <strong>final step</strong> of your routine.</li><li>Avoid the <strong>eyes, lips, eyebrows, and hairline</strong>.</li><li>Allow the mask to dry completely for approximately <strong>15 minutes</strong>.</li><li>Leave it on overnight while you sleep.</li><li>The next morning, gently peel the film away from the edges or rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</li><li>Use approximately <strong>3–4 times per week</strong> according to MEDICUBE\'s recommendation.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Because this formula contains retinol, beginners or sensitive skin types may prefer to introduce it gradually and avoid combining it with multiple strong exfoliating treatments in the same routine.</p><h2>Suitable For</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">MEDICUBE lists the product for <strong>all skin types</strong>, including:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dry skin</li><li>Oily skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Dull skin</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">It is particularly suitable for those concerned with <strong>dark spots, hyperpigmentation, dullness, uneven skin tone, uneven texture, dryness, and fine lines</strong>.</p><h2>Product Details</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Kojic Acid Turmeric Night Wrapping Mask</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 75ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Overnight Peel-Off / Wrapping Mask</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Gel that dries into a thin film</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Kojic Acid, Turmeric Extract, Collagen, Retinol, Vitamin C, Niacinamide</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Brightening, dark spot care, hydration, radiance, texture and elasticity care</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Approximately 3–4 times weekly</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,23,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/IcZ7unyBKT1oGTJrw4ITN3pOMQDuFBXLeKp9rsG5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:20:00','2026-09-17 09:17:33'),(323,'PDRN Hydrating Gel Cleanser 200ml','pdrn-hydrating-gel-cleanser-200ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>MEDICUBE PDRN Hydrating Gel Cleanser 200ml</strong> is a gentle <strong>jelly-to-foam facial cleanser</strong> designed to remove daily impurities, excess oil, blackheads, and dead skin cells while helping maintain the skin’s moisture balance. Its smooth pink gel transforms into a rich, lightweight foam when mixed with water, providing a comfortable cleansing experience without leaving the skin feeling overly dry or tight.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The formula combines <strong>99% Pure PDRN, Collagen, LHA, Niacinamide, Ceramides, Hyaluronic Acid, Glycerin, and Panthenol</strong> to provide cleansing, hydration, gentle exfoliation, and moisture-barrier care in one daily face wash. It is formulated with a mild, low-pH base and has been tested for low irritation.</p><h2>Key Benefits</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Gentle Deep Cleansing:</strong> Removes dirt, excess sebum, impurities, and daily buildup.</li><li><strong>Pore &amp; Blackhead Care:</strong> Helps cleanse pore impurities and reduce the appearance of congestion.</li><li><strong>Gentle Exfoliation:</strong> LHA helps remove dead skin cells and refine rough-looking texture.</li><li><strong>Hydrating Cleanse:</strong> Helps maintain comfortable moisture levels during and after cleansing.</li><li><strong>PDRN Skin Care:</strong> 99% Pure Salmon DNA PDRN provides conditioning and skin-supporting care.</li><li><strong>Supports the Skin Barrier:</strong> Ceramides, Panthenol, and Hyaluronic Acid help maintain moisture and barrier comfort.</li><li><strong>Brightening Care:</strong> Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.</li><li><strong>Low-pH Formula:</strong> Designed for a mild, comfortable daily cleansing routine.</li><li><strong>Jelly-to-Foam Texture:</strong> The soft gel transforms into a light, rich foam with water.</li><li><strong>Suitable for Daily Use:</strong> Can be used in both morning and evening routines.</li></ul><h2>Key Ingredients</h2><h3>99% Pure Salmon DNA PDRN</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">PDRN, listed as <strong>Sodium DNA</strong>, is a key ingredient in the formula. It provides skin-conditioning care while supporting a healthier, more hydrated-looking complexion.</p><h3>LHA</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Capryloyl Salicylic Acid (LHA)</strong> provides gentle exfoliating care by helping remove dead skin cells and buildup from pores. It helps improve the appearance of rough texture without the need for harsh physical scrubbing.</p><h3>Collagen</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong> helps provide moisturizing and conditioning benefits, leaving the skin feeling softer and more supple after cleansing.</p><h3>Niacinamide</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Niacinamide helps support a brighter, more even-looking complexion while providing additional skin-conditioning and pore-care benefits.</p><h3>Ceramide Complex</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The formula contains several ceramides, including <strong>Ceramide NP, Ceramide AS, Ceramide NS, Ceramide EOP, and Ceramide AP</strong>, which help support the skin’s moisture barrier.</p><h3>Hyaluronic Acid</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Hydrolyzed Hyaluronic Acid and Sodium Hyaluronate help provide moisture-retaining hydration for a comfortable, supple skin feel.</p><h3>Panthenol &amp; Glycerin</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">These moisturizing ingredients help keep skin feeling hydrated and comfortable after washing.</p><h2>Jelly-to-Foam Cleansing Texture</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">One of the standout features of the <strong>MEDICUBE PDRN Hydrating Gel Cleanser</strong> is its unique texture.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The cleanser starts as a <strong>smooth, soft jelly-like gel</strong>. When water is added and the product is gently massaged, it transforms into a <strong>rich yet lightweight foam</strong> that spreads comfortably across the face.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This texture helps provide an effective cleanse while maintaining a comfortable, non-stripping skin feel.</p><h2>Clinical Test Results</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">According to MEDICUBE\'s reported clinical testing:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>99.3% of pore impurities removed</strong></li><li><strong>81.2% of dead skin cells removed</strong></li><li><strong>31.6% reduction in excess sebum</strong></li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The clinical trial was conducted by the <strong>Global Institute of Dermatological Sciences</strong>. Individual results may vary depending on skin type and condition.</p><h2>How to Use</h2><h3>For Morning Cleansing</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Wet your face with lukewarm water.</li><li>Apply an appropriate amount of cleanser to your hands.</li><li>Gently massage over the entire face.</li><li>Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</li><li>Follow with toner and the rest of your skincare routine.</li></ol><h3>For Evening Cleansing</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>If wearing heavy makeup or water-resistant sunscreen, use a cleansing oil or makeup remover first.</li><li>Apply the PDRN Gel Cleanser to the face.</li><li>Gently massage to create a soft foam.</li><li>Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</li><li>Continue with toner, serum, moisturizer, and other skincare steps.</li></ol><h2>Suitable For</h2><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This cleanser is suitable for <strong>dry, combination, oily, and sensitive skin</strong>. It can be particularly useful for skin concerns such as:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Excess oil and sebum</li><li>Blackheads and clogged pores</li><li>Uneven skin texture</li><li>Dull-looking skin</li><li>Dehydration</li><li>Dryness after cleansing</li><li>Uneven-looking skin tone</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its mild, low-pH formulation makes it suitable for everyday morning and evening cleansing.</p><h2>Product Details</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MEDICUBE</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> PDRN Hydrating Gel Cleanser</li><li><strong>Also Known As:</strong> PDRN Pink Gel Cleanser</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 200ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Jelly Gel → Lightweight Foam</li><li><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> 99% Pure PDRN, Collagen, LHA, Niacinamide, Ceramides, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Cleansing, hydration, pore care, gentle exfoliation, barrier support, brightening care</li><li><strong>Skin Types:</strong> Dry, Combination, Oily &amp; Sensitive</li><li><strong>Use:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,3,51,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/ueJERNX8zHqR7OJGvz0X3naFUtLynE6Y4VVTinVl.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-04 04:23:10','2026-09-17 09:16:34'),(324,'Collagen Jelly Cream 50ml','collagen-jelly-cream-50ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Medicube Collagen Jelly Cream 50ml</strong> is a hydrating and firming facial moisturizer designed to help improve the appearance of skin elasticity, dryness, and loss of firmness. Its lightweight jelly-like texture spreads smoothly over the skin and provides a fresh, moisturizing finish without feeling overly heavy.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Formulated with collagen-focused skincare ingredients, the cream helps support a plumper, smoother-looking complexion while keeping the skin comfortably hydrated. It is suitable for daily skincare routines and can be especially beneficial for dry, dehydrated, or dull-looking skin.</p><h2>Key Benefits</h2><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps provide long-lasting hydration</li><li>Supports a firmer and more elastic-looking c