]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/vJGi1kdOHqJdf4Ko3qmby4j6ELvUwi8JwRMsva27.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-05 08:37:39','2026-09-15 15:20:17'),(355,'Wonder Releaf Centella Toner 200ml','wonder-releaf-centella-toner-200ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Toner is a soothing and hydrating facial toner formulated with <strong>Centella Asiatica</strong> to help calm irritated skin, strengthen the skin barrier, and maintain balanced moisture levels. Its lightweight, refreshing texture absorbs comfortably into the skin without leaving a heavy or sticky feeling.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">This toner is ideal for skin that feels sensitive, dry, dehydrated, or easily irritated. It can be used as an essential step after cleansing to prepare the skin for serums, ampoules, and moisturizers.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>🌿 Helps soothe sensitive and irritated skin</li><li>💧 Provides lightweight and lasting hydration</li><li>🛡️ Supports a healthy skin barrier</li><li>✨ Helps improve the appearance of dull and stressed skin</li><li>🌱 Contains Centella Asiatica for calming care</li><li>💦 Helps keep skin soft, smooth, and comfortable</li><li>Suitable for daily skincare routines</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredient</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Centella Asiatica:</strong> Known for its soothing properties, Centella helps calm the appearance of redness and skin discomfort while supporting the skin\'s natural barrier.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Irritated or stressed skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Skin needing gentle soothing and hydration</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face thoroughly.</li><li>Apply an appropriate amount of toner to your palms or a cotton pad.</li><li>Gently pat or press onto the face and neck until absorbed.<