creen, and impurities.</li><li>Add a small amount of water and continue massaging until the oil turns milky.</li><li>Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</li><li>Follow with a water-based cleanser for double cleansing.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> PURITO</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> From Green Cleansing Oil</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 200ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Cleansing Oil</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight oil</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Daily, preferably in the evening</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>PURITO From Green Cleansing Oil offers <strong>gentle yet effective cleansing</strong> while helping maintain skin comfort and moisture. It is an excellent everyday cleansing oil for removing makeup, sunscreen, and impurities without the heavy or greasy after-feel associated with some cleansing oils.</p>',NULL,NULL,2,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/nEicrq19oXJ5rMrineYPJaHJXU7CVyURW9R4q8TI.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 08:53:38','2026-09-15 15:17:17'),(366,'Dermide Cica Barrier Sleeping Pack 80ml','dermide-cica-barrier-sleeping-pack-80ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Purito Dermide Cica Barrier Sleeping Pack is an intensive overnight moisturizer designed to soothe, hydrate, and strengthen the skin’s moisture barrier while you sleep. Enriched with <strong>Centella Asiatica (Cica)</strong> and barrier-supporting ingredients, it helps relieve the feeling of dryness and tightness while keeping the skin moisturized and comfortable.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its rich yet comfortable texture works as the final step of a nighttime skincare routine, helping you wake up with softer, smoother, and more hydrated-looking skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps deeply moisturize dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Supports a healthy skin moisture barrier</li><li>Helps soothe sensitive and stressed-looking skin</li><li>Reduces the feeling of dryness and tightness</li><li>Helps improve rough and flaky-looking skin</li><li>Provides nourishing overnight care</li><li>Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and supple</li><li>Ideal for skin that feels weakened or moisture-depleted</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Centella Asiatica (Cica):</strong> Helps soothe and comfort sensitive, stressed-looking skin.</li><li><strong>Ceramides:</strong> Help support the skin’s moisture barrier and reduce moisture loss.</li><li><strong>Panthenol:</strong> Helps moisturize and soothe dry skin.</li><li><strong>Allantoin:</strong> Helps calm and comfort the skin.</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Rough or flaky-looking skin</li><li>Skin with a weakened moisture barrier</li><li>Skin needing intensive overnight hydration</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Complete your regular evening skincare routine.</li><li>Apply an appropriate amount of the sleeping pack as the final skincare step.</li><li>Gently spread over the face and allow it to absorb.</li><li>Leave it on overnight.</li><li>Rinse your face gently the following morning and continue with your morning routine.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Purito</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Dermide Cica Barrier Sleeping Pack</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 80ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Overnight Sleeping Pack / Moisturizer</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Rich, moisturizing, and comfortable</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Evening / Overnight</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially dry and sensitive skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>Purito Dermide Cica Barrier Sleeping Pack combines <strong>overnight hydration, soothing Cica care, and moisture-barrier support</strong> in one easy-to-use treatment. It is an excellent choice for skin that feels dry, sensitive, rough, or moisture-depleted and needs extra nourishment during the night.</p>',NULL,NULL,25,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/7M2YQEXsD5dV8SsoSBzKEkF3z7oUSWH8pfDxkJmF.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 08:57:27','2026-09-15 15:16:49');
INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (367,'Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++++ 60ml','daily-soft-touch-sunscreen-spf-50-pa-60ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Purito Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++++ is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to provide high-level protection against UVA and UVB rays while keeping the skin moisturized and comfortable. Its soft, non-heavy texture spreads easily and absorbs comfortably, making it suitable for everyday use.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The sunscreen is ideal for those who want reliable sun protection without a greasy or uncomfortable finish. It can be used as the final step of your morning skincare routine and works well under makeup.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides broad-spectrum SPF 50+ sun protection</li><li>Helps protect skin from UVA and UVB rays</li><li>Lightweight and comfortable for daily use</li><li>Helps maintain skin hydration</li><li>Leaves a soft, smooth skin finish</li><li>Does not feel overly heavy or greasy</li><li>Easy to spread and blend</li><li>Suitable for everyday facial use</li><li>Works well as the final step of a morning skincare routine</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Chemical UV Filters:</strong> Help protect the skin from UVA and UVB radiation.</li><li><strong>Moisturizing Ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin hydration and comfort.</li><li><strong>Skin-Soothing Ingredients:</strong> Help keep the skin feeling calm and comfortable.</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>All skin types</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dry skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Daily outdoor and indoor routines</li><li>Those looking for a lightweight sunscreen</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Apply as the final step of your morning skincare routine.</li><li>Take an adequate amount and evenly apply to the face, neck, and other exposed areas.</li><li>Apply generously before sun exposure.</li><li>Reapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor exposure.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Purito</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 60ml</li><li><strong>SPF:</strong> 50+</li><li><strong>PA Rating:</strong> PA++++</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Sunscreen</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight and soft</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Morning / Daytime</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>Purito Daily Soft Touch Sunscreen SPF 50 PA++++ combines <strong>high-level UVA/UVB protection with a lightweight, comfortable texture</strong>, making it an easy choice for everyday sun protection. It helps keep skin protected, moisturized, and comfortable throughout the day.</p>',NULL,NULL,19,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/h05AvzaciTMc8HnfDabLkNdJMC8mw83lSe94b2xd.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 08:59:56','2026-09-15 15:16:24'),(368,'Oat PDRN Gentle Refining Toner  200ml','oat-pdrn-gentle-refining-toner-200ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">PURITO Oat PDRN Gentle Refining Toner is a gentle daily toner designed to hydrate, smooth, and refresh the skin while supporting a healthy-looking skin barrier. Combining <strong>Oat-based soothing care with PDRN-focused skin conditioning</strong>, it helps improve the appearance of rough, dry, and tired-looking skin without leaving a heavy or sticky feeling.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The lightweight formula can be easily layered into your skincare routine and is suitable for everyday use.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides refreshing and lasting hydration</li><li>Helps smooth the appearance of rough skin texture</li><li>Supports a healthy-looking moisture barrier</li><li>Helps soothe dry and sensitive-looking skin</li><li>Improves the appearance of dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Helps keep skin soft, supple, and comfortable</li><li>Prepares skin for better application of subsequent skincare</li><li>Lightweight texture suitable for daily use</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Oat:</strong> Helps moisturize, soften, and comfort dry or sensitive-looking skin.</li><li><strong>PDRN:</strong> Helps support skin conditioning and a smoother, healthier-looking appearance.</li><li><strong>Moisturizing ingredients:</strong> Help replenish and maintain skin hydration.</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Rough or uneven-looking skin</li><li>Dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Skin needing extra hydration and barrier care</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face thoroughly.</li><li>Apply an appropriate amount of toner to your face using your hands or a cotton pad.</li><li>Gently pat until absorbed.</li><li>For extra hydration, apply another thin layer.</li><li>Follow with serum, moisturizer, and sunscreen during the daytime.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> PURITO</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Oat PDRN Gentle Refining Toner</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 200ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Toner</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight and hydrating</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Morning and evening</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially dry and sensitive skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>PURITO Oat PDRN Gentle Refining Toner provides <strong>gentle hydration, soothing care, and skin-refining support</strong> in a lightweight formula. It is an ideal everyday toner for maintaining soft, smooth, hydrated, and comfortable-looking skin.</p>',NULL,NULL,6,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/VwiHD7LcmmRkOKp4I9MgKweOFH9Wo9oEjMIcmn3Y.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:01:57','2026-09-15 15:15:49'),(369,'Wonder Releaf Centella BB Cream SPF30 PA+++ (21 Light Beige) 30ml','wonder-releaf-centella-bb-cream-spf30-pa-21-light-beige-30ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Purito Wonder Releaf Centella BB Cream SPF30 PA+++ is a lightweight, multifunctional BB cream that combines <strong>natural-looking coverage, skincare benefits, and daily sun protection</strong> in one product. Enriched with Centella Asiatica, it helps create a smoother, more even-looking complexion while providing comfortable hydration.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">The <strong>21 Light Beige</strong> shade is designed for light skin tones and offers buildable coverage that helps blur the appearance of redness, blemishes, and uneven skin tone without looking overly heavy.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides natural-looking, buildable coverage</li><li>Helps even out the appearance of skin tone</li><li>Helps blur the appearance of redness and minor imperfections</li><li>Provides SPF30 PA+++ daily sun protection</li><li>Helps soothe and moisturize the skin</li><li>Creates a smooth, fresh-looking complexion</li><li>Comfortable for everyday wear</li><li>Suitable for use as a makeup base</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Centella Asiatica:</strong> Helps soothe and comfort sensitive-looking skin.</li><li><strong>Niacinamide:</strong> Helps support an even-looking complexion and healthy skin barrier.</li><li><strong>Moisturizing ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin hydration and comfort throughout the day.</li></ul><h3>Shade Information</h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>21 Light Beige</strong> – A light beige shade suitable for light skin tones. It provides a natural-looking finish and can be used for everyday complexion makeup.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Light skin tones</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dry skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Those looking for light-to-medium natural-looking coverage</li><li>Anyone wanting skincare and makeup benefits in one product</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Complete your regular skincare routine.</li><li>Apply a small amount of BB cream to the face.</li><li>Spread evenly using your fingers, makeup sponge, or brush.</li><li>Add another thin layer to areas requiring additional coverage.</li><li>For prolonged sun exposure, use a dedicated sunscreen underneath and reapply sunscreen as needed.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Purito</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Wonder Releaf Centella BB Cream</li><li><strong>Shade:</strong> 21 Light Beige</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 30ml</li><li><strong>SPF:</strong> 30</li><li><strong>PA Rating:</strong> PA+++</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> BB Cream / Complexion Makeup</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Light to medium, buildable</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> Natural-looking</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Light skin tones and most skin types</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>Purito Wonder Releaf Centella BB Cream SPF30 PA+++ combines <strong>natural-looking coverage, soothing Centella care, hydration, and daily sun protection</strong> in a convenient formula. The 21 Light Beige shade is a great choice for creating an even, fresh, and polished complexion while keeping the skin comfortable.</p>',NULL,NULL,40,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/vjdEaSXhNBno1Ay3Zaza9a3X5b2l1YyvWoPOaPzi.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:03:34','2026-09-15 15:15:03'),(370,'Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion 60ml','wonder-releaf-centella-daily-sun-lotion-60ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to protect the skin from harmful UV exposure while providing soothing and moisturizing care. Enriched with <strong>Centella Asiatica</strong>, it helps keep the skin feeling calm, hydrated, and comfortable throughout the day.</p><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Its lotion-like texture spreads easily and sits comfortably on the skin, making it suitable for everyday use as the final step of your morning skincare routine.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps protect skin from daily sun exposure</li><li>Provides comfortable daily UV protection</li><li>Helps soothe sensitive and stressed-looking skin</li><li>Provides lightweight hydration</li><li>Supports the skin\'s moisture barrier</li><li>Helps reduce the feeling of dryness and tightness</li><li>Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortable</li><li>Lightweight lotion texture suitable for everyday wear</li><li>Convenient for use as the final step of a morning skincare routine</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Centella Asiatica (Cica):</strong> Helps soothe and comfort sensitive-looking skin.</li><li><strong>Moisturizing ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin hydration and softness.</li><li><strong>Skin-conditioning ingredients:</strong> Help support a comfortable, healthy-looking complexion.</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Skin prone to dryness or discomfort</li><li>Daily indoor and outdoor routines</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Complete your morning skincare routine.</li><li>Apply an adequate amount evenly to the face and neck.</li><li>Use as the final step of your skincare routine before makeup.</li><li>Reapply throughout the day, especially after sweating, wiping the face, or prolonged sun exposure.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Purito</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 60ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Sunscreen / Sun Lotion</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight lotion</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Morning / Daytime</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose It?</h3><p>Purito Wonder Releaf Centella Daily Sun Lotion combines <strong>daily sun protection with soothing Centella care and lightweight hydration</strong>. It is a convenient everyday sunscreen for maintaining protected, moisturized, and comfortable-looking skin.</p>',NULL,NULL,19,74,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/FDhYc2XfUU7DD6vnq1YGU7eQ0VsQqRNWyQhoZUJ8.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:05:24','2026-09-15 15:49:08'),(371,'Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Aqua Gel Cream 100ml','isntree-hyaluronic-acid-aqua-gel-cream-100ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Aqua Gel Cream is a lightweight, refreshing gel moisturizer designed to provide deep hydration without leaving the skin feeling heavy or greasy. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and moisturizing ingredients, it helps replenish moisture, improve skin softness, and support a healthy-looking moisture barrier. Its cool aqua-gel texture absorbs comfortably into the skin, making it especially suitable for dehydrated, combination, and oily skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides lightweight and long-lasting hydration</li><li>Helps replenish moisture-depleted skin</li><li>Supports a healthy moisture barrier</li><li>Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of dryness and tightness</li><li>Non-heavy gel texture suitable for daily use</li><li>Excellent for oily, combination, and dehydrated skin</li><li>Can be used comfortably under makeup</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Hyaluronic Acid:</strong> Helps attract and retain moisture for hydrated, plump-looking skin</li><li><strong>Moisturizing Ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin softness and prevent moisture loss</li><li><strong>Skin-Conditioning Ingredients:</strong> Help keep the skin comfortable and smooth</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Oily skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dehydrated skin</li><li>Dry skin that prefers lightweight hydration</li><li>Skin that feels tight or moisture-depleted</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and apply toner or essence.</li><li>Take an appropriate amount of the gel cream.</li><li>Gently spread it over the face and neck.</li><li>Pat lightly until fully absorbed.</li><li>Use morning and evening as the final step of your skincare routine.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Isntree</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid Aqua Gel Cream</li><li><strong>Volume:</strong> 100ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Hydrating Gel Cream / Face Moisturizer</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight Aqua Gel</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Hydration, moisture retention, and skin comfort</li><li><strong>Suitable for:</strong> All skin types, especially oily, combination, and dehydrated skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Aqua Gel Cream?</h3><p>If you want effective daily hydration without a thick or sticky finish, this aqua gel cream is an excellent choice. Its lightweight texture delivers refreshing moisture while helping the skin feel softer, smoother, and comfortably hydrated.</p>',NULL,NULL,15,19,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/IUcWAx3e6gtwPI2VmqfNp4hTk1dAg6WeL9s4mIeX.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:11:50','2026-09-15 14:45:37'),(372,'Hyaluronic Acid Toner 200ml','hyaluronic-acid-toner-200ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Toner is a hydrating facial toner formulated to replenish moisture and help keep the skin soft, smooth, and comfortable. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid, it helps attract and retain moisture while supporting the skin’s natural moisture balance. Its refreshing texture makes it an ideal daily toner for dehydrated, dry, combination, and sensitive skin.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Provides intense and lasting hydration</li><li>Helps replenish moisture in dehydrated skin</li><li>Supports the skin’s moisture barrier</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of dryness and tightness</li><li>Leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed</li><li>Helps maintain a healthy-looking moisture balance</li><li>Prepares skin for better absorption of subsequent skincare products</li><li>Suitable for daily morning and evening use</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Hyaluronic Acid:</strong> Helps attract and retain moisture for hydrated, plump-looking skin</li><li><strong>Moisturizing Ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin softness and reduce moisture loss</li><li><strong>Skin-Conditioning Ingredients:</strong> Help improve the skin’s overall comfortable and smooth appearance</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Dry skin</li><li>Dehydrated skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Sensitive skin</li><li>Skin prone to dryness and tightness</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face thoroughly.</li><li>Apply an appropriate amount of toner to your palms or a cotton pad.</li><li>Gently pat or smooth over the face and neck.</li><li>Follow with serum, essence, and moisturizer.</li><li>Use morning and evening for best results.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Isntree</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Hyaluronic Acid Toner</li><li><strong>Volume:</strong> 200ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Hydrating Facial Toner</li><li><strong>Texture:</strong> Lightweight, refreshing toner</li><li><strong>Main Benefit:</strong> Hydration and moisture retention</li><li><strong>Suitable for:</strong> All skin types, especially dry and dehydrated skin</li><li><strong>Usage:</strong> Morning &amp; Evening</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Toner?</h3><p>This toner is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a simple yet effective hydration step in their skincare routine. It helps restore moisture after cleansing and leaves the skin feeling fresh, soft, and comfortably hydrated without a heavy finish.</p>',NULL,NULL,6,19,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/SnbFRRhCNHhB6QbmjphFqd35eYsX9dx1NWbCxbfP.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:13:14','2026-09-15 14:45:03'),(373,'Hyper Niacinamide 20 Serum 20ml','hyper-niacinamide-20-serum-20ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Isntree Hyper Niacinamide 20 Serum is a concentrated brightening serum formulated with <strong>20% Niacinamide</strong> to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dark spots, excess sebum, and visible pores. It helps promote a clearer, smoother, and more balanced-looking complexion while supporting overall skin texture.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Helps brighten dull and uneven-looking skin</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of dark spots and post-blemish marks</li><li>Supports a more even-looking skin tone</li><li>Helps control excess sebum and shine</li><li>Minimizes the appearance of enlarged pores</li><li>Helps improve rough and uneven skin texture</li><li>Supports a healthy-looking skin barrier</li><li>Lightweight serum texture suitable for targeted skincare</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>20% Niacinamide:</strong> Helps brighten the complexion, improve uneven tone, and reduce the appearance of pores and excess oil</li><li><strong>Hydrating Ingredients:</strong> Help maintain skin moisture and comfort</li><li><strong>Skin-Conditioning Ingredients:</strong> Help leave the skin smoother and more balanced-looking</li></ul><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li>Oily skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dull and uneven-looking skin</li><li>Skin with visible pores</li><li>Skin with excess sebum</li><li>Skin concerned with dark spots and post-blemish marks</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol data-spread=\"false\" start=\"1\"><li>Cleanse your face and apply toner.</li><li>Take a small amount of serum and gently apply it over the face.</li><li>Focus on areas with uneven tone, visible pores, or excess oil.</li><li>Pat gently until absorbed.</li><li>Follow with moisturizer.</li><li>Use sunscreen during the daytime.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Tip:</strong> Because this is a high-concentration niacinamide serum, beginners or sensitive skin types may prefer starting with a few applications per week and gradually increasing frequency.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Isntree</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Hyper Niacinamide 20 Serum</li><li><strong>Volume:</strong> 20ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Brightening &amp; Pore Care Serum</li><li><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> 20% Niacinamide</li><li><strong>Main Concerns:</strong> Dark spots, uneven tone, excess sebum, visible pores, dullness</li><li><strong>Suitable for:</strong> Oily, combination, and uneven-looking skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Isntree Hyper Niacinamide 20 Serum?</h3><p>With a high concentration of <strong>20% Niacinamide</strong>, this serum is designed for intensive brightening, pore-care, and sebum-control routines. It is a great option for those looking to achieve a more radiant, refined, and balanced-looking complexion.</p>',NULL,