t of serum to dry skin.</li><li>Gently spread over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.</li><li>Follow with a nourishing moisturizer.</li><li>Start <strong>2–3 nights per week</strong> and gradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to retinol.</li><li>Always use <strong>broad-spectrum sunscreen during the daytime</strong>.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Important:</strong> Retinol can cause dryness, redness, or sensitivity, especially when starting. Avoid using it on the same night as strong exfoliating acids or other potentially irritating active ingredients if your skin is not accustomed to them.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Isntree</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Hyper Retinol EX 1.0 Serum</li><li><strong>Volume:</strong> 20ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Retinol Anti-Aging Serum</li><li><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> 1.0% Retinol</li><li><strong>Main Concerns:</strong> Fine lines, wrinkles, uneven texture, dullness, visible pores</li><li><strong>Recommended Usage:</strong> Evening</li><li><strong>Suitable for:</strong> Experienced retinol users and mature/texture-concerned skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Isntree Hyper Retinol EX 1.0 Serum?</h3><p>This concentrated retinol serum is a great choice for an advanced skincare routine focused on smoother texture, improved firmness, and reducing the visible signs of aging. Its <strong>1.0% retinol formula</strong> makes it better suited to users who have already built tolerance to lower-strength retinol products.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,19,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/cvepdxKySXoUO1oiza9NHkD5KEAEvXugU2nyRbJ4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:16:38','2026-09-15 14:44:07'),(375,'Green Tea Fresh Toner 200ml','green-tea-fresh-toner-200ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Isntree Green Tea Fresh Toner is a lightweight, refreshing toner designed to hydrate, soothe, and b