as.</li><li>Gently pat until absorbed.</li><li>Follow with a soothing moisturizer.</li><li>Start <strong>2–3 times per week</strong> and gradually increase according to your skin’s tolerance.</li></ol><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Important:</strong> AHA can increase skin sensitivity to sunlight. Always apply sunscreen during the daytime. Avoid using it together with multiple strong exfoliating or irritating active ingredients if your skin is sensitive.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li><strong>Brand:</strong> Isntree</li><li><strong>Product:</strong> Chestnut AHA 8% Clear Essence</li><li><strong>Volume:</strong> 100ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> AHA Exfoliating Essence</li><li><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> 8% AHA</li><li><strong>Main Benefits:</strong> Exfoliation, texture refinement, brightening, pore care</li><li><strong>Recommended Usage:</strong> Evening, a few times per week</li><li><strong>Suitable for:</strong> Normal, combination, oily, and texture-concerned skin</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Isntree Chestnut AHA 8% Clear Essence?</h3><p>This exfoliating essence is a great option for those looking to refresh dull skin and improve rough, uneven texture. Its <strong>8% AHA formula</strong> helps remove surface buildup and supports a smoother, brighter, and more refined-looking complexion.</p>',NULL,NULL,13,19,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/lPcHhlqtFnF7yghDIkMOpR64nPwbgi8NapVyyYvy.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-06 09:21:29','2026-09-15 14:42:13'),(378,'Hyaluronic Acid Natural Sun Cream 50ml','hyaluronic-acid-natural-sun-cream-50ml','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Natural Sun Cream is a moisturizing daily sunscreen designed to provide UV protection while keeping the skin hydrated and comfortable. Enriched with Hyaluronic Acid and skin-conditioning ingredients, it helps protect the skin from sun exposure while supporting a soft, smooth, and he