ppropriate amount to the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1is3cby\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"963\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"110e94m\" data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1000\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bazxp\" data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1028\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k3fvzy\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\nUse morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1077\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1462\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1088\">Brand:</strong> Mary &amp; May<br data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1102\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1114\">Product:</strong> Niacinamide + Chaenomeles Sinensis Serum<br data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1171\">Category:</strong> Brightening Face Serum<br data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1206\">Size:</strong> 30ml<br data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1214\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1234\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Niacinamide, Chaenomeles Sinensis Extract<br data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1279\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1291\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight serum<br data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1312\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\">Suitable For:</strong> All skin types, especially dull and uneven-looking skin<br data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1388\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1388\" data-end=\"1401\">Best For:</strong> Brightening, pore care, hydration, and smoother-looking skin</p>',NULL,NULL,11,49,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/VD8lB0r1UfGBxynaRHk8vmoVk51wKSWV4pY3yz79.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-0