ng> Contains multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid, Squalane, and moisturizing ingredients to help maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aid53z\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"996\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"923\">Antioxidant Care:</strong> Yuja and Vitamin C-related ingredients help provide antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p55f3h\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1120\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1025\">Supports Skin Barrier:</strong> Niacinamide, Squalane, and nourishing emollients help maintain a healthy-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mw1ssv\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1255\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1145\">Radiance Boosting:</strong> Helps leave the complexion looking smoother, fresher, and more radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1213\" data-content-reference-end=\"1245\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1276\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1441\"><strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1296\">Niacinamide 5%</strong> – Helps brighten the appearance of uneven skin tone, support the skin barrier, refine the appearance of pores, and improve overall skin texture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1615\"><strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1466\">Yuja (Citrus Junos)</strong> – A Korean citrus ingredient known for its vitamin C and antioxidant content. It helps give dull-looking skin a fresher and more radiant appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1724\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1669\">Hippophae Rhamnoides Water (Sea Buckthorn Water)</strong> – Provides skin-conditioning and antioxidant benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1810\"><strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1738\">Squalane</strong> – Helps replenish moisture and leaves the skin feeling soft and smooth.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1935\"><strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1839\">Hyaluronic Acid Complex</strong> – Multiple forms of hyaluronic acid help attract and retain moisture for hydrated-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"2054\"><strong data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1969\">Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate</strong> – A vitamin C derivative included for brightening and antioxidant skincare benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2182\"><strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2069\">Adenosine</strong> – A skin-conditioning ingredient commonly used in anti-aging formulations. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2135\" data-content-reference-end=\"2154\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fpw453\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2210\">Unique Capsule Texture</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2576\">The cream features a <strong data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2271\">clear gel base with yellow capsules</strong>. The capsules break as you massage the product into the skin, allowing the cream and capsule components to blend together. The gel-to-capsule ratio can also be adjusted according to skin type: a higher gel ratio for oily skin and a higher capsule ratio for dry skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2511\" data-content-reference-end=\"2530\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2594\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i888i1\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2624\">\r\nDull and tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2643\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"147vxko\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\nDark spots and hyperpigmentation concerns\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pvjg7r\" data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2712\">\r\nDry or dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15tktu7\" data-start=\"2713\" data-end=\"2733\">\r\nRough skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tz2891\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\nNormal, combination, and oily skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2786\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b29vll\" data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2830\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner/serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bm7i4d\" data-start=\"2831\" data-end=\"2882\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the capsule cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uexoxi\" data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\nGently massage it over the face and neck until the capsules are fully blended.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h0n2pr\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"2996\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"2995\">morning and evening</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bbt7tf\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\nDuring daytime, finish with a broad-spectrum sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3010\" data-content-reference-end=\"3029\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3114\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3380\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3135\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3127\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uy2wok\" data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3175\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3150\">Product:</strong> SEOUL 1988 Capsule Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkitmx\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3220\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3198\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Niacinamide 5% + Yuja\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpv5wz\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3237\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3223\" data-end=\"3232\">Size:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2fsck9\" data-start=\"3238\" data-end=\"3289\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3252\">Texture:</strong> Dual-texture gel cream with capsules\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3321\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3306\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"90x4jb\" data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3380\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3324\" data-end=\"3336\">Made in:</strong> Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3279\" data-content-reference-end=\"3298\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lbjtps\" data-start=\"3382\" data-end=\"3397\">Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3854\">Hippophae Rhamnoides Water, Water, Glycerin, Niacinamide, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Dipropylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Shea Butter, Butylene Glycol, Squalane, Dimethicone, Glyceryl Glucoside, Jojoba Seed Oil, Adenosine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Citrus Junos Fruit Oil, Collagen Water, Rosemary Leaf Extract, Olive Fruit Oil, and multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid, among other ingredients. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3735\" data-content-reference-end=\"3754\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"4025\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3856\" data-end=\"3869\">Best for:</strong> Those looking for a <strong data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3929\">brightening + hydrating moisturizer</strong> to improve dullness, uneven tone, and dehydration while giving the skin a healthy-looking glow.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Gung7fsHIvI39inKDL9v4qw4sQeVx2OxjpML4fRf.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:25:57','2026-09-14 15:16:51'),(403,'Seoul1988 Essence : Snail Mucin 97% + Rice 100ml','seoul1988-essence-snail-mucin-97-rice-100ml','<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"443\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"91\">KSECRET SEOUL 1988 Essence</strong> is a lightweight Korean skincare essence formulated with <strong data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"202\">97% Snail Secretion Filtrate and Rice ingredients</strong>. It provides intense hydration while helping improve the appearance of uneven texture, dullness, and dryness. The fast-absorbing formula leaves skin feeling soft, smooth, soothed, and naturally radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"406\" data-content-reference-end=\"438\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"461\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b196u9\" data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"527\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"483\">Deep Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish and maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7w0cqb\" data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"621\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"561\">Skin Repair &amp; Barrier Care:</strong> Snail mucin helps support a healthier-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tc5afb\" data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"650\">Improves Skin Texture:</strong> Helps make rough and uneven skin appear smoother.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"adb7ff\" data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"836\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"719\">Brightening:</strong> Rice extract, rice water, and rice ferment filtrate help improve dull-looking skin and promote a radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oona5m\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"922\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"852\">Soothing:</strong> Allantoin and Panthenol help calm stressed or irritated-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10vl8c5\" data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1009\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"947\">Boosts Elasticity:</strong> Snail mucin helps support smoother, more supple-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iv2qis\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1137\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1045\">Lightweight &amp; Fast-Absorbing:</strong> Absorbs comfortably without a heavy or greasy finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1095\" data-content-reference-end=\"1127\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1158\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1338\"><strong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1205\">Snail Secretion Filtrate 97% (970,000ppm)</strong><br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\">\r\nThe star ingredient of the formula. It helps hydrate, soothe, improve the appearance of skin texture, and support skin elasticity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1521\"><strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1393\">Rice Extract + Rice Water + Rice Ferment Filtrate</strong><br data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1396\">\r\nHelps brighten dull-looking skin, improve texture, and provide additional hydration for a smoother, more luminous appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1648\"><strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1545\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\nA form of hyaluronic acid that helps attract and retain moisture, leaving skin plumper and hydrated.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1737\"><strong data-start=\"1650\" data-end=\"1663\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\nHelps moisturize and soothe the skin while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1907\"><strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1752\">Allantoin</strong><br data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\nKnown for its soothing and skin-conditioning properties, making it helpful for stressed or sensitive-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1860\" data-content-reference-end=\"1892\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1925\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i93wd\" data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\nAll skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueib1d\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1968\">\r\nDry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gi7vye\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\nDull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hn6xcb\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2002\">\r\nUneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q56xcr\" data-start=\"2003\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\nSensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jo4ja\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2047\">\r\nCombination and oily skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dl0w0z\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2085\">\r\nSkin needing soothing and hydration\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2101\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2139\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xtdjo0\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2185\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frd06p\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\nApply evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ygezh3\" data-start=\"2226\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"107i4bf\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2299\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2417\">It can be used <strong data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2339\">morning and evening</strong> as part of your daily skincare routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2365\" data-content-reference-end=\"2384\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2438\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2451\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ezxzyx\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2493\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2462\" data-end=\"2474\">Product:</strong> SEOUL 1988 Essence\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n4m817\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2539\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2496\" data-end=\"2516\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Snail Mucin 97% + Rice\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttu6tj\" data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2557\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2551\">Size:</strong> 100ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"omigt1\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2596\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2572\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight gel essence\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2628\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2613\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17c8vj3\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2655\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2631\" data-end=\"2643\">Made in:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ahj0a1\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2698\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2669\">Finish:</strong> Hydrated, smooth, non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ntw1l\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2726\">Dermatologist Tested:</strong> Yes <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2698\" data-content-reference-end=\"2730\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2770\" data-end=\"2790\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"3192\">Snail Secretion Filtrate (970,000ppm), Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Ethyl Hexanediol, Allantoin, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Carbomer, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Panthenol, Water, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Extract (130ppm), Arginine, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Seed Water (30ppm), Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake) (30ppm). <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3117\" data-content-reference-end=\"3136\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3345\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3207\">Best for:</strong> Anyone looking for a <strong data-start=\"3229\" data-end=\"3276\">hydrating, soothing and brightening essence</strong> that helps improve rough texture and restore a healthy-looking glow.</p>',NULL,NULL,13,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/gRTJHFQKXbRa1jtCUrEAJMUWr8vzaONT9ygTeeBm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:33:37','2026-09-14 15:19:36'),(404,'Seoul 1988 Cream : Snail Mucin 93+Rice 100ml','seoul-1988-cream-snail-mucin-93rice-100ml','<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"513\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"87\">KSECRET SEOUL 1988 Cream</strong> is a Korean moisturizing cream formulated with <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"188\">93% Snail Secretion Filtrate and Rice ingredients</strong>. It provides long-lasting hydration while helping soothe stressed skin, support the skin barrier, and improve the appearance of dullness and uneven texture. The formula also contains <strong data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"428\">Panthenol, Ectoin, Allantoin, and Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> for additional moisturizing and soothing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"476\" data-content-reference-end=\"509\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"531\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j4lm53\" data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"611\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"534\" data-end=\"553\">Deep Hydration:</strong> 93% Snail Mucin helps replenish and retain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dz5q3s\" data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"726\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"638\">Brightens Dull Skin:</strong> Rice extract and rice ferment help promote a brighter, more radiant-looking complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18oebmi\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"746\">Soothes Skin:</strong> Panthenol and Allantoin help calm dry and stressed-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7j7j4s\" data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"907\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"840\">Supports Skin Barrier:</strong> Ectoin and Panthenol help strengthen and protect the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ec8u4v\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"992\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"936\">Improves Skin Texture:</strong> Helps make rough, uneven skin feel smoother and softer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kwuaaw\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1016\">Plumps &amp; Smooths:</strong> Hydrating ingredients help give skin a supple, healthy-looking appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ck2gov\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1218\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1118\">Non-Greasy Moisture:</strong> Provides rich hydration with a comfortable gel-cream texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1177\" data-content-reference-end=\"1210\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1239\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1392\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1273\">Snail Secretion Filtrate 93%</strong><br data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\nThe star ingredient helps provide intense hydration while supporting smoother, softer, and more supple-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1428\">Rice Bran Water &amp; Rice Extract</strong><br data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\nHelp nourish dull-looking skin and support a brighter, more even-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1611\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1549\">Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake)</strong><br data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1552\">\r\nProvides additional skin-conditioning and brightening care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1694\"><strong data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1626\">Panthenol</strong><br data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1629\">\r\nHelps moisturize, soothe, and support the skin\'s natural barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1706\">Ectoin</strong><br data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\nA protective ingredient that helps support the skin barrier and maintain comfortable hydration.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1879\"><strong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1819\">Allantoin</strong><br data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\nHelps soothe and condition dry or irritated-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"2011\"><strong data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1903\">Sodium Hyaluronate</strong><br data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1906\">\r\nHelps attract and retain moisture for hydrated, plump-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1966\" data-content-reference-end=\"1998\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2029\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueib1d\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\nDry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gi7vye\" data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2067\">\r\nDull skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fnvp4e\" data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2093\">\r\nRough or uneven texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhoy6j\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2131\">\r\nSensitive and stressed-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg62nq\" data-start=\"2132\" data-end=\"2161\">\r\nNormal and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"me22o4\" data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\nSkin needing extra hydration and barrier support\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2228\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zlct\" data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2276\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner and serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vt7ls\" data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2320\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5fztg\" data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2361\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2398\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ee24zo\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2515\">\r\nUse as the <strong data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2452\">final step of your skincare routine</strong>, morning and/or evening. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2465\" data-content-reference-end=\"2497\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2536\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"2537\" data-end=\"2557\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2549\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"navfpl\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2589\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2572\">Product:</strong> SEOUL 1988 Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i6865r\" data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2612\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Snail Mucin 93% + Rice\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ttu6tj\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2638\" data-end=\"2647\">Size:</strong> 100ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o8xaji\" data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2688\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2668\">Texture:</strong> Rich gel-type cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2705\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2746\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2734\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kgjr4y\" data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2874\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2767\">Main Concerns:</strong> Dryness, dullness, rough texture, dehydration, weakened skin barrier <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2819\" data-content-reference-end=\"2853\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lbjtps\" data-start=\"2876\" data-end=\"2891\">Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2892\" data-end=\"3324\">Snail Secretion Filtrate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, 1,2-Hexanediol, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone, Water, Cetearyl Olivate, Carbomer, Arginine, Benzyl Glycol, Sorbitan Olivate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Water, Allantoin, Sodium Polyacrylate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Disodium EDTA, Butylene Glycol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake), Panthenol, Ectoin, Sodium Hyaluronate. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3266\" data-content-reference-end=\"3285\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3494\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3339\">Best for:</strong> Those looking for a <strong data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3408\">hydrating, soothing, brightening moisturizer</strong> that helps support the skin barrier while leaving the skin soft, smooth, and radiant.</p>',NULL,NULL,16,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/vgFDMOHzImw0yLMlE9AkRrLbm7n2BMyCQG4OwIdL.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:35:42','2026-09-14 15:22:20'),(405,'SEOUL 1988 Cleansing Oil : Pine Cica 1% + Probiotics  200ml','seoul-1988-cleansing-oil-pine-cica-1-probiotics-200ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-4\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-4\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-4\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"f449d847-0065-4dee-a26a-48c105f64362\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"503\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"106\">KSECRET SEOUL 1988 Cleansing Oil</strong> is a gentle Korean cleansing oil formulated with <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"219\">1% Pine Cica Complex, Probiotics, and five plant-based oils</strong>. It effectively dissolves makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, blackheads, whiteheads, and daily impurities while helping keep the skin feeling soft, calm, and hydrated. It is suitable for <strong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"464\">all skin types, including sensitive and acne-prone skin</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"466\" data-content-reference-end=\"498\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"521\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qt8zub\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"608\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"555\">Removes Makeup &amp; Sunscreen:</strong> Easily melts away makeup, sunscreen, and impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ebq2ch\" data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"693\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"635\">Deep Pore Cleansing:</strong> Helps dissolve excess sebum and pore-clogging impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1beuagf\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"727\">Blackhead &amp; Whitehead Care:</strong> Helps loosen impurities inside pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zi1s5x\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"795\">Soothes Sensitive Skin:</strong> 1% Pine Cica Complex provides calming skincare benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j64qic\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"937\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"881\">Supports Skin Barrier:</strong> Probiotics help support a healthy-looking skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qlvglh\" data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"965\">Nourishing Hydration:</strong> Five plant-based oils help keep skin soft and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u4sgrc\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1051\">Lightweight Formula:</strong> Emulsifies with water and rinses away without a heavy oily residue.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5aaww\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1155\">Suitable for Acne-Prone Skin:</strong> Non-comedogenic and designed for gentle daily cleansing. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1208\" data-content-reference-end=\"1241\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1271\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1297\">Pine Cica Complex 1%</strong><br data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1300\">\r\nCombines pine and Centella-derived ingredients to help soothe stressed skin and support a comfortable skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1526\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1431\">Probiotics</strong><br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\">\r\nHelp support the skin\'s natural barrier and maintain a balanced, healthy-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1615\"><strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1550\">Macadamia Seed Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\">\r\nHelps dissolve impurities while providing nourishing moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1630\">Olive Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\nProvides emollient care and helps leave skin feeling soft after cleansing.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1796\"><strong data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1727\">Grape Seed Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\">\r\nA lightweight plant oil that helps condition and nourish the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1896\"><strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1820\">Sunflower Seed Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"1823\">\r\nHelps cleanse away makeup and excess oil while maintaining skin softness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2035\"><strong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1917\">Jojoba Seed Oil</strong><br data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\nHelps dissolve sebum and impurities while supporting a moisturized skin feel. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1989\" data-content-reference-end=\"2022\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2053\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2231\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17i93wd\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\nAll skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q56xcr\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2087\">\r\nSensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"id043a\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\nOily and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3ii391\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\nAcne-prone skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10skeda\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2171\">\r\nSkin with blackheads and whiteheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ev3bjv\" data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2206\">\r\nSkin concerned with excess sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pvjg7r\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2231\">\r\nDry or dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2247\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e97dvo\" data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount to <strong data-start=\"2282\" data-end=\"2310\">dry hands and a dry face</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhtkyt\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\nGently massage over the entire face, focusing on areas with makeup or clogged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ip5sds\" data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2473\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and massage until the oil turns <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2472\">milky</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2x9396\" data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n4o38\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser for a complete double-cleansing routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2581\" data-content-reference-end=\"2600\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2652\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"3034\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2665\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10mip2l\" data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2713\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2676\" data-end=\"2688\">Product:</strong> SEOUL 1988 Cleansing Oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12rionm\" data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2762\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2736\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Pine Cica 1% + Probiotics\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tui43o\" data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2780\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2774\">Size:</strong> 200ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1sbr6wf\" data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2821\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2795\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight cleansing oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2853\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2838\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2879\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2867\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztt678\" data-start=\"2880\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2898\">Formulation:</strong> Alcohol-free, fragrance-free, essential-oil-free, non-comedogenic\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4ntw1l\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3034\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2967\" data-end=\"2992\">Dermatologist Tested:</strong> Yes <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2966\" data-content-reference-end=\"2999\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lbjtps\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3051\">Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3478\">Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Sorbeth-30 Tetraoleate, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Pinus Densiflora Leaf Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Glycoproteins, Madecassoside, Madecassic Acid, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3406\" data-content-reference-end=\"3439\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3651\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3493\">Best for:</strong> A gentle first-step cleanser for removing <strong data-start=\"3536\" data-end=\"3597\">makeup, sunscreen, excess oil, blackheads, and impurities</strong> while providing soothing and barrier-supporting care.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,2,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/QI1n21j0TSUrmUvd0lwpXSC3V81RG03wWidlXyUW.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:37:33','2026-09-14 15:17:37'),(406,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask 60ml','collagen-boosting-secret-sleeping-mask-60ml','<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"511\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"106\">KSECRET Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask</strong> is an overnight Korean skincare treatment designed to <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"238\">hydrate, nourish, brighten, and improve the appearance of skin elasticity</strong> while you sleep. Its lightweight gel texture contains <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"404\">collagen, Vitamin E capsules, niacinamide, adenosine, panthenol, hyaluronic acid, and a retinoid ingredient</strong>, helping skin look smoother, plumper, and more refreshed by morning. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"474\" data-content-reference-end=\"506\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"529\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aa3f0c\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"626\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"564\">Intense Overnight Hydration:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prevent dry, tight-feeling skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"le2vh8\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"658\">Improves Skin Elasticity:</strong> Collagen, adenosine, and nourishing ingredients help skin appear firmer and more supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ghz7lc\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"774\">Brightens Dull Skin:</strong> Niacinamide helps improve the appearance of dullness and uneven-looking tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cz5lzl\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"942\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"880\">Smooths Skin Texture:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of rough texture and fine lines.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z1t8pu\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"971\">Vitamin E Nourishment:</strong> Melting Vitamin E capsules provide antioxidant and moisturizing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d6sl5m\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1064\">Plumping Effect:</strong> Hydrating ingredients such as hyaluronic acid help leave skin looking fuller and refreshed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hk1ccm\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1183\">Lightweight Texture:</strong> Absorbs comfortably without a heavy or greasy feeling. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1234\" data-content-reference-end=\"1266\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1297\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1411\"><strong data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1332\">Hydrolyzed &amp; Soluble Collagen</strong> – Helps moisturize and improve the appearance of skin firmness and elasticity.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1428\">Niacinamide</strong> – Helps brighten dull-looking skin, improve uneven tone, and support the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1564\">Vitamin E (Tocopherol &amp; Tocopheryl Acetate)</strong> – Provides antioxidant and nourishing benefits while helping maintain skin moisture.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1780\"><strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1664\">Adenosine</strong> – A skin-conditioning ingredient commonly used in anti-aging skincare to help improve the appearance of fine lines.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1869\"><strong data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1795\">Panthenol</strong> – Helps soothe and moisturize the skin while supporting the skin barrier.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1980\"><strong data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1911\">Hyaluronic Acid + Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> – Help attract and retain moisture for softer, plumper-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2137\"><strong data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2013\">Hydroxypinacolone Retinoate</strong> – A retinoid ingredient included in the formula for skin-renewing and smoothing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2090\" data-content-reference-end=\"2123\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2155\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueib1d\" data-start=\"2156\" data-end=\"2181\">\r\nDry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jzh56n\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2210\">\r\nDull or tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y4aez1\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2224\">\r\nMature skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jozycx\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2255\">\r\nRough or uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkemtx\" data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2288\">\r\nSkin concerned with fine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cg62nq\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2318\">\r\nNormal and combination skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2334\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yhbgza\" data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2405\">\r\nCleanse your face and complete your usual evening skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ujcya\" data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount as the <strong data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2458\">final step</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tzkry6\" data-start=\"2460\" data-end=\"2526\">\r\nGently massage until the Vitamin E capsules are fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19jjhix\" data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2549\">\r\nLeave on overnight.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5ia4jz\" data-start=\"2550\" data-end=\"2630\">\r\nRinse with water the following morning. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2579\" data-content-reference-end=\"2598\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2651\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"3034\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"2652\" data-end=\"2672\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2664\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7hshao\" data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2726\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2687\">Product:</strong> Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpvvv4\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2743\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2738\">Size:</strong> 60ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r8zny4\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2791\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2758\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, non-greasy gel mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2u0q7t\" data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2886\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2814\">Key Ingredients:</strong> Collagen, Vitamin E, Niacinamide, Adenosine, Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2900\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9eob20\" data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2947\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2923\">Use:</strong> Overnight sleeping mask\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n22i6r\" data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"3034\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2964\">Skin Type:</strong> Suitable for various skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2965\" data-content-reference-end=\"2997\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lgtwr4\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3054\">Important Note</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3306\">The ingredient list includes <strong data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3115\">Hydroxypinacolone Retinoate</strong> as well as several essential/fragrance oils, including lavender, orange, bergamot, and rose. If your skin is very sensitive, patch testing is advisable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3232\" data-content-reference-end=\"3264\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3479\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3321\">Best for:</strong> Anyone looking for an <strong data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3396\">overnight hydrating and anti-aging sleeping mask</strong> that helps skin appear smoother, plumper, brighter, and more refreshed by morning.</p>',NULL,NULL,25,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/7LqgkgCgYpcA1PacspzQ4YgQpCt4CRUueH4EdJfn.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:40:42','2026-09-14 15:16:22'),(407,'SEOUL 1988 Glow Serum : Niacinamide 15% + Yuja 30ml','seoul-1988-glow-serum-niacinamide-15-yuja-30ml','<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"571\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"98\">KSECRET SEOUL 1988 Glow Serum</strong> is a high-strength brightening serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"171\">15% Niacinamide</strong> and <strong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"209\">Yuja (Citrus Junos) Fruit Oil</strong>. It is designed to improve the appearance of dark spots, dullness, uneven skin tone, and rough texture while providing hydration and a healthy, radiant glow. The lightweight formula also contains <strong data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"483\">Tranexamic Acid, Glutathione, Panthenol, Squalane, and Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> for brightening, soothing, and moisturizing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"534\" data-content-reference-end=\"566\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"589\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7oxs5f\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"654\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"615\">Brightens dull skin</strong> and promotes a more radiant complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a37ywh\" data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"719\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"719\">Helps improve the appearance of dark spots and uneven tone</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qyxv7h\" data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"741\">15% Niacinamide</strong> supports brighter-looking, more refined skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11x0hr2\" data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"845\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"801\">Yuja oil</strong> provides nourishing and glow-enhancing care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1prykko\" data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"881\">Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione</strong> provide additional brightening support\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x6z8v8\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"983\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"950\">Panthenol + Beta-Glucan</strong> help soothe and hydrate the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17qa1ug\" data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1019\">Squalane + Sodium Hyaluronate</strong> help maintain moisture and softness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14e1vel\" data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1113\">uneven skin texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1056l0w\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1224\">\r\nLightweight, fast-absorbing texture with a <strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1186\">dewy, non-greasy finish</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1182\" data-content-reference-end=\"1227\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1245\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1931\"><strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1266\">Niacinamide 15%:</strong> Helps brighten the appearance of skin, improve uneven tone, and refine the look of pores.<br data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1393\">Yuja (Citrus Junos) Fruit Oil:</strong> Helps nourish the skin and enhance a healthy-looking glow.<br data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1475\">Tranexamic Acid:</strong> Supports a more even-looking complexion and targeted brightening care.<br data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1565\">Glutathione:</strong> Provides antioxidant and brightening support.<br data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1614\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1628\">Panthenol:</strong> Helps soothe and maintain skin hydration.<br data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1673\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1686\">Squalane:</strong> Helps soften skin and reduce moisture loss.<br data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1733\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1756\">Sodium Hyaluronate:</strong> Provides hydrating support for smoother, plumper-looking skin.<br data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1822\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1836\">Adenosine:</strong> Helps support smoother-looking skin and anti-aging care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1897\" data-content-reference-end=\"1929\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"id2l6p\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1946\">Skin Type</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"199