k\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2610\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2591\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET SEOUL 1988\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"183fimu\" data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2636\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2625\">Product:</strong> Glow Serum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ft9acu\" data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2654\">Key Active:</strong> Niacinamide 15%\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"32x40\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2697\">Featured Ingredient:</strong> Yuja\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3ogu0\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2721\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2716\">Volume:</strong> 30ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2747\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2735\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tij9mw\" data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2762\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight, fast-absorbing, non-greasy\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlmmzt\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2873\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2816\">Finish:</strong> Dewy, radiant glow <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2834\" data-content-reference-end=\"2866\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2895\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"3765\">Water, Niacinamide, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Glycereth-26, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Pentylene Glycol, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Squalane, Panthenol, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Adenosine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Gellan Gum, Agar, Sodium Phytate, Beta-Glucan, Citrus Junos Fruit Oil, Glutathione, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Hydroxydecyl Ubiquinone, Melia Azadirachta Flower Extract, Ocimum Sanctum Leaf Extract, Melia Azadirachta Leaf Extract, Curcuma Longa (Turmeric) Root Extract, Corallina Officinalis Extract, Tranexamic Acid, Xanthan Gum, Tocopherol, Sodium Ascorbyl Phosphate. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3721\" data-content-reference-end=\"3740\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3904\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3767\" data-end=\"3780\">Best for:</strong> Dark spots, dullness, uneven skin tone, pigmentation concerns, and achieving a brighter, smoother, more radiant complexion.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/GJhtBFF3oYou8feT3Z3fc4P3kOzAGIhjexfOdZ3G.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:45:42','2026-09-14 15:20:14'),(408,'SEOUL 1988 Sun : Pine Tree + Ceramide 50ml','seoul-1988-sun-pine-tree-ceramide-50ml','<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"584\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"104\">KSECRET SEOUL 1988 Sun: Pine Tree + Ceramide</strong> is a lightweight daily chemical sunscreen offering <strong data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"174\">SPF 50+ PA++++</strong> broad-spectrum UV protection. Enriched with <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"316\">Pine Tree Bud Extract, Ceramide NP, Niacinamide, Adenosine, Tocopherol, and multiple peptides</strong>, it helps protect the skin from UVA/UVB damage while supporting hydration, soothing, and the skin barrier. Its lightweight formula absorbs quickly and is designed to leave a smooth, glowing finish without a noticeable white cast. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"547\" data-content-reference-end=\"579\"><