ontents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1168\" data-content-reference-end=\"1201\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1212\" data-end=\"1231\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1325\"><strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1272\">Pine Tree Bud Extract (10,009 ppm):</strong> Helps soothe the skin and provides antioxidant care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1413\"><strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1353\">Ceramide NP (100 ppm):</strong> Helps strengthen the skin barrier and reduce moisture loss.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1431\">Niacinamide:</strong> Helps improve the appearance of uneven tone and supports overall skin conditioning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1583\"><strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1531\">Adenosine:</strong> Helps support smoother, more youthful-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1660\"><strong data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1612\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E):</strong> Provides antioxidant and conditioning benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1938\"><strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1682\">Peptide Complex:</strong> Includes <strong data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1846\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, and Hexapeptide-9</strong>, which support a smoother, firmer-looking complexion. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1892\" data-content-reference-end=\"1911\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"id2l6p\" data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1953\">Skin Type</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"1997\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1985\">all skin types</strong>, including:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qdpa0\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2008\">\r\nDry skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q56xcr\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2025\">\r\nSensitive skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8ycizy\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\nCombination skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16f7z39\" data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2062\">\r\nDehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gxkjma\" data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2086\">\r\nSkin prone to redness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30us8s\" data-start=\"2087\" data-end=\"2109\">\r\nNormal and oily skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2111\" data-end=\"2125\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tpqvgh\" data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2189\">\r\nApply as the <strong data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2188\">last step of your morning skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87brvl\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount and spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1atvpya\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2308\">\r\nGently massage or pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1kq84\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2400\">\r\nReapply during prolonged outdoor exposure, especially after sweating or wiping the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2421\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wekw2k\" data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2434\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET SEOUL 1988\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11zvnvo\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2494\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2468\">Product:</strong> Sun: Pine Tree + Ceramide\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pagba4\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2513\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2497\" data-end=\"2505\">SPF:</strong> SPF 50+\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"87s7f9\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2537\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2530\">PA Rating:</strong> PA++++\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3t33y\" data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2540\" data-end=\"2551\">Volume:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yey4ei\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2568\">Type:</strong> Chemical sunscreen\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i222xm\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2590\" data-end=\"2602\">Texture:</strong> Lightweight and fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"czp652\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2647\">Finish:</strong> Smooth, glowy finish\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2685\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xbbhz\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2759\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2715\">Made in:</strong> Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2695\" data-content-reference-end=\"2728\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2761\" data-end=\"2781\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"3913\">Water, Propanediol, Dibutyl Adipate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Butyloctyl Salicylate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Niacinamide, Methylene Bis-Benzotriazolyl Tetramethylbutylphenol, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Caprylyl Methicone, Diethylhexyl Butamido Triazone, Glycerin, Pinus Sylvestris Bud Extract (10,009 ppm), Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Pentylene Glycol, Cardiospermum Halicacabum Flower/Leaf/Vine Extract, Hedychium Coronarium Root Extract, Echium Plantagineum Seed Oil, Behenyl Alcohol, Poly C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate, Polyglyceryl-3 Methylglucose Distearate, Octyldodecanol, Decyl Glucoside, Tromethamine, Carbomer, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-6, Ethylhexylglycerin, Adenosine, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil Unsaponifiables, Xanthan Gum, Glyceryl Caprylate, Tocopherol, Ceramide NP (100 ppm), Caprylyl Glycol, Nonapeptide-1, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Tetrapeptide-7, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Hexapeptide-9. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3845\" data-content-reference-end=\"3877\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4087\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3928\">Best for:</strong> Daily UV protection with added <strong data-start=\"3960\" data-end=\"4020\">soothing, hydration, barrier support, and a healthy glow</strong>, especially for dry, sensitive, dehydrated, or redness-prone skin.</p>',NULL,NULL,19,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/5S1WTLKYsixvlE9loVHqNsqLuBXhsAFBb2mv9vVj.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:48:11','2026-09-14 15:21:11'),(409,'Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm 11ml','collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-11ml','<p data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"528\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"50\" data-end=\"93\">KSECRET Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm</strong> is a portable, multi-purpose skincare balm designed to provide <strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"230\">instant hydration, nourishment, brightness, and a smooth-looking glow</strong>. It contains <strong data-start=\"244\" data-end=\"275\">15% Vitamin C (150,000 ppm)</strong>, hydrolyzed collagen, panthenol, sea buckthorn oil, and peptide ingredients. The convenient stick format makes it easy to apply to dry areas, fine lines, and areas that need an extra boost of moisture and radiance. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"491\" data-content-reference-end=\"523\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"546\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eqcx4s\" data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"614\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"580\">Brightens dull-looking skin</strong> and promotes a radiant complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nan6fq\" data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"680\">\r\nContains <strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"643\">15% Vitamin C</strong> for antioxidant and brightening care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k7w73l\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"745\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of <strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"745\">dark spots and uneven tone</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xz16mm\" data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"818\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"771\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</strong> supports a smoother, firmer-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tiv5lc\" data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"866\">\r\nProvides <strong data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"866\">instant moisture and nourishment</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8iolet\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"927\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of <strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"927\">fine lines and wrinkles</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1orj629\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"943\">Panthenol</strong> helps soothe and hydrate the skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ihhf1z\" data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1001\">Sea Buckthorn Oil</strong> provides nourishing antioxidant care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrvawl\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\nConvenient <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1071\">multi-use stick</strong> for on-the-go touch-ups\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s1lspd\" data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\nCan be used on areas such as the <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1176\">face, neck, lips, cheeks, and dry patches</strong> <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1172\" data-content-reference-end=\"1204\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1235\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1384\"><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1269\">Vitamin C 15% (150,000 ppm):</strong> Helps brighten dull skin and improve the appearance of uneven pigmentation while providing antioxidant protection.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1493\"><strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1410\">Hydrolyzed Collagen:</strong> Helps moisturize the skin and support a smoother, more elastic-looking appearance.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1572\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1509\">Panthenol:</strong> Helps maintain hydration and soothe dry or uncomfortable skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1649\"><strong data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1596\">Sea Buckthorn Oil:</strong> Nourishes the skin and provides antioxidant support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1738\"><strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1686\">Tocopheryl Acetate (Vitamin E):</strong> Helps condition skin and provides antioxidant care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1806\"><strong data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1754\">Adenosine:</strong> Supports smoother-looking skin and anti-aging care.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"2021\"><strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1828\">Peptide Complex:</strong> Includes Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Oligopeptide-1 and Oligopeptide-2 for skin-conditioning and firming support. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1974\" data-content-reference-end=\"1993\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"id2l6p\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2036\">Skin Type</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2081\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2068\">all skin types</strong>, especially:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ueib1d\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2107\">\r\nDry and dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jzh56n\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2136\">\r\nDull or tired-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wkemtx\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\nSkin concerned with fine lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"91rwxw\" data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2188\">\r\nUneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j7kufy\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2225\">\r\nDry patches needing quick moisture\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2241\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zwji3z\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2295\">\r\nUse at the <strong data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2294\">last step of your skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v0l7pj\" data-start=\"2296\" data-end=\"2372\">\r\nTwist up the balm and gently swipe a small amount onto the desired areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"psuq1a\" data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2414\">\r\nPat or massage lightly until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i2a74j\" data-start=\"2415\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\nReapply whenever the skin feels dry or needs a fresh glow. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2449\" data-content-reference-end=\"2468\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2535\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2859\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wcxt6c\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2556\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2548\">Brand:</strong> KSECRET\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugyfrj\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2603\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2571\">Product:</strong> Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yylbyo\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2619\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2615\">Size:</strong> 11g\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ys50pt\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2665\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2637\">Key Active:</strong> Vitamin C 15% / 150,000 ppm\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytul7d\" data-start=\"2666\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2681\">Key Care:</strong> Brightening, hydration, firming &amp; anti-aging care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kjfy7o\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2763\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2746\">Texture:</strong> Solid balm stick\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g52eu9\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2789\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2777\">Origin:</strong> South Korea\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cfdp6l\" data-start=\"2790\" data-end=\"2859\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2806\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2776\" data-content-reference-end=\"2809\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2881\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"3668\">Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Vegetable Oil, Ascorbic Acid (15%, 150,000ppm), Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Diisostearyl Malate, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Ceresin, Dipentaerythrityl Hexahydroxystearate/Hexastearate/Hexarosinate, Hexyldecyl Ethylhexanoate, Beeswax, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Dipropylene Glycol, Shorea Robusta Seed Butter, Sucrose Tetrastearate Triacetate, Fragrance, Caprylyl Glycol, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Hippophae Rhamnoides Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Oil Soluble Licorice (Glycyrrhiza) Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Adenosine, Water, Butylene Glycol, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Panthenol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Acetyl Hexapeptide-8, Copper Tripeptide-1, Palmitoyl Pentapeptide-4, Oligopeptide-1, Oligopeptide-2. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3581\" data-content-reference-end=\"3614\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3791\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3683\">Best for:</strong> On-the-go <strong data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3763\">brightening, hydration, dry patches, dullness, and fine-line care</strong> in a convenient balm stick.</p>',NULL,NULL,28,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Kg87mKCcYqwjsupSS30actWdTwFlg6hsEk8aVpEJ.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:51:47','2026-09-14 15:15:50'),(410,'Retinal Liposome 1% & Fermented Rice Anti-aging Cream 50ml','retinal-liposome-1-fermented-rice-anti-aging-cream-50ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-9\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-9\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:3caf56ad-1211-4e38-856a-52b0217dfaf6-9\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-20\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"91041834-a427-436d-ad7c-990cc1581bc3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6-mini\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"549\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"152\">K-SECRET SEOUL 1988 Retinal Liposome 1% + Fermented Rice Anti-Aging Cream</strong> is an advanced nighttime moisturizer formulated to target <strong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"290\">fine lines, wrinkles, uneven skin tone, rough texture, and loss of firmness</strong>. It combines retinal in a liposome delivery system with <strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"459\">Lactobacillus/Rice Ferment, niacinamide, bakuchiol, vitamin C &amp; E, peptides, and soothing botanical extracts</strong> to support smoother, brighter, firmer-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"512\" data-content-reference-end=\"544\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"567\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8iolet\" data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"628\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"628\">fine lines and wrinkles</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"69pkfg\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"685\">\r\nSupports a <strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"685\">firmer, more elastic-looking complexion</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u0trrz\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"735\">\r\nHelps improve <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"735\">rough and uneven skin texture</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oph0yl\" data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"795\">\r\nBrightens dull-looking skin and supports a more even tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fl7ulj\" data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"867\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"818\">Retinal Liposome</strong> provides advanced retinoid-based anti-aging care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14jnb2x\" data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"888\">Fermented Rice</strong> helps with brightening and skin conditioning\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hs2u0r\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"960\">Bakuchiol + peptides</strong> provide additional firming and skin-smoothing support\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyklkt\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1059\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1034\">Vitamin C &amp; E</strong> provide antioxidant care\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cm55an\" data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1110\">\r\nHelps support the <strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1110\">skin barrier and hydration</strong>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g0ixf3\" data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1219\">\r\nSmooth, creamy texture that absorbs without a heavy or sticky finish <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1177\" data-content-reference-end=\"1209\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nx5zqf\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1240\">Key Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1511\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1266\">Retinal Liposome 1%:</strong> A retinal-based anti-aging ingredient designed to improve the appearance of wrinkles, uneven texture, and skin tone. The liposome system is intended to help deliver and stabilize the retinal in the formula. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1464\" data-content-reference-end=\"1483\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1593\"><strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1544\">Lactobacillus/Rice Ferment:</strong> Helps brighten, hydrate, and condition the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1690\"><strong data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1611\">Niacinamide:</strong> Supports brighter-looking, more even-toned skin and overall skin conditioning.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1804\"><strong data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1706\">Bakuchiol:</strong> A plant-derived ingredient commonly used in anti-aging formulas to support smoother-looking skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1897\"><strong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1819\">Peptides:</strong> Three peptide ingredients help support a firmer, smoother-looking complexion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1970\"><strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1925\">Vitamin C &amp; Vitamin E:</strong> Provide antioxidant and brightening support.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2029\"><strong data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"1992\">Ginseng Ferment:</strong> Helps soothe and condition the skin.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2119\"><strong data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2045\">Allantoin:</strong> Helps calm and moisturize the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2054\" data-content-reference-end=\"2086\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"id2l6p\" data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2134\">Skin Type</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2181\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2166\">all skin types</strong>, particularly:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12q1ji4\" data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2212\">\r\nMature or aging-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3px1hq\" data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2235\">\r\nDull and uneven skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g0ph2u\" data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2260\">\r\nRough or textured skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yo3p0t\" data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2306\">\r\nSkin concerned with fine lines and wrinkles\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1huzy0l\" data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2343\">\r\nSkin lacking firmness and radiance\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2359\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d2mw5o\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2390\">\r\nCleanse and tone your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b1tybp\" data-start=\"2391\" data-end=\"2448\">\r\nApply a moderate amount of cream evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ykg86y\" data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2478\">\r\nGently pat until absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uq5bii\" data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2541\">\r\nUse primarily as part of your <strong data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2540\">evening skincare routine</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tcfhyb\" data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2609\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always apply a <strong data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2608\">broad-spectrum sunscreen</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2823\"><strong data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2627\">Retinal tip:</strong> If you are new to retinal, start <strong data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2684\">2–3 nights per week</strong> and gradually increase frequency as your skin becomes accustomed to it. Avoid introducing several strong active products at the same time.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1o2c85r\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2844\">Product Details</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"3219\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"46wxfn\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2857\">Brand:</strong> K-SECRET / KSECRET SEOUL 1988\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yj4axr\" data-start=\"2888\" data-end=\"2956\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2902\">Product:</strong> Retinal Liposome 1% + Fermented Rice Anti-Aging Cream\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3t33y\" data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2975\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2970\">Volume:</strong> 50ml\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xto0np\" data-start=\"2976\" data-end=\"3038\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2994\">Key Concern:</strong> Anti-aging, wrinkles, pigmentation, texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17ui6ss\" data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3084\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3041\" data-end=\"3053\">Texture:</strong> Smooth, creamy, fast-absorbing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15r21zk\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3123\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3098\">Finish:</strong> Soft, smooth, non-sticky\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dc9me8\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3155\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3140\">Skin Type:</strong> All skin types\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uggakc\" data-start=\"3156\" data-end=\"3219\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3169\">Origin:</strong> South Korea <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3149\" data-content-reference-end=\"3181\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13ztoir\" data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3241\">Full Ingredients</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"4568\">Water, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Glycerin, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Niacinamide, Propanediol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Polyisobutene, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, Lactobacillus/Rice Ferment (1,000 ppm), Lactobacillus/Soybean Ferment Extract, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Saccharomyces/Coix Lacryma-Jobi Ma-yuen Seed Ferment Filtrate, Saccharomyces/Potato Extract Ferment Filtrate, Xanthan Gum, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Disodium EDTA, Ethylhexylglycerin, Allantoin, Caprylyl Glycol, Adenosine, Glyceryl Acrylate/Acrylic Acid Copolymer, Caprylyl/Capryl Glucoside, Cholesterol, Polyglyceryl-10 Oleate, Sorbitan Oleate, Brassica Campestris (Rapeseed) Sterols, Phytosteryl/Behenyl/Octyldodecyl Lauroyl Glutamate, <strong data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4132\">Retinal (100 ppm)</strong>, Silica, Aluminum/Magnesium Hydroxide Stearate, Tocopherol, Potassium Cetyl Phosphate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Arctium Lappa Root Extract, Cnidium Officinale Root Extract, Dioscorea Japonica Root Extract, Paeonia Suffruticosa Root Extract, Rehmannia Chinensis Root Extract, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, Bakuchiol, sh-Oligopeptide-1, sh-Oligopeptide-2, sh-Polypeptide-1. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"4493\" data-content-reference-end=\"4525\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4716\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4583\">Best for:</strong> Fine lines, wrinkles, uneven tone, rough texture, dullness, and loss of firmness—especially as a <strong data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4715\">nighttime anti-aging treatment</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,16,48,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/hE6wc0pC1bkSF3gpEkwTORxk2uCAp3QNHlDmwLBu.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 04:54:16','2026-09-14 15:32:40'),(411,'AHA BHA Peeling Serum 30ml','aha-bha-peeling-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"342\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL AHA BHA Peeling Serum is an exfoliating facial serum designed to help remove dead skin cells, unclog pores, and improve the appearance of rough, uneven skin. AHA works mainly on the skin’s surface, while BHA penetrates into pores to help clear excess sebum and buildup.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"360\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhoimd\" data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"394\">\r\nHelps exfoliate dead skin cells\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ob4w3v\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"425\">\r\nHelps unclog congested pores\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqx4lq\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"466\">\r\nImproves rough and uneven skin texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eo0ub3\" data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"525\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of blackheads and whiteheads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bg1zbe\" data-start=\"526\" data-end=\"576\">\r\nPromotes a smoother, brighter-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16qza30\" data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"620\">\r\nHelps control excess oil and pore buildup\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oev850\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"669\">\r\nSupports clearer-looking skin with regular use\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"685\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"941\">After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount evenly over the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas. Start <strong data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"817\">1–2 times per week</strong>, then gradually increase according to your skin\'s tolerance. Follow with moisturizer. <strong data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"941\">Use sunscreen during the daytime.</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"959\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1116\">Best suited for <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1033\">oily, combination, congested, and rough-textured skin</strong>. Sensitive skin should introduce exfoliating acids gradually and patch-test first.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1243\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1127\">Note:</strong> Avoid using it in the same routine with other strong exfoliating acids or retinoids if your skin becomes irritated.</p>',NULL,NULL,11,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/63SKFbYKecvM4cemNi0WUqcPL5dkexCbpnASFVG5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 05:44:44','2026-09-14 14:59:13'),(412,'Anti-Melasma Cica Treatment Toner 155ml','anti-melasma-cica-treatment-toner-155ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:834971ae-0756-4c81-8e82-bde3aa64ad92-1\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:834971ae-0756-4c81-8e82-bde3aa64ad92-1\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:834971ae-0756-4c81-8e82-bde3aa64ad92-1\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"68faf65d-046d-471f-8f63-2bd22e0819f7\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\"><div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\"><p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"407\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL Anti-Melasma Cica Treatment Toner is a soothing and brightening toner formulated to help improve the appearance of uneven skin tone, dark spots, and post-blemish marks. With Cica-focused care, it helps calm the skin while providing lightweight hydration and preparing the skin for the next steps of your skincare routine.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"425\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"749\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bqfk7i\" data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"491\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dark spots and uneven skin tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q9qm1v\" data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"543\">\r\nSupports a brighter, more even-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jm6egv\" data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"585\">\r\nHelps soothe sensitive or stressed skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22xmrw\" data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"618\">\r\nProvides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9mzt27\" data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"666\">\r\nHelps maintain a healthy-looking skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ygjk86\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"710\">\r\nPrepares skin for serums and moisturizers\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n46ni4\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"749\">\r\nSuitable for daily skincare routines\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"765\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"919\">After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the face and gently pat until absorbed. For extra hydration, apply a second layer to areas that feel dry.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"921\" data-end=\"937\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"1101\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"1013\">dull, uneven, dry, combination, and sensitive-looking skin</strong>, especially those concerned with the appearance of pigmentation and post-blemish marks.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1118\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1112\">Size:</strong> 155ml</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,6,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/sQvitTPe4vShGSaZ5QdTEKWE4C3ikW04IyV95mrf.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 05:46:59','2026-09-14 14:50:19'),(413,'Cicavita B5 Tranexamic Acid Toner 155ml','cicavita-b5-tranexamic-acid-toner-155ml','<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"469\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL Cicavita B5 Tranexamic Acid Toner is a brightening and soothing facial toner designed to help improve the appearance of dark spots, uneven skin tone, and dullness while providing hydration and skin-comforting care. Its combination of <strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"381\">Tranexamic Acid, Vitamin B5, and Cica-focused ingredients</strong> makes it suitable for daily skincare routines targeting pigmentation and stressed skin.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"487\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dcbabt\" data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"548\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of dark spots and pigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1filjpf\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"605\">\r\nHelps promote a brighter, more even-looking complexion\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ow720\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"647\">\r\nSupports a healthy-looking skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"22xmrw\" data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"680\">\r\nProvides lightweight hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q3ibm8\" data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"730\">\r\nHelps soothe and comfort irritated-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z8rwag\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"785\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of dull and uneven skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5yjg4l\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"851\">\r\nPrepares skin for better application of serums and moisturizers\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qw4ccu\" data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"867\">How to Use</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"1107\">After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the face using your hands or a cotton pad. Gently pat until fully absorbed. Follow with serum and moisturizer. <strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1063\">Use sunscreen during the daytime</strong> for better protection against pigmentation.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ndroi4\" data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1125\">Suitable For</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1298\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1208\">dull, uneven, dehydrated, combination, and sensitive-looking skin</strong>, particularly for those concerned with the appearance of dark spots and uneven skin tone.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1315\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1309\">Size:</strong> 155ml</p>',NULL,NULL,6,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/Fl7RDFl9g29sScGamlTvtHOxuodbNq2GpxNJbQht.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 05:48:32','2026-09-14 14:49:50'),(414,'Egg White Pore Clinic Cleansing Foam 150ml','egg-white-pore-clinic-cleansing-foam-150ml','<p data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"370\" class=\"PDq2pG