aily cleanser with pore-care benefits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1062\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1056\">Size:</strong> 150ml</p>',NULL,NULL,3,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/paL5BB05nYBqRXTzQgCpALH7X1MwvERhZ69PC8Cv.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 05:50:16','2026-09-14 14:49:18'),(415,'Hyaluvita B5 Cica Serum 30ml','hyaluvita-b5-cica-serum-30ml','<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"381\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL Hyaluvita B5 Cica Serum is a hydrating and soothing facial serum designed to replenish moisture, calm stressed-looking skin, and support a healthy skin barrier. With <strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"282\">Hyaluronic Acid, Vitamin B5, and Cica</strong>, it provides lightweight hydration while helping skin feel softer, smoother, and more comfortable.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"399\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"721\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1leldeo\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"442\">\r\nProvides deep and long-lasting hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ll9ku5\" data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"488\">\r\nHelps soothe dry and sensitive-looking skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tuwemq\" data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"522\">\r\nSupports a healthy skin barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tnu0mq\" data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"574\">\r\nHelps reduce the feeling of tightness and dryness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wdwqll\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"626\">\r\nImproves the appearance of rough, dehydrated skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uuz66\" data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"676\">\r\nLeaves skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8yjbnd\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"721\">\r\nLightweight texture suita