, roughness, or tightness.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1214\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1162\">Size:</strong> 50ml<br data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1190\">Key Ingredients:</strong> 7% Ceramide, Vitamin B5</p>',NULL,NULL,16,31,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]',NULL,'products/thumbnails/n7B2w3YCueINXLIcV3YuNhz0WEuEcYe0G2yajUoM.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-08 06:05:14','2026-09-14 14:46:15'),(423,'Pomegranate Lip Night Mask 5ml','pomegranate-lip-night-mask-5ml','<p data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"349\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">CARE:NEL Pomegranate Lip Night Mask is an overnight lip treatment designed to provide intense moisture and nourishment to dry, rough, and flaky lips. Enriched with pomegranate-focused care, it helps soften the lips and maintain a smooth, healthy-looking appearance while you sleep.<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ycgkk5\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"367\">Key Benefits</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mt57jh\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"414\">\r\nProvides overnight hydration and nourishment\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogdbd6\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"448\">\r\nHelps soften dry and rough lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0q8w2\" data-start=\"449\" data-end=\"492\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of flaky skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1obgmb\" data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"536\">\r\nSupports smoother, healthier-looking lips\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v4ngxo\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"584\">\r\nHelps prevent lips from feeling dry and tight\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"htuohu\" data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"630\">\r\nLeaves lips soft and comfortable by morning\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hzbq0q\" data-start=\"631\" data-end