l9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3224\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3566\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"du16dy\" data-start=\"3225\" data-end=\"3258\">\r\nCleanse your face and pat dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rx8eoz\" data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3335\">\r\nApply an even layer over the entire face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xdxn6k\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3410\">\r\nLeave on for <strong data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3367\">3–5 minutes</strong> (do not allow the mask to completely dry).\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dwh1mr\" data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3463\">\r\nGently massage with lukewarm water while rinsing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rkizgt\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3566\">\r\nUse <strong data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3493\">1–2 times per week</strong>, depending on your skin condition. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3513\" data-content-reference-end=\"3546\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3568\" data-end=\"3571\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3594\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"4070\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Unlike traditional clay masks that can leave skin feeling dry, the <strong data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3704\">Anua Heartleaf + Enzyme Pore Clay Pack</strong> combines <strong data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3816\">Heartleaf Extract, natural enzymes, Bentonite, Kaolin, Panthenol, Ceramide NP, and Hyaluronic Acid</strong> to deeply purify pores while keeping skin hydrated, calm, and comfortable. It\'s an excellent weekly treatment for oily, combination, acne-prone, and sensitive skin seeking smoother texture and visibly refined pores.</p>',NULL,NULL,24,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/9qvzwDy3V8fmmR5b3k0d