=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2255\" data-content-reference-end=\"2287\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><hr data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\"><h1 data-section-id=\"1e704tr\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2334\">Full Ingredients (INCI)</h1><p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2336\" data-end=\"2892\">Houttuynia Cordata Extract (77%), Water, Gluconolactone, Propanediol, Tromethamine, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Betaine, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/VP Copolymer, Ulmus Davidiana Root Extract, Pueraria Lobata Root Extract, Pinus Palustris Leaf Extract, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Flower Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Coix Lacryma-Jobi Ma-yuen Seed Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Madecassoside, Asiatic Acid, Asiaticoside, Madecassic Acid, Sodium Phytate. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2840\" data-content-reference-end=\"2859\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p><hr data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2897\"><h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2908\">Texture</h1><ul data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mb4ash\" data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\nSoft dual-sided cotton toner pads\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n2lwmq\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2973\">\r\nLightweight watery essence\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7zs8sm\" data-start=\"2974\" data-end=\"2993\">\r\nNon-sticky finish\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cebirf\" data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\nRefreshing and soothing feel\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><hr data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3029\"><h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3043\">How to Use</h1><ol data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3501\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"3044\" data-end=\"3076\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r9vahz\" data-start=\"3077\" data-end=\"3121\">\r\nTake one pad using the included tweezers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rgakbe\" data-start=\"3122\" data-end=\"3208\">\r\nGently wipe the <strong data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3158\">embossed side</strong> across your face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2bhhp\" data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3284\">\r\nFlip the pad and use the <strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3252\">smooth side</strong> to soothe and hydrate the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"si2j4a\" data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3390\">\r\nFor intensive calming care, place the pad on irritated areas for <strong data-start=\"3353\" data-end=\"3368\">3–5 minutes</strong> as a mini sheet mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wazrrs\" data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3428\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g5xqtw\" data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3501\">\r\nUse daily, morning and evening. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3431\" data-content-reference-end=\"3463\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol><hr data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3506\"><h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3528\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1><p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"572\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3529\" data-end=\"4054\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The <strong data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3570\">Anua Heartleaf 77 + PHA Clear Pad</strong> combines <strong data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3605\">77% Heartleaf Extract</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3607\" data-end=\"3614\">PHA</strong>, <strong data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3637\">Centella Asiatica</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"3643\" data-end=\"3667\">Anti-Sebum P Complex</strong> to provide gentle daily exfoliation, pore care, hydration, and soothing benefits in one simple step. The dual-sided design makes it ideal for improving skin texture while remaining gentle enough for sensitive and acne-prone skin. Clinical testing showed improvements in pore appearance, sebum control, hydration, and smoother skin with regular use</p>',NULL,NULL,8,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/YPqIfUy5tfoYz0eiqQxn83MeAF1zRwufmKWeB0Xm.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:22:51','2026-09-18 11:22:51'),(432,'Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Mild 200ml','heartleaf-pore-control-cleansing-oil-mild-200ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"568\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Mild is a lightweight, fragrance-free cleansing oil specially formulated for sensitive, acne-prone, and easily irritated skin. It effectively dissolves waterproof makeup, sunscreen, excess sebum, blackheads, and daily impurities while maintaining the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. The non-comedogenic formula emulsifies easily with water, leaving the skin clean, soft, and refreshed without any greasy residue. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"531\" data-content-reference-end=\"564\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"573\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpyre2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"594\">Product Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pn30z0\" data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"652\">\r\nDeeply removes makeup, sunscreen, dirt, and excess oil.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"177jpl\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"698\">\r\nHelps dissolve blackheads and unclog pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0sfbg\" data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"761\">\r\nSoothes irritated and sensitive skin with Heartleaf Extract.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"157fwxn\" data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"805\">\r\nMaintains skin hydration after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1px8p6k\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"840\">\r\nSupports a healthy skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uspkc5\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"900\">\r\nLightweight, non-greasy formula with easy emulsification.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ou5gdt\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"952\">\r\nNon-comedogenic and suitable for acne-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17g9m9k\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\nFragrance-free and gentle around the eye area.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"oxek3q\" data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1092\">\r\nLeaves skin feeling fresh, clean, and comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1051\" data-content-reference-end=\"1084\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oh0gei\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1121\">Best For Skin Types</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1187\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1201\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f2cacw\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1297\">\r\nSuitable for daily use, even for easily irritated skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1252\" data-content-reference-end=\"1285\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1322\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"895910\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1431\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1367\">Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong> – Calms irritation, reduces redness, and supports healthy skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2g2jqx\" data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1456\">Sunflower Seed Oil</strong> – Nourishes and helps maintain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s4ror6\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1521\">Rosemary Leaf Oil</strong> – Helps balance excess sebum and provides antioxidant benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fb1rse\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1652\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1620\">Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride</strong> – Softens skin while cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y5yrkj\" data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1723\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1681\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</strong> – Protects skin with antioxidant support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrj12t\" data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1758\">Lightweight Cleansing Esters</strong> – Dissolve makeup, sunscreen, and impurities without clogging pores. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1816\" data-content-reference-end=\"1849\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1870\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1882\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"2069\">A lightweight, silky cleansing oil that transforms into a milky emulsion upon contact with water, rinsing away cleanly without leaving an oily film. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2016\" data-content-reference-end=\"2035\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2089\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2izykb\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\nPump 2–3 times into dry hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2ym1m3\" data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2204\">\r\nApply to a dry face and gently massage in circular motions for 30–60 seconds.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"73ov5v\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2286\">\r\nAdd a small amount of lukewarm water to emulsify the oil into a milky texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9te1hx\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2317\">\r\nContinue massaging briefly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2358\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hdp1cl\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2487\">\r\nFollow with a water-based cleanser as the second step of your double-cleansing routine. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2416\" data-content-reference-end=\"2449\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2494\" data-end=\"2515\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2804\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mzt0xn\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2580\">\r\nRemoves stubborn waterproof makeup and sunscreen effortlessly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u91h6d\" data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2623\">\r\nCleans pores without stripping moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7et0lc\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2668\">\r\nIdeal first cleanser for double cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wllm6o\" data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\nGentle enough for everyday use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ag1ef2\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2804\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves skin smooth, hydrated, and refreshed after every wash.&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,2,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/KDWO0aWuyZD2CgBN1adO61ad0gusT2YuUYolKf9v.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:25:16','2026-09-18 11:25:16'),(433,'Birch Moisture Boosting Pad 160ml (70EA)','birch-moisture-boosting-pad-160ml-70ea','<h1 data-section-id=\"173umpx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"47\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Anua Birch Moisture Boosting Pad is a hydrating toner pad infused with </span><strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"177\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">70,000ppm Japanese White Birch Sap</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> to deeply moisturize, strengthen the skin barrier, and maintain the skin\'s natural pH balance. Enriched with </span><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"346\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Panthenol, 10 types of Hyaluronic Acid, and ABC Complex</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, these ultra-soft vegan pads instantly replenish moisture, soothe sensitive skin, and prepare the skin for the next skincare steps. The lightweight, essence-soaked pads leave the skin fresh, plump, and radiant without any sticky feeling.</span></h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"627\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpyre2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"648\">Product Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"1185\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1781q4h\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"695\">\r\nProvides instant and long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1z89ip\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"738\">\r\nMaintains the skin\'s natural pH balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<l