ble for all skin types, especially skin experiencing dryness or irritation. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1367\" data-content-reference-end=\"1399\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1416\" data-end=\"1419\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1439\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tok6dy\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1534\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1482\">Japanese White Birch Sap (70,000ppm)</strong> – Deeply hydrates and helps maintain skin moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wuzaos\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1563\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong> – Strengthens the skin barrier and calms irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gxtioh\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1716\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1650\">10 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Delivers multi-layer hydration for plump, healthy-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13irx3y\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1719\" data-end=\"1732\">Allantoin</strong> – Soothes and protects sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzrr0l\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1832\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1785\">Betaine</strong> – Maintains moisture balance and softens skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15jin42\" data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1898\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1861\">Cucumber Fruit Extract</strong> – Refreshes and calms stressed skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11bqur3\" data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1925\">Gluconolactone (PHA)</strong> – Gently smooths skin texture while providing hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14fi4ju\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2100\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2006\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant protection and soothes the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2048\" data-content-reference-end=\"2080\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2105\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2117\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2378\">Soft vegan cotton pads saturated with a lightweight, watery essence that absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue. The pads feel cooling and refreshing, making them ideal for daily hydration or quick soothing care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2321\" data-content-reference-end=\"2340\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2398\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2399\" data-end=\"2431\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"575c6u\" data-start=\"2432\" data-end=\"2481\">\r\nTake one toner pad using the included tweezer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"88s844\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2545\">\r\nGently wipe across the face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t6pyh5\" data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2611\">\r\nPat the remaining essence into the skin for better absorption.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ioh81\" data-start=\"2612\" data-end=\"2722\">\r\nFor an intensive hydration treatment, place the pads on dry areas for <strong data-start=\"2685\" data-end=\"2700\">3–5 minutes</strong> as a mini sheet mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kcrqlh\" data-start=\"2723\" data-end=\"2798\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2723\" data-content-reference-end=\"2755\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2803\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2805\" data-end=\"2826\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"3195\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zgxjpd\" data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2870\">\r\nDelivers deep hydration in one easy step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ppvzbf\" data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2919\">\r\nInstantly refreshes tired and dehydrated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhisuq\" data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier with Birch Sap and Panthenol.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oag777\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\nPerfect before makeup for a smoother, dewier finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11egeza\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\nGentle enough for everyday use, even on sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5agzgd\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3195\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nHelps keep skin soft, balanced, healthy, and glowing all day.&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,8,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/LUFYBzrbLIFFgCXoz0FCc2IHpGHGqRMUcWNPkZza.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:30:24','2026-09-18 11:30:24'),(434,'Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder 40ml','rice-enzyme-brightening-cleansing-powder-40ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"667\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Anua Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder is a <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"183\">2-in-1 water-activated powder cleanser and wash-off mask</strong> designed to gently cleanse, exfoliate, and brighten dull skin. Formulated with <strong data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"342\">Rice Powder, Rice Bran Water, Papain Enzyme, Alpha-Arbutin, and Ceramide NP</strong>, it removes dead skin cells, excess oil, sunscreen residue, and impurities while helping maintain the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. The powder transforms into a soft, creamy foam when mixed with water, leaving the skin smoother, softer, and more radiant without feeling dry or tight. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"630\" data-content-reference-end=\"662\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpyre2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"693\">Product Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xx50q4\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"754\">\r\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells without harsh scrubbing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f8fc16\" data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"793\">\r\nBrightens dull and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t30b0d\" data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"850\">\r\nRemoves dirt, excess sebum, sunscreen, and impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3hx0wl\" data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"900\">\r\nHelps minimize rough texture and clogged pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t8s0wg\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"952\">\r\nSupports a healthy skin barrier with Ceramide NP.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1avlae4\" data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1007\">\r\nHydrates while cleansing for a non-stripping finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gbfzep\" data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\nCan be used as both a daily cleanser and a wash-off mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lcnvxf\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1119\">\r\nLeaves skin smooth, soft, refreshed, and radiant.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137ykmx\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1207\">\r\nFragrance-free and suitable for sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1165\" data-content-reference-end=\"1197\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1212\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oh0gei\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1236\">Best For Skin Types</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1281\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1292\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gg5upv\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1348\">\r\nDull &amp; Uneven Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ytagq9\" data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\nRough Texture &amp; Clogged Pores <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1371\" data-content-reference-end=\"1404\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1443\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5f6k9a\" data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1505\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1461\">Rice Powder</strong> – Gently exfoliates and smooths rough skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vedht2\" data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1568\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1527\">Rice Bran Water</strong> – Hydrates and brightens the complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d1szg0\" data-start=\"1569\" data-end=\"1637\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1587\">Rice Extract</strong> – Nourishes the skin and promotes a healthy glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17h75jr\" data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1728\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1666\">Papain (Papaya Enzyme)</strong> – Dissolves dead skin cells for gentle enzymatic exfoliation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b5xrb1\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1748\">Alpha-Arbutin</strong> – Helps brighten skin and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6isiv\" data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1883\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1829\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Strengthens the skin barrier and locks in moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fxp57z\" data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1907\">Lactic Acid (AHA)</strong> – Improves skin texture and enhances radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hrivuq\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1957\" data-end=\"1970\">Allantoin</strong> – Soothes irritation and calms sensitive skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2004\" data-content-reference-end=\"2036\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2060\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2072\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2276\">A fine, silky powder that transforms into a rich, creamy foam with water. When used as a mask, it forms a smooth, elastic paste that adheres comfortably to the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2220\" data-content-reference-end=\"2252\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2281\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2296\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19r9ox9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2321\">As a Daily Cleanser</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3y3eb\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2340\">\r\nWet your hands.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qqvsp\" data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2393\">\r\nDispense a small amount of powder into your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojsvaf\" data-start=\"2394\" data-end=\"2462\">\r\nAdd water and rub your hands together until it forms a soft foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"476c00\" data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\nGently massage onto damp skin for 30–60 seconds.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2515\" data-end=\"2555\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fy06we\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2579\">As a Wash-Off Mask</h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2858\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"m5dut\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2702\">\r\nMix approximately 1 tablespoon of powder with 1–1½ tablespoons of water (or toner) until a smooth, elastic paste forms.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1acjzyn\" data-start=\"2703\" data-end=\"2733\">\r\nApply evenly to clean skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dd7kdp\" data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\nLeave on for <strong data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2766\">5–10 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"195gwf4\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2858\">\r\nGently massage and rinse off with lukewarm water. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2797\" data-content-reference-end=\"2829\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2860\" data-end=\"2863\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2886\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"3280\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"28qtdo\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2940\">\r\nTwo products in one: cleanser and brightening mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6c38tw\" data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"3005\">\r\nDelivers gentle exfoliation without damaging the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ws5z9q\" data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\nHelps achieve smoother, softer, glass-like skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"176cr7y\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3107\">\r\nBrightens dull skin while maintaining hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6ewk66\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3169\">\r\nPerfect for daily use and suitable even for sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11qumyo\" data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3280\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nFree from artificial fragrance for a comfortable cleansing experience</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/ATrkUBU2IgfE8Tv0iotWbG8XR8srvHTleDTJ1xmB.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:32:36','2026-09-18 11:32:36'),(435,'Birch 70% Moisture Boosting Toner 250ml','birch-70-moisture-boosting-toner-250ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-64\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-64\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-64\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-140\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-con