656\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"666\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpyre2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"687\">Product Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1hl5dyw\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"731\">\r\nDelivers deep and long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16t2g0\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"779\">\r\nHelps maintain the skin\'s natural pH balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1az2wsb\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"838\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss and strengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8hawkf\" data-start=\"839\" data-end=\"876\">\r\nSoothes redness and sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b5kdqx\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"912\">\r\nBalances oil and moisture levels.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"thend6\" data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"955\">\r\nLeaves skin soft, smooth, and refreshed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j81qyx\" data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1006\">\r\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, non-sticky formula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xrs4fj\" data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\nEnhances absorption of serums and moisturizers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hqf8sh\" data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\nVegan and cruelty-free formula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100f4sm\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1174\">\r\nSuitable for daily morning and evening use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1132\" data-content-reference-end=\"1164\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oh0gei\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1203\">Best For Skin Types</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1214\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1249\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1263\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1282\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1313\"><strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1313\">Skin Concerns</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1327\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frzcfz\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\nRedness &amp; Irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17b8l6t\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1373\">\r\nDamaged Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ca00sk\" data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1403\">\r\nUneven Oil-Moisture Balance\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14x75iz\" data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1453\">\r\nDull Skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1406\" data-content-reference-end=\"1438\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1458\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1478\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r0mg8m\" data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1618\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1549\">70% Japanese White Birch Sap (Betula Platyphylla Japonica Juice)</strong> – Deeply hydrates, maintains pH balance, and prevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wuzaos\" data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1700\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1647\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong> – Strengthens the skin barrier and calms irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tirnaf\" data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1734\">10 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</strong> – Provides multi-layer hydration for plump, healthy-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13irx3y\" data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1855\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1816\">Allantoin</strong> – Soothes and protects sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hbkba4\" data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1920\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1869\">Betaine</strong> – Maintains moisture balance and softens the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h3mvrl\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1997\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1949\">Cucumber Fruit Extract</strong> – Instantly cools and refreshes irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1isj86d\" data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2070\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2000\" data-end=\"2023\">Gluconic Acid (PHA)</strong> – Gently smooths skin texture while hydrating.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h4deon\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2198\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2099\">Gardenia Fruit Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant benefits and supports healthier skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2146\" data-content-reference-end=\"2178\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2203\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2215\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2216\" data-end=\"2448\">A lightweight, watery toner that absorbs quickly into the skin, delivering a fresh, dewy finish without any greasy or sticky residue. Perfect for layering with other hydrating skincare products. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2391\" data-content-reference-end=\"2423\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2450\" data-end=\"2453\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2468\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2762\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2501\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12to6ys\" data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2564\">\r\nDispense a moderate amount onto your palms or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqlu9\" data-start=\"2565\" data-end=\"2604\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"107i4bf\" data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2679\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xi9mgx\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2762\">\r\nUse morning and evening for best results. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2700\" data-content-reference-end=\"2733\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2790\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"3174\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h0jdb5\" data-start=\"2791\" data-end=\"2842\">\r\nInstantly hydrates and refreshes dehydrated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g56lfn\" data-start=\"2843\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\nStrengthens the moisture barrier with Birch Sap and Panthenol.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13q5a49\" data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2948\">\r\nGentle enough for even sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1popmgn\" data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2992\">\r\nLayers beautifully without feeling heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i5ugzl\" data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3062\">\r\nCreates a smooth, plump base for the rest of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wpfkka\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3174\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nIdeal for achieving healthy, glowing, and well-hydrated skin every day. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3108\" data-content-reference-end=\"3140\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,6,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/LED9XCrFFmZp4mg3j4xvSOM2ErM1b5QHpPqRfXoN.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:36:05','2026-09-18 11:36:05'),(436,'Vitamin C20 Blemish Serum 30ml','vitamin-c20-blemish-serum-30ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"618\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">ANUA Vitamin C20 Blemish Serum is a high-potency brightening serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"179\">20% Pure Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid)</strong> and <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"211\">56% Green Lemon Extract</strong> to visibly reduce dark spots, post-acne marks, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone. The formula is further enhanced with <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"403\">Vitamin E, Ferulic Acid, Glutathione, Panthenol, and Bisabolol</strong> to improve antioxidant protection while soothing and strengthening the skin barrier. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly, leaving skin brighter, smoother, and more radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"581\" data-content-reference-end=\"613\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"623\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"rpyre2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"644\">Product Benefits</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"buxx31\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"685\">\r\nBrightens dull and tired-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ysmnc7\" data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"725\">\r\nHelps fade acne scars and dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qpyv91\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"775\">\r\nReduces hyperpigmentation and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2hl54y\" data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"848\">\r\nProvides powerful antioxidant protection against environmental damage.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bbe2c\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"886\">\r\nImproves skin radiance and clarity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yl1v\" data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"946\">\r\nHelps minimize the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vj1i0w\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"1014\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier while delivering Vitamin C effectively.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"j81qyx\" data-start=\"1015\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, non-sticky formula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7slxtq\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1130\">\r\nDermatologically tested. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1088\" data-content-reference-end=\"1120\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1135\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1oh0gei\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1159\">Best For Skin Types</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1173\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1192\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1204\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1216\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak7cn8\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\nUneven Skin Tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uk7m8c\" data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\nHyperpigmented Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzws36\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\nPost-Acne Marks\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1482\"><strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1286\">Note:</strong> Because it contains <strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1329\">20% pure Vitamin C</strong>, beginners or very sensitive skin types should introduce it gradually and perform a patch test before regular use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1435\" data-content-reference-end=\"1467\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1487\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1507\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jdf9n6\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1594\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1548\">20% Pure Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid)</strong> – Brightens skin and helps fade pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7gcy33\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1687\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1624\">56% Green Lemon Extract</strong> – Rich in natural Vitamin C and antioxidants for radiant skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bkxuc6\" data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1716\">Vitamin E (Tocopherol)</strong> – Enhances antioxidant protection and supports skin repair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1efscsq\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1795\">Ferulic Acid</strong> – Stabilizes Vitamin C and boosts its effectiveness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aia0ge\" data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1914\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1866\">Glutathione</strong> – Helps brighten skin and reduce discoloration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nxgn6p\" data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1943\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong> – Hydrates and strengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1oh3k83\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2053\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2010\">Alpha-Bisabolol</strong> – Calms irritation and improves skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v7vk3a\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2115\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2071\">Niacinamide</strong> – Supports brighter, smoother-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eur5l0\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2133\">Ceramide NP</strong> – Reinforces the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vklae0\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2298\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2178\" data-end=\"2207\">Multiple Hyaluronic Acids</strong> – Provide deep hydration and improve skin plumpness. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2246\" data-content-reference-end=\"2278\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2303\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2315\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2573\">A lightweight, silky serum that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy or sticky finish. The formula contains Vita-Barrier capsules that help deliver Vitamin C efficiently while keeping skin comfortable. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2516\" data-content-reference-end=\"2548\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2575\" data-end=\"2578\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2593\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2631\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cx1i6a\" data-start=\"2632\" data-end=\"2695\">\r\nDispense <strong data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2657\">2–3 drops</strong> of the serum onto your face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo7ms0\" data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2731\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"93jfrg\" data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2761\">\r\nFollow with a moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uhg6qo\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2844\">\r\nDuring the daytime, always apply a broad-spectrum sunscreen (SPF 30 or higher).\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e8q6p8\" data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2995\">\r\nIf you are new to high-strength Vitamin C, start using it <strong data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2929\">2–3 nights per week</strong>, then gradually increase frequency as your skin builds tolerance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3169\"><strong data-start=\"2997\" data-end=\"3013\">Storage Tip:</strong> Keep the serum refrigerated (approximately <strong data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3067\">3–10°C</strong>) after opening to help maintain the stability of the Vitamin C. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3107\" data-content-reference-end=\"3139\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3174\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3197\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3587\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pokdt2\" data-start=\"3198\" data-end=\"3268\">\r\nHigh-strength <strong data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3231\">20% Vitamin C</strong> for maximum brightening performance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qckfkv\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\nHelps visibly reduce dark spots, acne scars, and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a9ww40\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3419\">\r\nEnhanced with <strong data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3384\">Vitamin E and Ferulic Acid</strong> for superior antioxidant benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qllrsm\" data-start=\"3420\" data-end=\"3475\">\r\nContains soothing ingredients to minimize irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1spdm54\" data-start=\"3476\" data-end=\"3587\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nDelivers a healthy, radiant, and glowing complexion with continued use.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,11,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/Q4fhpsyhXzF7AaodmWv06oOk2gXqyDAEDhEUTHCu.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:38:39','2026-09-18 11:38:39'),(437,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream 100ml','heartleaf-70-soothing-cream-100ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"567\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Anua Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream is a lightweight gel-cream moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"199\">70% Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong> to calm sensitive skin, reduce redness, and provide long-lasting hydration. Enriched with <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"350\">Triple Cica Complex, Panthenol, Niacinamide, and Betaine</strong>, this soothing cream helps strengthen the skin barrier while delivering a refreshing, non-greasy finish. It absorbs quickly without clogging pores, making