mj\" data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1105\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1150\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1205\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1205\">Skin Concerns</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"frzcfz\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\nRedness &amp; Irritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17b8l6t\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\nDamaged Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1265\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gvle0p\" data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\nExcess Oil\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cddgu3\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\nSensitive &amp; Reactive Skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1298\" data-content-reference-end=\"1331\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1349\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"j5c8dg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1369\">Key Ingredients</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tvfhzz\" data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1418\">70% Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong> – Soothes irritation and helps protect skin from external stress.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m3lrj1\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1551\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1516\">Centella Asiatica Extract</strong> – Calms and supports skin healing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nqkgxq\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1621\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1573\">Madecassic Acid</strong> – Helps repair and strengthen the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cueav0\" data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1640\">Asiatic Acid</strong> – Reduces irritation and improves skin resilience.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tgtxnp\" data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1710\">Asiaticoside</strong> – Promotes skin recovery and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jpenzf\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1827\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1779\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</strong> – Moisturizes and strengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pt9n9j\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1888\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1845\">Niacinamide</strong> – Brightens skin and improves uneven tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vnbr12\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1937\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1902\">Betaine</strong> – Helps maintain moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c2fvtm\" data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2016\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1970\">Portulaca Oleracea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant and soothing benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dohh5p\" data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2133\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2045\">Vitamin E (Tocopherol)</strong> – Protects the skin against environmental damage. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2083\" data-content-reference-end=\"2116\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2138\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"25ntkq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2150\">Texture</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2374\">A refreshing, lightweight gel-cream that melts into the skin quickly, delivering intense hydration without feeling heavy or sticky. It leaves the skin soft with a fresh, healthy finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2320\" data-content-reference-end=\"2352\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2379\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"peqbl9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2394\">How to Use</h2>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zlct\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2442\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner and serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vt7ls\" data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2486\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xpjw75\" data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2531\">\r\nGently spread it over your face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2568\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vs5qjm\" data-start=\"2569\" data-end=\"2709\">\r\nUse morning and night as the final step of your skincare routine (before sunscreen in the morning). <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2650\" data-content-reference-end=\"2682\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2714\">\r\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vtcvuy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2737\">Why You\'ll Love It</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"3134\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iht027\" data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2802\">\r\nContains <strong data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"2774\">70% Heartleaf Extract</strong> for powerful soothing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"113e0co\" data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2867\">\r\nLightweight hydration perfect for humid weather and oily skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1we2d56\" data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2930\">\r\nHelps repair a weakened skin barrier while reducing redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yeed3y\" data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\nLayers well under makeup without pilling.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15p0i4v\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3035\">\r\nNon-greasy, fast-absorbing formula suitable for daily use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ymdw6u\" data-start=\"3036\" data-end=\"3134\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves skin calm, balanced, hydrated, and healthy-looking.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/QSzIOWwNTIRBNwsH7unlxaF3wcvg7hovOkazYLTA.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:43:41','2026-09-18 11:43:41'),(438,'PDRN Hyaluronic Acid 100 Moisturizing Cream 60ml','pdrn-hyaluronic-acid-100-moisturizing-cream-60ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-67\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-67\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-67\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-146\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var