Benefits</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hegepk\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"751\">\r\nDelivers deep, long-lasting hydration for up to 100 hours.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x0v5lx\" data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"805\">\r\nHelps improve skin elasticity and collagen support.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30kjqj\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"856\">\r\nStrengthens the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5w3u6f\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"902\">\r\nProvides a healthy, dewy \"glass skin\" glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mmsc7q\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"940\">\r\nPlumps and smooths dehydrated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj366k\" data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"987\">\r\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, and non-sticky.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fu1sco\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\nLayers beautifully under makeup without pilling.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hohqe5\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1087\">\r\nHelps soften fine lines caused by dehydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"71rak6\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\nFragrance-free and non-comedogenic.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f0jckc\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\nSuitable for daily AM &amp; PM use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1155\" data-content-reference-end=\"1187\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1225\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1236\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1268\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1287\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3h8q5\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1318\">\r\nMature Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1346\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1360\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1381\" data-end=\"1392\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmrng1\" data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1405\">\r\nFine Lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ydjqjn\" data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1426\">\r\nLoss of Elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pwfu8\" data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\nRough Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ibdex6\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\nLack of Glow <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1448\" data-content-reference-end=\"1480\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1500\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1520\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3inq25\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1543\">PDRN (Sodium DNA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8y51f9\" data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1579\">\r\nSupports skin repair and renewal.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5juvtk\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\nImproves skin vitality and elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1cluj1q\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1662\">\r\nPromotes a healthy, radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4n1lm\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1695\">10 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj91cd\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1729\">\r\nDelivers multi-layer hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mp0z4g\" data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1765\">\r\nHelps keep skin plump and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1791\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1816\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0clzp\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1842\">\r\nImproves skin softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qu9xjv\" data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1865\">\r\nSupports elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xf76sy\" data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1901\">\r\nHelps maintain a firm appearance.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1903\" data-end=\"1918\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pupxs\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1948\">\r\nBrightens uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1949\" data-end=\"1980\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rdbf9t\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\nHelps improve overall skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xt7os6\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2032\">Squalane</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ou615q\" data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2077\">\r\nDeeply moisturizes without clogging pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gcsn3\" data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2097\">\r\nPrevents dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mv4h64\" data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2129\">\r\nSoftens and smooths the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8jtp1n\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2176\">Centella Asiatica Extract &amp; Madecassoside</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h5nvne\" data-start=\"2177\" data-end=\"2199\">\r\nCalm irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6qj637\" data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\nStrengthen the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1c4hs9q\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2248\">\r\nReduce redness.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2250\" data-end=\"2263\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ohmj5\" data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2322\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k88vxy\" data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2394\">\r\nPromotes smoother-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2342\" data-content-reference-end=\"2374\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2396\" data-end=\"2399\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2401\" data-end=\"2410\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2648\">A silky, lightweight cream that melts into the skin with a smooth, non-greasy finish. It absorbs quickly, delivers lasting hydration, and creates a soft, dewy base without leaving any sticky residue. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2591\" data-content-reference-end=\"2623\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2650\" data-end=\"2653\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2667\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2984\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zlct\" data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2715\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner and serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k5z5fd\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2755\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n5fztg\" data-start=\"2756\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\nGently spread over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2833\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gjkpc7\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2904\">\r\nUse morning and evening as the final step of your skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4x1ts2\" data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2984\">\r\nIn the daytime, follow with sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2922\" data-content-reference-end=\"2954\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2986\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3011\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3429\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d8zu8l\" data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3125\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3077\">PDRN, Hydrolyzed Collagen, and 10 Hyaluronic Acids</strong> for intensive hydration and skin-plumping care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yovk5x\" data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3203\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier while delivering a radiant, healthy glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"snws8h\" data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3261\">\r\nPerfect under makeup thanks to its non-pilling formula.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"83leqb\" data-start=\"3262\" data-end=\"3320\">\r\nFragrance-free, lightweight, and suitable for daily use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6zdwzd\" data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3429\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nIdeal for anyone seeking hydrated, smooth, bouncy, and glowing skin.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></di