>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"izraib\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"863\">\r\nGently exfoliates with PHA for smoother skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k1jjts\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"916\">\r\nProvides deep hydration and long-lasting moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qj0p0x\" data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"953\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3lfm5\" data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"994\">\r\nImproves skin elasticity and radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kx5exc\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1024\">\r\nSmooths rough skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11wikjx\" data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\nSuitable for daily brightening and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vvyrr0\" data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\nCan be used as a quick brightening mask. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1112\" data-content-reference-end=\"1145\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1181\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1206\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1225\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1237\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1254\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gg5upv\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\nDull &amp; Uneven Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1303\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\