t marks.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mx3p3j\" data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1739\">\r\nPromotes a more even complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1y4jc2w\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1778\">Pink Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"38uep3\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1816\">\r\nHelps revitalize dull-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fw7q1u\" data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1850\">\r\nSupports healthy skin vitality.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6920oj\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1876\">PHA (Gluconolactone)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f6p6hj\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\nGently exfoliates dead skin cells.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18etzrf\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1965\">\r\nSmooths skin texture while maintaining hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dcesft\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1990\">7 Types of Peptides</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrt01z\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2030\">\r\nSupport skin firmness and elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16z48q\" data-start=\"2031\" data-end=\"2075\">\r\nHelp improve the appearance of fine lines.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uvd29o\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2117\">Sodium Hyaluronate &amp; Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zm9dgt\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2143\">\r\nDeliver deep hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t8as2s\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2178\">\r\nKeep skin plump and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2203\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0clzp\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2229\">\r\nImproves skin softness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0sb9d\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\nEnhances skin elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2272\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aa0ai4\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2369\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2320\" data-content-reference-end=\"2353\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2374\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2385\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2590\">Soft, essence-soaked toner pads with a lightweight, refreshing finish. The pads adhere comfortably to the skin without dripping and leave no sticky residue after use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2537\" data-content-reference-end=\"2556\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2595\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2609\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mx8p49\" data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2670\">\r\nAfter cleansing, take one pad using the included tweezer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103fovt\" data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\nApply the pad to areas of concern (such as under the eyes, cheeks, or dark spots) for <strong data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2777\">10–20 minutes</strong> like a mini sheet mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ga0oa\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2881\">\r\nRemove the pad and gently wipe across the face following the skin\'s texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ab4xn1\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2946\">\r\nPat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8m5kbu\" data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2989\">\r\nFollow with your serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vnga1f\" data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"3078\">\r\nSuitable for <strong data-start=\"3006\" data-end=\"3039\">daily morning and evening use</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3007\" data-content-reference-end=\"3039\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3083\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3085\" data-end=\"3105\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3544\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nj2lzs\" data-start=\"3106\" data-end=\"3181\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3117\" data-end=\"3141\">5% Niacinamide + TXA</strong> to visibly brighten and even skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pkqoa3\" data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3257\">\r\nHalf-moon pad design fits perfectly around the under-eye and cheek areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h3ztc2\" data-start=\"3258\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\nProvides hydration, gentle exfoliation, and targeted brightening in one step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lec480\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3399\">\r\nCan be used as both a toner pad and a quick treatment mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"95px7j\" data-start=\"3400\" data-end=\"3544\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nIdeal for achieving a smoother, brighter, and radiant \"glass skin\" complexion with consistent daily use.&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,8,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/GXtPOGTMul5dPvU2TknvqXJHmPDZ5fWoMYPoU1Ao.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:46:51','2026-09-18 11:46:51'),(440,'PDRN 100 Hyaluronic Acid Glow Pad (60 Pads) 180ml','pdrn-100-hyal