2316\" data-end=\"2339\">Kakadu Plum Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"de42r5\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2363\">\r\nRich in antioxidants.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fgzpli\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2440\">\r\nHelps brighten and protect the skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2388\" data-content-reference-end=\"2420\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2445\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2456\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2715\">Large <strong data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2492\">7cm dual-sided toner pads</strong> saturated with a lightweight, non-sticky essence. The <strong data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2559\">gel side</strong> delivers intensive moisture, while the <strong data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2619\">soft fabric side</strong> gently refines skin texture for a smooth, glowing finish. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2658\" data-content-reference-end=\"2690\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2720\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2734\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"3198\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2767\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7th3dl\" data-start=\"2768\" data-end=\"2813\">\r\nUse the included tweezers to take one pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zzp87h\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2903\">\r\nPlace the <strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2839\">gel side</strong> on dry or dull areas for <strong data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2881\">5–10 minutes</strong> as a mini sheet mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1st4wgf\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3001\">\r\nRemove the pad and gently wipe the face with the <strong data-start=\"2956\" data-end=\"2971\">fabric side</strong> following the skin\'s texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gr4fsc\" data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3066\">\r\nPat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxy215\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3109\">\r\nFollow with your serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ki9bhu\" data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3198\">\r\nSuitable for <strong data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3159\">daily morning and evening use</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3136\" data-content-reference-end=\"3168\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3203\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3225\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3735\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iz570g\" data-start=\"3226\" data-end=\"3337\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3299\">PDRN, Hyaluronic Acid, Collagen, Niacinamide, and Peptides</strong> for complete hydration and glow care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v4tu3a\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3403\">\r\nDual-sided design hydrates and gently refines skin in one step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18q1po9\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3461\">\r\nPerfect as a quick morning moisture mask before makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"v3bksg\" data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3517\">\r\nHelps create a plump, radiant, glass-skin complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8l50uz\" data-start=\"3518\" data-end=\"3735\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLightweight, fragrance-free, and suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Brand testing reports immediate improvements in hydration and visible glow after one use.</li></ul>',NULL