ntain moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"youfrq\" data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2252\">\r\nLeaves skin soft and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2257\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2268\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2509\">Ultra-soft vegan cotton pads saturated with a lightweight, watery essence that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy or sticky finish. The pads feel cooling and refreshing, making them ideal for sensitive or irritated skin.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2514\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2528\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2561\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7th3dl\" data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\nUse the included tweezers to take one pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1i2crhs\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\nGently wipe the pad across your face, avoiding the eye and lip areas.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4w0l00\" data-start=\"2681\" data-end=\"2801\">\r\nFor extra soothing care, place the pad on areas with redness or irritation for <strong data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2779\">5–10 minutes</strong> as a mini sheet mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gr4fsc\" data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2866\">\r\nPat the remaining essence into the skin until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nxy215\" data-start=\"2867\" data-end=\"2909\">\r\nFollow with your serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t1bxu1\" data-start=\"2910\" data-end=\"2944\">\r\nUse daily, morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2949\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2971\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3372\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qc7h9f\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3044\">Azelaic Complex, Hyaluronic Acid, Heartleaf, and Centella</strong> to calm redness while deeply hydrating the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7jtsyv\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3154\">\r\nPerfect for sensitive, acne-prone, and redness-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rxrx2d\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\nDelivers a cooling, refreshing sensation with every use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17u040n\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3288\">\r\nCan be used as both a daily toner pad and a targeted soothing treatment.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sdvvyt\" data-start=\"3289\" data-end=\"3372\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves skin hydrated, balanced, smoother, and visibly calmer with consistent use.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,8,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/lKcH2Pxj6WLUKFgOKs18wvv973ZifMyGcuoQebqR.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 11:51:25','2026-09-18 11:51:25'),(442,'Zero Cast Moisturizing Finish Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++ 50ml','zero-cast-moisturizing-finish-sunscreen-spf50-pa-50ml','<h1 data-section-id=\"1m2l1rf\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"65\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ANUA Zero Cast Moisturizing Finish Sunscreen is a lightweight, broad-spectrum </span><strong data-start=\"164\" data-end=\"181\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> chemical sunscreen that provides powerful protection against UVA and UVB rays while delivering long-lasting hydration. Formulated with </span><strong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"402\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hyaluronic Acid, Panthenol, Niacinamide, Ceramides, and Centella Asiatica Extract</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, it helps strengthen the skin barrier, soothe irritation, and keep the skin moisturized throughout the day. The invisible formula blends seamlessly into all skin tones without leaving a white cast, making it ideal for everyday wear under makeup or on its own.</span></h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v1mjmx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"687\">Product Benefits</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ugav2z\" data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"738\">\r\nBroad-spectrum <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"722\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> sun protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w4hyet\" data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"797\">\r\nLeaves <strong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"767\">zero white cast</strong>, suitable for all skin tones.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wi3ahd\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"832\">\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzasob\" data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"880\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5cjszp\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"914\">\r\nSoothes redness and irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"onxp3w\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"965\">\r\nLightweight, fast-absorbing, non-greasy texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kzhhcw\" data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\nControls excess oil while maintaining skin hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yeed3y\" data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1065\">\r\nLayers well under makeup without pilling.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fun24\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\nHelps prevent sun-induced dark spots and premature aging.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tbf9x2\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\nSuitable for daily use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1158\