ay.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97f4c\" data-start=\"1525\" data-end=\"1556\">\r\nLeaves skin plump and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1584\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1682\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1616\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j1fejd\" data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1650\">\r\nSoothes irritation and dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"177pj7h\" data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1682\">\r\nSupports healthy skin repair.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1699\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eu7z4i\" data-start=\"1700\" data-end=\"1722\">\r\nBrightens dull skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ectf3m\" data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1756\">\r\nHelps improve uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsq1w\" data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"1781\">\r\nBalances excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1813\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1830\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ea286e\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1874\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1900\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iu0ub5\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1931\">\r\nKeeps skin soft and healthy.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13o39xy\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1962\">Centella Asiatica Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ktz626\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2000\">\r\nCalms sensitive and irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggks8s\" data-start=\"2001\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\nHelps reduce redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vg22cm\" data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\nSupports skin recovery.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yk69rt\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2078\">Vitamin E (Tocopherol)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtbs2e\" data-start=\"2079\" data-end=\"2113\">\r\nProvides antioxidant protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ypsltx\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2167\">\r\nHelps defend the skin against environmental stress.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2172\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2183\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2398\">A lightweight, moisturizing lotion with a silky finish that spreads effortlessly across the skin. It absorbs quickly, leaves <strong data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2326\">no white cast</strong>, and provides a natural, fresh finish without feeling greasy or sticky.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2403\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2417\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2460\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"okv7cc\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2551\">\r\nApply an adequate amount evenly over the face and neck as the final step before makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yo7ms0\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2587\">\r\nGently pat until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c85nbj\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2635\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2634\">15–20 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wg9pd\" data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2737\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2664\">2 hours</strong>, or after sweating, swimming, or towel drying for continuous protection.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2742\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2764\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"3178\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fntnch\" data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2848\">\r\nDelivers <strong data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2793\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> broad-spectrum UV protection with an invisible finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rnoxa9\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2915\">\r\nLeaves <strong data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2875\">no white cast</strong>, making it perfect for every skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1142bo5\" data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"2974\">\r\nHydrates while protecting the skin from harmful UV rays.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2dikpg\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"3037\">\r\nLightweight, comfortable formula suitable for everyday wear.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vwj8z9\" data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3118\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier and helps maintain a healthy, radiant complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l1l3i3\" data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3178\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nIdeal for use under makeup with a smooth, natural finish.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/q6uRsz6RFJZeTky3xj9kdnvJDHgxqkHaEPMrYOVA.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:01:21','2026-09-18 12:01:21'),(443,'PDRN 100 Hyaluronic Acid Booster Toner 250ml','pdrn-100-hyaluronic-acid-booster-toner-250ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-72\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section c