1039\" data-end=\"1084\">\r\nSuitable for daily morning and evening use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1089\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1112\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1123\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1158\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1172\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3h8q5\" data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1205\">\r\nMature Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1233\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1247\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1267\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmrng1\" data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\nFine Lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ydjqjn\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\nLoss of Elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pwfu8\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1329\">\r\nRough Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"rat09j\" data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1344\">\r\nLack of Glow\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ektkj\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1365\">\r\nTired-Looking Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1370\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1390\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n3ber7\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1439\">PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide / Sodium DNA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohjy38\" data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1469\">\r\nSupports skin regeneration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt0b9b\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\nHelps improve elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q2bhll\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\nPromotes a healthier, more youthful complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12t5tq3\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1580\">11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1695\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0kaf7\" data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\nProvides deep, multi-layer hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8v0y7z\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1664\">\r\nHelps retain moisture throughout the day.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a2f95p\" data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1695\">\r\nPlumps and smooths the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1720\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bgprf\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1746\">\r\nImproves skin firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21ts7y\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1769\">\r\nEnhances elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqyhuj\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1800\">\r\nLeaves skin soft and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1817\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pupxs\" data-start=\"1818\" data-end=\"1847\">\r\nBrightens uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qj0p0x\" data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ed9z4\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1917\">\r\nImproves overall skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1934\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ea286e\" data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1978\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2004\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"49pebs\" data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2040\">\r\nKeeps skin healthy and resilient.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2042\" data-end=\"2068\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ur5h27\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2088\">\r\nCalms irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldeyvl\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2124\">\r\nStrengthens the moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wi3ahd\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2159\">\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2174\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fljx2j\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2232\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4el1e2\" data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\nPromotes smoother, firmer skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4j1yfq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2279\">Betaine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16h2rhx\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2314\">\r\nHelps maintain moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mv4h64\" data-start=\"2315\" data-end=\"2346\">\r\nSoftens and smooths the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2351\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2362\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2581\">A lightweight, essence-like toner with a silky, watery texture that absorbs quickly into the skin. It provides instant hydration without leaving any greasy or sticky residue, leaving the skin fresh, plump, and radiant.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2586\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2588\" data-end=\"2600\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2633\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8pqjr\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2696\">\r\nPour an appropriate amount onto your palms or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqlu9\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2736\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2737\" data-end=\"2773\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ssk5eg\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2823\">\r\nLayer 2–3 times for extra hydration if needed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wazrrs\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2861\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"glv5t\" data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2895\">\r\nUse every morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2897\" data-end=\"2900\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2902\" data-end=\"2922\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"3370\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6t6bea\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"3062\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3009\">PDRN, 11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid, Collagen, Ceramides, and Niacinamide</strong> for comprehensive hydration and skin-repairing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogapjb\" data-start=\"3063\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\nProvides long-lasting moisture while improving skin elasticity and radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n0htik\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3200\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier for healthier-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dn0zvn\" data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3273\">\r\nLayers beautifully with other skincare products without feeling heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1siw578\" data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3370\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nIdeal for achieving smooth, plump, hydrated, and glowing glass skin with consistent daily use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,6,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/WT1amnOA8FXeMjs0iTrqzsxBCueuaE6LalM3PF15.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:02:51','2026-09-18 12:02:51'),(444,'Azelaic Acid 3+ CICA Skin Clarifying Toner 250ml','azelaic-acid-3-cica-skin-clarifying-toner-250ml','<h1 data-section-id=\"1qlqnq2\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"55\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">ANUA Azelaic Acid 3+ CICA Skin Clarifying Toner is a daily soothing toner formulated to gently exfoliate, calm redness, and improve overall skin clarity. Powered by </span><strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"260\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3% Azelaic Acid</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">, </span><strong data-start=\"262\" data-end=\