>\r\nLeaves skin soft and radiant.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1553\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pupxs\" data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1583\">\r\nBrightens uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b6qx1l\" data-start=\"1584\" data-end=\"1625\">\r\nHelps minimize the appearance of pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lzvdog\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1659\">\r\nControls excess oil production.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1691\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1708\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xem5uh\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1750\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1776\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n2p8j5\" data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1817\">\r\nProtects against environmental stress.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1845\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1945\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wt052u\" data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1878\">\r\nSoothes and hydrates the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9xo0uy\" data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1905\">\r\nSupports barrier repair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12yuvle\" data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1945\">\r\nHelps reduce dryness after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cmhhdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1966\">Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2063\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vajd2u\" data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"1996\">\r\nProvides lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-se