ion-id=\"1v8rwn0\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2652\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and lather into a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cvkatg\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2727\">\r\nGently massage onto the face in circular motions for <strong data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2726\">30–60 seconds</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2768\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2814\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sxloup\" data-start=\"2815\" data-end=\"2887\">\r\nUse every morning and evening as part of your daily skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2892\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2914\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"3347\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c4nydo\" data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\nGently cleanses while preserving the skin\'s natural moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hu60js\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3065\">\r\nInfused with <strong data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3027\">Peach Extract and Niacinamide</strong> for brighter, healthier-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qsbu3u\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3128\">\r\nRich foam effectively removes impurities without irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12yit6g\" data-start=\"3129\" data-end=\"3198\">\r\nHydrating formula keeps skin soft and comfortable after every wash.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dhg5xb\" data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3255\">\r\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iv2o7x\" data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3347\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving a clean, fresh, smooth, and naturally radiant complexion every day.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/tDaeeMIgVHGz1a1eFdqRqMSWUeYXN69vunRbkAM5.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:06:26','2026-09-18 12:06:26'),(446,'PDRN Hyaluronic Acid Hydrating Capsule Mist 100ml','pdrn-hyaluronic-acid-hydrating-capsule-mist-100ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-75\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-75\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-75\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-162\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\"><div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"aa171b2f-6e95-4466-9e35-03dbc3b6c794\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-wor