\n<li data-section-id=\"12yin1f\" data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"938\">\r\nRestores a healthy, radiant glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yg9oah\" data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"972\">\r\nSoothes dryness and irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rc8bor\" data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\nFine mist applies evenly without leaving a sticky residue.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1jnc6fh\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1071\">\r\nCan be used before or after makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aihpqy\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1127\">\r\nSuitable for daily use whenever skin needs hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1155\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1166\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1198\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1217\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3h8q5\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1248\">\r\nMature Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1276\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1290\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1bmrng1\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1315\">\r\nFine Lines\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1335\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ydjqjn\" data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1356\">\r\nLoss of Elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pwfu8\" data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1372\">\r\nRough Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ektkj\" data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\nTired-Looking Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1418\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n3ber7\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1467\">PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide / Sodium DNA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohjy38\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1497\">\r\nSupports skin regeneration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5midim\" data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\nImproves elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6v50n0\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\nPromotes healthier-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12t5tq3\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1588\">11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q0kaf7\" data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1628\">\r\nProvides deep, multi-layer hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmp8cv\" data-start=\"1629\" data-end=\"1653\">\r\nHelps retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k9nm81\" data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1685\">\r\nLeaves skin plump and supple.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1710\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1uaaftm\" data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1741\">\r\nHelps improve skin firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"21ts7y\" data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1764\">\r\nEnhances elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xn5dns\" data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1786\">\r\nSoftens rough skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1803\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pupxs\" data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1833\">\r\nBrightens uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qj0p0x\" data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1870\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ed9z4\" data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1903\">\r\nImproves overall skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1920\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"n59u3b\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"1972\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s natural protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1973\" data-end=\"1998\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1904bau\" data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\nMaintains healthy skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2052\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17c90ie\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2074\">\r\nSoothes irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"z5kpvt\" data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2096\">\r\nDeeply moisturizes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29aput\" data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2128\">\r\nSupports skin barrier repair.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4j1yfq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2141\">Betaine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"d32llz\" data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2187\">\r\nHelps maintain the skin\'s moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b7xusw\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2223\">\r\nLeaves skin soft and comfortable.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2238\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19ohmj5\" data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2297\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jrinyj\" data-start=\"2298\" data-end=\"2331\">\r\nPromotes smoother-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2336\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2338\" data-end=\"2347\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2552\">An ultra-fine, lightweight capsule mist that disperses evenly over the skin. The moisturizing capsules burst upon application, delivering instant hydration with a fresh, non-greasy, and non-sticky finish.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2557\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2571\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"3007\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18ygno1\" data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2660\">\r\nShake the bottle gently before use to mix the moisturizing capsules with the essence.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h0pe3g\" data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2719\">\r\nHold the bottle about <strong data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2698\">20–30 cm</strong> away from your face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17p29tu\" data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2770\">\r\nClose your eyes and spray evenly over the face.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s8p74d\" data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2837\">\r\nAllow the mist to absorb naturally or gently pat into the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p03l3h\" data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2941\">\r\nUse after cleansing, between skincare steps, before or after makeup, or anytime your skin feels dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ltx3b5\" data-start=\"2942\" data-end=\"3007\">\r\nReapply throughout the day whenever extra hydration is needed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3012\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3014\" data-end=\"3034\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3478\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8haamb\" data-start=\"3035\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\nDelivers an instant burst of hydration with every spray.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mkfcod\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3232\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3180\">PDRN, 11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid, Collagen, Ceramides, and Niacinamide</strong> for intensive moisturizing and skin-repairing care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rxrscp\" data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3296\">\r\nUltra-fine mist refreshes the skin without disrupting makeup.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"opltsu\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3385\">\r\nLightweight, non-sticky formula suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8mr4lq\" data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3478\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving smooth, plump, hydrated, and glowing \"glass skin\" anytime, anywhere.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,9,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/LLYN6lvujhEXr6Z49QxOZcwlfEPGqk4AYvWb8Run.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:07:52','2026-09-18 12:07:52'),(447,'Azelaic Acid Cica Skin Soothing Moisturizer 100ml','azelaic-acid-cica-skin-soothing-moistu