cinamide TXA Brightening Booster Toner is a lightweight, hydrating brightening toner formulated with </span><strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"202\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5% Niacinamide</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">, </span><strong data-start=\"204\" data-end=\"229\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">, </span><strong data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"248\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Alpha-Arbutin</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">, </span><strong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"265\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Glutathione</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">, </span><strong data-start=\"267\" data-end=\"286\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">, and </span><strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"305\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Panthenol</strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> to visibly improve dullness, dark spots, post-acne marks, and uneven skin tone. This essence-like toner deeply hydrates while strengthening the skin barrier, leaving the skin brighter, smoother, and more radiant. Its fast-absorbing, non-sticky formula makes it suitable for daily use and ideal for layering with other brightening skincare products.</span></h1>\r\n<hr data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"659\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v1mjmx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"661\" data-end=\"679\">Product Benefits</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1f8fc16\" data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"718\">\r\nBrightens dull and uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i88b8f\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"767\">\r\nHelps reduce dark spots and hyperpigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wvuqjk\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"806\">\r\nFades post-acne marks and blemishes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a76eh\" data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"847\">\r\nProvides deep, long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3mve1m\" data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"890\">\r\nStrengthens the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s384sb\" data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"936\">\r\nImproves overall skin clarity and radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1086ws5\" data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"966\">\r\nHelps balance excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kx5exc\" data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"996\">\r\nSmooths rough skin texture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9b4wm\" data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1050\">\r\nEnhances the absorption of serums and moisturizers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgebaz\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1096\">\r\nSuitable for daily morning and evening use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1101\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1124\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1138\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1149\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1168\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1215\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1243\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3cxydb\" data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1256\">\r\nDark Spots\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"wgm9vz\" data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\nHyperpigmentation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qzws36\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\nPost-Acne Marks\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ak7cn8\" data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1313\">\r\nUneven Skin Tone\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1325\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1339\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14pwfu8\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1355\">\r\nRough Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1375\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1400\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eniipc\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1420\">5% Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10pupxs\" data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1450\">\r\nBrightens uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dj1hbl\" data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1490\">\r\nHelps reduce the appearance of pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1fxsq1w\" data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1515\">\r\nBalances excess sebum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1547\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"663c8n\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1574\">Tranexamic Acid (TXA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1aksdzm\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1610\">\r\nHelps fade stubborn pigmentation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mabiif\" data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1645\">\r\nReduces post-acne discoloration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11xnkx9\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1689\">\r\nPromotes a clearer, more even complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yle5jc\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1708\">Alpha-Arbutin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1umv0yt\" data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\">\r\nHelps minimize the appearance of dark spots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eu7z4i\" data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1778\">\r\nBrightens dull skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1a6s1on\" data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1811\">\r\nImproves overall skin clarity.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19wanng\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1828\">Glutathione</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2lbaqu\" data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1887\">\r\nPowerful antioxidant that helps brighten the complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cyce12\" data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"1934\">\r\nProtects the skin from environmental stress.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cmhhdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1955\">Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1li8c1q\" data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\nDelivers deep hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1om8stz\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2018\">\r\nKeeps skin plump and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2044\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2072\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12fmvc0\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2098\">\r\nSoothes irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldeyvl\" data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2134\">\r\nStrengthens the moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wi3ahd\" data-start=\"2135\" data-end=\"2169\">\r\nProvides long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2186\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ea286e\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2230\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b9wwnb\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\nHelps maintain healthy skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vy11ck\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2302\">Allantoin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xn5dns\" data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2324\">\r\nSoftens rough skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ur5h27\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2344\">\r\nCalms irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vg22cm\" data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2370\">\r\nSupports skin recovery.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2386\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2387\" data-end=\"2596\">A lightweight, watery essence toner that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a greasy or sticky residue. It layers comfortably, making it perfect for the \"7-skin method\" or multiple hydration layers.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2601\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2615\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"369bfa\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2648\">\r\nCleanse your face thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"i8pqjr\" data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2711\">\r\nPour an appropriate amount onto your palms or a cotton pad.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1usqlu9\" data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2751\">\r\nGently apply over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2f9h5n\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2839\">\r\nLayer 2–3 times for extra hydration if desired.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hrt30g\" data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2894\">\r\nFollow with your brightening serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xqcrw6\" data-start=\"2895\" data-end=\"2976\">\r\nDuring the daytime, finish with a broad-spectrum sunscreen (SPF 30 or higher).\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2983\" data-end=\"3003\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3471\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ahrm0l\" data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3127\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3079\">Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Alpha-Arbutin, and Glutathione</strong> for powerful brightening and tone-evening care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zablof\" data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3199\">\r\nDelivers intense hydration while improving skin clarity and radiance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eov9k9\" data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3276\">\r\nLightweight, non-sticky formula suitable for daily use and all skin types.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iz0fcn\" data-start=\"3277\" data-end=\"3370\">\r\nHelps reduce dark spots, post-acne marks, and dullness for a healthier, glowing complexion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"psknzb\" data-start=\"3371\" data-end=\"3471\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving smooth, hydrated, luminous, and even-toned \"glass skin\" with consistent use.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt