 data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"27sdpw\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"765\">\r\nGently removes dirt, oil, sunscreen, and daily impurities.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ogmklz\" data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"808\">\r\nDelivers deep hydration while cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wzasob\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"856\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qrx64w\" data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"904\">\r\nPrevents dryness and tightness after washing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ti97o7\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"945\">\r\nImproves skin softness and smoothness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ww2cuw\" data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"992\">\r\nSupports skin elasticity and a healthy glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"kuyfmj\" data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1041\">\r\nRich, creamy foam cleanses without irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ifzr9j\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\nMaintains the skin\'s natural moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sgebaz\" data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1136\">\r\nSuitable for daily morning and evening use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"33uea9\" data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1195\">\r\nDermatologically tested and suitable for sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1200\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1223\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1234\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16g15c5\" data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\nDehydrated Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1283\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1302\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1y3h8q5\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1316\">\r\nMature Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1344\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1378\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"giuwrq\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1390\">\r\nDull Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ft2wgb\" data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1421\">\r\nFine Lines Caused by Dryness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fmoy7\" data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1442\">\r\nRough Skin Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11nefqf\" data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1460\">\r\nDaily Cleansing\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ydjqjn\" data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\nLoss of Elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1486\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1506\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n3ber7\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1555\">PDRN (Polydeoxyribonucleotide / Sodium DNA)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ohjy38\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\nSupports skin regeneration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dt0b9b\" data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1613\">\r\nHelps improve elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sps5cr\" data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1646\">\r\nPromotes healthy-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12t5tq3\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1679\">11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"yej8sb\" data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1713\">\r\nProvides multi-layer hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmp8cv\" data-start=\"1714\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\nHelps retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97f4c\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1770\">\r\nLeaves skin plump and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1795\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2bgprf\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1821\">\r\nImproves skin firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1p0sb9d\" data-start=\"1822\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\nEnhances skin elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xn5dns\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1871\">\r\nSoftens rough skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1899\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1middip\" data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1930\">\r\nDeeply hydrates and soothes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ou2e8\" data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\nStrengthens the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"qn73fx\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1989\">\r\nHelps reduce irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2006\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ea286e\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2050\">\r\nReinforces the skin\'s protective barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2076\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"49pebs\" data-start=\"2077\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\nKeeps skin healthy and resilient.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1crqgps\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2129\">Niacinamide</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1eu7z4i\" data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2152\">\r\nBrightens dull skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ectf3m\" data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2186\">\r\nHelps improve uneven skin tone.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4lwdc1\" data-start=\"2187\" data-end=\"2215\">\r\nSupports the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4tm9lz\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2217\" data-end=\"2229\">Glycerin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2309\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k84mv5\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\nDraws moisture into the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1nkv3it\" data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2309\">\r\nKeeps skin soft and hydrated after cleansing.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vy11ck\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2324\">Allantoin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vm6fm4\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2350\">\r\nSoothes sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl2d66\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2375\">\r\nHelps calm irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ccxq91\" data-start=\"2376\" data-end=\"2420\">\r\nPromotes smoother, healthier-looking skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2425\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2436\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2675\">A rich, creamy cleansing foam that creates dense, cushiony bubbles to gently lift away impurities without over-drying the skin. It rinses off easily, leaving the skin clean, hydrated, soft, and refreshed with no tight or stripped feeling.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2680\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2694\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14xmzpn\" data-start=\"2695\" data-end=\"2732\">\r\nWet your face with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qfrwnp\" data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2794\">\r\nDispense an appropriate amount of cleanser into your palm.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w3migr\" data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\nAdd a small amount of water and work into a rich foam.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"axdaec\" data-start=\"2853\" data-end=\"2937\">\r\nGently massage the foam over your face in circular motions for <strong data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2936\">30–60 seconds</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2938\" data-end=\"2978\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3024\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sxloup\" data-start=\"3025\" data-end=\"3097\">\r\nUse every morning and evening as part of your daily skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3102\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3124\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3579\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12ufpio\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3266\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"3136\" data-end=\"3220\">PDRN, 11 Types of Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Ceramides, and Panthenol</strong> to cleanse while providing intense hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tpcxyb\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3343\">\r\nRemoves impurities without disrupting the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6mglcm\" data-start=\"3344\" data-end=\"3405\">\r\nLeaves skin soft, plump, and refreshed after every cleanse.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vlxam5\" data-start=\"3406\" data-end=\"3487\">\r\nGentle, non-stripping formula suitable for daily use, including sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tusw88\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3579\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving clean, hydrated, healthy-looking, and radiant skin with every wash.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/BE9IB68otozBGZUROzW2NesOuNb0OzQWOePR5ezN.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:16:29','2026-09-18 12:16:29'),(450,'Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam 150ml','heartleaf-succinic-moisture-cleansing-foam-150ml','<h1 data-section-id=\"1siizlm\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"55\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><br></h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"678\">ANUA Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam is a gentle, low-pH facial cleanser formulated to effectively remove dirt, excess oil, sunscreen residue, and daily impurities while maintaining the skin\'s natural moisture barrier. Powered by <strong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"359\">Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong>, <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"378\">Succinic Acid</strong>, <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"393\">Panthenol</strong>, <strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"410\">Ceramide NP</strong>, <strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"431\">Hyaluronic Acid</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"449\">Glycerin</strong>, this rich cleansing foam helps soothe sensitive skin, balance sebum production, and leave the skin feeling clean, soft, and hydrated without tightness. Its creamy micro-foam provides a refreshing cleanse suitable for daily us