d=\"1kmw93v\" data-start=\"2710\" data-end=\"2750\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8jivmi\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2796\">\r\nFollow with toner, serum, and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nirym8\" data-start=\"2797\" data-end=\"2847\">\r\nUse every morning and evening for best results.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2852\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2854\" data-end=\"2874\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"3307\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhrzsv\" data-start=\"2875\" data-end=\"2980\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2925\">Heartleaf Extract and Succinic Acid</strong> to cleanse, soothe, and balance oily, acne-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1m9t2g6\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3055\">\r\nRemoves impurities while protecting the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"t20rdw\" data-start=\"3056\" data-end=\"3141\">\r\nLow-pH, non-stripping formula keeps skin hydrated and comfortable after every wash.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ih9s1c\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3204\">\r\nIdeal for sensitive, combination, and acne-prone skin types.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"18q3dvb\" data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3307\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves the skin feeling clean, refreshed, smooth, and healthy without any greasy or tight sensation.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,3,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/b9iLkWGu9xWW3oDXtUvMYJCgxoYyGxRNCXYMWTf4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:20:54','2026-09-18 12:20:54'),(451,'K-Pop Demon Hunters Glow Skin Discovery Set.','k-pop-demon-hunters-glow-skin-discovery-set','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281