\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2815\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"crmbpy\" data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2943\">\r\nFor an intensive soothing treatment, soak cotton pads with the toner and place them on irritated areas for <strong data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"2942\">5–10 minutes</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1wazrrs\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"2981\">\r\nFollow with serum and moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15p99rw\" data-start=\"2982\" data-end=\"3053\">\r\nUse every morning and evening. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2967\" data-content-reference-end=\"2999\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3058\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3080\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3519\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ybl6hp\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3160\">\r\nFormulated with <strong data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3124\">77% Heartleaf Extract</strong> to calm and comfort sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fhp4kt\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3241\">\r\nInfused with <strong data-start=\"3176\" data-end=\"3213\">multiple forms of Hyaluronic Acid</strong> for long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"u4kw8m\" data-start=\"3242\" data-end=\"3324\">\r\nLightweight, fragrance-free, and non-comedogenic formula suitable for daily use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ysxbp9\" data-start=\"3325\" data-end=\"3392\">\r\nHelps strengthen the skin barrier while reducing visible redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"29kchb\" data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3519\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving a calm, hydrated, balanced, and radiant \"glass skin\" complexion.&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,6,3,NUL