al for everyday wear. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2520\" data-content-reference-end=\"2552\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2591\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"105fiti\" data-start=\"2592\" data-end=\"2634\">\r\nComplete your morning skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16aliof\" data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2708\">\r\nApply a generous amount evenly to the face and neck as the final step.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16mbi2w\" data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2756\">\r\nApply <strong data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2755\">15–20 minutes before sun exposure</strong>.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0nud1\" data-start=\"2757\" data-end=\"2832\">\r\nReapply every <strong data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2785\">2 hours</strong>, or after sweating, swimming, or towel drying.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4w3xyl\" data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2907\">\r\nUse daily for optimal protection. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2850\" data-content-reference-end=\"2882\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2912\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2934\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3404\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x5w8m4\" data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3019\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2963\">SPF50+ PA++++</strong> mineral UV protection with soothing botanical extracts.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4dsnby\" data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3089\">\r\nHelps calm sensitive skin while defending against daily sun damage.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1rk1gpw\" data-start=\"30