\n<li data-section-id=\"11w8qya\" data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2106\">\r\nHelps reinforce the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1n0clzp\" data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2132\">\r\nImproves skin softness.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18s576m\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2151\">Basil Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"de42r5\" data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2175\">\r\nRich in antioxidants.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"s9h5og\" data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2205\">\r\nHelps soothe stressed skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gbri32\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2241\">Fraxinus Rhynchophylla Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lyf8s5\" data-start=\"2242\" data-end=\"2287\">\r\nProvides soothing and antioxidant benefits.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fqjr6u\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2321\">Ulmus Davidiana Root Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ylx1ko\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\nHelps maintain skin hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"x9itg\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2386\">\r\nSupports skin barrier health.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6p6bna\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2424\">Amaranthus Caudatus Seed Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"f36dgx\" data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2459\">\r\nNourishes and protects the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"170mivt\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2487\">Tocopherol (Vitamin E)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"gtbs2e\" data-start=\"2488\" data-end=\"2522\">\r\nProvides antioxidant protection.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4glfqj\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2607\">\r\nHelps defend skin from environmental damage. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2555\" data-content-reference-end=\"2587\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2609\" data-end=\"2612\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2614\" data-end=\"2623\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2897\">A silky, lightweight milk-lotion texture that spreads effortlessly across the skin and absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy or sticky residue. It provides a smooth, hydrated finish that works beautifully under sunscreen and makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2840\" data-content-reference-end=\"2872\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2902\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2916\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zlct\" data-start=\"2917\" data-end=\"2964\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner and serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13e14cw\" data-start=\"2965\" data-end=\"3008\">\r\nPump <strong data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"2986\">1–2 pumps</strong> onto your fingertips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kneiwp\" data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3056\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3093\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"scxx8g\" data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3182\">\r\nUse as the final moisturizing step in both your morning and evening skincare routine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tq9ho5\" data-start=\"3183\" data-end=\"3262\">\r\nIn the morning, follow with sunscreen. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3200\" data-content-reference-end=\"3232\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"3264\" data-end=\"3267\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3289\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3786\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewsjgx\" data-start=\"3290\" data-end=\"3393\">\r\nFormulated with <strong data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3333\">70% Heartleaf Extract</strong> to deliver soothing care for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ffgkpg\" data-start=\"3394\" data-end=\"3479\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3422\">Triple Hyaluronic Acid</strong> provides deep, long-lasting hydration without heaviness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j1f4cg\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3580\">\r\nLightweight, non-comedogenic formula absorbs quickly and layers well with other skincare products.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w04k3d\" data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3637\">\r\nPerfect as a daily moisturizer and makeup-prep lotion.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5t5ij4\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3786\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves the skin calm, hydrated, smooth, and naturally radiant while helping maintain a healthy skin barrier.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,17,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/VA18LLjaZ30ZE6nGGVwY7IkMpXCI7lG2cxrh2ikq.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:37:46','2026-09-18 12:37:46'),(456,'PDRN Lip Serum 10ml','pdrn-lip-serum-10ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6aa82882-3e64-83e8-abc5-fa10b25ea281-85\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--