engthen the lip moisture barrier. It can be used as a daily lip serum, a hydrating base before lipstick, or an overnight lip sleeping mask for intensive care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"562\" data-content-reference-end=\"594\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v1mjmx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"624\">Product Benefits</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a76eh\" data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"665\">\r\nProvides deep, long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1r3u5p3\" data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"710\">\r\nHelps repair dry, rough, and chapped lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"dn44vl\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"749\">\r\nSmooths the appearance of lip lines.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"eapxid\" data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"794\">\r\nSupports a fuller, healthier-looking pout.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ybix9g\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"834\">\r\nStrengthens the lip moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cxc9g8\" data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"868\">\r\nSoftens flaky and peeling lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"intm6w\" data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"921\">\r\nLeaves a natural glossy finish without stickiness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1harlm7\" data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"988\">\r\nCan be used as both a daily lip serum and an overnight lip mask.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c9dia4\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\nComfortable to wear under lipstick or lip tint.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4gfud7\" data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1107\">\r\nSuitable for sensitive lips. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1065\" data-content-reference-end=\"1098\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\