 data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1436\">\r\nHelps support lip repair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lne7fz\" data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1479\">\r\nImproves the appearance of lip firmness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"66wix1\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1514\">\r\nPromotes healthier-looking lips.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17vhy9\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1539\">Hydrolyzed Collagen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"hugs96\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1571\">\r\nHelps improve lip elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12mnpdh\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1607\">\r\nLeaves lips smoother and plumper.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"910mv0\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1633\">\r\nSoftens fine lip lines.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cmhhdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1654\">Hyaluronic Acid</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1745\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"poxe1w\" data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1684\">\r\nDelivers intense hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g0mo8k\" data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1719\">\r\nKeeps lips soft and moisturized.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uubkye\" data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1745\">\r\nPrevents moisture loss.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"sady6g\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1762\">Ceramide NP</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ybix9g\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1802\">\r\nStrengthens the lip moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nofk7g\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1835\">\r\nHelps protect against dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16berj7\" data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1857\">\r\nLocks in hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1885\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1981\