nd=\"2571\">A rich, cushiony lip serum with a lightweight, non-sticky texture that glides smoothly onto the lips. It leaves a comfortable glossy finish while delivering long-lasting moisture without feeling heavy. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2520\" data-content-reference-end=\"2553\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2576\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2590\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2952\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"6felkv\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2641\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount to clean, dry lips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1e4i6me\" data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2700\">\r\nReapply throughout the day whenever your lips feel dry.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12t28wf\" data-start=\"2701\" data-end=\"2741\">\r\nWear alone for a natural glossy look.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8kvoud\" data-start=\"2742\" data-end=\"2809\">\r\nApply before lipstick or lip tint for a smoother, hydrated base.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b4hliy\" data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2952\">\r\nBefore bedtime, apply a generous layer as an overnight lip sleeping mask for intensive moisture care. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2897\" data-content-reference-end=\"2930\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2957\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2979\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3430\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7bmn2t\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3081\">\r\nCombines <strong data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3041\">PDRN, Collagen, Hyaluronic Acid, and Ceramides</strong> for intensive lip repair and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"afcdkj\" data-start=\"3082\" data-end=\"3164\">\r\nSmooths dry, flaky lips while enhancing their natural, healthy-looking fullness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lladmj\" data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3230\">\r\nLightweight, non-sticky formula with a beautiful glossy finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"e0n4cc\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3310\">\r\nVersatile enough for daytime hydration, lipstick prep, or overnight lip care.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1awj6m2\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3430\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nLeaves lips soft, supple, plump, and deeply moisturized with every application. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"3371\" data-content-reference-end=\"3404\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\" class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)\"></div>',NULL,NULL,30,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/o0V8yFQF1cAQ8cL9nhwUrgFErfbgO0fPEGDYx9i7.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:39:28','2026-09-18 12:39:28'),(457,'Heartleaf 70% Intense Calming Cream 50ml','heartleaf-70-intense-calming-cream-50ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"608\">ANUA Heartleaf 70% Intense Calming Cream is a rich yet lightweight moisturizer formulated with <strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"209\">70% Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong>, <strong data-start=\"211\" data-end=\"226\">Ceramide NP</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"232\" data-end=\"245\">Panthenol</