.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19zar72\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1932\" data-end=\"1957\">Hydrogenated Lecithin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"9ib2ir\" data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1988\">\r\nReinforces the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1auz7l1\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2019\">\r\nEnhances moisture retention.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r4qayg\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2036\">Cholesterol</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1d37qbg\" data-start=\"2037\" data-end=\"2081\">\r\nSupports the skin\'s natural lipid barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ft2opo\" data-start=\"2082\" data-end=\"2123\">\r\nHelps maintain healthy, resilient skin.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gov6ba\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2125\" data-end=\"2138\">Adenosine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yueeqx\" data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2184\">\r\nHelps improve the appearance of fine lines.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"15vlg5y\" data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2256\">\r\nPromotes smoother-looking skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2209\" data-content-reference-end=\"2241\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2258\" data-end=\"2261\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2272\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2516\">A creamy, rich moisturizer with a lightweight, non-greasy finish. It spreads smoothly over the skin, absorbs quickly, and leaves the skin feeling hydrated, calm, and comfortable without any sticky residue. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2464\" data-content-reference-end=\"2496\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2518\" data-end=\"2521\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2535\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2891\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1w0zlct\" data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2583\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner and serum.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"vt7ls\" data-start=\"2584\" data-end=\"2627\">\r\nTake an appropriate amount of the cream.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3pjh0s\" data-start=\"2628\" data-end=\"2679\">\r\nGently spread it evenly over your face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2680\" data-end=\"2716\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jhtdvv\" data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2788\">\r\nUse as the final step of your skincare routine, morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1l0r74o\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2891\">\r\nIn the daytime, follow with sunscreen for optimal protection. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2834\" data-content-reference-end=\"2853\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2896\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2898\" data-end=\"2918\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"3369\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"135qerp\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"3010\">\r\nContains <strong data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"2955\">70% Heartleaf Extract</strong> to provide intensive soothing care for sensitive skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"103c6d1\" data-start=\"3011\" data-end=\"3100\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3042\">Ceramide NP and Panthenol</strong> work together to strengthen and protect the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1xdit4n\" data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3156\">\r\nRich hydration with a lightweight, non-greasy finish.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16w04as\" data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3213\">\r\nFragrance-free, gentle, and suitable for everyday use.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"p2iylt\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3369\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for calming redness, repairing a damaged skin barrier, and achieving soft, healthy, and well-hydrated skin.&nbsp;</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/mIUnX8TgidEu2Z6DliQYk189ifcFt4A8DkXSlwJs.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:43:19','2026-09-18 12:43:19'),(458,'Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule 30ml','heartleaf-80-soothing-ampoule-30ml','<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"656\">ANUA Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule is a lightweight, fragrance-free facial serum formulated with <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"207\">80% Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</strong> to calm irritated skin, reduce visible redness, and provide long-lasting hydration. Enriched with <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"359\">Panthenol, Hyaluronic Acid, Betaine, and Glycerin</strong>, this fast-absorbing ampoule helps strengthen the skin\'s moisture barrier while leaving the skin smooth, refreshed, and naturally radiant. Its non-comedogenic, low-irritation formula makes it ideal for daily use, especially for sensitive and acne-prone skin. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"619\" data-content-reference-end=\"651\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"661\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"v1mjmx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"681\">Product Benefits</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"11jsl61\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"731\">\r\nInstantly soothes sensitive and irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"tc1g08\" data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"781\">\r\nHelps reduce visible redness caused by dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19a76eh\" data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"822\">\r\nProvides deep, long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"30kjqj\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"873\">\r\nStrengthens the skin\'s natural moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"aqx84i\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"926\">\r\nHelps balance excess sebum without clogging pores.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"7n9oho\" data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"968\">\r\nLeaves skin soft, plump, and refreshed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cr0s98\" data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\nLightweight, non-sticky, and fast-absorbing.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"c7flhu\" data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1053\">\r\nCreates a healthy, glass-skin glow.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"71rak6\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1091\">\r\nFragrance-free and non-comedogenic.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"100f4sm\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1175\">\r\nSuitable for daily morning and evening use. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1133\" data-content-reference-end=\"1165\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1nqoa21\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1203\">Best For Skin Types</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"q4dxmj\" data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1220\">\r\nSensitive Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1238\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8xpbv2\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1257\">\r\nCombination Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"r5r96s\" data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1269\">\r\nOily Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8pqons\" data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1280\">\r\nDry Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"la4b5w\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\nNormal Skin\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w8iueh\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1322\">Best For Skin Concerns</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"k6itgw\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\nRedness\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3d2sht\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1345\">\r\nIrritation\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qkl03\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1359\">\r\nDehydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pg7fua\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1379\">\r\nWeak Skin Barrier\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kk5ib9\" data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\nAcne-Prone Skin\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h7ghgf\" data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1412\">\r\nExcess Sebum\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3fmoy7\" data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1433\">\r\nRough Skin Texture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14x75iz\" data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1483\">\r\nDull Skin <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1436\" data-content-reference-end=\"1468\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1488\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1787cn4\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1508\">Hero Ingredients</h1>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x2eadx\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1556\">80% Heartleaf (Houttuynia Cordata) Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v54yuf\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1596\">\r\nSoothes sensitive and irritated skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ggks8s\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\nHelps reduce redness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1px8p6k\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1655\">\r\nSupports a healthy skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"88654r\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1683\">Panthenol (Vitamin B5)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1t7aw1x\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1711\">\r\nDeeply hydrates the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ldeyvl\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1747\">\r\nStrengthens the moisture barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nl2d66\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1772\">\r\nHelps calm irritation.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kbalnf\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1814\">Sodium Hyaluronate (Hyaluronic Acid)</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x7yazr\" data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1849\">\r\nDelivers long-lasting hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16h2rhx\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1884\">\r\nHelps maintain moisture balance.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"97f4c\" data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1916\">\r\nLeaves skin plump and smooth.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4j1yfq\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1918\" data-end=\"1929\">Betaine</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lmp8cv\" data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1954\">\r\nHelps retain moisture.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"mv4h64\" data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1986\">\r\nSoftens and smooths the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"sksxyu\" data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2024\">\r\nMaintains healthy hydration levels.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4tm9lz\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2038\">Glycerin</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uzqm1v\" data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2071\">\r\nAttracts moisture to the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19gcsn3\" data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2091\">\r\nPrevents dryness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14ye91a\" data-start=\"2092\" data-end=\"2112\">\r\nKeeps skin supple.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8htdsd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2149\">Cassia Obtusifolia Seed Extract</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"y1doxz\" data-start=\"2150\" data-end=\"2192\">\r\nHelps condition and moisturize the skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1k98jw3\" data-start=\"2193\" data-end=\"2266\">\r\nSupports a smoother skin texture. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2214\" data-content-reference-end=\"2246\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2271\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"14eyr2x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2282\">Texture</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2525\">A lightweight, watery gel ampoule that absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving a sticky or greasy residue. It delivers refreshing hydration and leaves the skin looking naturally healthy and radiant. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2468\" data-content-reference-end=\"2500\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2530\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"tkk0fi\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2532\" data-end=\"2544\">How to Use</h1>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ougxd6\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2582\">\r\nCleanse your face and apply toner.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h58h2v\" data-start=\"2583\" data-end=\"2645\">\r\nDispense <strong data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2608\">2–3 drops</strong> of the ampoule onto your fingertips.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1kneiwp\" data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2693\">\r\nGently spread evenly over the face and neck.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"137o5e9\" data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2730\">\r\nPat lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1im77zg\" data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2758\">\r\nFollow with moisturizer.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g4my68\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2792\">\r\nUse every morning and evening.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3dfwv\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2916\">\r\nFor a dewy makeup look, mix 1–2 drops with your foundation or apply before makeup. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2854\" data-content-reference-end=\"2887\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<hr data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2921\">\r\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1ykf3bd\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2943\">Why You\'ll Love It</h1>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3367\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ofvmgs\" data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3032\">\r\nFormulated with <strong data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"2987\">80% Heartleaf Extract</strong> to provide intensive soothing and hydration.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"2shgwl\" data-start=\"3033\" data-end=\"3091\">\r\nHelps calm redness while strengthening the skin barrier.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1g7gs2b\" data-start=\"3092\" data-end=\"3170\">\r\nLightweight, fragrance-free, and suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ul4s6t\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3236\">\r\nLayers well with other skincare products without feeling heavy.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xzc42a\" data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3367\" data-is-last-node=\"\">\r\nPerfect for achieving calm, hydrated, healthy, and naturally glowing glass skin every day.</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,12,3,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/1mO0QQrojxDNi2b05eahkdrMs2zUPyROzHk1gO6a.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-18 12:45:18','2026-09-18 12:45:18'),(459,'Collagen Whitening Cream 50ml','collagen-whitening-cream-50ml','<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3W CLINIC Collagen Whitening Cream is a moisturizing and brightening face cream formulated with collagen to help improve the appearance of dull, tired-looking skin. It provides hydration while supporting a smoother, more supple and radiant-looking complexion.</span></h2><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Helps brighten dull-looking skin</li><li>Provides deep and long-lasting hydration</li><li>Helps improve skin softness and smoothness</li><li>Supports a firmer, more elastic-looking complexion</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of uneven skin tone</li><li>Leaves skin looking fresh, healthy and radiant</li></ul><h3>Key Ingredients</h3><p><strong>Collagen:</strong> Helps maintain a moisturized, supple and elastic-looking appearance.<br><strong>Brightening ingredients:</strong> Help improve the appearance of dull and uneven-looking skin.<br><strong>Moisturizing ingredients:</strong> Help replenish hydration and maintain a comfortable skin feel.</p><h3>Texture</h3><p>A creamy, moisturizing texture that spreads easily and absorbs comfortably into the skin without leaving the skin feeling excessively dry.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Dull and tired-looking skin</li><li>Dry or dehydrated skin</li><li>Uneven-looking skin tone</li><li>Skin needing extra moisture and softness</li><li>Normal, dry and combination skin</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p>After cleansing and applying toner/serum, take an appropriate amount and gently spread over the face. Pat lightly until fully absorbed. Use morning and evening as part of your skincare routine.</p><p><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml<br><strong>Brand:</strong> 3W CLINIC<br><strong>Product Type:</strong> Face Cream<br><strong>Skin Concern:</strong> Dullness, dryness, uneven skin tone<br><strong>Usage:</strong> AM &amp; PM</p>',NULL,NULL,16,21,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/QCn9LCQW1TA8yGtPardibESkEkAiVXI7BQCQrNzG.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 07:50:23','2026-09-21 07:50:23'),(460,'Crystal White Milky Cream 50ml','crystal-white-milky-cream-50ml','<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3W CLINIC Crystal White Milky Cream is a moisturizing and brightening face cream designed to help improve the appearance of dull and uneven skin. Its milky cream texture provides moisture while leaving the skin looking smoother, softer, and more radiant.</span></h2><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Helps brighten dull-looking skin</li><li>Helps improve the appearance of uneven skin tone</li><li>Provides moisturizing care for dry and dehydrated skin</li><li>Leaves skin feeling soft and smooth</li><li>Helps create a fresh, healthy-looking glow</li><li>Supports a more even and radiant complexion</li><li>Comfortable for everyday skincare use</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li><strong>Brightening Care:</strong> Helps skin look clearer and more luminous.</li><li><strong>Moisturizing:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and reduce the feeling of dryness.</li><li><strong>Milky Cream Texture:</strong> Smooth and creamy texture that spreads easily over the skin.</li><li><strong>Daily Use:</strong> Suitable for use as part of a morning and evening skincare routine.</li></ul><h3>Texture</h3><p>A soft, creamy milky texture that glides smoothly over the skin and leaves a moisturized, comfortable finish.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Dull-looking skin</li><li>Uneven skin tone</li><li>Dry or dehydrated skin</li><li>Normal to combination skin</li><li>Skin that needs extra moisture and radiance</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p>After cleansing, toner, and serum, apply an appropriate amount of cream evenly over the face. Gently pat or massage until absorbed. Use morning and evening.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> 3W CLINIC</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Crystal White Milky Cream</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Face Cream</li><li><strong>Main Concerns:</strong> Dullness, dryness, uneven-looking skin tone</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> AM &amp; PM</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,16,21,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/QmqJq4HLrlkXCDotX49Tgtjwo9HQcmeTQBD3uz5L.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 07:51:50','2026-09-21 07:51:50'),(461,'Lavender Relaxing Body Lotion 550ml','lavender-relaxing-body-lotion-550ml','<p>3W CLINIC Lavender Relaxing Body Lotion is a moisturizing body lotion formulated to provide daily hydration while leaving the skin feeling soft, smooth, and refreshed. Infused with a relaxing lavender fragrance, it helps create a pleasant and soothing body-care experience.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Provides daily moisture to dry and rough skin</li><li>Helps keep skin soft, smooth, and supple</li><li>Helps reduce the feeling of dryness and tightness</li><li>Leaves the skin feeling fresh and comfortable</li><li>Provides a calming and relaxing lavender scent</li><li>Helps maintain healthy-looking, moisturized skin</li><li>Suitable for everyday full-body use</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><p><strong>Lavender Care:</strong> Provides a pleasant lavender fragrance for a relaxing body-care experience.<br><strong>Moisturizing:</strong> Helps replenish moisture and prevent the skin from feeling dry.<br><strong>Smooth Finish:</strong> Leaves skin feeling soft and comfortable without excessive heaviness.<br><strong>Large 550ml Size:</strong> Ideal for regular daily use on the entire body.</p><h3>Texture</h3><p>A smooth, lightweight lotion that spreads easily over the body and absorbs comfortably into the skin.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Dry and normal skin</li><li>Rough or dehydrated body skin</li><li>Daily moisturizing needs</li><li>Anyone who enjoys a soft lavender fragrance</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p>After bathing or whenever the skin feels dry, apply an appropriate amount to the body. Gently massage until fully absorbed. For best results, use regularly, especially on dry areas such as elbows, knees, and hands.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> 3W CLINIC</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Lavender Relaxing Body Lotion</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 550ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Body Lotion</li><li><strong>Skin Concern:</strong> Dryness, roughness, dehydration</li><li><strong>Fragrance:</strong> Lavender</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> Daily</li><li><strong>Application:</strong> Body</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,36,21,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/WeC3puB5vaTDACLkbIT9HuTCPDvJvqIKDdB3N0Rv.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 07:54:13','2026-09-21 07:54:13'),(462,'Collagen Cleansing Foam 100ml','collagen-cleansing-foam-100ml','<p>3W CLINIC Collagen Cleansing Foam is a daily facial cleanser designed to gently remove dirt, excess oil, makeup residue, and impurities from the skin. Enriched with collagen, it helps maintain a soft, smooth, and moisturized feel while cleansing.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Gently cleanses dirt, oil, and impurities</li><li>Helps remove daily buildup from the skin</li><li>Leaves skin feeling fresh and clean</li><li>Helps maintain skin softness and smoothness</li><li>Provides moisturizing care during cleansing</li><li>Helps prevent the skin from feeling excessively dry after washing</li><li>Suitable for everyday facial cleansing</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><p><strong>Collagen Care:</strong> Helps support a soft, supple, and healthy-looking complexion.<br><strong>Deep Cleansing:</strong> Helps remove excess sebum and impurities from the skin.<br><strong>Moisturizing Feel:</strong> Cleanses without leaving the skin feeling overly tight or uncomfortable.<br><strong>Rich Foam:</strong> Creates a creamy foam that spreads easily across the face.</p><h3>Texture</h3><p>A creamy cleansing foam that lathers with water and provides a refreshing cleansing experience.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Oily skin</li><li>Skin needing daily cleansing and freshness</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol start=\"1\"><li>Wet your face with lukewarm water.</li><li>Take a small amount of cleansing foam and work it into a rich lather with water.</li><li>Gently massage over the face in circular motions.</li><li>Rinse thoroughly with clean water.</li><li>Follow with toner and your regular skincare routine.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> 3W CLINIC</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Collagen Cleansing Foam</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 100ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Cleanser</li><li><strong>Key Ingredient:</strong> Collagen</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> Daily, AM &amp; PM</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Normal, combination, and oily skin</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,3,21,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/TWyXd7qMmN0D00wxtC957ZHz13AMx1rjdG050yTe.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 07:55:30','2026-09-21 07:55:30'),(463,'Velvet Finish Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ 70ml','velvet-finish-sun-milk-spf50-pa-70ml','<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MISSHA Velvet Finish Sun Milk SPF50+ PA++++ is a lightweight daily sunscreen designed to provide high-level protection against UVA and UVB rays. Its soft, velvet-like finish helps reduce excess shine while leaving the skin feeling smooth and comfortable.</span></h2><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Provides <strong>broad-spectrum SPF50+ PA++++</strong> UV protection</li><li>Helps protect skin from UVA and UVB rays</li><li>Helps reduce the appearance of excess oil and shine</li><li>Leaves a smooth, soft, velvet-like finish</li><li>Lightweight and comfortable for daily use</li><li>Helps create a suitable base before makeup</li><li>Convenient for everyday face and neck protection</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><p><strong>High UV Protection:</strong> SPF50+ helps protect against UVB rays, while PA++++ indicates very high UVA protection.</p><p><strong>Velvet Finish:</strong> Designed to leave a smooth, soft-matte finish rather than an overly greasy appearance.</p><p><strong>Lightweight Sun Milk:</strong> The fluid milk-type texture spreads easily over the skin and is comfortable for daily wear.</p><p><strong>Makeup-Friendly:</strong> The smooth finish can work well underneath makeup.</p><h3>Texture</h3><p>A lightweight, fluid sun-milk texture that spreads easily and leaves a smooth, velvety finish.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Normal skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Oily skin</li><li>People who prefer a soft-matte finish</li><li>Daily outdoor and indoor UV protection</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><p>As the last step of your morning skincare routine, apply a generous and even layer to the face, neck, and other exposed areas. Apply approximately <strong>15 minutes before sun exposure</strong>. Reapply regularly, especially after sweating, swimming, or prolonged outdoor activity.</p><h3>Product Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MISSHA</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Velvet Finish Sun Milk</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 70ml</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Facial Sunscreen / Sun Milk</li><li><strong>Sun Protection:</strong> SPF50+ PA++++</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> Velvet / Soft Matte</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> Every morning</li><li><strong>Suitable For:</strong> Normal, combination, and oily skin</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,19,7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/pk8M146RxW9OFxYdj6a5pEFYifQaWdfsNfsWcwXT.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 08:06:00','2026-09-21 08:06:00'),(464,'M Perfect Cover BB Cream SPF 42 PA+++ No.23 Natural Beige 50ml','m-perfect-cover-bb-cream-spf-42-pa-no23-natural-beige-50ml','<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream is an all-in-one complexion product that combines </span><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">makeup coverage, moisturizing care, and UV protection</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">. Shade </span><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No.23 Natural Beige</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> helps create a smooth, even-looking complexion while helping conceal the appearance of blemishes, redness, and minor imperfections.</span></h2><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Provides <strong>medium to buildable coverage</strong></li><li>Helps conceal blemishes, redness, and uneven skin tone</li><li>Creates a smooth and natural-looking complexion</li><li>Provides <strong>SPF 42 PA+++</strong> UV protection</li><li>Helps keep skin feeling moisturized and comfortable</li><li>Helps create a polished look without heavy foundation</li><li>Suitable for everyday makeup</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><p><strong>Natural Coverage</strong><br>Helps even out the appearance of skin tone while maintaining a natural-looking finish.</p><p><strong>UV Protection</strong><br>SPF 42 PA+++ helps protect the skin against daily UVA and UVB exposure.</p><p><strong>Moisturizing Care</strong><br>Helps maintain a comfortable, moisturized feeling while wearing the BB cream.</p><p><strong>Shade No.23 – Natural Beige</strong><br>A natural beige shade generally suitable for <strong>light to medium skin tones</strong>, depending on individual undertone and complexion.</p><h3>Texture &amp; Finish</h3><p>It has a smooth, creamy texture that blends easily into the skin. It provides buildable coverage with a natural, polished-looking finish.</p><h3>Suitable For</h3><ul><li>Normal skin</li><li>Dry skin</li><li>Combination skin</li><li>Uneven-looking skin tone</li><li>Daily makeup users</li><li>Anyone looking for coverage with added UV protection</li></ul><h3>How to Use</h3><ol start=\"1\"><li>Complete your regular skincare routine.</li><li>Take an appropriate amount of BB cream.</li><li>Apply evenly over the face using your fingers, makeup sponge, or foundation brush.</li><li>Gently blend from the center of the face outward.</li><li>Apply another thin layer to areas requiring additional coverage.</li></ol><h3>Product Information</h3><ul><li><strong>Brand:</strong> MISSHA</li><li><strong>Product Name:</strong> M Perfect Cover BB Cream</li><li><strong>Shade:</strong> No.23 Natural Beige</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</li><li><strong>SPF:</strong> SPF 42</li><li><strong>PA Rating:</strong> PA+++</li><li><strong>Product Type:</strong> BB Cream / Complexion Makeup</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Medium to Buildable</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> Natural-looking</li><li><strong>Recommended Use:</strong> Daily</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,40,7,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/2btrgIiDURNJChSWNF7RnrX57L8QIQdlKdOBTKpj.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 08:07:42','2026-09-21 08:07:42'),(465,'M Perfect Cover BB Cream PRO 20ml','m-perfect-cover-bb-cream-pro-20ml','<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream PRO is a multifunctional BB cream designed to provide complexion coverage, skincare benefits, and UV protection in one easy-to-use product. It helps even out the appearance of skin tone, conceal minor imperfections, and create a smooth, natural-looking complexion.</span></h2><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ul><li>Provides natural-looking, buildable coverage</li><li>Helps conceal blemishes, redness, and uneven skin tone</li><li>Helps create a smooth and even-looking complexion</li><li>Provides daily UV protection</li><li>Helps maintain a moisturized and comfortable skin feel</li><li>Gives the skin a polished, healthy-looking appearance</li><li>Convenient <strong>20ml</strong> size for everyday use or travel</li></ul><h3>Key Features</h3><p><strong>Multi-Functional BB Cream</strong><br>Combines makeup coverage with skincare-oriented benefits and sun protection.</p><p><strong>Buildable Coverage</strong><br>Can be applied in a thin layer for a natural look or built up over areas requiring more coverage.</p><p><strong>Natural-Looking Finish</strong><br>Helps create an even complexion without the heavy appearance of traditional foundation.</p><p><strong>Travel-Friendly Size</strong><br>The 20ml format is convenient for carrying in a handbag, makeup pouch, or travel kit.</p><h3>Texture</h3><p>A smooth, creamy BB cream texture that blends easily over the skin and provides comfortab