ng data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1258\">Malt Extract</strong> – Helps improve hair softness and elasticity.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"19sryjg\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1437\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1348\">Traditional Korean Botanical Extracts</strong> – Support healthy scalp balance and stronger hair. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1390\" data-content-reference-end=\"1422\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2byf7d\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1454\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1454\">Texture</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1573\">A lightweight golden gel shampoo that creates a rich, refreshing lather and rinses away clean without leaving residue.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qqu61a\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1593\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1593\">How to Use</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1899\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1qbqwhl\" data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1642\">\r\nWet your hair thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"12clp7e\" data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1682\">\r\nApply an adequate amount of shampoo.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ewknev\" data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\nGently massage into the scalp and hair until it lathers.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2zun1\" data-start=\"1743\" data-end=\"1771\">\r\nLeave on for 1–2 minutes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1job7gy\" data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1792\">\r\nRinse thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"14i2wh7\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1899\">\r\nFollow with a conditioner or hair treatment for the best results. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1847\" data-content-reference-end=\"1879\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1accwdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1927\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1927\">Why You\'ll Love It</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2263\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Ryo Yuja Shampoo combines the revitalizing power of <strong data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"1997\">Yuja (Citron)</strong> with Korean herbal technology to deliver a refreshing cleanse while nourishing both the scalp and hair. With every wash, it helps restore shine, softness, and vitality, leaving hair healthier, smoother, and naturally refreshed.</p>',NULL,NULL,32,69,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/4JL46ipp0MJOgfBs7nBO6s0iWo2LLoNhINPX92GL.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 10:44:25','2026-09-21 10:44:25'),(483,'Seoul Sunset Hair Loss Expert Care Shampoo (Spicy Flora) 585ml','seoul-sunset-hair-loss-expert-care-shampoo-spicy-flora-585ml','<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6ab13415-4cdc-83e8-9491-7a7ac4f515c5-17\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-6ab13415-4cdc-83e8-9491-7a7ac4f515c5-17\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-6ab13415-4cdc-83e8-9491-7a7ac4f515c5-17\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-66\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-8 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--