-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\nNormal to dry scalp\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1555234\" data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1141\">\r\nAll hair types\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cfawx3\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1166\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1166\">Key Ingredients</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ljf9dj\" data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1278\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1191\">Ginsen9EX™ Complex</strong> – A blend of Korean ginseng and 9 herbal ingredients that helps strengthen hair roots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"cbzlvx\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1364\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1306\">Panax Ginseng Extract</strong> – Nourishes the scalp and promotes stronger-looking hair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nindl\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1390\">Ginger Root Extract</strong> – Helps improve scalp vitality.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"126zlbg\" data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1495\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1437\">Caffeine</strong> – Energizes the scalp and supports healthier hair growth.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"zavmkm\" data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1519\">Camellia Seed Oil</strong> – Provides moisture and smoothness.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1lpiye\" data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1620\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1580\">Green Tea Seed Oil</strong> – Rich in antioxidants to protect hair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xa5rjs\" data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1680\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1639\">Rice Extract</strong> – Helps improve hair softness and shine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q5lmk3\" data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1787\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1719\">Calendula &amp; Honeysuckle Extracts</strong> – Calm and nourish the scalp. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"1740\" data-content-reference-end=\"1772\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h5y3yk\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1812\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1812\">Fragrance Notes</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1844\"><strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1844\">Seoul Sunset – Spicy Floral</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"o7q6ae\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1875\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1861\">Top Notes:</strong> Bitter Orange\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"lhssrw\" data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1913\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1895\">Middle Notes:</strong> Gardenia, Freesia\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"a8ubxe\" data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1942\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1916\" data-end=\"1931\">Base Notes:</strong> Sandalwood\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1944\" data-end=\"2088\">A sophisticated floral fragrance with warm citrus and woody notes that leaves hair smelling fresh all day. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2036\" data-content-reference-end=\"2068\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2byf7d\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2105\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2105\">Texture</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2232\">A rich, creamy shampoo that creates a soft, dense foam to thoroughly cleanse the scalp without stripping its natural moisture.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qqu61a\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2252\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2238\" data-end=\"2252\">How to Use</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwljq7\" data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2311\">\r\nWet your hair and scalp thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h78jpl\" data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2354\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of shampoo.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"jy4ci0\" data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2404\">\r\nMassage gently into the scalp for 2–3 minutes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"ztwrar\" data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2425\">\r\nRinse thoroughly.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pd6o7n\" data-start=\"2426\" data-end=\"2550\">\r\nFor best results, follow with <strong data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2511\">RYO Seoul Sunset Hair Loss Expert Care Treatment</strong>. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2493\" data-content-reference-end=\"2525\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1accwdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2552\" data-end=\"2578\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2578\">Why You\'ll Love It</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"3022\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">RYO Seoul Sunset Hair Loss Expert Care Shampoo combines advanced Korean herbal scalp science with an elegant salon-inspired fragrance. The gentle low-acid formula effectively cleanses while helping reduce hair fall, soothe the scalp, and strengthen hair from the roots. Every wash leaves your hair healthier, fresher, and wrapped in a luxurious Spicy Floral scent inspired by the beauty of a Seoul sunset. <span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"2960\" data-content-reference-end=\"2992\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"></span></span></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden has-[&gt;_:empty]:hidden\"><div class=\"text-center\"></div></div></div><div data-conversation-scr