ass=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"248b9x\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"444\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"444\">Key Benefits</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"793\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1quy58f\" data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"475\">\r\nRepairs dry and damaged hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"16k9p4s\" data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"515\">\r\nDeeply nourishes and moisturizes hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1yrqbob\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"554\">\r\nStrengthens weak and brittle strands\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1u7tngh\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"598\">\r\nHelps reduce hair breakage and split ends\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1b25xtx\" data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"641\">\r\nRestores softness, shine, and elasticity\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"4mwp2d\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"684\">\r\nSmooths frizz and improves manageability\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"onsn0b\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"729\">\r\nGently cleanses without stripping moisture\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1vhzlgo\" data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"768\">\r\nSupports a healthy scalp environment\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"svbvmg\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"793\">\r\nSuitable for daily use\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w21qz0\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"815\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"815\">Suitable For</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"8qb2c5\" data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"826\">\r\nDry hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"unep4l\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"841\">\r\nDamaged hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"b2tayl\" data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"862\">\r\nColor-treated hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xxaxp8\" data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"888\">\r\nChemically treated hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1lbut\" data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"914\">\r\nFrizzy and brittle hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1j4tjm5\" data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"961\">\r\nAll hair types needing intensive nourishment\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cfawx3\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"986\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"986\">Key Ingredients</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1601js2\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1079\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1015\">Korean Ginseng Extract</strong> – Nourishes the scalp and helps strengthen hair from the roots.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"fgecwj\" data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1153\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1103\">Camellia Seed Oil</strong> – Deeply moisturizes dry hair and enhances shine.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"pbo447\" data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1232\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1169\">Argan Oil</strong> – Rich in essential fatty acids that help repair damaged hair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"17sr04n\" data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1258\">Pomegranate Extract</strong> – Helps improve hair elasticity and vitality.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"70dh3c\" data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1382\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1328\">Green Tea Extract</strong> – Provides antioxidant protection for healthier hair.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"xoqd21\" data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1454\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1415\">Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5)</strong> – Hydrates and improves hair strength.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"h6n56q\" data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1555\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1495\">Traditional Korean Herbal Extracts</strong> – Help nourish the scalp and maintain healthy-looking hair.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2byf7d\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1572\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1561\" data-end=\"1572\">Texture</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1730\">A rich, creamy shampoo that creates a luxurious foam, effectively cleansing the scalp while leaving hair soft, smooth, and moisturized without feeling heavy.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qqu61a\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1750\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1750\">How to Use</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ol data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"uwljq7\" data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1809\">\r\nWet your hair and scalp thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1h78jpl\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1852\">\r\nApply an appropriate amount of shampoo.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1269gd9\" data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1921\">\r\nGently massage into the scalp and hair until a rich lather forms.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2zun1\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1950\">\r\nLeave on for 1–2 minutes.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1s7rgth\" data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1982\">\r\nRinse thoroughly with water.\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ornqzi\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2084\">\r\nFollow with <strong data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2042\">Ryo Damage Care &amp; Nourishing Conditioner</strong> or a hair treatment for the best results.\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1accwdl\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2112\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2112\">Why You\'ll Love It</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2113\" data-end=\"2432\">Ryo Damage Care &amp; Nourishing Shampoo combines traditional Korean herbal ingredients with advanced nourishing technology to repair damaged hair from within. It helps replenish lost moisture, strengthen weakened strands, and restore healthy shine, leaving your hair soft, resilient, and easier to manage after every wash.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"d4jz9q\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2460\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2460\">Product Highlights</strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1pqeino\" data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2492\">\r\n💛 Repairs dry &amp; damaged hair\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1o06d6m\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2543\">\r\n🌿 Enriched with Korean Ginseng &amp; Botanical Oils\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"g3h00s\" data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2577\">\r\n💧 Deep nourishment &amp; hydration\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"934ois\" data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2619\">\r\n💪 Helps reduce breakage and split ends\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10ac861\" data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2656\">\r\n✨ Leaves hair soft, smooth &amp; shiny\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohvmrm\" data-start=\"2657\" data-end=\"2687\">\r\n🚿 Suitable for everyday use</li></ul>',NULL,NULL,32,69,NULL,'[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'products/thumbnails/BhXY8EvyubIejWVax8UurtDZTpfbiJ9VLrm3RdO7.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active',1,1,'2026-09-21 11:08:22','2026-09-21 11:08:22');
